txt"],"pt":["Otimização de SEO com robots","Geração de sitemap","Criação de imagens OG","Adição de dados estruturados com schema-org","Configuração fácil e personalizável"],"ru":["Поисковая оптимизация с помощью robots","Генерация sitemap","Создание изображений OG","Добавление структурированных данных с помощью schema-org","Легкая и настраиваемая конфигурация"],"ar":["تحسين محركات البحث مع الروبوتات","إنشاء خريطة الموقع","إنشاء الصور OG","إضافة بيانات مخططة مع نموذج المخطط","ضبط سهل وقابل للتخصيص"]},"keywords":{"es":["cómo usar Nuxt SEO","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para SEO","Nuxt SEO alternativa","Nuxt SEO vs otros módulos","instalación de Nuxt SEO","guía de configuración de Nuxt SEO","mejora del SEO con Nuxt","optimización de sitio web con Nuxt SEO"],"fr":["comment utiliser Nuxt SEO","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour le SEO","alternative à Nuxt SEO","Nuxt SEO vs d''autres modules","installation de Nuxt SEO","guide de configuration de Nuxt SEO","amélioration du SEO avec Nuxt","optimisation du site web avec Nuxt SEO"],"de":["wie man Nuxt SEO verwendet","KI-Tools für SEO","Nuxt SEO Alternative","Nuxt SEO vs andere Module","Installation von Nuxt SEO","Konfigurationsanleitung für Nuxt SEO","Verbesserung des SEO mit Nuxt","Optimierung der Website mit Nuxt SEO"],"pt":["nuxt seo","otimização de seo","ferramentas de ia","configuração de seo","guia de instalação do nuxt","alternativas ao nuxt","nuxt vs next","como usar o nuxt seo","o que é nuxt seo"],"ru":["nuxt seo","поисковая оптимизация","ии агенты","настройка seo","руководство по установке nuxt","альтернативы nuxt","nuxt vs next","как использовать nuxt seo","что такое nuxt seo"],"ar":["نuxt seo","تحسين محركات البحث","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ضبط تحسين محركات البحث","دليل تثبيت نuxt","بديل لنuxt","نuxt مقابل نيكست","كيفية استخدام نuxt seo","ما هو نuxt seo"]}},"owner":"onmax","repo":"nuxt-skills","repoPath":"onmax/nuxt-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.577Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nuxt-seo","description":"Nuxt SEO meta-module with robots, sitemap, og-image, schema-org. Use when configuring SEO, generating sitemaps, creating OG images, or adding structured data.","bodyPreview":"# Nuxt SEO\n\n```bash\nnpx nuxi module add @nuxtjs/seo\n```\n\n## When to Use\n\nWorking with:\n\n- SEO configuration (site URL, name, indexability)\n- Robots.txt and sitemap.xml generation\n- Dynamic OG image generation\n- JSON-LD structured data (schema.org)\n- Breadcrumbs and canonical URLs\n\n## Loading Files\n\n**Consider loading these reference files based on your task:**\n\n- [ ] [references/site-config.md](references/site-config.md) - if configuring site URL, name, or SEO foundation\n- [ ] [references/crawla","body":"# Nuxt SEO\n\n```bash\nnpx nuxi module add @nuxtjs/seo\n```\n\n## When to Use\n\nWorking with:\n\n- SEO configuration (site URL, name, indexability)\n- Robots.txt and sitemap.xml generation\n- Dynamic OG image generation\n- JSON-LD structured data (schema.org)\n- Breadcrumbs and canonical URLs\n\n## Loading Files\n\n**Consider loading these reference files based on your task:**\n\n- [ ] [references/site-config.md](references/site-config.md) - if configuring site URL, name, or SEO foundation\n- [ ] [references/crawlability.md](references/crawlability.md) - if setting up robots.txt or sitemap.xml\n- [ ] [references/og-image.md](references/og-image.md) - if generating dynamic OG images\n- [ ] [references/schema-org.md](references/schema-org.md) - if adding JSON-LD structured data\n- [ ] [references/utilities.md](references/utilities.md) - if working with breadcrumbs, canonical URLs, or link checking\n\n**DO NOT load all files at once.** Load only what''s relevant to your current task.\n\n## Site Config\n\nFoundation for all SEO modules. Configure `site` in `nuxt.config.ts`, access via `useSiteConfig()`. See [references/site-config.md](references/site-config.md) for full options.\n\n## Module Overview\n\n| Module            | Purpose         | Key API                       |\n| ----------------- | --------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| nuxt-site-config  | Shared config   | `useSiteConfig()`             |\n| @nuxtjs/robots    | robots.txt      | `useRobotsRule()`             |\n| @nuxtjs/sitemap   | sitemap.xml     | `defineSitemapEventHandler()` |\n| nuxt-og-image     | OG images       | `defineOgImage()`             |\n| nuxt-schema-org   | JSON-LD         | `useSchemaOrg()`              |\n| nuxt-seo-utils    | Meta utilities  | `useBreadcrumbItems()`        |\n| nuxt-link-checker | Link validation | Build-time checks             |\n\n## Nuxt Content v3\n\nUse `asSeoCollection()` for automatic sitemap, og-image, and schema-org from frontmatter:\n\n```ts\n// content.config.ts\nimport { defineCollection, defineContentConfig } from ''@nuxt/content''\nimport { asSeoCollection } from ''@nuxtjs/seo/content''\n\nexport default defineContentConfig({\n  collections: {\n    posts: defineCollection(asSeoCollection({ type: ''page'', source: ''posts/**'' }))\n  }\n})\n```\n\n**Important:** Load `@nuxtjs/seo` before `@nuxt/content` in modules array:\n\n```ts\nexport default defineNuxtConfig({\n  modules: [''@nuxtjs/seo'', ''@nuxt/content'']\n})\n```\n\nFrontmatter fields: `ogImage`, `sitemap`, `robots`, `schemaOrg`.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- [nuxt-content](../nuxt-content/SKILL.md) - For MDC rendering with SEO frontmatter\n\n## Links\n\n- [Documentation](https://nuxtseo.com)\n- [GitHub](https://github.com/harlan-zw/nuxt-seo)\n\n## Token Efficiency\n\nMain skill: ~250 tokens. Each sub-file: ~400-600 tokens. Only load files relevant to current task.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T07:18:07.347Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing advanced SEO configuration and optimization in Nuxt.js applications.","zh":"非常适合需要在 Nuxt.js 应用程序中进行高级 SEO 配置和优化的全栈代理。","ja":"Nuxt.js アプリケーションで高度な SEO 設定と最適化が必要なフルスタックエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Nuxt.js 애플리케이션에서 고급 SEO 구성 및 최적화를 필요로 하는 풀 스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan configuración y optimización avanzadas de SEO en aplicaciones Nuxt.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack qui ont besoin d''une configuration et d''une optimisation avancées du SEO dans les applications Nuxt.js.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine erweiterte SEO-Konfiguration und -Optimierung in Nuxt.js-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de configuração e otimização avançadas de SEO em aplicações Nuxt.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для полнофункциональных агентов, которым необходима продвинутая настройка и оптимизация SEO в приложениях Nuxt.js.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء العامون الذين يحتاجون إلى تكوين متقدم وتحسين للبحث المتقدم في تطبيقات Nuxt.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate dynamic OG images, JSON-LD structured data, and manage robots.txt and sitemap.xml files using @nuxtjs/seo, enhancing site indexability and search engine rankings.","zh":"赋予代理生成动态 OG 图像、JSON-LD 结构化数据，并使用 @nuxtjs/seo 管理 robots.txt 和 sitemap.xml 文件，从而提高网站的索引能力和搜索引擎排名。","ja":"@nuxtjs/seo を使用して、動的 OG 画像、JSON-LD 構造化データを生成し、robots.txt および sitemap.xml ファイルを管理することで、サイトのインデックス可能性と検索エンジンのランキングを向上させるエージェントをエンパワーメントします。","ko":"@nuxtjs/seo를 사용하여 동적 OG 이미지, JSON-LD 구조화된 데이터를 생성하고 robots.txt 및 sitemap.xml 파일을 관리하여 웹사이트의 색인 가능성과 검색 엔진 순위를 향상시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar imágenes OG dinámicas, datos estructurados JSON-LD y gestionar archivos robots.txt y sitemap.xml utilizando @nuxtjs/seo, lo que mejora la indexabilidad del sitio y los rankings de los motores de búsqueda.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des images OG dynamiques, des données structurées JSON-LD et de gérer les fichiers robots.txt et sitemap.xml en utilisant @nuxtjs/seo, ce qui améliore l''indexabilité du site et les classements des moteurs de recherche.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, dynamische OG-Bilder, strukturierte JSON-LD-Daten und robots.txt- und sitemap.xml-Dateien mit @nuxtjs/seo zu verwalten, was die Indexierbarkeit der Website und die Suchmaschinenranglisten verbessert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar imagens OG dinâmicas, dados estruturados JSON-LD e gerenciar arquivos robots.txt e sitemap.xml usando @nuxtjs/seo, melhorando a indexação do site e os rankings dos motores de busca.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать динамические изображения OG, структурированные данные JSON-LD и управлять файлами robots.txt и sitemap.xml с помощью @nuxtjs/seo, улучшая индексирование сайта и рейтинги поисковых систем.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء ب生成 صور OG ديناميكية وبيانات JSON-LD المنظمة وإدارة ملفات robots.txt وسitemap.xml باستخدام @nuxtjs/seo، مما يحسن khảية الفهرسة للموقع وتصنيفات محركات البحث."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring site URL, name, and indexability for improved search engine visibility","Generating dynamic OG images for enhanced social media sharing","Creating JSON-LD structured data for better schema.org integration"],"zh":["为提高搜索引擎可见性而配置网站 URL、名称和索引能力","生成动态 OG 图像以增强社交媒体分享","创建 JSON-LD 结构化数据以实现更好的 schema.org 集成"],"ja":["検索エンジンの可視性を向上させるためにサイト URL、名前、インデックス可能性を構成する","動的 OG 画像を生成してソーシャルメディアの共有を強化する","schema.org の統合を向上させるために JSON-LD 構造化データを作成する"],"ko":["검색 엔진 노출을 개선하기 위해 사이트 URL, 이름, 색인 가능성을 구성하는 것","동적 OG 이미지를 생성하여 소셜 미디어 공유를 강화하는 것","schema.org 통합을 개선하기 위해 JSON-LD 구조화된 데이터를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Configuración de la URL del sitio, el nombre y la indexabilidad para mejorar la visibilidad en los motores de búsqueda","Generación de imágenes OG dinámicas para una mejor compartición en las redes sociales","Creación de datos estructurados JSON-LD para una mejor integración de schema.org"],"fr":["Configuration de l''URL du site, du nom et de l''indexabilité pour améliorer la visibilité dans les moteurs de recherche","Génération d''images OG dynamiques pour un partage amélioré sur les réseaux sociaux","Création de données structurées JSON-LD pour une meilleure intégration de schema.org"],"de":["Konfiguration der Site-URL, des Namens und der Indexierbarkeit für eine verbesserte Sichtbarkeit in Suchmaschinen","Generierung dynamischer OG-Bilder für ein verbessertes Teilen in sozialen Netzwerken","Erstellung strukturierter JSON-LD-Daten für eine bessere Integration von schema.org"],"pt":["Configurando URL do site, nome e indexação para melhorar a visibilidade do mecanismo de busca","Gerando imagens OG dinâmicas para compartilhamento melhorado de mídia social","Criando dados estruturados JSON-LD para melhor integração com schema.org"],"ru":["Настройка URL сайта, имени и индексирования для улучшения видимости поисковой системы","Генерация динамических изображений OG для улучшения обмена в социальных сетях","Создание структурированных данных JSON-LD для лучшей интеграции с schema.org"],"ar":["تكوين URL الموقع، الاسم والفهرسة لتحسين الرؤية لمحرك البحث","جعل صور OG ديناميكية لمشاركة وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية المحسنة","إنشاء بيانات JSON-LD المنظمة لتحسين التكامل مع schema.org"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Nuxt.js installation and @nuxtjs/seo module","Limited to SEO configuration and optimization within Nuxt.js ecosystem"],"zh":["需要 Nuxt.js 安装和 @nuxtjs/seo 模块","仅限于 Nuxt.js 生态系统内的 SEO 配置和优化"],"ja":["Nuxt.js のインストールと @nuxtjs/seo モジュールが必要","Nuxt.js エコシステム内でのみ SEO 設定と最適化が可能"],"ko":["Nuxt.js 설치 및 @nuxtjs/seo 모듈이 필요함","Nuxt.js 생태계 내에서만 SEO 구성 및 최적화가 가능"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Nuxt.js y el módulo @nuxtjs/seo","Limitado a la configuración y optimización de SEO dentro del ecosistema de Nuxt.js"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Nuxt.js et du module @nuxtjs/seo","Limité à la configuration et à l''optimisation du SEO dans l''écosystème de Nuxt.js"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Nuxt.js und des Moduls @nuxtjs/seo","Begrenzt auf die SEO-Konfiguration und -Optimierung innerhalb des Nuxt.js-Ökosystems"],"pt":["Exige instalação do Nuxt.js e módulo @nuxtjs/seo","Limitado à configuração e otimização de SEO dentro do ecossistema Nuxt.js"],"ru":["Требует установки Nuxt.js и модуля @nuxtjs/seo","Ограничен настройкой и оптимизацией SEO внутри экосистемы Nuxt.js"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Nuxt.js ووحدة @nuxtjs/seo","محدود بتكوين وتحسين البحث المتقدم داخل نظام Nuxt.js"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"254b902fbdd467b08ff7c2556f02dec2afc99fcd47583e02d1f31f9c30e8fbb3","qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('n8n-io/n8n/n8n-conventions', 'official', 'n8n-io', 'n8n', 'n8n-io/n8n', 'n8n-conventions', 176919, 55278, 69, '2026-03-01T05:12:14Z', '2026-03-01T05:14:59.407Z', '6823cc50d12f4ccbb581f5aad8d38bd8feb0b1201b9db70aee38aa2ec082bf68', '{"id":"n8n-io/n8n/n8n-conventions","name":"n8n-conventions","description":{"zh":"n8n 快速参考指南，提供关键模式和最佳实践，帮助开发者提高工作效率。包括 TypeScript、错误处理和工作流自动化等方面","ja":"n8n クイックリファレンスガイド - キーパターンとベストプラクティスを提供して開発者の生産性を向上。TypeScript、エラーハンドリング、ワークフローオートメーションなどを含む","ko":"n8n 빠른 참조 가이드 - 개발자의 생산성을 향상시키는 주요 패턴 및 모범 사례 제공。TypeScript, 오류 처리 및 워크플로 자동화 등 포함","es":"n8n-conventions es una guía rápida para desarrolladores que necesitan recordar patrones críticos para la automatización de flujos de trabajo con n8n","fr":"n8n-conventions est un guide rapide pour les développeurs qui ont besoin de se rappeler des modèles critiques pour l''automatisation des flux de travail avec n8n","de":"n8n-conventions ist ein schnelles Nachschlagewerk für Entwickler, die kritische Muster für die Automatisierung von Workflows mit n8n nachschlagen müssen","pt":"O n8n-conventions é um guia rápido para padrões de desenvolvimento do n8n, incluindo TypeScript e tratamento de erros","ru":"n8n-conventions - это быстрый справочник по конвенциям разработки n8n, включая TypeScript и обработку ошибок","ar":"n8n-conventions هو مرجع سريع للقواعد التوجيهية لتطوير n8n، بما في ذلك TypeScript ومعالجة الأخطاء","en":"Quick reference for n8n patterns. Full docs /AGENTS.md"},"owner":"n8n-io","repo":"n8n","repoPath":"n8n-io/n8n","stars":176919,"forks":55278,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:12:14Z","topics":["ai","apis","automation","cli","data-flow","development","integration-framework","integrations","ipaas","low-code","low-code-platform","mcp","mcp-client","mcp-server","n8n","no-code","self-hosted","typescript","workflow","workflow-automation"],"skillMd":{"name":"n8n-conventions","description":"Quick reference for n8n patterns. Full docs /AGENTS.md","bodyPreview":"# n8n Quick Reference\n\n**📚 Full Documentation:**\n- **General:** `/AGENTS.md` - Architecture, commands, workflows\n- **Frontend:** `/packages/frontend/AGENTS.md` - CSS variables, timing\n\nUse this skill when you need quick reminders on critical patterns.\n\n## Critical Rules (Must Follow)\n\n**TypeScript:**\n- Never `any` → use `unknown`\n- Prefer `satisfies` over `as` (except tests)\n- Shared types in `@n8n/api-types`\n\n**Error Handling:**\n```typescript\nimport { UnexpectedError } from ''n8n-workflow'';\nthr","body":"# n8n Quick Reference\n\n**📚 Full Documentation:**\n- **General:** `/AGENTS.md` - Architecture, commands, workflows\n- **Frontend:** `/packages/frontend/AGENTS.md` - CSS variables, timing\n\nUse this skill when you need quick reminders on critical patterns.\n\n## Critical Rules (Must Follow)\n\n**TypeScript:**\n- Never `any` → use `unknown`\n- Prefer `satisfies` over `as` (except tests)\n- Shared types in `@n8n/api-types`\n\n**Error Handling:**\n```typescript\nimport { UnexpectedError } from ''n8n-workflow'';\nthrow new UnexpectedError(''message'', { extra: { context } });\n// DON''T use deprecated ApplicationError\n```\n\n**Frontend:**\n- Vue 3 Composition API (`<script setup lang=\"ts\">`)\n- CSS variables (never hardcode px) - see `/packages/frontend/AGENTS.md`\n- All text via i18n (`$t(''key'')`)\n- `data-testid` for E2E (single value, no spaces)\n\n**Backend:**\n- Controller → Service → Repository\n- Dependency injection via `@n8n/di`\n- Config via `@n8n/config`\n- Zod schemas for validation\n\n**Testing:**\n- Vitest (unit), Playwright (E2E)\n- Mock external dependencies\n- Work from package directory: `pushd packages/cli && pnpm test`\n\n**Database:**\n- SQLite/PostgreSQL only (app DB)\n- Exception: DB nodes (MySQL Node, etc.) can use DB-specific features\n\n**Commands:**\n```bash\npnpm build > build.log 2>&1  # Always redirect\npnpm typecheck               # Before commit\npnpm lint                    # Before commit\n```\n\n## Key Packages\n\n| Package | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| `packages/cli` | Backend API |\n| `packages/frontend/editor-ui` | Vue 3 frontend |\n| `packages/@n8n/api-types` | Shared types |\n| `packages/@n8n/db` | TypeORM entities |\n| `packages/workflow` | Core interfaces |\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n**Pinia Store:**\n```typescript\nimport { STORES } from ''@n8n/stores'';\nexport const useMyStore = defineStore(STORES.MY_STORE, () => {\n  const state = shallowRef([]);\n  return { state };\n});\n```\n\n**Vue Component:**\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\ntype Props = { title: string };\nconst props = defineProps<Props>();\n</script>\n```\n\n**Service:**\n```typescript\nimport { Service } from ''@n8n/di'';\nimport { Config } from ''@n8n/config'';\n\n@Service()\nexport class MyService {\n  constructor(private readonly config: Config) {}\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n📖 **Need more details?** Read `/AGENTS.md` and `/packages/frontend/AGENTS.md`\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:14:59.407Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理 - n8n 快速参考","ja":"AIエージェント - n8n クイックリファレンス","ko":"AI 에이전트 - n8n 빠른 참조","es":"Herramientas de AI: n8n-conventions para desarrolladores","fr":"Outils d''IA : n8n-conventions pour les développeurs","de":"KI-Tools: n8n-conventions für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramentas de IA n8n: Convenções de Desenvolvimento","ru":"ИИ Агенты n8n: Справочник по Конвенциям","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي n8n: إرشادات الترميز","en":"n8n-conventions"},"description":{"zh":"n8n 快速参考指南，提供关键模式和最佳实践，帮助开发者提高工作效率。包括 TypeScript、错误处理和工作流自动化等方面","ja":"n8n クイックリファレンスガイド - キーパターンとベストプラクティスを提供して開発者の生産性を向上。TypeScript、エラーハンドリング、ワークフローオートメーションなどを含む","ko":"n8n 빠른 참조 가이드 - 개발자의 생산성을 향상시키는 주요 패턴 및 모범 사례 제공。TypeScript, 오류 처리 및 워크플로 자동화 등 포함","es":"n8n-conventions es una guía rápida para desarrolladores que necesitan recordar patrones críticos para la automatización de flujos de trabajo con n8n","fr":"n8n-conventions est un guide rapide pour les développeurs qui ont besoin de se rappeler des modèles critiques pour l''automatisation des flux de travail avec n8n","de":"n8n-conventions ist ein schnelles Nachschlagewerk für Entwickler, die kritische Muster für die Automatisierung von Workflows mit n8n nachschlagen müssen","pt":"O n8n-conventions é um guia rápido para padrões de desenvolvimento do n8n, incluindo TypeScript e tratamento de erros","ru":"n8n-conventions - это быстрый справочник по конвенциям разработки n8n, включая TypeScript и обработку ошибок","ar":"n8n-conventions هو مرجع سريع للقواعد التوجيهية لتطوير n8n، بما في ذلك TypeScript ومعالجة الأخطاء","en":"Quick reference for n8n patterns. Full docs /AGENTS.md"},"definition":{"en":"Quick reference for n8n patterns. Full docs /AGENTS.md"},"features":{"zh":["TypeScript 支持","错误处理最佳实践","工作流自动化","低代码开发","自托管支持"],"ja":["TypeScript サポート","エラーハンドリングベストプラクティス","ワークフローオートメーション","ローコード開発","セルフホスティングサポート"],"ko":["TypeScript 지원","오류 처리 모범 사례","워크플로 자동화","저 код 개발","자체 호스팅 지원"],"es":["Patrones de automatización de flujos de trabajo","Convenciones de código para desarrolladores","Integración con la plataforma n8n","Uso de TypeScript y sus características","Manejo de errores y excepciones"],"fr":["Modèles d''automatisation de flux de travail","Conventions de code pour les développeurs","Intégration avec la plateforme n8n","Utilisation de TypeScript et de ses fonctionnalités","Gestion des erreurs et des exceptions"],"de":["Muster für die Automatisierung von Workflows","Code-Konventionen für Entwickler","Integration mit der n8n-Plattform","Verwendung von TypeScript und seinen Funktionen","Fehler- und Ausnahmehandling"],"pt":["Convenções de desenvolvimento do n8n","Tipos de dados em TypeScript","Tratamento de erros com UnexpectedError","Integração de APIs com o n8n","Automação de fluxo de trabalho com o n8n"],"ru":["Конвенции разработки n8n","Типы данных в TypeScript","Обработка ошибок с UnexpectedError","Интеграция API с n8n","Автоматизация рабочего процесса с n8n"],"ar":["إرشادات الترميز ل n8n","أنواع البيانات في TypeScript","معالجة الأخطاء باستخدام UnexpectedError","تكامل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات مع n8n","تلقيمية تدفق العمل مع n8n"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","n8n","工作流自动化","TypeScript","低代码开发","自托管","错误处理","开发者工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","n8n","ワークフローオートメーション","TypeScript","ローコード開発","セルフホスティング","エラーハンドリング","開発者ツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","n8n","워크플로 자동화","TypeScript","저 코드 개발","자체 호스팅","오류 처리","개발자 도구"],"es":["n8n","automatización de flujos de trabajo","desarrollo de software","TypeScript","integración de APIs","herramientas de AI","desarrollo low-code","plataformas de integración"],"fr":["n8n","automatisation de flux de travail","développement de logiciels","TypeScript","intégration d''API","outils d''IA","développement low-code","plateformes d''intégration"],"de":["n8n","Automatisierung von Workflows","Software-Entwicklung","TypeScript","API-Integration","KI-Tools","Low-Code-Entwicklung","Integrationsplattformen"],"pt":["n8n","desenvolvimento de software","TypeScript","tratamento de erros","integração de APIs","automação de fluxo de trabalho","ferramentas de IA","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["n8n","разработка программного обеспечения","TypeScript","обработка ошибок","интеграция API","автоматизация рабочего процесса","ИИ Агенты","разработчики"],"ar":["n8n","تطوير البرمجيات","TypeScript","معالجة الأخطاء","تكامل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","تلقيمية تدفق العمل","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","المطورون"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Workflow Automation Agents needing to adhere to n8n patterns and conventions.","zh":"非常适合需要遵循n8n模式和约定的工作流自动化代理。","ja":"n8nのパターンと規約に従う必要があるワークフロー自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"n8n 패턴 및 규칙을 준수해야 하는 워크플로 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización de flujos de trabajo que necesitan adherirse a patrones y convenciones de n8n.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation de workflow qui doivent respecter les modèles et conventions de n8n.","de":"Perfekt für Workflow-Automatisierungsagenten, die den Mustern und Konventionen von n8n entsprechen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Fluxo de Trabalho que precisam aderir aos padrões e convenções do n8n.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации рабочих процессов, которым необходимо соблюдать шаблоны и соглашения n8n.","ar":"مثالي لعميل автомة سير العمل الذي يحتاج إلى الالتزام بنماذج وآلات ن8n."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write clean TypeScript code using `unknown` instead of `any`, prefer `satisfies` over `as`, and handle errors with `UnexpectedError` from `n8n-workflow`, ensuring consistency across workflows and frontend implementations.","zh":"赋予代理写干净的TypeScript代码，使用`unknown`代替`any`，更喜欢`satisfies`而不是`as`，并使用`n8n-workflow`中的`UnexpectedError`处理错误，确保工作流和前端实现的一致性。","ja":"エージェントがクリーンなTypeScriptコードを記述できるようにし、`unknown`を`any`の代わりに使用し、`as`よりも`satisfies`を優先し、`n8n-workflow`の`UnexpectedError`でエラーを処理し、ワークフローとフロントエンドの実装の一貫性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 깨끗한 TypeScript 코드를 작성할 수 있도록 하며, `any` 대신 `unknown`을 사용하고, `as` 대신 `satisfies`를 선호하며, `n8n-workflow`의 `UnexpectedError`로 오류를 처리하여 워크플로와 프론트엔드 구현의 일관성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir un código TypeScript limpio utilizando `unknown` en lugar de `any`, prefiriendo `satisfies` sobre `as` y manejando errores con `UnexpectedError` desde `n8n-workflow`, garantizando la consistencia en flujos de trabajo y implementaciones de frontend.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire un code TypeScript propre en utilisant `unknown` au lieu de `any`, en préférant `satisfies` à `as` et en gérant les erreurs avec `UnexpectedError` depuis `n8n-workflow`, assurant ainsi la cohérence à travers les flux de travail et les implémentations frontend.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, sauberen TypeScript-Code zu schreiben, indem sie `unknown` anstelle von `any` verwenden, `satisfies` bevorzugen gegenüber `as` und Fehler mit `UnexpectedError` von `n8n-workflow` behandeln, wodurch die Konsistenz über Workflows und Frontend-Implementierungen hinweg gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escreverem código TypeScript limpo usando `unknown` em vez de `any`, preferir `satisfies` em vez de `as` e lidar com erros com `UnexpectedError` do `n8n-workflow`, garantindo a consistência em todo o fluxo de trabalho e implementações de frontend.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать чистый код TypeScript, используя `unknown` вместо `any`, предпочитая `satisfies` вместо `as` и обрабатывая ошибки с помощью `UnexpectedError` из `n8n-workflow`, обеспечивая согласованность во всех рабочих процессах и реализациях frontend.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من كتابة رمز TypeScript نظيف باستخدام `unknown` بدلاً من `any`، و تفضيل `satisfies` على `as`، ومعالجة الأخطاء باستخدام `UnexpectedError` من `n8n-workflow` ، مما يضمن الاتساق عبر سير العمل وتطبيقات الواجهة الأمامية."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing coding standards for n8n workflows","Implementing robust error handling mechanisms with `UnexpectedError`","Developing reusable frontend components with consistent CSS variables and timing"],"zh":["强制n8n工作流的编码标准","使用`UnexpectedError`实现强大的错误处理机制","使用一致的CSS变量和定时开发可重用的前端组件"],"ja":["n8nワークフローのコーディング規約を強制する","`UnexpectedError`を使用した堅牢なエラーハンドリングメカニズムの実装","一貫したCSS変数とタイミングを使用して再利用可能なフロントエンドコンポーネントを開発する"],"ko":["n8n 워크플로의 코딩 표준 시행","`UnexpectedError`를 사용한 강력한 오류 처리 메커니즘 구현","일관된 CSS 변수와 타이밍을 사용하여 재사용 가능한 프론트엔드 컴포넌트 개발"],"es":["Hacer cumplir los estándares de codificación para flujos de trabajo de n8n","Implementar mecanismos de manejo de errores robustos con `UnexpectedError`","Desarrollar componentes de frontend reutilizables con variables CSS consistentes y temporización"],"fr":["Faire respecter les normes de codage pour les flux de travail n8n","Mettre en œuvre des mécanismes de gestion d''erreurs robustes avec `UnexpectedError`","Développer des composants frontend réutilisables avec des variables CSS cohérentes et une temporisation"],"de":["Durchsetzen von Kodierungsstandards für n8n-Workflows","Implementieren robuster Fehlerbehandlungsmechanismen mit `UnexpectedError`","Entwickeln wiederverwendbarer Frontend-Komponenten mit konsistenten CSS-Variablen und Zeitsteuerung"],"pt":["Aplicar padrões de codificação para fluxos de trabalho do n8n","Implementar mecanismos de tratamento de erros robustos com `UnexpectedError`","Desenvolver componentes de frontend reutilizáveis com variáveis CSS consistentes e temporização"],"ru":["Применять стандарты кодирования для рабочих процессов n8n","Реализовывать надежные механизмы обработки ошибок с помощью `UnexpectedError`","Разрабатывать многократно используемые компоненты frontend с согласованными переменными CSS и таймингом"],"ar":["تطبيق معايير الترميز لسير العمل n8n","تنفيذ آليات معالجة الأخطاء القوية باستخدام `UnexpectedError`","تطوير مكونات الواجهة الأمامية القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع متغيرات CSS متسقة وتوقيت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of TypeScript and n8n workflow architecture","Limited to n8n-specific implementations and conventions"],"zh":["需要TypeScript和n8n工作流架构的知识","仅限n8n特定的实现和约定"],"ja":["TypeScriptとn8nワークフローアーキテクチャの知識が必要","n8n特有の実装と規約に限定される"],"ko":["TypeScript와 n8n 워크플로 아키텍처에 대한 지식이 필요","n8n 특정 구현 및 규약으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de TypeScript y arquitectura de flujos de trabajo de n8n","Limitado a implementaciones y convenciones específicas de n8n"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en TypeScript et en architecture de flux de travail n8n","Limité aux implémentations et conventions spécifiques à n8n"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von TypeScript und n8n-Workflow-Architektur","Begrenzt auf n8n-spezifische Implementierungen und Konventionen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de TypeScript e arquitetura de fluxo de trabalho do n8n","Limitado a implementações e convenções específicas do n8n"],"ru":["Требует знания TypeScript и архитектуры рабочих процессов n8n","Ограничен реализациями и соглашениями, специфичными для n8n"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة TypeScript و هيكل سير العمل n8n","محدود بالتنفيذات والأilenames الخاصة بن8n"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6823cc50d12f4ccbb581f5aad8d38bd8feb0b1201b9db70aee38aa2ec082bf68","repoEtag":"W/\"2bfcea59898d93bb3842b5336c5e1c10d08a62ce151b2223d6a7b4480bfdf16a\"","qualityScore":69}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('obra/superpowers/brainstorming', 'official', 'obra', 'superpowers', 'obra/superpowers', 'brainstorming', 66125, 5048, 68, '2026-03-01T05:08:15Z', '2026-03-01T05:08:47.269Z', '7a238df1ebf0656c1da199aafafcc78c42f47bf4e56dd4e007a67afbb10af455', '{"id":"obra/superpowers/brainstorming","name":"brainstorming","description":{"zh":"头脑风暴技能可以帮助开发者将想法转化为成熟的设计和规格，通过自然的协作对话","ja":"ブレーンストーミング機能は、開発者がアイデアを完全な設計と仕様に変えるのに役立ちます","ko":"브레인스토밍 기능은 개발자가 아이디어를 완전한 디자인과 사양으로 변환하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"El brainstorming es fundamental antes de cualquier trabajo creativo, ayuda a explorar la intención del usuario y los requisitos de diseño","fr":"Le brainstorming est essentiel avant tout travail créatif, il aide à explorer l''intention de l''utilisateur et les exigences de conception","de":"Brainstorming ist vor jeder kreativen Arbeit grundlegend, hilft bei der Erforschung der Benutzerintention und der Designanforderungen","pt":"As ferramentas de IA para brainstorming ajudam a transformar ideias em designs e specs, melhorando o desenvolvimento de projetos","ru":"ИИ Агенты для мозгового штурма помогают превратить идеи в дизайны и спецификации, улучшая разработку проектов","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتفكير الإبداعي تساعد على تحويل الأفكار إلى تصاميم و مواصفات، مما يعزز تطوير المشاريع","en":"You MUST use this before any creative work - creating features, building components, adding functionality, or modifying behavior. Explores user intent, requirements and design before implementation."},"owner":"obra","repo":"superpowers","repoPath":"obra/superpowers","stars":66125,"forks":5048,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:08:15Z","topics":[],"skillMd":{"name":"brainstorming","description":"You MUST use this before any creative work - creating features, building components, adding functionality, or modifying behavior. Explores user intent, requirements and design before implementation.","bodyPreview":"# Brainstorming Ideas Into Designs\n\n## Overview\n\nHelp turn ideas into fully formed designs and specs through natural collaborative dialogue.\n\nStart by understanding the current project context, then ask questions one at a time to refine the idea. Once you understand what you''re building, present the design and get user approval.\n\n<HARD-GATE>\nDo NOT invoke any implementation skill, write any code, scaffold any project, or take any implementation action until you have presented a design and the us","body":"# Brainstorming Ideas Into Designs\n\n## Overview\n\nHelp turn ideas into fully formed designs and specs through natural collaborative dialogue.\n\nStart by understanding the current project context, then ask questions one at a time to refine the idea. Once you understand what you''re building, present the design and get user approval.\n\n<HARD-GATE>\nDo NOT invoke any implementation skill, write any code, scaffold any project, or take any implementation action until you have presented a design and the user has approved it. This applies to EVERY project regardless of perceived simplicity.\n</HARD-GATE>\n\n## Anti-Pattern: \"This Is Too Simple To Need A Design\"\n\nEvery project goes through this process. A todo list, a single-function utility, a config change — all of them. \"Simple\" projects are where unexamined assumptions cause the most wasted work. The design can be short (a few sentences for truly simple projects), but you MUST present it and get approval.\n\n## Checklist\n\nYou MUST create a task for each of these items and complete them in order:\n\n1. **Explore project context** — check files, docs, recent commits\n2. **Ask clarifying questions** — one at a time, understand purpose/constraints/success criteria\n3. **Propose 2-3 approaches** — with trade-offs and your recommendation\n4. **Present design** — in sections scaled to their complexity, get user approval after each section\n5. **Write design doc** — save to `docs/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<topic>-design.md` and commit\n6. **Transition to implementation** — invoke writing-plans skill to create implementation plan\n\n## Process Flow\n\n```dot\ndigraph brainstorming {\n    \"Explore project context\" [shape=box];\n    \"Ask clarifying questions\" [shape=box];\n    \"Propose 2-3 approaches\" [shape=box];\n    \"Present design sections\" [shape=box];\n    \"User approves design?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Write design doc\" [shape=box];\n    \"Invoke writing-plans skill\" [shape=doublecircle];\n\n    \"Explore project context\" -> \"Ask clarifying questions\";\n    \"Ask clarifying questions\" -> \"Propose 2-3 approaches\";\n    \"Propose 2-3 approaches\" -> \"Present design sections\";\n    \"Present design sections\" -> \"User approves design?\";\n    \"User approves design?\" -> \"Present design sections\" [label=\"no, revise\"];\n    \"User approves design?\" -> \"Write design doc\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Write design doc\" -> \"Invoke writing-plans skill\";\n}\n```\n\n**The terminal state is invoking writing-plans.** Do NOT invoke frontend-design, mcp-builder, or any other implementation skill. The ONLY skill you invoke after brainstorming is writing-plans.\n\n## The Process\n\n**Understanding the idea:**\n- Check out the current project state first (files, docs, recent commits)\n- Ask questions one at a time to refine the idea\n- Prefer multiple choice questions when possible, but open-ended is fine too\n- Only one question per message - if a topic needs more exploration, break it into multiple questions\n- Focus on understanding: purpose, constraints, success criteria\n\n**Exploring approaches:**\n- Propose 2-3 different approaches with trade-offs\n- Present options conversationally with your recommendation and reasoning\n- Lead with your recommended option and explain why\n\n**Presenting the design:**\n- Once you believe you understand what you''re building, present the design\n- Scale each section to its complexity: a few sentences if straightforward, up to 200-300 words if nuanced\n- Ask after each section whether it looks right so far\n- Cover: architecture, components, data flow, error handling, testing\n- Be ready to go back and clarify if something doesn''t make sense\n\n## After the Design\n\n**Documentation:**\n- Write the validated design to `docs/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<topic>-design.md`\n- Use elements-of-style:writing-clearly-and-concisely skill if available\n- Commit the design document to git\n\n**Implementation:**\n- Invoke the writing-plans skill to create a detailed implementation plan\n- Do NOT invoke any other skill. writing-plans is the next step.\n\n## Key Principles\n\n- **One question at a time** - Don''t overwhelm with multiple questions\n- **Multiple choice preferred** - Easier to answer than open-ended when possible\n- **YAGNI ruthlessly** - Remove unnecessary features from all designs\n- **Explore alternatives** - Always propose 2-3 approaches before settling\n- **Incremental validation** - Present design, get approval before moving on\n- **Be flexible** - Go back and clarify when something doesn''t make sense\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:08:47.269Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具 -头脑风暴技能","ja":"AIエージェント - ブレーンストーミング","ko":"AI 에이전트 - 브레인스토밍","es":"Herramientas de AI para Brainstorming: Diseño de Ideas","fr":"Outils d''IA pour le Brainstorming: Conception de Designs","de":"KI-Tools für Brainstorming: Ideen in Designs umsetzen","pt":"Ferramentas de IA para Brainstorming: Desenvolvimento de ...","ru":"ИИ Агенты для мозгового штурма: разработка проектов","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتفكير الإبداعي: تطوير المشاريع","en":"brainstorming"},"description":{"zh":"头脑风暴技能可以帮助开发者将想法转化为成熟的设计和规格，通过自然的协作对话","ja":"ブレーンストーミング機能は、開発者がアイデアを完全な設計と仕様に変えるのに役立ちます","ko":"브레인스토밍 기능은 개발자가 아이디어를 완전한 디자인과 사양으로 변환하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"El brainstorming es fundamental antes de cualquier trabajo creativo, ayuda a explorar la intención del usuario y los requisitos de diseño","fr":"Le brainstorming est essentiel avant tout travail créatif, il aide à explorer l''intention de l''utilisateur et les exigences de conception","de":"Brainstorming ist vor jeder kreativen Arbeit grundlegend, hilft bei der Erforschung der Benutzerintention und der Designanforderungen","pt":"As ferramentas de IA para brainstorming ajudam a transformar ideias em designs e specs, melhorando o desenvolvimento de projetos","ru":"ИИ Агенты для мозгового штурма помогают превратить идеи в дизайны и спецификации, улучшая разработку проектов","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتفكير الإبداعي تساعد على تحويل الأفكار إلى تصاميم و مواصفات، مما يعزز تطوير المشاريع","en":"You MUST use this before any creative work - creating features, building components, adding functionality, or modifying behavior. Explores user intent, requi..."},"definition":{"en":"You MUST use this before any creative work - creating features, building components, adding functionality, or modifying behavior. Explores user intent, requirements and design before implementation."},"features":{"zh":["将想法转化为成熟的设计和规格","通过自然的协作对话","理解项目背景","提出问题以完善想法","呈现设计并获得用户批准"],"ja":["アイデアを完全な設計と仕様に","自然なコラボレーションの対話を通じて","プロジェクトの背景を理解","質問をしてアイデアを洗練","設計を提示してユーザーの承認を得る"],"ko":["아이디어를 완전한 디자인과 사양으로","자연적인 협력 대화를 통해","프로젝트의 배경을 이해","질문하여 아이디어를 정제","디자인을 제시하고 사용자의 승인을 얻기"],"es":["Exploración de la intención del usuario","Desarrollo de ideas y especificaciones","Diálogo colaborativo natural","Presentación de diseños y aprobación del usuario","Refinamiento de ideas a través de preguntas"],"fr":["Exploration de l''intention de l''utilisateur","Développement d''idées et de spécifications","Dialogue collaboratif naturel","Présentation de conceptions et approbation de l''utilisateur","Affinement des idées à travers des questions"],"de":["Erforschung der Benutzerintention","Entwicklung von Ideen und Spezifikationen","Natürlicher Zusammenarbeit-Dialog","Präsentation von Designs und Benutzerzustimmung","Verfeinerung von Ideen durch Fragen"],"pt":["Transformação de ideias em designs e specs","Diálogo colaborativo para refinar ideias","Apresentação de designs e aprovação do usuário","Melhoria do desenvolvimento de projetos","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Превращение идей в дизайны и спецификации","Совместный диалог для уточнения идей","Презентация дизайнов и утверждение пользователя","Улучшение разработки проектов","Интеграция с инструментами разработки"],"ar":["تحويل الأفكار إلى تصاميم و مواصفات","حوار تعاوني لتصفية الأفكار","عرض التصاميم و موافقة المستخدم","تحسين تطوير المشاريع","دمج مع أدوات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","头脑风暴技能","设计和规格","协作对话","项目背景","开发者工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","ブレーンストーミング","設計と仕様","コラボレーションの対話","プロジェクトの背景","開発者ツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","브레인스토밍","디자인과 사양","협력 대화","프로젝트의 배경","개발자 도구"],"es":["herramientas de AI para brainstorming","diseño de ideas","desarrollo de software","collaboración en equipo","intención del usuario","especificaciones de diseño"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour le brainstorming","conception de designs","développement de logiciels","collaboration d''équipe","intention de l''utilisateur","spécifications de conception"],"de":["KI-Tools für Brainstorming","Design-Entwicklung","Software-Entwicklung","Teamzusammenarbeit","Benutzerintention","Design-Spezifikationen"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","brainstorming","desenvolvimento de projetos","design de projetos","specs de projetos","diálogo colaborativo","apresentação de designs"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","мозговой штурм","разработка проектов","дизайн проектов","спецификации проектов","совместный диалог","презентация дизайнов"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التفكير الإبداعي","تطوير المشاريع","تصميم المشاريع","مواصفات المشاريع","حوار تعاوني","عرض التصاميم"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversational AI Agents requiring collaborative design and specification development through natural dialogue.","zh":"适合需要通过自然对话进行协作设计和规格开发的对话式 AI 代理。","ja":"会話AIエージェントが自然な対話を通じて共同設計および仕様開発を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자연어 대화를 통해 협업 디자인 및 사양 개발이 필요한 대화형 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Conversacional que requieren un diseño y desarrollo de especificaciones colaborativos a través del diálogo natural.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA Conversationnels nécessitant une conception et un développement de spécifications collaboratifs via le dialogue naturel.","de":"Ideal für Conversational AI-Agents, die ein kollaboratives Design und eine Spezifikationsentwicklung durch natürliche Dialoge erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Conversational AI Agents que requerem desenvolvimento colaborativo de design e especificação através de diálogo natural.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Conversational AI Agents, требующих совместной разработки дизайна и спецификаций посредством естественного диалога.","ar":"مثالي لـ Conversational AI Agents التي تتطلب تطوير تصميم وتعاوني للمواصفات من خلال الحوار الطبيعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to explore user intent and requirements through iterative questioning, presenting refined designs and specs for approval, leveraging natural language processing and collaborative dialogue protocols.","zh":"启用代理通过迭代提问来探索用户意图和需求，通过自然语言处理和协作对话协议，提出完善的设计和规格以供批准。","ja":"エージェントが反復的な質問を通じてユーザーの意図と要件を探索し、自然言語処理と共同対話プロトコルを利用して、改良された設計と仕様を承認するために提出します。","ko":"에이전트가 반복적인 질문을 통해 사용자의 의도와 요구사항을 탐색하고, 자연어 처리와 협업 대화 프로토콜을 사용하여 개선된 설계와 사양을 승인하기 위해 제시합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a explorar la intención y los requisitos del usuario a través de una interrogación iterativa, presentando diseños y especificaciones refinados para su aprobación, aprovechando el procesamiento de lenguaje natural y los protocolos de diálogo colaborativo.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''explorer l''intention et les exigences de l''utilisateur à travers une interrogation itérative, présentant des conceptions et des spécifications raffinées pour approbation, en exploitant le traitement du langage naturel et les protocoles de dialogue collaboratif.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Benutzerabsicht und -anforderungen durch iterative Fragestellung zu erkunden, präsentiert verfeinerte Designs und Spezifikationen zur Genehmigung, nutzt die Verarbeitung von natürlicher Sprache und kollaborative Dialogprotokolle.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a explorar a intenção e os requisitos do usuário através de questionamento iterativo, apresentando designs e especificações refinados para aprovação, aproveitando o processamento de linguagem natural e protocolos de diálogo colaborativo.","ru":"Позволяет агентам исследовать намерения и требования пользователей с помощью итеративного опроса, представляя усовершенствованные проекты и спецификации для одобрения, используя обработку естественного языка и протоколы совместного диалога.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من استكشاف نية المستخدم والمتطلبات من خلال الأسئلة التكرارية، وعرض تصاميم ومواصفات مُحسنة للموافقة، مستفيدًا من معالجة اللغة الطبيعية وبروتوكولات الحوار التعاوني."},"useCases":{"en":["Refining project concepts through iterative questioning","Developing detailed design specifications","Validating user requirements through collaborative dialogue"],"zh":["通过迭代提问来完善项目概念","开发详细的设计规格","通过协作对话来验证用户需求"],"ja":["反復的な質問を通じてプロジェクトの概念を洗練する","詳細な設計仕様を開発する","共同対話を通じてユーザーの要件を検証する"],"ko":["반복적인 질문을 통해 프로젝트 개념을 세부화하는 것","詳細한 설계 사양을 개발하는 것","협업 대화를 통해 사용자 요구사항을 검증하는 것"],"es":["Refinar conceptos de proyecto a través de una interrogación iterativa","Desarrollar especificaciones de diseño detalladas","Validar los requisitos del usuario a través del diálogo colaborativo"],"fr":["Affiner les concepts de projet à travers une interrogation itérative","Développer des spécifications de conception détaillées","Valider les exigences de l''utilisateur via le dialogue collaboratif"],"de":["Projektkonzepte durch iterative Fragestellung verfeinern","Detaillierte Designspezifikationen entwickeln","Benutzeranforderungen durch kollaborativen Dialog validieren"],"pt":["Refinamento de conceitos de projeto através de questionamento iterativo","Desenvolvimento de especificações de design detalhadas","Validação de requisitos do usuário através de diálogo colaborativo"],"ru":["Уточнение концепций проекта с помощью итеративного опроса","Разработка детальных спецификаций дизайна","Проверка требований пользователей посредством совместного диалога"],"ar":["تحسين مفاهيم المشروع من خلال الأسئلة التكرارية","تطوير مواصفات تصميم مفصلة","التحقق من متطلبات المستخدم من خلال الحوار التعاوني"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires explicit user approval before implementation","Does not invoke implementation skills or write code"],"zh":["需要用户明确批准后才可以实施","不调用实现技能或编写代码"],"ja":["実装する前にユーザーの明示的な承認が必要","実装スキルを呼び出すかコードを記述しない"],"ko":["구현하기 전에 사용자의 명시적인 승인이 필요함","구현 스킬을 호출하거나 코드를 작성하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere una aprobación explícita del usuario antes de la implementación","No invoca habilidades de implementación ni escribe código"],"fr":["Nécessite une approbation explicite de l''utilisateur avant la mise en œuvre","Ne fait pas appel à des compétences de mise en œuvre ni n''écrit de code"],"de":["Benötigt eine explizite Benutzerzustimmung vor der Implementierung","Ruft keine Implementierungsfähigkeiten auf und schreibt keinen Code"],"pt":["Requer aprovação explícita do usuário antes da implementação","Não invoca habilidades de implementação ou escreve código"],"ru":["Требует явного одобрения пользователя перед реализацией","Не вызывает навыки реализации и не пишет код"],"ar":["يتطلب موافقة صريحة من المستخدم قبل التنفيذ","لا يستدعي مهارات التنفيذ أو يكتب التعليمات البرمجية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7a238df1ebf0656c1da199aafafcc78c42f47bf4e56dd4e007a67afbb10af455","repoEtag":"W/\"c0159b000a3f1065b2a623072c2f281d1dae59e39bce28acebe789d1e6a6aa8e\"","qualityScore":68}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('obra/superpowers/finishing-a-development-branch', 'official', 'obra', 'superpowers', 'obra/superpowers', 'finishing-a-development-branch', 66125, 5048, 68, '2026-03-01T05:08:15Z', '2026-03-01T05:08:48.116Z', 'dd2f82c6dc8582b621f9eb57fcb65f557f88eadf872727ac81d0840ae12c504e', '{"id":"obra/superpowers/finishing-a-development-branch","name":"finishing-a-development-branch","description":{"zh":"完成开发分支的AI工具，提供结构化的合并、PR和清理选项","ja":"開発ブランチの完了を支援するAIエージェント、合并、PR、クリーンナップの構造化されたオプションを提供","ko":"개발 분기 완성을 위한 AI 에이전트, 구조화된 병합, PR 및 정리 옵션 제공","es":"La habilidad de finalizar una rama de desarrollo es crucial para los desarrolladores. Esta herramienta de AI guía la implementación y prueba del código","fr":"La compétence de finaliser une branche de développement est essentielle pour les développeurs. Cet outil d''IA guide l''implémentation et les tests du code","de":"Die Fähigkeit, einen Entwicklungszweig abzuschließen, ist für Entwickler von entscheidender Bedeutung. Dieses KI-Tool leitet die Implementierung und das Testen des Codes","pt":"A ferramenta de IA para finalizar ramo de desenvolvimento ajuda a concluir o trabalho de desenvolvimento, apresentando opções estruturadas para mesclar, PR ou limpeza","ru":"ИИ Агент для завершения разработки ветки помогает завершить работу по разработке, предлагая структурированные варианты для слияния, PR или очистки","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي لإنهاء فرع التطوير تساعد في إكمال العمل التطويري، مع تقديم خيارات منظمة للدمج أو 청소","en":"Use when implementation is complete, all tests pass, and you need to decide how to integrate the work - guides completion of development work by presenting structured options for merge, PR, or cleanup"},"owner":"obra","repo":"superpowers","repoPath":"obra/superpowers","stars":66125,"forks":5048,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:08:15Z","topics":[],"skillMd":{"name":"finishing-a-development-branch","description":"Use when implementation is complete, all tests pass, and you need to decide how to integrate the work - guides completion of development work by presenting structured options for merge, PR, or cleanup","bodyPreview":"# Finishing a Development Branch\n\n## Overview\n\nGuide completion of development work by presenting clear options and handling chosen workflow.\n\n**Core principle:** Verify tests → Present options → Execute choice → Clean up.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the finishing-a-development-branch skill to complete this work.\"\n\n## The Process\n\n### Step 1: Verify Tests\n\n**Before presenting options, verify tests pass:**\n\n```bash\n# Run project''s test suite\nnpm test / cargo test / pytest / go test ./...\n`","body":"# Finishing a Development Branch\n\n## Overview\n\nGuide completion of development work by presenting clear options and handling chosen workflow.\n\n**Core principle:** Verify tests → Present options → Execute choice → Clean up.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the finishing-a-development-branch skill to complete this work.\"\n\n## The Process\n\n### Step 1: Verify Tests\n\n**Before presenting options, verify tests pass:**\n\n```bash\n# Run project''s test suite\nnpm test / cargo test / pytest / go test ./...\n```\n\n**If tests fail:**\n```\nTests failing (<N> failures). Must fix before completing:\n\n[Show failures]\n\nCannot proceed with merge/PR until tests pass.\n```\n\nStop. Don''t proceed to Step 2.\n\n**If tests pass:** Continue to Step 2.\n\n### Step 2: Determine Base Branch\n\n```bash\n# Try common base branches\ngit merge-base HEAD main 2>/dev/null || git merge-base HEAD master 2>/dev/null\n```\n\nOr ask: \"This branch split from main - is that correct?\"\n\n### Step 3: Present Options\n\nPresent exactly these 4 options:\n\n```\nImplementation complete. What would you like to do?\n\n1. Merge back to <base-branch> locally\n2. Push and create a Pull Request\n3. Keep the branch as-is (I''ll handle it later)\n4. Discard this work\n\nWhich option?\n```\n\n**Don''t add explanation** - keep options concise.\n\n### Step 4: Execute Choice\n\n#### Option 1: Merge Locally\n\n```bash\n# Switch to base branch\ngit checkout <base-branch>\n\n# Pull latest\ngit pull\n\n# Merge feature branch\ngit merge <feature-branch>\n\n# Verify tests on merged result\n<test command>\n\n# If tests pass\ngit branch -d <feature-branch>\n```\n\nThen: Cleanup worktree (Step 5)\n\n#### Option 2: Push and Create PR\n\n```bash\n# Push branch\ngit push -u origin <feature-branch>\n\n# Create PR\ngh pr create --title \"<title>\" --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\n<2-3 bullets of what changed>\n\n## Test Plan\n- [ ] <verification steps>\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\nThen: Cleanup worktree (Step 5)\n\n#### Option 3: Keep As-Is\n\nReport: \"Keeping branch <name>. Worktree preserved at <path>.\"\n\n**Don''t cleanup worktree.**\n\n#### Option 4: Discard\n\n**Confirm first:**\n```\nThis will permanently delete:\n- Branch <name>\n- All commits: <commit-list>\n- Worktree at <path>\n\nType ''discard'' to confirm.\n```\n\nWait for exact confirmation.\n\nIf confirmed:\n```bash\ngit checkout <base-branch>\ngit branch -D <feature-branch>\n```\n\nThen: Cleanup worktree (Step 5)\n\n### Step 5: Cleanup Worktree\n\n**For Options 1, 2, 4:**\n\nCheck if in worktree:\n```bash\ngit worktree list | grep $(git branch --show-current)\n```\n\nIf yes:\n```bash\ngit worktree remove <worktree-path>\n```\n\n**For Option 3:** Keep worktree.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Option | Merge | Push | Keep Worktree | Cleanup Branch |\n|--------|-------|------|---------------|----------------|\n| 1. Merge locally | ✓ | - | - | ✓ |\n| 2. Create PR | - | ✓ | ✓ | - |\n| 3. Keep as-is | - | - | ✓ | - |\n| 4. Discard | - | - | - | ✓ (force) |\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n**Skipping test verification**\n- **Problem:** Merge broken code, create failing PR\n- **Fix:** Always verify tests before offering options\n\n**Open-ended questions**\n- **Problem:** \"What should I do next?\" → ambiguous\n- **Fix:** Present exactly 4 structured options\n\n**Automatic worktree cleanup**\n- **Problem:** Remove worktree when might need it (Option 2, 3)\n- **Fix:** Only cleanup for Options 1 and 4\n\n**No confirmation for discard**\n- **Problem:** Accidentally delete work\n- **Fix:** Require typed \"discard\" confirmation\n\n## Red Flags\n\n**Never:**\n- Proceed with failing tests\n- Merge without verifying tests on result\n- Delete work without confirmation\n- Force-push without explicit request\n\n**Always:**\n- Verify tests before offering options\n- Present exactly 4 options\n- Get typed confirmation for Option 4\n- Clean up worktree for Options 1 & 4 only\n\n## Integration\n\n**Called by:**\n- **subagent-driven-development** (Step 7) - After all tasks complete\n- **executing-plans** (Step 5) - After all batches complete\n\n**Pairs with:**\n- **using-git-worktrees** - Cleans up worktree created by that skill\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:08:48.116Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具：完成开发分支","ja":"AIエージェント：開発ブランチの完了","ko":"AI 에이전트: 개발 분기 완료","es":"Herramientas de AI: Finalizar rama de desarrollo","fr":"Outils d''IA: Finaliser une branche de développement","de":"KI-Tools: Entwicklungszweig abschließen","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Finalizar Ramo de Desenvolvimento","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Завершение Разработки Ветки","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: إنهاء فرع التطوير","en":"finishing-a-development-branch"},"description":{"zh":"完成开发分支的AI工具，提供结构化的合并、PR和清理选项","ja":"開発ブランチの完了を支援するAIエージェント、合并、PR、クリーンナップの構造化されたオプションを提供","ko":"개발 분기 완성을 위한 AI 에이전트, 구조화된 병합, PR 및 정리 옵션 제공","es":"La habilidad de finalizar una rama de desarrollo es crucial para los desarrolladores. Esta herramienta de AI guía la implementación y prueba del código","fr":"La compétence de finaliser une branche de développement est essentielle pour les développeurs. Cet outil d''IA guide l''implémentation et les tests du code","de":"Die Fähigkeit, einen Entwicklungszweig abzuschließen, ist für Entwickler von entscheidender Bedeutung. Dieses KI-Tool leitet die Implementierung und das Test...","pt":"A ferramenta de IA para finalizar ramo de desenvolvimento ajuda a concluir o trabalho de desenvolvimento, apresentando opções estruturadas para mesclar, PR o...","ru":"ИИ Агент для завершения разработки ветки помогает завершить работу по разработке, предлагая структурированные варианты для слияния, PR или очистки","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي لإنهاء فرع التطوير تساعد في إكمال العمل التطويري، مع تقديم خيارات منظمة للدمج أو 청소","en":"Use when implementation is complete, all tests pass, and you need to decide how to integrate the work - guides completion of development work by presenting s..."},"definition":{"en":"Use when implementation is complete, all tests pass, and you need to decide how to integrate the work - guides completion of development work by presenting structured options for merge, PR, or cleanup"},"features":{"zh":["结构化的合并选项","自动化测试和代码审查","PR和清理选项","开发工作的完成指南","集成工作的决策支持"],"ja":["合并の構造化されたオプション","自動テストとコードレビュー","PRとクリーンナップのオプション","開発作業の完了ガイド","作業の統合の意思決定サポート"],"ko":["구조화된 병합 옵션","자동 테스트 및 코드 리뷰","PR 및 정리 옵션","개발 작업 완료 가이드","작업 통합 의사 결정 지원"],"es":["Guía para la implementación y prueba del código","Opciones estructuradas para la fusión, PR o limpieza","Compatibilidad con flujos de trabajo de desarrollo","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo populares","Soporte para múltiples lenguajes de programación","Informes detallados y análisis del código"],"fr":["Guide pour l''implémentation et les tests du code","Options structurées pour la fusion, la PR ou le nettoyage","Compatibilité avec les flux de travail de développement","Intégration avec des outils de développement populaires","Support pour plusieurs langages de programmation","Rapports détaillés et analyse du code"],"de":["Anleitung für die Implementierung und das Testen des Codes","Strukturierte Optionen für die Zusammenführung, PR oder Bereinigung","Kompatibilität mit Entwicklungswerkflüssen","Integration mit beliebten Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen","Detaillierte Berichte und Code-Analyse"],"pt":["Opções estruturadas para mesclar","Opções para Pull Request (PR)","Opções para limpeza","Guia para concluir o trabalho de desenvolvimento","Suporte para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Структурированные варианты для слияния","Варианты для Pull Request (PR)","Варианты для очистки","Руководство для завершения работы по разработке","Поддержка разработчиков"],"ar":["خيارات منظمة للدمج","خيارات لطلب السحب (PR)","خيارات لل청소","دليل لإكمال العمل التطويري","دعم المطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","开发分支","自动化测试","代码审查","合并","PR","清理","开发工作","集成"],"ja":["AIエージェント","開発ブランチ","自動テスト","コードレビュー","合并","PR","クリーンナップ","開発作業","統合"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","개발 분기","자동 테스트","코드 리뷰","병합","PR","정리","개발 작업","통합"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","finalizar rama de desarrollo","implementación y prueba de código","fusión de ramas","pull request","limpieza de código","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software","pruebas de software"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour développeurs","finaliser une branche de développement","implémentation et tests de code","fusion de branches","demande de tirage","nettoyage de code","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels","tests de logiciels"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","Entwicklungszweig abschließen","Implementierung und Testen von Code","Zusammenführung von Zweigen","Pull-Request","Code-Bereinigung","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen","Software-Tests"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","desenvolvimento de software","finalizar ramo de desenvolvimento","mesclar","PR","limpeza","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","разработка программного обеспечения","завершение разработки ветки","слияние","PR","очистка","разработчики"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","إنهاء فرع التطوير","الدمج","PR","청소","المطورين"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents needing structured development branch completion capabilities, particularly those utilizing npm, cargo, pytest, or go test.","zh":"适用于需要结构化开发分支完成能力的开发代理，特别是那些使用npm、cargo、pytest或go test的代理。","ja":"npm、cargo、pytest、またはgo testを利用する開発エージェントが構造化された開発ブランチの完了機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"npm, cargo, pytest 또는 go test를 사용하는 개발 에이전트가 구조화된 개발 분기 완성 기능을 필요로 할 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan capacidades de finalización de ramas de desarrollo estructuradas, particularmente aquellos que utilizan npm, cargo, pytest o go test.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant des capacités de finalisation de branches de développement structurées, en particulier ceux utilisant npm, cargo, pytest ou go test.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine strukturierte Entwicklungszweigabschlussfunktion benötigen, insbesondere solche, die npm, cargo, pytest oder go test verwenden.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de capacidades de conclusão de ramificação de desenvolvimento estruturada, particularmente aqueles que utilizam npm, cargo, pytest ou go test.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходимы структурированные возможности завершения ветки разработки, особенно для тех, кто использует npm, cargo, pytest или go test.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النمطية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات إكمال فرع التطوير المنظم، خاصة أولئك الذين يستخدمون npm، cargo، pytest، أو go test."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to guide completion of development work by verifying tests, presenting merge, PR, or cleanup options, and executing chosen workflows using npm test, cargo test, pytest, or go test.","zh":"赋予代理指导开发工作的完成，通过验证测试、展示合并、PR或清理选项，并使用npm test、cargo test、pytest或go test执行选定的工作流。","ja":"エージェントが開発作業の完了を導くことを可能にし、テストの検証、병합、PR、またはクリーンアップのオプションの提示、およびnpm test、cargo test、pytest、またはgo testを使用した選択されたワークフローの実行を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 개발 작업의 완성을 안내할 수 있도록 하며, 테스트의 검증, 병합, PR 또는 정리 옵션의 표시, 및 npm test, cargo test, pytest 또는 go test를 사용한 선택된 워크플로우의 실행을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a guiar la finalización del trabajo de desarrollo verificando pruebas, presentando opciones de fusión, PR o limpieza y ejecutando flujos de trabajo elegidos usando npm test, cargo test, pytest o go test.","fr":"Permet aux agents de guider l''achèvement du travail de développement en vérifiant les tests, en présentant des options de fusion, PR ou de nettoyage et en exécutant des flux de travail choisis à l''aide de npm test, cargo test, pytest ou go test.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Fertigstellung der Entwicklungsaufgaben zu leiten, indem sie Tests überprüfen, Merge-, PR- oder Bereinigungsoptionen präsentieren und ausgewählte Workflows mit npm test, cargo test, pytest oder go test ausführen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a orientar a conclusão do trabalho de desenvolvimento, verificando testes, apresentando opções de mesclagem, PR ou limpeza e executando fluxos de trabalho escolhidos usando npm test, cargo test, pytest ou go test.","ru":"Позволяет агентам направлять завершение разработки, проверяя тесты, представляя варианты слияния, PR или очистки и выполняя выбранные рабочие процессы с использованием npm test, cargo test, pytest или go test.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إرشاد إكمال العمل التطويري من خلال التحقق من الاختبارات وعرض خيارات الدمج أو الطلبات السحب أو تنظيف وتنفيذ سير العمل المختارة باستخدام npm test، cargo test، pytest أو go test."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating development branch cleanup","Executing pull requests after successful testing","Streamlining merge workflows for completed features"],"zh":["自动化开发分支清理","在成功测试后执行拉取请求","为完成的功能流线化合并工作流"],"ja":["開発ブランチのクリーンアップを自動化する","成功したテスト後にプルリクエストを実行する","完了した機能の병합ワークフローをストリームライン化する"],"ko":["개발 분기 정리를 자동화하는 것","성공한 테스트 후에 풀 リクエスト를 실행하는 것","완성된 기능의 병합 워크플로우를 스트림라인화하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la limpieza de ramas de desarrollo","Ejecución de solicitudes de extracción después de pruebas exitosas","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de fusión para características completadas"],"fr":["Automatisation de la nettoyage de branches de développement","Exécution de demandes d''extraction après des tests réussis","Optimisation des flux de travail de fusion pour les fonctionnalités terminées"],"de":["Automatisierung der Entwicklungszweigbereinigung","Ausführen von Pull-Requests nach erfolgreichen Tests","Optimierung von Merge-Workflows für abgeschlossene Funktionen"],"pt":["Automatizar a limpeza da ramificação de desenvolvimento","Executar solicitações de pull após testes bem-sucedidos","Otizar fluxos de trabalho de mesclagem para recursos concluídos"],"ru":["Автоматизация очистки ветки разработки","Выполнение запросов на слияние после успешных тестов","Оптимизация рабочих процессов слияния для завершенных функций"],"ar":["تأتمة تنظيف فرع التطوير","تنفيذ طلبات السحب بعد الاختبارات الناجحة","تبسيط سير العمل لدمج الميزات المكتملة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires project test suite setup","Limited to projects using supported testing frameworks (npm, cargo, pytest, go test)"],"zh":["需要项目测试套件设置","仅限于使用支持的测试框架（npm、cargo、pytest、go test）的项目"],"ja":["プロジェクトのテストスイート設定が必要","サポートされているテストフレームワーク（npm、cargo、pytest、go test）のみを使用するプロジェクトに限定される"],"ko":["프로젝트 테스트 스위트 설정이 필요","지원되는 테스트 프레임워크(npm, cargo, pytest, go test)만을 사용하는 프로젝트에 한정됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración del conjunto de pruebas del proyecto","Limitado a proyectos que utilizan frameworks de pruebas admitidos (npm, cargo, pytest, go test)"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration du jeu de tests du projet","Limité aux projets utilisant des frameworks de tests pris en charge (npm, cargo, pytest, go test)"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung des Test-Suiten-Setups des Projekts","Begrenzt auf Projekte, die unterstützte Testframeworks (npm, cargo, pytest, go test) verwenden"],"pt":["Requer configuração do conjunto de testes do projeto","Limitado a projetos que usam estruturas de teste compatíveis (npm, cargo, pytest, go test)"],"ru":["Требует настройки набора тестов проекта","Ограничен проектами, использующими поддерживаемые фреймворки тестирования (npm, cargo, pytest, go test)"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد حزمة اختبارات المشروع","محدود بمشاريع تستخدم إطارات اختبار مدعومة (npm، cargo، pytest، go test)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"dd2f82c6dc8582b621f9eb57fcb65f557f88eadf872727ac81d0840ae12c504e","repoEtag":"W/\"c0159b000a3f1065b2a623072c2f281d1dae59e39bce28acebe789d1e6a6aa8e\"","qualityScore":68}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('obra/superpowers/requesting-code-review', 'official', 'obra', 'superpowers', 'obra/superpowers', 'requesting-code-review', 66125, 5048, 68, '2026-03-01T05:08:15Z', '2026-03-01T05:08:48.221Z', '2da31af22a58938ab78f3ee6d5b4687fcca062b923b646459eb52ba72117ef97', '{"id":"obra/superpowers/requesting-code-review","name":"requesting-code-review","description":{"zh":"请求代码审查是确保代码质量的关键步骤，使用AI工具可以高效地完成此过程","ja":"コードレビューの依頼はコード品質を確保するための重要なステップです。AIエージェントを使用するとこのプロセスを効率的に実行できます","ko":"코드 리뷰 요청은 코드 품질을 보장하는 중요한 단계입니다. AI 에이전트를 사용하면 이 프로세스를 효율적으로 수행할 수 있습니다","es":"La habilidad de solicitar revisión de código es esencial para garantizar la calidad del código. Aprenda a solicitar revisiones de manera efectiva","fr":"La compétence de demander une revue de code est essentielle pour garantir la qualité du code. Apprenez à demander des revues de manière efficace","de":"Die Fähigkeit, Code-Reviews anzufordern, ist entscheidend für die Code-Qualität. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Reviews effektiv anfordern","pt":"A revisão de código é uma prática essencial para garantir a qualidade do código, utilize as ferramentas de IA para melhorar seu fluxo de trabalho","ru":"Код ревью является важной практикой для обеспечения качества кода, используйте ИИ Агенты для улучшения вашего рабочего процесса","ar":"مراجعة الكود هي ممارسة أساسية لضمان جودة الكود، استخدم أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين تدفق العمل","en":"Use when completing tasks, implementing major features, or before merging to verify work meets requirements"},"owner":"obra","repo":"superpowers","repoPath":"obra/superpowers","stars":66125,"forks":5048,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:08:15Z","topics":[],"skillMd":{"name":"requesting-code-review","description":"Use when completing tasks, implementing major features, or before merging to verify work meets requirements","bodyPreview":"# Requesting Code Review\n\nDispatch superpowers:code-reviewer subagent to catch issues before they cascade.\n\n**Core principle:** Review early, review often.\n\n## When to Request Review\n\n**Mandatory:**\n- After each task in subagent-driven development\n- After completing major feature\n- Before merge to main\n\n**Optional but valuable:**\n- When stuck (fresh perspective)\n- Before refactoring (baseline check)\n- After fixing complex bug\n\n## How to Request\n\n**1. Get git SHAs:**\n```bash\nBASE_SHA=$(git rev-pa","body":"# Requesting Code Review\n\nDispatch superpowers:code-reviewer subagent to catch issues before they cascade.\n\n**Core principle:** Review early, review often.\n\n## When to Request Review\n\n**Mandatory:**\n- After each task in subagent-driven development\n- After completing major feature\n- Before merge to main\n\n**Optional but valuable:**\n- When stuck (fresh perspective)\n- Before refactoring (baseline check)\n- After fixing complex bug\n\n## How to Request\n\n**1. Get git SHAs:**\n```bash\nBASE_SHA=$(git rev-parse HEAD~1)  # or origin/main\nHEAD_SHA=$(git rev-parse HEAD)\n```\n\n**2. Dispatch code-reviewer subagent:**\n\nUse Task tool with superpowers:code-reviewer type, fill template at `code-reviewer.md`\n\n**Placeholders:**\n- `{WHAT_WAS_IMPLEMENTED}` - What you just built\n- `{PLAN_OR_REQUIREMENTS}` - What it should do\n- `{BASE_SHA}` - Starting commit\n- `{HEAD_SHA}` - Ending commit\n- `{DESCRIPTION}` - Brief summary\n\n**3. Act on feedback:**\n- Fix Critical issues immediately\n- Fix Important issues before proceeding\n- Note Minor issues for later\n- Push back if reviewer is wrong (with reasoning)\n\n## Example\n\n```\n[Just completed Task 2: Add verification function]\n\nYou: Let me request code review before proceeding.\n\nBASE_SHA=$(git log --oneline | grep \"Task 1\" | head -1 | awk ''{print $1}'')\nHEAD_SHA=$(git rev-parse HEAD)\n\n[Dispatch superpowers:code-reviewer subagent]\n  WHAT_WAS_IMPLEMENTED: Verification and repair functions for conversation index\n  PLAN_OR_REQUIREMENTS: Task 2 from docs/plans/deployment-plan.md\n  BASE_SHA: a7981ec\n  HEAD_SHA: 3df7661\n  DESCRIPTION: Added verifyIndex() and repairIndex() with 4 issue types\n\n[Subagent returns]:\n  Strengths: Clean architecture, real tests\n  Issues:\n    Important: Missing progress indicators\n    Minor: Magic number (100) for reporting interval\n  Assessment: Ready to proceed\n\nYou: [Fix progress indicators]\n[Continue to Task 3]\n```\n\n## Integration with Workflows\n\n**Subagent-Driven Development:**\n- Review after EACH task\n- Catch issues before they compound\n- Fix before moving to next task\n\n**Executing Plans:**\n- Review after each batch (3 tasks)\n- Get feedback, apply, continue\n\n**Ad-Hoc Development:**\n- Review before merge\n- Review when stuck\n\n## Red Flags\n\n**Never:**\n- Skip review because \"it''s simple\"\n- Ignore Critical issues\n- Proceed with unfixed Important issues\n- Argue with valid technical feedback\n\n**If reviewer wrong:**\n- Push back with technical reasoning\n- Show code/tests that prove it works\n- Request clarification\n\nSee template at: requesting-code-review/code-reviewer.md\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:08:48.221Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具：请求代码审查","ja":"AIエージェント：コードレビューの依頼","ko":"AI 에이전트: 코드 리뷰 요청","es":"Herramientas de AI: Solicitar revisión de código","fr":"Outils d''IA : Demander une revue de code","de":"KI-Tools: Code-Review anfordern","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Revisão de Código","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Запрос Код Ревью","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: مراجعة الكود","en":"requesting-code-review"},"description":{"zh":"请求代码审查是确保代码质量的关键步骤，使用AI工具可以高效地完成此过程","ja":"コードレビューの依頼はコード品質を確保するための重要なステップです。AIエージェントを使用するとこのプロセスを効率的に実行できます","ko":"코드 리뷰 요청은 코드 품질을 보장하는 중요한 단계입니다. AI 에이전트를 사용하면 이 프로세스를 효율적으로 수행할 수 있습니다","es":"La habilidad de solicitar revisión de código es esencial para garantizar la calidad del código. Aprenda a solicitar revisiones de manera efectiva","fr":"La compétence de demander une revue de code est essentielle pour garantir la qualité du code. Apprenez à demander des revues de manière efficace","de":"Die Fähigkeit, Code-Reviews anzufordern, ist entscheidend für die Code-Qualität. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Reviews effektiv anfordern","pt":"A revisão de código é uma prática essencial para garantir a qualidade do código, utilize as ferramentas de IA para melhorar seu fluxo de trabalho","ru":"Код ревью является важной практикой для обеспечения качества кода, используйте ИИ Агенты для улучшения вашего рабочего процесса","ar":"مراجعة الكود هي ممارسة أساسية لضمان جودة الكود، استخدم أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين تدفق العمل","en":"Use when completing tasks, implementing major features, or before merging to verify work meets requirements"},"definition":{"en":"Use when completing tasks, implementing major features, or before merging to verify work meets requirements"},"features":{"zh":["自动化代码审查","实时代码反馈","代码质量保证","提高代码可靠性","减少代码错误"],"ja":["自動化コードレビュー","リアルタイムコードフィードバック","コード品質の保証","コードの信頼性の向上","コードエラーの減少"],"ko":["자동화 코드 리뷰","실시간 코드 피드백","코드 품질 보장","코드 신뢰성 향상","코드 오류 감소"],"es":["Revisión de código temprana y frecuente","Detección de errores y mejora de la calidad","Optimización del flujo de trabajo","Colaboración efectiva entre desarrolladores","Mejora de la calidad del código"],"fr":["Revue de code précoce et fréquente","Détection des erreurs et amélioration de la qualité","Optimisation du flux de travail","Collaboration efficace entre les développeurs","Amélioration de la qualité du code"],"de":["Frühe und häufige Code-Reviews","Fehlererkennung und Qualitätsverbesserung","Workflow-Optimierung","Effektive Zusammenarbeit zwischen Entwicklern","Qualitätsverbesserung des Codes"],"pt":["Revisão de código automatizada","Detecção de erros e bugs","Melhoria da qualidade do código","Integração com o fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento","Suporte a múltiplos linguagens de programação"],"ru":["Автоматизированная код ревью","Обнаружение ошибок и багов","Улучшение качества кода","Интеграция с рабочим процессом разработки","Поддержка нескольких языков программирования"],"ar":["مراجعة الكود الآلية","كشف الأخطاء والعيوب","تحسين جودة الكود","التكامل مع تدفق العمل التطويعي","دعم لغات برمجة متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","代码审查","代码质量","代码可靠性","代码开发","自动化代码审查"],"ja":["AIエージェント","コードレビュー","コード品質","コード信頼性","コード開発","自動化コードレビュー"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","코드 리뷰","코드 품질","코드 신뢰성","코드 개발","자동화 코드 리뷰"],"es":["herramientas de AI","solicitar revisión de código","revisión de código","calidad del código","desarrollo de software","colaboración entre desarrolladores"],"fr":["outils d''IA","demander une revue de code","revue de code","qualité du code","développement de logiciels","collaboration entre les développeurs"],"de":["KI-Tools","Code-Review anfordern","Code-Review","Code-Qualität","Software-Entwicklung","Zusammenarbeit zwischen Entwicklern"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","revisão de código","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade do código","automatização de teste","integração contínua"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","код ревью","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","автоматизация тестирования","непрерывная интеграция"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مراجعة الكود","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الكود","آلية الاختبار","التكامل المستمر"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring rigorous quality control and collaboration tools in Git-based development environments","zh":"非常适合需要严格质量控制和基于 Git 的开发环境中协作工具的代码审查智能体","ja":"Gitベースの開発環境において、厳格な品質管理とコラボレーションツールを必要とするコードレビューエージェントに最適です","ko":"Git 기반 개발 환경에서 엄격한 품질 관리 및 협업 도구가 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 이상적입니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisión de Código que requieren un control de calidad riguroso y herramientas de colaboración en entornos de desarrollo basados en Git","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Revue de Code nécessitant un contrôle qualité rigoureux et des outils de collaboration dans des environnements de développement basés sur Git","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agenten, die eine strenge Qualitätskontrolle und Kollaborationswerkzeuge in Git-basierten Entwicklungsumgebungen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que exigem controle de qualidade rigoroso e ferramentas de colaboração em ambientes de desenvolvimento baseados em Git","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов проверки кода, требующих строгого контроля качества и инструментов совместной работы в средах разработки на основе Git","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء مراجعة التعليمات البرمجية التي تتطلب تحكمًا صارمًا في الجودة وأدوات التعاون في بيئات التطوير القائمة على Git"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to dispatch subagents like code-reviewer for early issue detection, utilizing Git SHAs and promoting a culture of review early and often, with mandatory reviews after task completion, major feature implementation, or before merging to main","zh":"使智能体能够分派子智能体（如 code-reviewer）以进行早期问题检测，利用 Git SHA 并提倡及早且经常进行代码审查的文化，在任务完成、主要功能实现后或合并到 main 分支前必须进行审查","ja":"エージェントが、code-reviewerのようなサブエージェントを派遣して早期の問題検出を行えるようにし、Git SHAを利用し、早期かつ頻繁なレビューの文化を促進します。タスク完了後、主要機能の実装後、またはmainへのマージ前にはレビューが必須となります","ko":"에이전트가 code-reviewer와 같은 서브에이전트를 파견하여 조기 문제 감지를 수행할 수 있도록 하고, Git SHA를 활용하며, 조기에 그리고 자주 리뷰하는 문화를 촉진합니다. 작업 완료 후, 주요 기능 구현 후 또는 main에 병합하기 전에 필수 리뷰가 필요합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes para enviar subagentes como revisores de código para la detección temprana de problemas, utilizando Git SHAs y promoviendo una cultura de revisión temprana y frecuente, con revisiones obligatorias después de la finalización de tareas, la implementación de funciones principales o antes de fusionar con main","fr":"Permet aux agents d''envoyer des sous-agents comme réviseurs de code pour la détection précoce des problèmes, en utilisant les Git SHAs et en promouvant une culture de revue précoce et fréquente, avec des revues obligatoires après l''achèvement des tâches, la mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités majeures ou avant de fusionner avec main","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Subagenten wie Code-Reviewer für die frühzeitige Erkennung von Problemen zu entsenden, indem Git-SHAs verwendet werden und eine Kultur der frühen und häufigen Überprüfung gefördert wird, mit obligatorischen Überprüfungen nach der Aufgabenabgeschlossenheit, der Implementierung von Hauptfunktionen oder vor dem Zusammenführen mit main","pt":"Capacita os agentes a despachar subagentes como code-reviewer para detecção precoce de problemas, utilizando Git SHAs e promovendo uma cultura de revisão precoce e frequente, com revisões obrigatórias após a conclusão da tarefa, implementação de recursos principais ou antes da mesclagem (merge) para a main","ru":"Позволяет агентам направлять субагентов, таких как code-reviewer, для раннего обнаружения проблем, используя Git SHAs и пропагандируя культуру раннего и частого ревью, с обязательными проверками после завершения задачи, реализации основных функций или перед слиянием с основной веткой (main)","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إرسال وكلاء فرعيين مثل مدقق التعليمات البرمجية لاكتشاف المشكلات مبكرًا، باستخدام Git SHAs وتعزيز ثقافة المراجعة المبكرة والمتكررة، مع مراجعات إلزامية بعد إكمال المهمة، أو تنفيذ ميزة رئيسية، أو قبل الدمج إلى الفرع الرئيسي (main)"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code review requests after completing tasks","Validating major feature implementations before merge","Debugging complex issues with fresh perspectives from subagents"],"zh":["在完成任务后自动执行代码审查请求","在合并前验证主要功能的实现","利用子智能体提供的新视角来调试复杂问题"],"ja":["タスク完了後のコードレビューリクエストの自動化","マージ前の主要機能実装の検証","サブエージェントからの新鮮な視点による複雑な問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["작업 완료 후 코드 리뷰 요청 자동화","병합 전 주요 기능 구현 검증","서브에이전트의 새로운 관점으로 복잡한 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar las solicitudes de revisión de código después de completar tareas","Validar la implementación de funciones principales antes de la fusión","Depurar problemas complejos con perspectivas frescas de los subagentes"],"fr":["Automatiser les demandes d''examen de code après l''achèvement des tâches","Valider la mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités majeures avant la fusion","Déboguer des problèmes complexes avec des perspectives fraîches des sous-agents"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Review-Anfragen nach dem Abschließen von Aufgaben","Überprüfen der Implementierung von Hauptfunktionen vor dem Zusammenführen","Fehlersuche komplexer Probleme mit frischen Perspektiven von Subagenten"],"pt":["Automatização de solicitações de revisão de código após a conclusão de tarefas","Validação de implementações de recursos principais antes do merge","Depuração de problemas complexos com novas perspectivas de subagentes"],"ru":["Автоматизация запросов на проверку кода после завершения задач","Проверка реализации основных функций перед слиянием","Отладка сложных проблем с новыми взглядами от субагентов"],"ar":["أتمتة طلبات مراجعة التعليمات البرمجية بعد إكمال المهام","التحقق من صحة تنفيذات الميزات الرئيسية قبل الدمج","تصحيح الأخطاء في المشكلات المعقدة بوجهات نظر جديدة من الوكلاء الفرعيين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git repository access","Limited to subagent-driven development workflows"],"zh":["需要访问 Git 代码库","仅限于子智能体驱动的开发工作流程"],"ja":["Gitリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","サブエージェント駆動の開発ワークフローに限定される"],"ko":["Git 저장소 접근이 필요함","서브에이전트 주도 개발 워크플로우로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio Git","Limitado a flujos de trabajo de desarrollo impulsados por subagentes"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel Git","Limité aux flux de travail de développement pilotés par des sous-agents"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Git-Repository","Begrenzt auf von Subagenten angetriebene Entwicklungswerkflüsse"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório Git","Limitado a fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento orientados por subagentes"],"ru":["Требует доступ к репозиторию Git","Ограничено рабочими процессами разработки на основе субагентов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع Git","يقتصر على سير عمل التطوير القائمة على الوكلاء الفرعيين"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2da31af22a58938ab78f3ee6d5b4687fcca062b923b646459eb52ba72117ef97","repoEtag":"W/\"c0159b000a3f1065b2a623072c2f281d1dae59e39bce28acebe789d1e6a6aa8e\"","qualityScore":68}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/clickhouse-io', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'clickhouse-io', 55024, 6781, 68, '2026-03-01T05:07:39Z', '2026-03-01T05:09:14.298Z', 'bc0d9351ae909eaa725b57ee5c4928274ed94e0b55e0fef4076cbe2844ae8a7b', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/clickhouse-io","name":"clickhouse-io","description":{"zh":"ClickHouse数据库模式、查询优化、分析和数据工程最佳实践","ja":"ClickHouseデータベースパターン、クエリ最適化、分析、データエンジニアリングのベストプラクティス","ko":"ClickHouse 데이터베이스 패턴, 쿼리 최적화, 분석 및 데이터 엔지니어링의 최선의 관행","es":"ClickHouse es una base de datos de alto rendimiento para análisis de datos y ofrece patrones y mejores prácticas para optimizar el rendimiento","fr":"ClickHouse est une base de données haute performance pour l''analyse de données et offre des modèles et des meilleures pratiques pour optimiser les performances","de":"ClickHouse ist eine Hochleistungs-Datenbank für Datenanalyse und bietet Muster und Best Practices zur Leistungsoptimierung","pt":"O ClickHouse é uma base de dados de alto desempenho para análise de dados. Aprenda a usar padrões de ClickHouse e agentes de IA para otimizar suas consultas e análises.","ru":"ClickHouse — это высокопроизводительная база данных для анализа данных. Узнайте, как использовать шаблоны ClickHouse и ИИ Агентов для оптимизации запросов и аналитики.","ar":"ClickHouse هو قاعدة بيانات عالية الأداء لتحليل البيانات. تعلم كيفية استخدام أنماط ClickHouse ووكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين استفساراتك والتحليلات.","en":"ClickHouse database patterns, query optimization, analytics, and data engineering best practices for high-performance analytical workloads."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":55024,"forks":6781,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:07:39Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"clickhouse-io","description":"ClickHouse database patterns, query optimization, analytics, and data engineering best practices for high-performance analytical workloads.","bodyPreview":"# ClickHouse Analytics Patterns\n\nClickHouse-specific patterns for high-performance analytics and data engineering.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Designing ClickHouse table schemas (MergeTree engine selection)\n- Writing analytical queries (aggregations, window functions, joins)\n- Optimizing query performance (partition pruning, projections, materialized views)\n- Ingesting large volumes of data (batch inserts, Kafka integration)\n- Migrating from PostgreSQL/MySQL to ClickHouse for analytics\n- Implementin","body":"# ClickHouse Analytics Patterns\n\nClickHouse-specific patterns for high-performance analytics and data engineering.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Designing ClickHouse table schemas (MergeTree engine selection)\n- Writing analytical queries (aggregations, window functions, joins)\n- Optimizing query performance (partition pruning, projections, materialized views)\n- Ingesting large volumes of data (batch inserts, Kafka integration)\n- Migrating from PostgreSQL/MySQL to ClickHouse for analytics\n- Implementing real-time dashboards or time-series analytics\n\n## Overview\n\nClickHouse is a column-oriented database management system (DBMS) for online analytical processing (OLAP). It''s optimized for fast analytical queries on large datasets.\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Column-oriented storage\n- Data compression\n- Parallel query execution\n- Distributed queries\n- Real-time analytics\n\n## Table Design Patterns\n\n### MergeTree Engine (Most Common)\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE markets_analytics (\n    date Date,\n    market_id String,\n    market_name String,\n    volume UInt64,\n    trades UInt32,\n    unique_traders UInt32,\n    avg_trade_size Float64,\n    created_at DateTime\n) ENGINE = MergeTree()\nPARTITION BY toYYYYMM(date)\nORDER BY (date, market_id)\nSETTINGS index_granularity = 8192;\n```\n\n### ReplacingMergeTree (Deduplication)\n\n```sql\n-- For data that may have duplicates (e.g., from multiple sources)\nCREATE TABLE user_events (\n    event_id String,\n    user_id String,\n    event_type String,\n    timestamp DateTime,\n    properties String\n) ENGINE = ReplacingMergeTree()\nPARTITION BY toYYYYMM(timestamp)\nORDER BY (user_id, event_id, timestamp)\nPRIMARY KEY (user_id, event_id);\n```\n\n### AggregatingMergeTree (Pre-aggregation)\n\n```sql\n-- For maintaining aggregated metrics\nCREATE TABLE market_stats_hourly (\n    hour DateTime,\n    market_id String,\n    total_volume AggregateFunction(sum, UInt64),\n    total_trades AggregateFunction(count, UInt32),\n    unique_users AggregateFunction(uniq, String)\n) ENGINE = AggregatingMergeTree()\nPARTITION BY toYYYYMM(hour)\nORDER BY (hour, market_id);\n\n-- Query aggregated data\nSELECT\n    hour,\n    market_id,\n    sumMerge(total_volume) AS volume,\n    countMerge(total_trades) AS trades,\n    uniqMerge(unique_users) AS users\nFROM market_stats_hourly\nWHERE hour >= toStartOfHour(now() - INTERVAL 24 HOUR)\nGROUP BY hour, market_id\nORDER BY hour DESC;\n```\n\n## Query Optimization Patterns\n\n### Efficient Filtering\n\n```sql\n-- ✅ GOOD: Use indexed columns first\nSELECT *\nFROM markets_analytics\nWHERE date >= ''2025-01-01''\n  AND market_id = ''market-123''\n  AND volume > 1000\nORDER BY date DESC\nLIMIT 100;\n\n-- ❌ BAD: Filter on non-indexed columns first\nSELECT *\nFROM markets_analytics\nWHERE volume > 1000\n  AND market_name LIKE ''%election%''\n  AND date >= ''2025-01-01'';\n```\n\n### Aggregations\n\n```sql\n-- ✅ GOOD: Use ClickHouse-specific aggregation functions\nSELECT\n    toStartOfDay(created_at) AS day,\n    market_id,\n    sum(volume) AS total_volume,\n    count() AS total_trades,\n    uniq(trader_id) AS unique_traders,\n    avg(trade_size) AS avg_size\nFROM trades\nWHERE created_at >= today() - INTERVAL 7 DAY\nGROUP BY day, market_id\nORDER BY day DESC, total_volume DESC;\n\n-- ✅ Use quantile for percentiles (more efficient than percentile)\nSELECT\n    quantile(0.50)(trade_size) AS median,\n    quantile(0.95)(trade_size) AS p95,\n    quantile(0.99)(trade_size) AS p99\nFROM trades\nWHERE created_at >= now() - INTERVAL 1 HOUR;\n```\n\n### Window Functions\n\n```sql\n-- Calculate running totals\nSELECT\n    date,\n    market_id,\n    volume,\n    sum(volume) OVER (\n        PARTITION BY market_id\n        ORDER BY date\n        ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW\n    ) AS cumulative_volume\nFROM markets_analytics\nWHERE date >= today() - INTERVAL 30 DAY\nORDER BY market_id, date;\n```\n\n## Data Insertion Patterns\n\n### Bulk Insert (Recommended)\n\n```typescript\nimport { ClickHouse } from ''clickhouse''\n\nconst clickhouse = new ClickHouse({\n  url: process.env.CLICKHOUSE_URL,\n  port: 8123,\n  basicAuth: {\n    username: process.env.CLICKHOUSE_USER,\n    password: process.env.CLICKHOUSE_PASSWORD\n  }\n})\n\n// ✅ Batch insert (efficient)\nasync function bulkInsertTrades(trades: Trade[]) {\n  const values = trades.map(trade => `(\n    ''${trade.id}'',\n    ''${trade.market_id}'',\n    ''${trade.user_id}'',\n    ${trade.amount},\n    ''${trade.timestamp.toISOString()}''\n  )`).join('','')\n\n  await clickhouse.query(`\n    INSERT INTO trades (id, market_id, user_id, amount, timestamp)\n    VALUES ${values}\n  `).toPromise()\n}\n\n// ❌ Individual inserts (slow)\nasync function insertTrade(trade: Trade) {\n  // Don''t do this in a loop!\n  await clickhouse.query(`\n    INSERT INTO trades VALUES (''${trade.id}'', ...)\n  `).toPromise()\n}\n```\n\n### Streaming Insert\n\n```typescript\n// For continuous data ingestion\nimport { createWriteStream } from ''fs''\nimport { pipeline } from ''stream/promises''\n\nasync function streamInserts() {\n  const stream = clickhouse.insert(''trades'').stream()\n\n  for await (const batch of dataSource) {\n    stream.write(batch)\n  }\n\n  await stream.end()\n}\n```\n\n## Materialized Views\n\n### Real-time Aggregations\n\n```sql\n-- Create materialized view for hourly stats\nCREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW market_stats_hourly_mv\nTO market_stats_hourly\nAS SELECT\n    toStartOfHour(timestamp) AS hour,\n    market_id,\n    sumState(amount) AS total_volume,\n    countState() AS total_trades,\n    uniqState(user_id) AS unique_users\nFROM trades\nGROUP BY hour, market_id;\n\n-- Query the materialized view\nSELECT\n    hour,\n    market_id,\n    sumMerge(total_volume) AS volume,\n    countMerge(total_trades) AS trades,\n    uniqMerge(unique_users) AS users\nFROM market_stats_hourly\nWHERE hour >= now() - INTERVAL 24 HOUR\nGROUP BY hour, market_id;\n```\n\n## Performance Monitoring\n\n### Query Performance\n\n```sql\n-- Check slow queries\nSELECT\n    query_id,\n    user,\n    query,\n    query_duration_ms,\n    read_rows,\n    read_bytes,\n    memory_usage\nFROM system.query_log\nWHERE type = ''QueryFinish''\n  AND query_duration_ms > 1000\n  AND event_time >= now() - INTERVAL 1 HOUR\nORDER BY query_duration_ms DESC\nLIMIT 10;\n```\n\n### Table Statistics\n\n```sql\n-- Check table sizes\nSELECT\n    database,\n    table,\n    formatReadableSize(sum(bytes)) AS size,\n    sum(rows) AS rows,\n    max(modification_time) AS latest_modification\nFROM system.parts\nWHERE active\nGROUP BY database, table\nORDER BY sum(bytes) DESC;\n```\n\n## Common Analytics Queries\n\n### Time Series Analysis\n\n```sql\n-- Daily active users\nSELECT\n    toDate(timestamp) AS date,\n    uniq(user_id) AS daily_active_users\nFROM events\nWHERE timestamp >= today() - INTERVAL 30 DAY\nGROUP BY date\nORDER BY date;\n\n-- Retention analysis\nSELECT\n    signup_date,\n    countIf(days_since_signup = 0) AS day_0,\n    countIf(days_since_signup = 1) AS day_1,\n    countIf(days_since_signup = 7) AS day_7,\n    countIf(days_since_signup = 30) AS day_30\nFROM (\n    SELECT\n        user_id,\n        min(toDate(timestamp)) AS signup_date,\n        toDate(timestamp) AS activity_date,\n        dateDiff(''day'', signup_date, activity_date) AS days_since_signup\n    FROM events\n    GROUP BY user_id, activity_date\n)\nGROUP BY signup_date\nORDER BY signup_date DESC;\n```\n\n### Funnel Analysis\n\n```sql\n-- Conversion funnel\nSELECT\n    countIf(step = ''viewed_market'') AS viewed,\n    countIf(step = ''clicked_trade'') AS clicked,\n    countIf(step = ''completed_trade'') AS completed,\n    round(clicked / viewed * 100, 2) AS view_to_click_rate,\n    round(completed / clicked * 100, 2) AS click_to_completion_rate\nFROM (\n    SELECT\n        user_id,\n        session_id,\n        event_type AS step\n    FROM events\n    WHERE event_date = today()\n)\nGROUP BY session_id;\n```\n\n### Cohort Analysis\n\n```sql\n-- User cohorts by signup month\nSELECT\n    toStartOfMonth(signup_date) AS cohort,\n    toStartOfMonth(activity_date) AS month,\n    dateDiff(''month'', cohort, month) AS months_since_signup,\n    count(DISTINCT user_id) AS active_users\nFROM (\n    SELECT\n        user_id,\n        min(toDate(timestamp)) OVER (PARTITION BY user_id) AS signup_date,\n        toDate(timestamp) AS activity_date\n    FROM events\n)\nGROUP BY cohort, month, months_since_signup\nORDER BY cohort, months_since_signup;\n```\n\n## Data Pipeline Patterns\n\n### ETL Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// Extract, Transform, Load\nasync function etlPipeline() {\n  // 1. Extract from source\n  const rawData = await extractFromPostgres()\n\n  // 2. Transform\n  const transformed = rawData.map(row => ({\n    date: new Date(row.created_at).toISOString().split(''T'')[0],\n    market_id: row.market_slug,\n    volume: parseFloat(row.total_volume),\n    trades: parseInt(row.trade_count)\n  }))\n\n  // 3. Load to ClickHouse\n  await bulkInsertToClickHouse(transformed)\n}\n\n// Run periodically\nsetInterval(etlPipeline, 60 * 60 * 1000)  // Every hour\n```\n\n### Change Data Capture (CDC)\n\n```typescript\n// Listen to PostgreSQL changes and sync to ClickHouse\nimport { Client } from ''pg''\n\nconst pgClient = new Client({ connectionString: process.env.DATABASE_URL })\n\npgClient.query(''LISTEN market_updates'')\n\npgClient.on(''notification'', async (msg) => {\n  const update = JSON.parse(msg.payload)\n\n  await clickhouse.insert(''market_updates'', [\n    {\n      market_id: update.id,\n      event_type: update.operation,  // INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE\n      timestamp: new Date(),\n      data: JSON.stringify(update.new_data)\n    }\n  ])\n})\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### 1. Partitioning Strategy\n- Partition by time (usually month or day)\n- Avoid too many partitions (performance impact)\n- Use DATE type for partition key\n\n### 2. Ordering Key\n- Put most frequently filtered columns first\n- Consider cardinality (high cardinality first)\n- Order impacts compression\n\n### 3. Data Types\n- Use smallest appropriate type (UInt32 vs UInt64)\n- Use LowCardinality for repeated strings\n- Use Enum for categorical data\n\n### 4. Avoid\n- SELECT * (specify columns)\n- FINAL (merge data before query instead)\n- Too many JOINs (denormalize for analytics)\n- Small frequent inserts (batch instead)\n\n### 5. Monitoring\n- Track query performance\n- Monitor disk usage\n- Check merge operations\n- Review slow query log\n\n**Remember**: ClickHouse excels at analytical workloads. Design tables for your query patterns, batch inserts, and leverage materialized views for real-time aggregations.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:09:14.298Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"ClickHouse AI工具：高性能数据分析","ja":"ClickHouse AIエージェント：高速データ分析","ko":"ClickHouse AI 에이전트: 고성능 데이터 분석","es":"Herramientas de ClickHouse para Análisis de Datos","fr":"Outils ClickHouse pour l''Analyse de Données","de":"ClickHouse-Tools für Datenanalyse","pt":"Padrões de Análise de ClickHouse com Agentes de IA","ru":"ИИ Агенты для ClickHouse: оптимизация запросов и аналитики","ar":"نماذج تحليل ClickHouse مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"clickhouse-io"},"description":{"zh":"ClickHouse数据库模式、查询优化、分析和数据工程最佳实践","ja":"ClickHouseデータベースパターン、クエリ最適化、分析、データエンジニアリングのベストプラクティス","ko":"ClickHouse 데이터베이스 패턴, 쿼리 최적화, 분석 및 데이터 엔지니어링의 최선의 관행","es":"ClickHouse es una base de datos de alto rendimiento para análisis de datos y ofrece patrones y mejores prácticas para optimizar el rendimiento","fr":"ClickHouse est une base de données haute performance pour l''analyse de données et offre des modèles et des meilleures pratiques pour optimiser les performances","de":"ClickHouse ist eine Hochleistungs-Datenbank für Datenanalyse und bietet Muster und Best Practices zur Leistungsoptimierung","pt":"O ClickHouse é uma base de dados de alto desempenho para análise de dados. Aprenda a usar padrões de ClickHouse e agentes de IA para otimizar suas consultas ...","ru":"ClickHouse — это высокопроизводительная база данных для анализа данных. Узнайте, как использовать шаблоны ClickHouse и ИИ Агентов для оптимизации запросов и ...","ar":"ClickHouse هو قاعدة بيانات عالية الأداء لتحليل البيانات. تعلم كيفية استخدام أنماط ClickHouse ووكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين استفساراتك والتحليلات.","en":"ClickHouse database patterns, query optimization, analytics, and data engineering best practices for high-performance analytical workloads."},"definition":{"en":"ClickHouse database patterns, query optimization, analytics, and data engineering best practices for high-performance analytical workloads."},"features":{"zh":["ClickHouse表架构设计","分析查询优化","查询性能优化","大数据量插入","从PostgreSQL/MySQL迁移到ClickHouse"],"ja":["ClickHouseテーブルスキーマ設計","分析クエリ最適化","クエリパフォーマンス最適化","大量データ挿入","PostgreSQL/MySQLからClickHouseへの移行"],"ko":["ClickHouse 테이블 스키마 설계","분석 쿼리 최적화","쿼리 성능 최적화","大量 데이터 삽입","PostgreSQL/MySQL에서 ClickHouse로의 마이그레이션"],"es":["Patrones de ClickHouse para análisis de datos","Optimización de consultas para cargas de trabajo analíticas","Ingesta de grandes volúmenes de datos","Migración desde PostgreSQL/MySQL a ClickHouse","Mejores prácticas para ingeniería de datos"],"fr":["Modèles ClickHouse pour l''analyse de données","Optimisation des requêtes pour les charges de travail analytiques","Ingestion de grands volumes de données","Migration de PostgreSQL/MySQL vers ClickHouse","Meilleures pratiques pour l''ingénierie de données"],"de":["ClickHouse-Muster für Datenanalyse","Abfrageoptimierung für Analyse-Workloads","Ingestion großer Datenmengen","Migration von PostgreSQL/MySQL zu ClickHouse","Best Practices für Datenengineering"],"pt":["Padrões de análise de ClickHouse","Otimização de consultas","Análise de dados de alto desempenho","Integração com agentes de IA","Melhoria do desempenho e eficiência"],"ru":["Шаблоны анализа ClickHouse","Оптимизация запросов","Высокопроизводительный анализ данных","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами","Повышение производительности и эффективности"],"ar":["نماذج تحليل ClickHouse","تحسين الاستفسارات","تحليل البيانات عالي الأداء","التكامل مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين الأداء والكفاءة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ClickHouse","AI工具","数据分析","查询优化","数据工程","MergeTree","PostgreSQL","MySQL"],"ja":["ClickHouse","AIエージェント","データ分析","クエリ最適化","データエンジニアリング","MergeTree","PostgreSQL","MySQL"],"ko":["ClickHouse","AI 에이전트","데이터 분석","쿼리 최적화","데이터 엔지니어링","MergeTree","PostgreSQL","MySQL"],"es":["Herramientas de ClickHouse","Análisis de datos","Patrones de bases de datos","Optimización de consultas","Ingeniería de datos","Cargas de trabajo analíticas","Agente de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["Outils ClickHouse","Analyse de données","Modèles de bases de données","Optimisation des requêtes","Ingénierie de données","Charges de travail analytiques","Agent d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["ClickHouse-Tools","Datenanalyse","Datenbankmuster","Abfrageoptimierung","Datenengineering","Analyse-Workloads","KI-Agent"],"pt":["ClickHouse","Análise de dados","Agentes de IA","Otimização de consultas","Alto desempenho","Análise de dados de alto desempenho","Integração com agentes de IA","Melhoria do desempenho"],"ru":["ClickHouse","Анализ данных","ИИ Агенты","Оптимизация запросов","Высокопроизводительный","Анализ данных высокого производительности","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами","Повышение производительности"],"ar":["ClickHouse","تحليل البيانات","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين الاستفسارات","عالي الأداء","تحليل البيانات عالي الأداء","التكامل مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين الأداء"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Data Analysis Agents requiring high-performance analytics and data engineering with ClickHouse database patterns","zh":"适用于需要高性能分析和数据工程的数据分析代理，使用ClickHouse数据库模式","ja":"ClickHouseデータベースパターンを使用した高性能分析およびデータエンジニアリングを必要とするデータ分析エージェントに最適","ko":"ClickHouse 데이터베이스 패턴을 사용하여 높은 성능 분석 및 데이터 엔지니어링이 필요한 데이터 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Datos que requieren análisis y ingeniería de datos de alto rendimiento con patrones de base de datos ClickHouse","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Analyse de Données nécessitant une analyse et une ingénierie de données de haute performance avec des modèles de base de données ClickHouse","de":"Ideal für Data-Analytics-Agents, die eine Analyse und Datenengineering mit hoher Leistung mit ClickHouse-Datenbankmustern erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Dados que exigem análise de alto desempenho e engenharia de dados com padrões de banco de dados ClickHouse","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа данных, требующих аналитики высокого производительности и инженерии данных с шаблонами базы данных ClickHouse","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل البيانات الذي يتطلب تحليل أداء عالي وتحليل البيانات باستخدام أنماط قاعدة بيانات ClickHouse"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize query performance using partition pruning, projections, and materialized views, while leveraging ClickHouse-specific patterns for high-performance analytics and data engineering, including MergeTree engine selection and Kafka integration","zh":"赋予代理优化查询性能的能力，使用分区剪枝、投影和物化视图，同时利用ClickHouse特定的模式实现高性能分析和数据工程，包括MergeTree引擎选择和Kafka集成","ja":"パーティションプルーニング、投影、物化ビューを使用してクエリパフォーマンスを最適化し、MergeTreeエンジンの選択やKafka統合など、ClickHouse固有のパターンを使用した高性能分析およびデータエンジニアリングを可能にする","ko":"파티션剪枝, 투영, 물화 뷰를 사용하여 쿼리 성능을 최적화하고, MergeTree 엔진 선택 및 Kafka 통합 등 ClickHouse 고유의 패턴을 사용하여 높은 성능 분석 및 데이터 엔지니어링을 가능하게 함","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar el rendimiento de las consultas utilizando poda de particiones, proyecciones y vistas materializadas, mientras aprovecha los patrones específicos de ClickHouse para análisis y ingeniería de datos de alto rendimiento, incluida la selección del motor MergeTree y la integración con Kafka","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les performances des requêtes en utilisant l''élagage de partitions, les projections et les vues matérialisées, tout en exploitant les modèles spécifiques à ClickHouse pour l''analyse et l''ingénierie de données de haute performance, y compris la sélection du moteur MergeTree et l''intégration à Kafka","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Abfrageleistung mit Partitionsschnitt, Projektionen und materialisierten Ansichten zu optimieren, während sie die spezifischen ClickHouse-Muster für Hochleistungsanalysen und Datenengineering nutzen, einschließlich der Auswahl des MergeTree-Motors und der Kafka-Integration","pt":"Permite que os agentes otimizem o desempenho das consultas usando poda de partição, projeções e vistas materializadas, aproveitando padrões específicos do ClickHouse para análise de alto desempenho e engenharia de dados, incluindo seleção do mecanismo MergeTree e integração do Kafka","ru":"Позволяет агентам оптимизировать производительность запросов с помощью обрезки разделов, проекций и материализованных представлений, используя шаблоны ClickHouse для аналитики высокого производительности и инженерии данных, включая выбор двигателя MergeTree и интеграцию с Kafka","ar":"يمكن للعميل تحسين أداء الاستعلامات باستخدام تقليم القسم والتصوير والمخططات المادية، واستخدام أنماط ClickHouse لأنظمة التحليل عالية الأداء والهندسة، بما في ذلك اختيار محرك MergeTree وتكامل Kafka"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing optimized ClickHouse table schemas","Writing high-performance analytical queries with aggregations and window functions","Migrating analytics workloads from PostgreSQL/MySQL to ClickHouse","Optimizing query performance for large-scale data ingestion"],"zh":["设计优化的ClickHouse表模式","使用聚合和窗口函数编写高性能分析查询","将分析工作负载从PostgreSQL/MySQL迁移到ClickHouse","优化大规模数据摄取的查询性能"],"ja":["最適化されたClickHouseテーブルスキーマを設計する","集約とウィンドウ関数を使用した高性能分析クエリを記述する","分析ワークロードをPostgreSQL/MySQLからClickHouseに移行する","大規模なデータインジェストのクエリパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["최적화된 ClickHouse 테이블 스키마 설계","집계 및 윈도우 함수를 사용하여 높은 성능 분석 쿼리 작성","분석 워크로드를 PostgreSQL/MySQL에서 ClickHouse로 마이그레이션","대규모 데이터 수집에 대한 쿼리 성능 최적화"],"es":["Diseñar esquemas de tablas de ClickHouse optimizados","Escribir consultas analíticas de alto rendimiento con agregaciones y funciones de ventana","Migrar cargas de trabajo de análisis de PostgreSQL/MySQL a ClickHouse","Optimizar el rendimiento de las consultas para la ingesta de grandes cantidades de datos"],"fr":["Concevoir des schémas de tables ClickHouse optimisés","Écrire des requêtes analytiques de haute performance avec des agrégations et des fonctions de fenêtrage","Migrer les charges de travail d''analyse de PostgreSQL/MySQL vers ClickHouse","Optimiser les performances des requêtes pour l''ingestion de grandes quantités de données"],"de":["Optimierte ClickHouse-Tabellenschemata entwerfen","Hochleistungsanalyse-Abfragen mit Aggregationen und Fensterfunktionen schreiben","Analyse-Workloads von PostgreSQL/MySQL zu ClickHouse migrieren","Abfrageleistung für die Aufnahme großer Datenmengen optimieren"],"pt":["Projetar esquemas de tabelas ClickHouse otimizados","Escrever consultas analíticas de alto desempenho com agregações e funções de janela","Migrar cargas de trabalho analíticas do PostgreSQL/MySQL para o ClickHouse","Otimizar o desempenho da consulta para ingestão de dados em grande escala"],"ru":["Проектировать оптимизированные схемы таблиц ClickHouse","Писать аналитические запросы высокого производительности с агрегатами и оконными функциями","Переносить аналитические рабочие нагрузки из PostgreSQL/MySQL в ClickHouse","Оптимизировать производительность запросов для крупномасштабной ингестии данных"],"ar":["تصميم مخططات جداول ClickHouse المُحسَّنة","كتابة استعلامات تحليلية عالية الأداء مع التجميعات ودالات النافذة","نقل حمولة العمل التحليلية من PostgreSQL/MySQL إلى ClickHouse","تحسين أداء الاستعلام لاستيعاب البيانات على نطاق واسع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ClickHouse database setup","Limited to analytical workloads","Familiarity with SQL and data engineering concepts necessary"],"zh":["需要ClickHouse数据库设置","仅限分析工作负载","需要SQL和数据工程概念的熟悉"],"ja":["ClickHouseデータベースの設定が必要","分析ワークロードに限定される","SQLおよびデータエンジニアリング概念の熟知が必要"],"ko":["ClickHouse 데이터베이스 설정 필요","분석 워크로드에만 제한","SQL 및 데이터 엔지니어링 개념에 대한 지식 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de base de datos ClickHouse","Limitado a cargas de trabajo analíticas","Familiaridad con conceptos de SQL y ingeniería de datos necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de base de données ClickHouse","Limité aux charges de travail analytiques","Familiarité avec les concepts de SQL et d''ingénierie de données nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt ClickHouse-Datenbanksetup","Begrenzt auf analytische Workloads","Vertrautheit mit SQL- und Datenengineering-Konzepten erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige configuração do banco de dados ClickHouse","Limitado a cargas de trabalho analíticas","Necessário conhecimento de SQL e conceitos de engenharia de dados"],"ru":["Требует настройки базы данных ClickHouse","Ограничен аналитическими рабочими нагрузками","Необходимо знание SQL и концепций инженерии данных"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد قاعدة بيانات ClickHouse","محدود بالحمل التحليلي","يُفضل معرفة SQL ومفاهيم هندسة البيانات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"bc0d9351ae909eaa725b57ee5c4928274ed94e0b55e0fef4076cbe2844ae8a7b","repoEtag":"W/\"1d66934774ad40d3d916abf4c33c3e340ab032f8212b35e12a94daa7359886c9\"","qualityScore":68}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/iterative-retrieval', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'iterative-retrieval', 55024, 6781, 68, '2026-03-01T05:07:39Z', '2026-03-01T05:11:20.077Z', '5bf02488afe5504290a715d534b8dc41fa366997077715bd555f25c6e372f5bc', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/iterative-retrieval","name":"iterative-retrieval","description":{"zh":"迭代检索模式是一种解决智能体上下文问题的方法，适用于需要动态上下文的多智能体工作流","ja":"イテレーティブ・リトリーバルは、マルチエージェントワークフローで動的にコンテキストを取得するためのパターン","ko":"반복적 검색 패턴은 다중 에이전트 워크플로우에서 동적으로 컨텍스트를 얻는 방법","es":"El patrón de recuperación iterativa resuelve el problema de contexto en flujos de trabajo de agentes de IA","fr":"Le modèle de récupération itérative résout le problème de contexte dans les flux de travail d''agents IA","de":"Das Muster der iterativen Retrieval löst das Kontextproblem in KI-Agenten-Workflows","pt":"O padrão de Iterative Retrieval é uma solução para o problema de contexto em fluxos de trabalho de multiagentes, onde subagentes não sabem que contexto precisam até começarem a trabalhar","ru":"Шаблон Iterative Retrieval - это решение проблемы контекста в многоагентных рабочих процессах, где субагенты не знают, какой контекст им нужен, пока они не начнут работать","ar":"نمط الاسترجاع التكراري هو حل لمشكلة السياق في سير عمل متعددة الوكلاء، حيث لا يعرفون ما السياق الذي يحتاجونه حتى يبدأوا بالعمل","en":"Pattern for progressively refining context retrieval to solve the subagent context problem"},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":55024,"forks":6781,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:07:39Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"iterative-retrieval","description":"Pattern for progressively refining context retrieval to solve the subagent context problem","bodyPreview":"# Iterative Retrieval Pattern\n\nSolves the \"context problem\" in multi-agent workflows where subagents don''t know what context they need until they start working.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Spawning subagents that need codebase context they cannot predict upfront\n- Building multi-agent workflows where context is progressively refined\n- Encountering \"context too large\" or \"missing context\" failures in agent tasks\n- Designing RAG-like retrieval pipelines for code exploration\n- Optimizing token usage in","body":"# Iterative Retrieval Pattern\n\nSolves the \"context problem\" in multi-agent workflows where subagents don''t know what context they need until they start working.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Spawning subagents that need codebase context they cannot predict upfront\n- Building multi-agent workflows where context is progressively refined\n- Encountering \"context too large\" or \"missing context\" failures in agent tasks\n- Designing RAG-like retrieval pipelines for code exploration\n- Optimizing token usage in agent orchestration\n\n## The Problem\n\nSubagents are spawned with limited context. They don''t know:\n- Which files contain relevant code\n- What patterns exist in the codebase\n- What terminology the project uses\n\nStandard approaches fail:\n- **Send everything**: Exceeds context limits\n- **Send nothing**: Agent lacks critical information\n- **Guess what''s needed**: Often wrong\n\n## The Solution: Iterative Retrieval\n\nA 4-phase loop that progressively refines context:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                                             │\n│   ┌──────────┐      ┌──────────┐            │\n│   │ DISPATCH │─────▶│ EVALUATE │            │\n│   └──────────┘      └──────────┘            │\n│        ▲                  │                 │\n│        │                  ▼                 │\n│   ┌──────────┐      ┌──────────┐            │\n│   │   LOOP   │◀─────│  REFINE  │            │\n│   └──────────┘      └──────────┘            │\n│                                             │\n│        Max 3 cycles, then proceed           │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Phase 1: DISPATCH\n\nInitial broad query to gather candidate files:\n\n```javascript\n// Start with high-level intent\nconst initialQuery = {\n  patterns: [''src/**/*.ts'', ''lib/**/*.ts''],\n  keywords: [''authentication'', ''user'', ''session''],\n  excludes: [''*.test.ts'', ''*.spec.ts'']\n};\n\n// Dispatch to retrieval agent\nconst candidates = await retrieveFiles(initialQuery);\n```\n\n### Phase 2: EVALUATE\n\nAssess retrieved content for relevance:\n\n```javascript\nfunction evaluateRelevance(files, task) {\n  return files.map(file => ({\n    path: file.path,\n    relevance: scoreRelevance(file.content, task),\n    reason: explainRelevance(file.content, task),\n    missingContext: identifyGaps(file.content, task)\n  }));\n}\n```\n\nScoring criteria:\n- **High (0.8-1.0)**: Directly implements target functionality\n- **Medium (0.5-0.7)**: Contains related patterns or types\n- **Low (0.2-0.4)**: Tangentially related\n- **None (0-0.2)**: Not relevant, exclude\n\n### Phase 3: REFINE\n\nUpdate search criteria based on evaluation:\n\n```javascript\nfunction refineQuery(evaluation, previousQuery) {\n  return {\n    // Add new patterns discovered in high-relevance files\n    patterns: [...previousQuery.patterns, ...extractPatterns(evaluation)],\n\n    // Add terminology found in codebase\n    keywords: [...previousQuery.keywords, ...extractKeywords(evaluation)],\n\n    // Exclude confirmed irrelevant paths\n    excludes: [...previousQuery.excludes, ...evaluation\n      .filter(e => e.relevance < 0.2)\n      .map(e => e.path)\n    ],\n\n    // Target specific gaps\n    focusAreas: evaluation\n      .flatMap(e => e.missingContext)\n      .filter(unique)\n  };\n}\n```\n\n### Phase 4: LOOP\n\nRepeat with refined criteria (max 3 cycles):\n\n```javascript\nasync function iterativeRetrieve(task, maxCycles = 3) {\n  let query = createInitialQuery(task);\n  let bestContext = [];\n\n  for (let cycle = 0; cycle < maxCycles; cycle++) {\n    const candidates = await retrieveFiles(query);\n    const evaluation = evaluateRelevance(candidates, task);\n\n    // Check if we have sufficient context\n    const highRelevance = evaluation.filter(e => e.relevance >= 0.7);\n    if (highRelevance.length >= 3 && !hasCriticalGaps(evaluation)) {\n      return highRelevance;\n    }\n\n    // Refine and continue\n    query = refineQuery(evaluation, query);\n    bestContext = mergeContext(bestContext, highRelevance);\n  }\n\n  return bestContext;\n}\n```\n\n## Practical Examples\n\n### Example 1: Bug Fix Context\n\n```\nTask: \"Fix the authentication token expiry bug\"\n\nCycle 1:\n  DISPATCH: Search for \"token\", \"auth\", \"expiry\" in src/**\n  EVALUATE: Found auth.ts (0.9), tokens.ts (0.8), user.ts (0.3)\n  REFINE: Add \"refresh\", \"jwt\" keywords; exclude user.ts\n\nCycle 2:\n  DISPATCH: Search refined terms\n  EVALUATE: Found session-manager.ts (0.95), jwt-utils.ts (0.85)\n  REFINE: Sufficient context (2 high-relevance files)\n\nResult: auth.ts, tokens.ts, session-manager.ts, jwt-utils.ts\n```\n\n### Example 2: Feature Implementation\n\n```\nTask: \"Add rate limiting to API endpoints\"\n\nCycle 1:\n  DISPATCH: Search \"rate\", \"limit\", \"api\" in routes/**\n  EVALUATE: No matches - codebase uses \"throttle\" terminology\n  REFINE: Add \"throttle\", \"middleware\" keywords\n\nCycle 2:\n  DISPATCH: Search refined terms\n  EVALUATE: Found throttle.ts (0.9), middleware/index.ts (0.7)\n  REFINE: Need router patterns\n\nCycle 3:\n  DISPATCH: Search \"router\", \"express\" patterns\n  EVALUATE: Found router-setup.ts (0.8)\n  REFINE: Sufficient context\n\nResult: throttle.ts, middleware/index.ts, router-setup.ts\n```\n\n## Integration with Agents\n\nUse in agent prompts:\n\n```markdown\nWhen retrieving context for this task:\n1. Start with broad keyword search\n2. Evaluate each file''s relevance (0-1 scale)\n3. Identify what context is still missing\n4. Refine search criteria and repeat (max 3 cycles)\n5. Return files with relevance >= 0.7\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Start broad, narrow progressively** - Don''t over-specify initial queries\n2. **Learn codebase terminology** - First cycle often reveals naming conventions\n3. **Track what''s missing** - Explicit gap identification drives refinement\n4. **Stop at \"good enough\"** - 3 high-relevance files beats 10 mediocre ones\n5. **Exclude confidently** - Low-relevance files won''t become relevant\n\n## Related\n\n- [The Longform Guide](https://x.com/affaanmustafa/status/2014040193557471352) - Subagent orchestration section\n- `continuous-learning` skill - For patterns that improve over time\n- Agent definitions in `~/.claude/agents/`\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:11:20.077Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理的迭代检索模式","ja":"AIエージェントのイテレーティブ・リトリーバル","ko":"AI 에이전트의 반복적 검색 패턴","es":"Iterative Retrieval para Agentes de IA","fr":"Récupération itérative pour les agents IA","de":"Iterative Retrieval für KI-Agents","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Iterative Retrieval para Agentes de IA","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Шаблон Iterative Retrieval для контекстного из...","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: استرجاع تكراري لتعزيز أداء الوكلاء","en":"iterative-retrieval"},"description":{"zh":"迭代检索模式是一种解决智能体上下文问题的方法，适用于需要动态上下文的多智能体工作流","ja":"イテレーティブ・リトリーバルは、マルチエージェントワークフローで動的にコンテキストを取得するためのパターン","ko":"반복적 검색 패턴은 다중 에이전트 워크플로우에서 동적으로 컨텍스트를 얻는 방법","es":"El patrón de recuperación iterativa resuelve el problema de contexto en flujos de trabajo de agentes de IA","fr":"Le modèle de récupération itérative résout le problème de contexte dans les flux de travail d''agents IA","de":"Das Muster der iterativen Retrieval löst das Kontextproblem in KI-Agenten-Workflows","pt":"O padrão de Iterative Retrieval é uma solução para o problema de contexto em fluxos de trabalho de multiagentes, onde subagentes não sabem que contexto preci...","ru":"Шаблон Iterative Retrieval - это решение проблемы контекста в многоагентных рабочих процессах, где субагенты не знают, какой контекст им нужен, пока они не н...","ar":"نمط الاسترجاع التكراري هو حل لمشكلة السياق في سير عمل متعددة الوكلاء، حيث لا يعرفون ما السياق الذي يحتاجونه حتى يبدأوا بالعمل","en":"Pattern for progressively refining context retrieval to solve the subagent context problem"},"definition":{"en":"Pattern for progressively refining context retrieval to solve the subagent context problem"},"features":{"zh":["解决智能体上下文问题","提高多智能体工作流中上下文检索效率","适用于需要动态上下文的工作流","支持RAG-like检索管道","优化token使用"],"ja":["コンテキスト問題を解決","マルチエージェントワークフローにおけるコンテキストの効率的な取得","動的なコンテキストを必要とするワークフローに対応","RAG-likeの検索パイプラインをサポート","トークンの使用を最適化"],"ko":["컨텍스트 문제 해결","다중 에이전트 워크플로우에서 컨텍스트 검색 효율성 향상","동적인 컨텍스트를 필요로 하는 워크플로우 지원","RAG-like 검색 파이프라인 지원","토큰 사용 최적화"],"es":["Resuelve el problema de contexto en flujos de trabajo de agentes de IA","Mejora la eficiencia de los flujos de trabajo de agentes de IA","Permite la refinación progresiva del contexto de recuperación","Es útil para la construcción de flujos de trabajo de agentes de IA","Optimiza el uso de tokens en las tareas de los agentes"],"fr":["Résout le problème de contexte dans les flux de travail d''agents IA","Améliore l''efficacité des flux de travail d''agents IA","Permet l''affinement progressif du contexte de récupération","Est utile pour la construction de flux de travail d''agents IA","Optimise l''utilisation de jetons dans les tâches des agents"],"de":["Löst das Kontextproblem in KI-Agenten-Workflows","Verbessert die Effizienz von KI-Agenten-Workflows","Ermöglicht die schrittweise Verfeinerung des Retrieval-Kontexts","Ist nützlich für den Aufbau von KI-Agenten-Workflows","Optimiert die Token-Nutzung in den Aufgaben der Agenten"],"pt":["Resolução do problema de contexto em fluxos de trabalho de multiagentes","Refinamento progressivo do contexto d