子代理上下文问题的多代理工作流代理","ja":"マルチエージェントワークフロー代理がサブエージェントのコンテキスト問題を解決するために進歩的なコンテキストの精緻化を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"다중 에이전트 워크플로우 에이전트가 하위 에이전트 컨텍스트 문제를 해결하기 위해 점진적인 컨텍스트 정련을 요구하는 경우 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Flujo de Trabajo de Multiagente que requieren un refinamiento progresivo del contexto para resolver el problema de contexto de subagente","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Flux de Travail Multi-Agent nécessitant un raffinement progressif du contexte pour résoudre le problème de contexte de sous-agent","de":"Ideal für Multi-Agent-Workflows, die ein progressives Kontext-Verfeinern erfordern, um das Subagent-Kontext-Problem zu lösen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Fluxo de Trabalho Múltiplo que exigem refinamento progressivo de contexto para resolver o problema de contexto de subagente","ru":"Идеально подходит для Многоагентных Workflow-агентов, требующих прогрессивного уточнения контекста для решения проблемы контекста субагента","ar":"مثالي لعمليات tácitos متعددة الوكلاء التي تتطلب تحسين السياق التدريجي لحل مشكلة سياق الوكيل الفرعي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to progressively refine context retrieval using the iterative retrieval pattern, solving the context problem in multi-agent workflows and optimizing token usage in RAG-like retrieval pipelines for code exploration","zh":"赋予代理进步地精化上下文检索使用迭代检索模式，解决多代理工作流中的上下文问题，并在类似RAG的检索管道中优化代码探索的标记使用","ja":"エージェントにイテレーティブなリトリーブパターンを使用してコンテキストのリトリーブを進歩的に精緻化する機能を与え、マルチエージェントワークフローでのコンテキスト問題を解決し、コードの探索のためにRAGのようなリトリーブパイプラインでトークンの使用を最適化する","ko":"에이전트에 반복적인 검색 패턴을 사용하여 컨텍스트 검색을 점진적으로 정련할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 다중 에이전트 워크플로우의 컨텍스트 문제를 해결하고 코드 탐색을 위한 RAG와 같은 검색 파이프라인에서 토큰 사용을 최적화","es":"Permite a los agentes refinar progresivamente la recuperación de contexto utilizando el patrón de recuperación iterativa, resolviendo el problema de contexto en flujos de trabajo de multiagente y optimizando el uso de tokens en tuberías de recuperación similares a RAG para la exploración de código","fr":"Permet aux agents de raffiner progressivement la récupération de contexte en utilisant le modèle de récupération itérative, résolvant le problème de contexte dans les flux de travail multi-agents et optimisant l''utilisation de jetons dans les pipelines de récupération similaires à RAG pour l''exploration de code","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, den Kontext schrittweise zu verfeinern, indem sie das iterative Retrieval-Muster verwenden, um das Kontext-Problem in Multi-Agent-Workflows zu lösen und die Token-Nutzung in RAG-ähnlichen Retrieval-Pipelines für die Code-Exploration zu optimieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a refinarem progressivamente a recuperação de contexto usando o padrão de recuperação iterativa, resolvendo o problema de contexto em fluxos de trabalho de múltiplos agentes e otimizando o uso de tokens em pipelines de recuperação semelhantes ao RAG para exploração de código","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью прогрессивного уточнения контекста с помощью итеративного шаблона извлечения, решая проблему контекста в многоагентных рабочих процессах и оптимизируя использование токенов в конвейерах извлечения, подобных RAG, для изучения кода","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحسين السياق تدريجياً باستخدام نمط الاسترجاع التكراري لحل مشكلة السياق في سير العمل متعددة الوكلاء وتحسين استخدام الرموز في خطوط أنابيب الاسترجاع الشبيهة بـ RAG لاستكشاف التعليمات البرمجية"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating context retrieval for subagents in multi-agent workflows","Debugging context too large or missing context failures in agent tasks","Building efficient RAG-like retrieval pipelines for codebase exploration","Optimizing token usage in iterative retrieval processes"],"zh":["自动化多代理工作流中子代理的上下文检索","调试代理任务中上下文过大或缺失上下文失败","构建高效的类似RAG的检索管道用于代码库探索","优化迭代检索过程中的标记使用"],"ja":["マルチエージェントワークフローでのサブエージェントのコンテキストのリトリーブを自動化する","エージェントタスクでのコンテキストが大きすぎるまたは不足している失敗をデバッグする","コードベースの探索のために効率的なRAGのようなリトリーブパイプラインを構築する","イテレーティブなリトリーブプロセスでのトークンの使用を最適化する"],"ko":["다중 에이전트 워크플로우에서 하위 에이전트의 컨텍스트 검색을 자동화","에이전트 작업에서 컨텍스트가 너무 크거나 누락된 컨텍스트 실패를 디버깅","코드베이스 탐색을 위한 효율적인 RAG와 같은 검색 파이프라인을 구축","반복적인 검색 프로세스에서 토큰 사용을 최적화"],"es":["Automatizar la recuperación de contexto para subagentes en flujos de trabajo de multiagente","Depurar errores de contexto demasiado grande o contexto faltante en tareas de agente","Crear tuberías de recuperación eficientes similares a RAG para la exploración de una base de código","Optimizar el uso de tokens en procesos de recuperación iterativa"],"fr":["Automatiser la récupération de contexte pour les sous-agents dans les flux de travail multi-agents","Déboguer les erreurs de contexte trop grand ou de contexte manquant dans les tâches d''agent","Créer des pipelines de récupération efficaces similaires à RAG pour l''exploration d''une base de code","Optimiser l''utilisation de jetons dans les processus de récupération itérative"],"de":["Automatisieren der Kontext-Wiederherstellung für Subagenten in Multi-Agent-Workflows","Fehlerbehebung bei Kontext-Fehlern, die zu groß oder fehlend sind, in Agenten-Aufgaben","Erstellen effizienter RAG-ähnlicher Retrieval-Pipelines für die Code-Exploration","Optimieren der Token-Nutzung in iterativen Retrieval-Prozessen"],"pt":["Automatizar a recuperação de contexto para subagentes em fluxos de trabalho de múltiplos agentes","Depurar falhas de contexto grande demais ou ausente em tarefas de agentes","Construir pipelines de recuperação eficientes semelhantes ao RAG para exploração de código","Otimizar o uso de tokens em processos de recuperação iterativa"],"ru":["Автоматизировать извлечение контекста для субагентов в многоагентных рабочих процессах","Отлаживать ошибки контекста, которые слишком велики или отсутствуют в задачах агентов","Построить эффективные конвейеры извлечения, подобные RAG, для изучения кода","Оптимизировать использование токенов в итеративных процессах извлечения"],"ar":["توفير استرجاع السياق آلياً للوكلاء التابعين في سير العمل متعددة الوكلاء","تصحيح أخطاء السياق الكبيرة جداً أو المفقودة في مهام الوكلاء","بناء خطوط أنابيب استرجاع كفاءة شبيهة بـ RAG لاستكشاف التعليمات البرمجية","تحسين استخدام الرموز في عمليات الاسترجاع التكرارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires spawning subagents that need codebase context","Limited to multi-agent workflows where context is progressively refined","May encounter context too large or missing context failures if not implemented correctly"],"zh":["需要生成需要代码库上下文的子代理","仅限于上下文进步地精化的多代理工作流","如果不正确实现，可能会遇到上下文过大或缺失上下文失败"],"ja":["コードベースのコンテキストが必要なサブエージェントを生成する必要がある","コンテキストが進歩的に精緻化されるマルチエージェントワークフローに限定される","正しく実装されないと、コンテキストが大きすぎるまたは不足している失敗に遭遇する可能性がある"],"ko":["코드베이스 컨텍스트가 필요한 하위 에이전트를 생성해야 함","컨텍스트가 점진적으로 정련되는 다중 에이전트 워크플로우에만 국한","올바르게 구현하지 않으면 컨텍스트가 너무 크거나 누락된 컨텍스트 실패를 만날 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la creación de subagentes que necesitan contexto de base de código","Limitado a flujos de trabajo de multiagente donde el contexto se refina progresivamente","Puede encontrarse con errores de contexto demasiado grande o contexto faltante si no se implementa correctamente"],"fr":["Nécessite la création de sous-agents qui ont besoin de contexte de base de code","Limité aux flux de travail multi-agents où le contexte est raffiné progressivement","Peut rencontrer des erreurs de contexte trop grand ou de contexte manquant si ce n''est pas implémenté correctement"],"de":["Erfordert die Erstellung von Subagenten, die Kontext der Codebasis benötigen","Begrenzt auf Multi-Agent-Workflows, in denen der Kontext schrittweise verfeinert wird","Kann auf Kontext-Fehler stoßen, die zu groß oder fehlend sind, wenn sie nicht korrekt implementiert werden"],"pt":["Exige a criação de subagentes que precisam de contexto de código","Limitado a fluxos de trabalho de múltiplos agentes onde o contexto é refinado progressivamente","Pode encontrar falhas de contexto grande demais ou ausente se não for implementado corretamente"],"ru":["Требует создания субагентов, которым нужен контекст кода","Ограничен многоагентными рабочими процессами, в которых контекст уточняется прогрессивно","Может столкнуться с ошибками контекста, которые слишком велики или отсутствуют, если не реализован правильно"],"ar":["يتطلب إنشاء وكلاء تابعين يحتاجون إلى سياق التعليمات البرمجية","محدود بسير العمل متعددة الوكلاء حيث يتم تحسين السياق تدريجياً","قد تواجه أخطاء السياق الكبيرة جداً أو المفقودة إذا لم يتم تنفيذها بشكل صحيح"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5bf02488afe5504290a715d534b8dc41fa366997077715bd555f25c6e372f5bc","repoEtag":"W/\"1d66934774ad40d3d916abf4c33c3e340ab032f8212b35e12a94daa7359886c9\"","qualityScore":68}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/java-coding-standards', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'java-coding-standards', 55024, 6781, 68, '2026-03-01T05:07:39Z', '2026-03-01T05:11:20.193Z', '253c3ef143330a2901c2b75fd8def3a3f9ec66e6cb1f8fd1e323b803004dd22b', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/java-coding-standards","name":"java-coding-standards","description":{"zh":"Java 编码标准指南，适用于 Spring Boot 服务，涵盖命名、不变性、Optional 用法、流、异常、泛型和项目布局","ja":"Spring Boot サービス向けの Java コーディング規約ガイド、命名、不変性、Optional の使用、ストリーム、例外、ジェネリクス、プロジェクトレイアウトを網羅","ko":"Spring Boot 서비스를 위한 Java 코딩 표준 가이드, 명명, 불변성, Optional 사용, 스트림, 예외, 제네릭스, 프로젝트 레이아웃을 포함","es":"Estándares de codificación Java para servicios de Spring Boot, incluyendo nombres, inmutabilidad y manejo de excepciones","fr":"Normes de codage Java pour les services Spring Boot, y compris les noms, l''immutabilité et la gestion des exceptions","de":"Java-Codierungsstandards für Spring-Boot-Dienste, einschließlich Namen, Unveränderlichkeit und Ausnahmehandling","pt":"Padrões de codificação Java para serviços Spring Boot, incluindo naming, imutabilidade, uso de Optional e streams, para melhorar a legibilidade e manutenção do código","ru":"Стандарты кодирования Java для сервисов Spring Boot, включая именование, неизменность, использование Optional и потоков, для улучшения читаемости и поддержки кода","ar":"معايير البرمجة الجافا لخدمات ربيع البوت، بما في ذلك التسمية واللا 丶ية واستخدام الخيارات والجداول، لتحسين القراءة والصيانة للبرمجية","en":"Java coding standards for Spring Boot services: naming, immutability, Optional usage, streams, exceptions, generics, and project layout."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":55024,"forks":6781,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:07:39Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"java-coding-standards","description":"Java coding standards for Spring Boot services: naming, immutability, Optional usage, streams, exceptions, generics, and project layout.","bodyPreview":"# Java Coding Standards\n\nStandards for readable, maintainable Java (17+) code in Spring Boot services.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Writing or reviewing Java code in Spring Boot projects\n- Enforcing naming, immutability, or exception handling conventions\n- Working with records, sealed classes, or pattern matching (Java 17+)\n- Reviewing use of Optional, streams, or generics\n- Structuring packages and project layout\n\n## Core Principles\n\n- Prefer clarity over cleverness\n- Immutable by default; minimize","body":"# Java Coding Standards\n\nStandards for readable, maintainable Java (17+) code in Spring Boot services.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Writing or reviewing Java code in Spring Boot projects\n- Enforcing naming, immutability, or exception handling conventions\n- Working with records, sealed classes, or pattern matching (Java 17+)\n- Reviewing use of Optional, streams, or generics\n- Structuring packages and project layout\n\n## Core Principles\n\n- Prefer clarity over cleverness\n- Immutable by default; minimize shared mutable state\n- Fail fast with meaningful exceptions\n- Consistent naming and package structure\n\n## Naming\n\n```java\n// ✅ Classes/Records: PascalCase\npublic class MarketService {}\npublic record Money(BigDecimal amount, Currency currency) {}\n\n// ✅ Methods/fields: camelCase\nprivate final MarketRepository marketRepository;\npublic Market findBySlug(String slug) {}\n\n// ✅ Constants: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE\nprivate static final int MAX_PAGE_SIZE = 100;\n```\n\n## Immutability\n\n```java\n// ✅ Favor records and final fields\npublic record MarketDto(Long id, String name, MarketStatus status) {}\n\npublic class Market {\n  private final Long id;\n  private final String name;\n  // getters only, no setters\n}\n```\n\n## Optional Usage\n\n```java\n// ✅ Return Optional from find* methods\nOptional<Market> market = marketRepository.findBySlug(slug);\n\n// ✅ Map/flatMap instead of get()\nreturn market\n    .map(MarketResponse::from)\n    .orElseThrow(() -> new EntityNotFoundException(\"Market not found\"));\n```\n\n## Streams Best Practices\n\n```java\n// ✅ Use streams for transformations, keep pipelines short\nList<String> names = markets.stream()\n    .map(Market::name)\n    .filter(Objects::nonNull)\n    .toList();\n\n// ❌ Avoid complex nested streams; prefer loops for clarity\n```\n\n## Exceptions\n\n- Use unchecked exceptions for domain errors; wrap technical exceptions with context\n- Create domain-specific exceptions (e.g., `MarketNotFoundException`)\n- Avoid broad `catch (Exception ex)` unless rethrowing/logging centrally\n\n```java\nthrow new MarketNotFoundException(slug);\n```\n\n## Generics and Type Safety\n\n- Avoid raw types; declare generic parameters\n- Prefer bounded generics for reusable utilities\n\n```java\npublic <T extends Identifiable> Map<Long, T> indexById(Collection<T> items) { ... }\n```\n\n## Project Structure (Maven/Gradle)\n\n```\nsrc/main/java/com/example/app/\n  config/\n  controller/\n  service/\n  repository/\n  domain/\n  dto/\n  util/\nsrc/main/resources/\n  application.yml\nsrc/test/java/... (mirrors main)\n```\n\n## Formatting and Style\n\n- Use 2 or 4 spaces consistently (project standard)\n- One public top-level type per file\n- Keep methods short and focused; extract helpers\n- Order members: constants, fields, constructors, public methods, protected, private\n\n## Code Smells to Avoid\n\n- Long parameter lists → use DTO/builders\n- Deep nesting → early returns\n- Magic numbers → named constants\n- Static mutable state → prefer dependency injection\n- Silent catch blocks → log and act or rethrow\n\n## Logging\n\n```java\nprivate static final Logger log = LoggerFactory.getLogger(MarketService.class);\nlog.info(\"fetch_market slug={}\", slug);\nlog.error(\"failed_fetch_market slug={}\", slug, ex);\n```\n\n## Null Handling\n\n- Accept `@Nullable` only when unavoidable; otherwise use `@NonNull`\n- Use Bean Validation (`@NotNull`, `@NotBlank`) on inputs\n\n## Testing Expectations\n\n- JUnit 5 + AssertJ for fluent assertions\n- Mockito for mocking; avoid partial mocks where possible\n- Favor deterministic tests; no hidden sleeps\n\n**Remember**: Keep code intentional, typed, and observable. Optimize for maintainability over micro-optimizations unless proven necessary.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:11:20.193Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"Java 编码标准 - AI 智能代理","ja":"Java コーディング規約 - AI エージェント","ko":"Java 코딩 표준 - AI 에이전트","es":"Estándares de codificación Java para Spring Boot con Agen...","fr":"Normes de codage Java pour Spring Boot avec Outils d''IA","de":"Java-Codierungsstandards für Spring Boot mit KI-Agents","pt":"Padrões de Codificação Java para Spring Boot com Ferramen...","ru":"Стандарты Кодирования Java для Spring Boot с ИИ Агентами","ar":"معايير البرمجة الجافا لربيع البوت مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"java-coding-standards"},"description":{"zh":"Java 编码标准指南，适用于 Spring Boot 服务，涵盖命名、不变性、Optional 用法、流、异常、泛型和项目布局","ja":"Spring Boot サービス向けの Java コーディング規約ガイド、命名、不変性、Optional の使用、ストリーム、例外、ジェネリクス、プロジェクトレイアウトを網羅","ko":"Spring Boot 서비스를 위한 Java 코딩 표준 가이드, 명명, 불변성, Optional 사용, 스트림, 예외, 제네릭스, 프로젝트 레이아웃을 포함","es":"Estándares de codificación Java para servicios de Spring Boot, incluyendo nombres, inmutabilidad y manejo de excepciones","fr":"Normes de codage Java pour les services Spring Boot, y compris les noms, l''immutabilité et la gestion des exceptions","de":"Java-Codierungsstandards für Spring-Boot-Dienste, einschließlich Namen, Unveränderlichkeit und Ausnahmehandling","pt":"Padrões de codificação Java para serviços Spring Boot, incluindo naming, imutabilidade, uso de Optional e streams, para melhorar a legibilidade e manutenção ...","ru":"Стандарты кодирования Java для сервисов Spring Boot, включая именование, неизменность, использование Optional и потоков, для улучшения читаемости и поддержки...","ar":"معايير البرمجة الجافا لخدمات ربيع البوت، بما في ذلك التسمية واللا 丶ية واستخدام الخيارات والجداول، لتحسين القراءة والصيانة للبرمجية","en":"Java coding standards for Spring Boot services: naming, immutability, Optional usage, streams, exceptions, generics, and project layout."},"definition":{"en":"Java coding standards for Spring Boot services: naming, immutability, Optional usage, streams, exceptions, generics, and project layout."},"features":{"zh":["命名约定","不变性","Optional 用法","流处理","异常处理","泛型"],"ja":["命名規約","不変性","Optional の使用","ストリーム処理","例外処理","ジェネリクス"],"ko":["명명 규칙","불변성","Optional 사용","스트림 처리","예외 처리","제네릭스"],"es":["Nombre y convenciones de nomenclatura","Inmutabilidad y minimización de cambios","Uso de Optional y streams","Manejo de excepciones y generics","Estructura de paquetes y diseño de proyectos"],"fr":["Noms et conventions de dénomination","Immutabilité et minimisation des changements","Utilisation d''Optional et de streams","Gestion des exceptions et des generics","Structure de paquets et conception de projets"],"de":["Namen und Benennungskonventionen","Unveränderlichkeit und Minimierung von Änderungen","Verwendung von Optional und Streams","Ausnahmehandling und Generics","Paketstruktur und Projektentwurf"],"pt":["Naming e convenções de codificação","Imutabilidade e uso de Optional","Streams e generics para melhorar a performance","Exceções e tratamento de erros","Projeto de layout e organização de pacotes"],"ru":["Именование и конвенции кодирования","Неизменность и использование Optional","Потоки и generics для улучшения производительности","Исключения и обработка ошибок","Проектирование макета и организация пакетов"],"ar":["التسمية والقواعد البرمجية","اللا 丶ية واستخدام الخيارات","الجداول والجينيركس لتحسين الأداء","الاستثناءات ومعالجة الأخطاء","تصميم التخطيط وتنظيم الحزم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Java 编码标准","Spring Boot 服务","AI 智能代理","Java 开发","代码质量","编码最佳实践"],"ja":["Java コーディング規約","Spring Boot サービス","AI エージェント","Java 開発","コード品質","コーディングベストプラクティス"],"ko":["Java 코딩 표준","Spring Boot 서비스","AI 에이전트","Java 개발","코드 품질","코딩 모범 사례"],"es":["Agentes de IA","Desarrollo de software","Estándares de codificación Java","Spring Boot","Inmutabilidad","Manejo de excepciones","Optional","Streams","Generics"],"fr":["Outils d''IA","Développement de logiciels","Normes de codage Java","Spring Boot","Immutabilité","Gestion des exceptions","Optional","Streams","Generics"],"de":["KI-Agents","Softwareentwicklung","Java-Codierungsstandards","Spring Boot","Unveränderlichkeit","Ausnahmehandling","Optional","Streams","Generics"],"pt":["padrões de codificação Java","Spring Boot","ferramentas de IA","desenvolvimento de software","produtividade","legibilidade","manutenção"],"ru":["стандарты кодирования Java","Spring Boot","ИИ Агенты","разработка программного обеспечения","производительность","читаемость","поддержка"],"ar":["معايير البرمجة الجافا","ربيع البوت","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","الإنتاجية","القراءة","الصيانة"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Java Development Agents needing to enforce Spring Boot coding standards and best practices.","zh":"非常适合需要执行 Spring Boot 编码标准和最佳实践的 Java 开发代理。","ja":"Spring Boot コーディング規約およびベストプラクティスを適用する必要がある Java 開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Spring Boot 코딩 표준 및 모범 사례를 적용해야 하는 Java 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Java que necesitan hacer cumplir los estándares y las mejores prácticas de codificación de Spring Boot.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Java qui doivent faire respecter les normes et les meilleures pratiques de codage de Spring Boot.","de":"Perfekt für Java-Entwicklungsagenten, die Spring Boot-Codierungsstandards und Best Practices durchsetzen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Java que precisam impor padrões de codificação e melhores práticas do Spring Boot.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Java, которым необходимо обеспечивать соблюдение стандартов кодирования и лучших практик Spring Boot.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الناشئين بالجافا الذين يحتاجون إلى فرض معايير البرمجة وأفضل الممارسات لاسبرينج بوت."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write readable and maintainable Java code, utilizing Optional, streams, and generics, while enforcing naming conventions, immutability, and exception handling in Spring Boot services.","zh":"赋予代理写出可读性强且易于维护的 Java 代码的能力，利用 Optional、流和泛型，同时在 Spring Boot 服务中执行命名约定、不可变性和异常处理。","ja":"エージェントが Optional、ストリーム、ジェネリクスを利用して、読みやすく保守性の高い Java コードを記述できるようにし、同時に Spring Boot サービスで命名規約、不変性、例外処理を適用する。","ko":"에이전트가 Optional, 스트림 및 제네릭스를 사용하여 가독성과 유지보수성이 높은 Java 코드를 작성할 수 있도록 하며,同时에 Spring Boot 서비스에서 명명 규칙, 불변성 및 예외 처리를 적용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir código Java legible y mantenible, utilizando Optional, streams y generics, mientras se hacen cumplir las convenciones de nomenclatura, inmutabilidad y manejo de excepciones en los servicios de Spring Boot.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire du code Java lisible et maintenable, en utilisant Optional, streams et generics, tout en faisant respecter les conventions de nommage, l''immuabilité et la gestion des exceptions dans les services Spring Boot.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, lesbares und wartbares Java-Code zu schreiben, indem Optional, Streams und Generics verwendet werden, während Namenskonventionen, Unveränderlichkeit und Ausnahmehandling in Spring-Boot-Diensten durchgesetzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escreverem código Java legível e mantenedor, utilizando Optional, streams e generics, enquanto impõe convenções de nomenclatura, imutabilidade e tratamento de exceções nos serviços do Spring Boot.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать читаемый и поддерживаемый код Java, используя Optional, streams и generics, а также обеспечивает соблюдение соглашений об именах, неизменности и обработки исключений в сервисах Spring Boot.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية كتابة كود جافا قابل للقراءة والصيانة، باستخدام الخيارات و Streams و Generics،，同时 يفرض اتفاقيات التسمية وعدم التغيير ومعالجة الاستثناءات في خدمات اسبرينج بوت."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing naming conventions and coding standards in Java projects","Implementing immutable data structures and minimizing mutability","Optimizing exception handling and error management in Spring Boot services","Reviewing and refining the use of Optional, streams, and generics in Java code"],"zh":["在 Java 项目中执行命名约定和编码标准","实现不可变数据结构并最小化可变性","在 Spring Boot 服务中优化异常处理和错误管理","审查和完善 Java 代码中 Optional、流和泛型的使用"],"ja":["Java プロジェクトで命名規約およびコーディング規約を適用する","不変データ構造を実装し、可変性を最小限に抑える","Spring Boot サービスで例外処理およびエラー管理を最適化する","Java コードで Optional、ストリーム、ジェネリクスの使用を確認し、改善する"],"ko":["Java 프로젝트에서 명명 규칙 및 코딩 표준을 적용하는 것","불변 데이터 구조를 구현하고 가변성을 최소화하는 것","Spring Boot 서비스에서 예외 처리 및 오류 관리를 최적화하는 것","Java 코드에서 Optional, 스트림, 제네릭스의 사용을 검토하고 개선하는 것"],"es":["Hacer cumplir las convenciones de nomenclatura y los estándares de codificación en proyectos de Java","Implementar estructuras de datos inmutables y minimizar la mutabilidad","Optimizar el manejo de excepciones y la gestión de errores en los servicios de Spring Boot","Revisar y perfeccionar el uso de Optional, streams y generics en el código Java"],"fr":["Faire respecter les conventions de nommage et les normes de codage dans les projets Java","Implémenter des structures de données immuables et minimiser la mutabilité","Optimiser la gestion des exceptions et la gestion des erreurs dans les services Spring Boot","Réviser et affiner l''utilisation d''Optional, streams et generics dans le code Java"],"de":["Durchsetzen von Namenskonventionen und Codierungsstandards in Java-Projekten","Implementierung unveränderlicher Datenstrukturen und Minimierung der Veränderlichkeit","Optimierung der Ausnahmehandling und Fehlernverwaltung in Spring-Boot-Diensten","Überprüfen und Verfeinern der Verwendung von Optional, Streams und Generics im Java-Code"],"pt":["Impor convenções de nomenclatura e padrões de codificação em projetos Java","Implementar estruturas de dados imutáveis e minimizar a mutabilidade","Otimizar tratamento de exceções e gerenciamento de erros em serviços do Spring Boot","Revisar e refinar o uso de Optional, streams e generics em código Java"],"ru":["Обеспечить соблюдение соглашений об именах и стандартов кодирования в проектах Java","Реализовать неизменные структуры данных и минимизировать изменяемость","Оптимизировать обработку исключений и управление ошибками в сервисах Spring Boot","Просмотреть и усовершенствовать использование Optional, streams и generics в коде Java"],"ar":["فرض اتفاقيات التسمية ومعايير البرمجة في مشاريع الجافا","تنفيذ هياكل بيانات غير قابلة للتغيير وتقليل التغيير","تحسين معالجة الاستثناءات وإدارة الأخطاء في خدمات اسبرينج بوت","مراجعة وتحسين استخدام الخيارات و Streams و Generics في كود الجافا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Java 17+ for records, sealed classes, and pattern matching support","Specific to Spring Boot services and may not be directly applicable to other Java frameworks"],"zh":["需要 Java 17+ 来支持记录、密封类和模式匹配","特定于 Spring Boot 服务，可能不直接适用于其他 Java 框架"],"ja":["レコード、シールドクラス、パターンマッチングのサポートには Java 17+ が必要","Spring Boot サービスに特化しており、他の Java フレームワークには直接適用できない可能性がある"],"ko":["레코드, 봉인 클래스 및 패턴 일치를 지원하려면 Java 17+가 필요합니다","Spring Boot 서비스에 특화되어 있으므로 다른 Java 프레임워크에는 직접적용할 수 없습니다"],"es":["Requiere Java 17+ para el soporte de registros, clases selladas y coincidencia de patrones","Específico para los servicios de Spring Boot y puede que no sea directamente aplicable a otros marcos de Java"],"fr":["Nécessite Java 17+ pour le support des enregistrements, des classes scellées et de la correspondance de modèles","Spécifique aux services Spring Boot et peut ne pas être directement applicable à d''autres frameworks Java"],"de":["Benötigt Java 17+ für die Unterstützung von Records, versiegelten Klassen und Mustervergleich","Spezifisch für Spring-Boot-Dienste und kann möglicherweise nicht direkt auf andere Java-Frameworks angewendet werden"],"pt":["Requer Java 17+ para suporte a registros, classes seladas e correspondência de padrões","Específico para serviços do Spring Boot e pode não ser diretamente aplicável a outros frameworks Java"],"ru":["Требует Java 17+ для поддержки записей, запечатанных классов и сопоставления с образцом","Конкретно для сервисов Spring Boot и может не быть直接 применимым к другим фреймворкам Java"],"ar":["يتطلب جافا 17+ لدعم السجلات والفصول المحكمة والتعاون مع الأنماط","محدد لخدمات اسبرينج بوت وربما لا يكون قابلا للتطبيق مباشرة على إطارات جافا أخرى"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"253c3ef143330a2901c2b75fd8def3a3f9ec66e6cb1f8fd1e323b803004dd22b","repoEtag":"W/\"1d66934774ad40d3d916abf4c33c3e340ab032f8212b35e12a94daa7359886c9\"","qualityScore":68}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/jpa-patterns', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'jpa-patterns', 55024, 6781, 68, '2026-03-01T05:07:39Z', '2026-03-01T05:11:20.245Z', '5302c813a58deb5420e10c6dec4c5f0d036c278f2c494c8243a23326a994063e', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/jpa-patterns","name":"jpa-patterns","description":{"zh":"JPA/Hibernate模式用于优化Spring Boot应用的数据模型、仓库和性能","ja":"JPA/Hibernateパターンは、Spring Bootアプリケーションのデータモデル、リポジトリ、パフォーマンスを最適化するために使用されます","ko":"JPA/Hibernate 패턴은 스프링 부트 애플리케이션의 데이터 모델, 리포지토리, 성능을 최적화하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"Patrones JPA/Hibernate para diseño de entidades, relaciones y optimización de consultas en Spring Boot","fr":"Modèles JPA/Hibernate pour la conception d''entités, les relations et l''optimisation des requêtes dans Spring Boot","de":"JPA/Hibernate-Muster für Entitätsdesign, Beziehungen und Abfrageoptimierung in Spring Boot","pt":"Padrões JPA/Hibernate para modelagem de dados e otimização de desempenho em Spring Boot","ru":"Шаблоны JPA/Hibernate для проектирования сущностей и оптимизации запросов в Spring Boot","ar":"أنماط JPA/Hibernate لنمذجة البيانات وتحسين الأداء في Spring Boot","en":"JPA/Hibernate patterns for entity design, relationships, query optimization, transactions, auditing, indexing, pagination, and pooling in Spring Boot."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":55024,"forks":6781,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:07:39Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"jpa-patterns","description":"JPA/Hibernate patterns for entity design, relationships, query optimization, transactions, auditing, indexing, pagination, and pooling in Spring Boot.","bodyPreview":"# JPA/Hibernate Patterns\n\nUse for data modeling, repositories, and performance tuning in Spring Boot.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Designing JPA entities and table mappings\n- Defining relationships (@OneToMany, @ManyToOne, @ManyToMany)\n- Optimizing queries (N+1 prevention, fetch strategies, projections)\n- Configuring transactions, auditing, or soft deletes\n- Setting up pagination, sorting, or custom repository methods\n- Tuning connection pooling (HikariCP) or second-level caching\n\n## Entity Design\n\n`","body":"# JPA/Hibernate Patterns\n\nUse for data modeling, repositories, and performance tuning in Spring Boot.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Designing JPA entities and table mappings\n- Defining relationships (@OneToMany, @ManyToOne, @ManyToMany)\n- Optimizing queries (N+1 prevention, fetch strategies, projections)\n- Configuring transactions, auditing, or soft deletes\n- Setting up pagination, sorting, or custom repository methods\n- Tuning connection pooling (HikariCP) or second-level caching\n\n## Entity Design\n\n```java\n@Entity\n@Table(name = \"markets\", indexes = {\n  @Index(name = \"idx_markets_slug\", columnList = \"slug\", unique = true)\n})\n@EntityListeners(AuditingEntityListener.class)\npublic class MarketEntity {\n  @Id @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)\n  private Long id;\n\n  @Column(nullable = false, length = 200)\n  private String name;\n\n  @Column(nullable = false, unique = true, length = 120)\n  private String slug;\n\n  @Enumerated(EnumType.STRING)\n  private MarketStatus status = MarketStatus.ACTIVE;\n\n  @CreatedDate private Instant createdAt;\n  @LastModifiedDate private Instant updatedAt;\n}\n```\n\nEnable auditing:\n```java\n@Configuration\n@EnableJpaAuditing\nclass JpaConfig {}\n```\n\n## Relationships and N+1 Prevention\n\n```java\n@OneToMany(mappedBy = \"market\", cascade = CascadeType.ALL, orphanRemoval = true)\nprivate List<PositionEntity> positions = new ArrayList<>();\n```\n\n- Default to lazy loading; use `JOIN FETCH` in queries when needed\n- Avoid `EAGER` on collections; use DTO projections for read paths\n\n```java\n@Query(\"select m from MarketEntity m left join fetch m.positions where m.id = :id\")\nOptional<MarketEntity> findWithPositions(@Param(\"id\") Long id);\n```\n\n## Repository Patterns\n\n```java\npublic interface MarketRepository extends JpaRepository<MarketEntity, Long> {\n  Optional<MarketEntity> findBySlug(String slug);\n\n  @Query(\"select m from MarketEntity m where m.status = :status\")\n  Page<MarketEntity> findByStatus(@Param(\"status\") MarketStatus status, Pageable pageable);\n}\n```\n\n- Use projections for lightweight queries:\n```java\npublic interface MarketSummary {\n  Long getId();\n  String getName();\n  MarketStatus getStatus();\n}\nPage<MarketSummary> findAllBy(Pageable pageable);\n```\n\n## Transactions\n\n- Annotate service methods with `@Transactional`\n- Use `@Transactional(readOnly = true)` for read paths to optimize\n- Choose propagation carefully; avoid long-running transactions\n\n```java\n@Transactional\npublic Market updateStatus(Long id, MarketStatus status) {\n  MarketEntity entity = repo.findById(id)\n      .orElseThrow(() -> new EntityNotFoundException(\"Market\"));\n  entity.setStatus(status);\n  return Market.from(entity);\n}\n```\n\n## Pagination\n\n```java\nPageRequest page = PageRequest.of(pageNumber, pageSize, Sort.by(\"createdAt\").descending());\nPage<MarketEntity> markets = repo.findByStatus(MarketStatus.ACTIVE, page);\n```\n\nFor cursor-like pagination, include `id > :lastId` in JPQL with ordering.\n\n## Indexing and Performance\n\n- Add indexes for common filters (`status`, `slug`, foreign keys)\n- Use composite indexes matching query patterns (`status, created_at`)\n- Avoid `select *`; project only needed columns\n- Batch writes with `saveAll` and `hibernate.jdbc.batch_size`\n\n## Connection Pooling (HikariCP)\n\nRecommended properties:\n```\nspring.datasource.hikari.maximum-pool-size=20\nspring.datasource.hikari.minimum-idle=5\nspring.datasource.hikari.connection-timeout=30000\nspring.datasource.hikari.validation-timeout=5000\n```\n\nFor PostgreSQL LOB handling, add:\n```\nspring.jpa.properties.hibernate.jdbc.lob.non_contextual_creation=true\n```\n\n## Caching\n\n- 1st-level cache is per EntityManager; avoid keeping entities across transactions\n- For read-heavy entities, consider second-level cache cautiously; validate eviction strategy\n\n## Migrations\n\n- Use Flyway or Liquibase; never rely on Hibernate auto DDL in production\n- Keep migrations idempotent and additive; avoid dropping columns without plan\n\n## Testing Data Access\n\n- Prefer `@DataJpaTest` with Testcontainers to mirror production\n- Assert SQL efficiency using logs: set `logging.level.org.hibernate.SQL=DEBUG` and `logging.level.org.hibernate.orm.jdbc.bind=TRACE` for parameter values\n\n**Remember**: Keep entities lean, queries intentional, and transactions short. Prevent N+1 with fetch strategies and projections, and index for your read/write paths.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:11:20.245Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具：JPA/Hibernate模式","ja":"AIエージェント：JPA/Hibernateパターン","ko":"AI 에이전트: JPA/Hibernate 패턴","es":"Patrones JPA/Hibernate para Spring Boot con Agentes de IA","fr":"Modèles JPA/Hibernate pour Spring Boot avec Outils d''IA","de":"JPA/Hibernate-Muster für Spring Boot mit KI-Agents","pt":"Padrões JPA/Hibernate para Desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Шаблоны JPA/Hibernate","ar":"وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي: أنماط JPA/Hibernate","en":"jpa-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"JPA/Hibernate模式用于优化Spring Boot应用的数据模型、仓库和性能","ja":"JPA/Hibernateパターンは、Spring Bootアプリケーションのデータモデル、リポジトリ、パフォーマンスを最適化するために使用されます","ko":"JPA/Hibernate 패턴은 스프링 부트 애플리케이션의 데이터 모델, 리포지토리, 성능을 최적화하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"Patrones JPA/Hibernate para diseño de entidades, relaciones y optimización de consultas en Spring Boot","fr":"Modèles JPA/Hibernate pour la conception d''entités, les relations et l''optimisation des requêtes dans Spring Boot","de":"JPA/Hibernate-Muster für Entitätsdesign, Beziehungen und Abfrageoptimierung in Spring Boot","pt":"Padrões JPA/Hibernate para modelagem de dados e otimização de desempenho em Spring Boot","ru":"Шаблоны JPA/Hibernate для проектирования сущностей и оптимизации запросов в Spring Boot","ar":"أنماط JPA/Hibernate لنمذجة البيانات وتحسين الأداء في Spring Boot","en":"JPA/Hibernate patterns for entity design, relationships, query optimization, transactions, auditing, indexing, pagination, and pooling in Spring Boot."},"definition":{"en":"JPA/Hibernate patterns for entity design, relationships, query optimization, transactions, auditing, indexing, pagination, and pooling in Spring Boot."},"features":{"zh":["实体设计和表映射","关系定义（@OneToMany、@ManyToOne、@ManyToMany）","查询优化（N+1预防、取策略、投影）","事务、审计、软删除配置","分页、排序、自定义仓库方法"],"ja":["エンティティ設計とテーブルマッピング","関係定義（@OneToMany、@ManyToOne、@ManyToMany）","クエリ最適化（N+1回避、フェッチ戦略、投影）","トランザクション、監査、ソフト删除設定","ページング、ソート、カスタムリポジトリメソッド"],"ko":["엔티티 디자인과 테이블 매핑","관계 정의(@OneToMany, @ManyToOne, @ManyToMany)","쿼리 최적화(N+1 예방, 페치 전략, 투영)","트랜잭션, 감사, 소프트 삭제 구성","페이징, 정렬, 커스텀 리포지토리 메서드"],"es":["Diseño de entidades y mapeo de tablas","Definición de relaciones (@OneToMany, @ManyToOne, @ManyToMany)","Optimización de consultas (prevención de N+1, estrategias de recuperación, proyecciones)","Configuración de transacciones, auditoría y eliminación suave","Configuración de paginación, ordenación y métodos personalizados de repositorio"],"fr":["Conception d''entités et mappage de tables","Définition de relations (@OneToMany, @ManyToOne, @ManyToMany)","Optimisation des requêtes (prévention de N+1, stratégies de récupération, projections)","Configuration des transactions, de l''audit et de la suppression douce","Configuration de la pagination, du tri et des méthodes de référentiel personnalisées"],"de":["Entitätsdesign und Tabelle-Mapping","Definition von Beziehungen (@OneToMany, @ManyToOne, @ManyToMany)","Abfrageoptimierung (Vermeidung von N+1, Fetch-Strategien, Projections)","Konfiguration von Transaktionen, Auditing und weichen Löschungen","Konfiguration von Paginierung, Sortierung und benutzerdefinierten Repository-Methoden"],"pt":["Modelagem de dados com JPA","Otimização de consultas com Hibernate","Configuração de transações e auditoria","Paginação e ordenação de dados","Otimização de desempenho com Spring Boot"],"ru":["Проектирование сущностей с JPA","Оптимизация запросов с Hibernate","Настройка транзакций и аудита","Пагинация и сортировка данных","Оптимизация производительности с Spring Boot"],"ar":["نمذجة البيانات مع JPA","تحسين الاستفسارات مع Hibernate","تكوين المعاملات والتدقيق","تنظيم البيانات وترتيبها","تحسين الأداء مع Spring Boot"]},"keywords":{"zh":["JPA","Hibernate","Spring Boot","数据访问","性能优化","实体设计","关系定义","查询优化"],"ja":["JPA","Hibernate","Spring Boot","データアクセス","パフォーマンス最適化","エンティティ設計","関係定義","クエリ最適化"],"ko":["JPA","Hibernate","Spring Boot","데이터 액세스","성능 최적화","엔티티 디자인","관계 정의","쿼리 최적화"],"es":["JPA/Hibernate","Spring Boot","patrones de diseño","optimización de consultas","Agentes de IA","desarrollo de aplicaciones","escalabilidad","rendimiento"],"fr":["JPA/Hibernate","Spring Boot","modèles de conception","optimisation des requêtes","Outils d''IA","développement d''applications","scalabilité","performances"],"de":["JPA/Hibernate","Spring Boot","Entwurfsmuster","Abfrageoptimierung","KI-Agents","Anwendungsentwicklung","Skalierbarkeit","Leistung"],"pt":["JPA","Hibernate","Spring Boot","modelagem de dados","otimização de desempenho","desenvolvimento de software","padrões de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["JPA","Hibernate","Spring Boot","проектирование сущностей","оптимизация запросов","разработка программного обеспечения","шаблоны разработки"],"ar":["JPA","Hibernate","Spring Boot","نمذجة البيانات","تحسين الأداء","تطوير البرمجيات","أنماط التطوير"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Spring Boot Agents needing advanced JPA/Hibernate entity design and performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 JPA/Hibernate 实体设计和性能优化功能的 Spring Boot Agent。","ja":"高度な JPA/Hibernate エンティティ設計とパフォーマンス最適化機能を必要とする Spring Boot Agent に最適です。","ko":"고급 JPA/Hibernate 엔티티 설계 및 성능 최적화 기능이 필요한 Spring Boot Agent에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Spring Boot que necesitan un diseño de entidad JPA/Hibernate avanzado y capacidades de optimización de rendimiento.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Spring Boot nécessitant une conception d''entité JPA/Hibernate avancée et des capacités d''optimisation des performances.","de":"Perfekt für Spring-Boot-Agents, die ein fortschrittliches JPA/Hibernate-Entity-Design und Leistungsoptimierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes Spring Boot que necessitam de design de entidades JPA/Hibernate avançado e capacidades de otimização de desempenho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Spring Boot, требующих расширенного проектирования сущностей JPA/Hibernate и возможностей оптимизации производительности.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الربوت سبرينج بوت الذين يحتاجون إلى تصميم كيان جبا/هايبيرنيت متقدم وقدرات تحسين الأداء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize JPA queries using N+1 prevention, fetch strategies, and projections, while configuring transactions, auditing, and connection pooling with HikariCP.","zh":"使 Agent 能够使用 N+1 问题预防、获取策略和投影来优化 JPA 查询，同时使用 HikariCP 配置事务、审计和连接池。","ja":"N+1問題の防止、フェッチ戦略、プロジェクションを使用して JPA クエリを最適化し、HikariCP を使用してトランザクション、監査、接続プールを構成する機能を Agent に提供します。","ko":"N+1 문제 방지, 페치 전략 및 프로젝션을 사용하여 JPA 쿼리를 최적화하고, HikariCP로 트랜잭션, 감사 및 커넥션 풀링을 구성하는 기능을 Agent에 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar consultas JPA utilizando la prevención de N+1, estrategias de recuperación y proyecciones, al mismo tiempo que configurar transacciones, auditorías y agrupación de conexiones con HikariCP.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les requêtes JPA en utilisant la prévention N+1, les stratégies de récupération et les projections, tout en configurant les transactions, les audits et le regroupement de connexions avec HikariCP.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, JPA-Abfragen zu optimieren, indem sie die Verhinderung von N+1, Abrufstrategien und Projektionen verwenden, während sie Transaktionen, Audits und Verbindungspooling mit HikariCP konfigurieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar consultas JPA usando prevenção N+1, estratégias de busca e projeções, enquanto configura transações, auditoria e pooling de conexões com HikariCP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать запросы JPA с помощью предотвращения N+1, стратегий выборки и проекций, а также настраивает транзакции, аудит и пул соединений с HikariCP.","ar":"يمنح العملاء القدرة على تحسين استعلامات جبا باستخدام منع N+1 و استراتيجيات البحث والتعيينات، بينما يقوم بتكوين المعاملات والتدقيق وبرك الاتصال مع HikariCP."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing JPA entities with complex relationships (@OneToMany, @ManyToOne, @ManyToMany)","Optimizing queries for performance using fetch strategies and projections","Configuring transactions, auditing, and soft deletes for data integrity"],"zh":["使用复杂关系（@OneToMany、@ManyToOne、@ManyToMany）设计 JPA 实体","使用获取策略和投影优化查询性能","配置事务、审计和软删除以确保数据完整性"],"ja":["複雑な関係 (@OneToMany、@ManyToOne、@ManyToMany) を使用した JPA エンティティの設計","フェッチ戦略とプロジェクションを使用したパフォーマンスのためのクエリ最適化","データ整合性のためのトランザクション、監査、論理削除の構成"],"ko":["복잡한 관계(@OneToMany, @ManyToOne, @ManyToMany)를 사용하여 JPA 엔티티 설계","페치 전략 및 프로젝션을 사용하여 성능을 위한 쿼리 최적화","데이터 무결성을 위한 트랜잭션, 감사 및 소프트 삭제 구성"],"es":["Diseñar entidades JPA con relaciones complejas (@OneToMany, @ManyToOne, @ManyToMany)","Optimizar consultas para el rendimiento utilizando estrategias de recuperación y proyecciones","Configurar transacciones, auditorías y eliminaciones suaves para la integridad de los datos"],"fr":["Concevoir des entités JPA avec des relations complexes (@OneToMany, @ManyToOne, @ManyToMany)","Optimiser les requêtes pour les performances en utilisant des stratégies de récupération et des projections","Configurer les transactions, les audits et les suppressions douces pour l''intégrité des données"],"de":["Entitäten von JPA mit komplexen Beziehungen (@OneToMany, @ManyToOne, @ManyToMany) entwerfen","Abfragen für die Leistung optimieren, indem Abrufstrategien und Projektionen verwendet werden","Transaktionen, Audits und weiche Löschungen für die Datenintegrität konfigurieren"],"pt":["Projeto de entidades JPA com relacionamentos complexos (@OneToMany, @ManyToOne, @ManyToMany)","Otimização de consultas para desempenho usando estratégias de busca e projeções","Configuração de transações, auditoria e exclusões suaves para integridade de dados"],"ru":["Проектирование сущностей JPA с сложными отношениями (@OneToMany, @ManyToOne, @ManyToMany)","Оптимизация запросов для производительности с помощью стратегий выборки и проекций","Настройка транзакций, аудита и мягкого удаления для целостности данных"],"ar":["تصميم كيانات جبا مع علاقات معقدة (@OneToMany, @ManyToOne, @ManyToMany)","تحسين الاستفسارات للأداء باستخدام استراتيجيات البحث والتعيينات","تكوين المعاملات والتدقيق والحذف الناعم لسلامة البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Spring Boot environment","Limited to JPA/Hibernate implementations","Needs understanding of Java-based data modeling"],"zh":["需要 Spring Boot 环境","仅限于 JPA/Hibernate 实现","需要理解基于 Java 的数据建模"],"ja":["Spring Boot 環境が必要","JPA/Hibernate の実装に限定される","Java ベースのデータモデリングの理解が必要"],"ko":["Spring Boot 환경이 필요함","JPA/Hibernate 구현으로 제한됨","Java 기반 데이터 모델링에 대한 이해가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Spring Boot","Limitado a implementaciones de JPA/Hibernate","Necesita comprensión de la modelización de datos basada en Java"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Spring Boot","Limité aux implémentations JPA/Hibernate","Nécessite une compréhension de la modélisation de données basée sur Java"],"de":["Benötigt eine Spring-Boot-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf JPA/Hibernate-Implementierungen","Benötigt ein Verständnis der Java-basierten Datenmodellierung"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Spring Boot","Limitado a implementações JPA/Hibernate","Necessita de compreensão de modelagem de dados baseada em Java"],"ru":["Требует среды Spring Boot","Ограничен реализациями JPA/Hibernate","Требует понимания моделирования данных на основе Java"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة سبرينج بوت","محدود بالتنفيذ جبا/هايبيرنيت","يحتاج إلى فهم نمذجة البيانات القائمة على جافا"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5302c813a58deb5420e10c6dec4c5f0d036c278f2c494c8243a23326a994063e","repoEtag":"W/\"1d66934774ad40d3d916abf4c33c3e340ab032f8212b35e12a94daa7359886c9\"","qualityScore":68}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/swiftui-patterns', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'swiftui-patterns', 55024, 6781, 68, '2026-03-01T05:07:39Z', '2026-03-01T05:12:11.311Z', 'c27f90145101dd77d64e9f9b70297c4167af26abb8a924f2a91326289bc3ec2c', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/swiftui-patterns","name":"swiftui-patterns","description":{"zh":"SwiftUI 模式和 AI 工具可以帮助您构建高效的 iOS 和 macOS 应用","ja":"SwiftUI パターンと AI エージェントを使用して、効率的な iOS と macOS アプリを構築しましょう","ko":"SwiftUI 패턴과 AI 에이전트를 사용하여 효율적인 iOS 및 macOS 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있습니다","es":"SwiftUI architecture patterns, state management with @Observable, view composition, navigation, performance optimization, and modern iOS/macOS UI best practices.","fr":"Modèles d''architecture SwiftUI, gestion d''état avec @Observable, composition de vues, navigation, optimisation des performances et meilleures pratiques d''UI modernes pour iOS/macOS.","de":"SwiftUI-Architekturmuster, Zustandsverwaltung mit @Observable, View-Zusammensetzung, Navigation, Leistungsoptimierung und moderne UI-Best-Practices für iOS/macOS.","pt":"SwiftUI é uma ferramenta poderosa para desenvolvedores iOS e macOS. Aprenda a usar padrões de arquitetura, gerenciamento de estado e otimização de desempenho com ferramentas de IA","ru":"SwiftUI - мощный инструмент для разработчиков iOS и macOS. Узнайте, как использовать шаблоны архитектуры, управление состоянием и оптимизацию производительности с ИИ Агентами","ar":"SwiftUI هي أداة قوية للمطورين iOS و macOS. تعلم كيفية استخدام أنماط الهندسة المعمارية وإدارة الحالة وأفضل Practices لتحسين الأداء مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"SwiftUI architecture patterns, state management with @Observable, view composition, navigation, performance optimization, and modern iOS/macOS UI best practices."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":55024,"forks":6781,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:07:39Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"swiftui-patterns","description":"SwiftUI architecture patterns, state management with @Observable, view composition, navigation, performance optimization, and modern iOS/macOS UI best practices.","bodyPreview":"# SwiftUI Patterns\n\nModern SwiftUI patterns for building declarative, performant user interfaces on Apple platforms. Covers the Observation framework, view composition, type-safe navigation, and performance optimization.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Building SwiftUI views and managing state (`@State`, `@Observable`, `@Binding`)\n- Designing navigation flows with `NavigationStack`\n- Structuring view models and data flow\n- Optimizing rendering performance for lists and complex layouts\n- Working with env","body":"# SwiftUI Patterns\n\nModern SwiftUI patterns for building declarative, performant user interfaces on Apple platforms. Covers the Observation framework, view composition, type-safe navigation, and performance optimization.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Building SwiftUI views and managing state (`@State`, `@Observable`, `@Binding`)\n- Designing navigation flows with `NavigationStack`\n- Structuring view models and data flow\n- Optimizing rendering performance for lists and complex layouts\n- Working with environment values and dependency injection in SwiftUI\n\n## State Management\n\n### Property Wrapper Selection\n\nChoose the simplest wrapper that fits:\n\n| Wrapper | Use Case |\n|---------|----------|\n| `@State` | View-local value types (toggles, form fields, sheet presentation) |\n| `@Binding` | Two-way reference to parent''s `@State` |\n| `@Observable` class + `@State` | Owned model with multiple properties |\n| `@Observable` class (no wrapper) | Read-only reference passed from parent |\n| `@Bindable` | Two-way binding to an `@Observable` property |\n| `@Environment` | Shared dependencies injected via `.environment()` |\n\n### @Observable ViewModel\n\nUse `@Observable` (not `ObservableObject`) — it tracks property-level changes so SwiftUI only re-renders views that read the changed property:\n\n```swift\n@Observable\nfinal class ItemListViewModel {\n    private(set) var items: [Item] = []\n    private(set) var isLoading = false\n    var searchText = \"\"\n\n    private let repository: any ItemRepository\n\n    init(repository: any ItemRepository = DefaultItemRepository()) {\n        self.repository = repository\n    }\n\n    func load() async {\n        isLoading = true\n        defer { isLoading = false }\n        items = (try? await repository.fetchAll()) ?? []\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### View Consuming the ViewModel\n\n```swift\nstruct ItemListView: View {\n    @State private var viewModel: ItemListViewModel\n\n    init(viewModel: ItemListViewModel = ItemListViewModel()) {\n        _viewModel = State(initialValue: viewModel)\n    }\n\n    var body: some View {\n        List(viewModel.items) { item in\n            ItemRow(item: item)\n        }\n        .searchable(text: $viewModel.searchText)\n        .overlay { if viewModel.isLoading { ProgressView() } }\n        .task { await viewModel.load() }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Environment Injection\n\nReplace `@EnvironmentObject` with `@Environment`:\n\n```swift\n// Inject\nContentView()\n    .environment(authManager)\n\n// Consume\nstruct ProfileView: View {\n    @Environment(AuthManager.self) private var auth\n\n    var body: some View {\n        Text(auth.currentUser?.name ?? \"Guest\")\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## View Composition\n\n### Extract Subviews to Limit Invalidation\n\nBreak views into small, focused structs. When state changes, only the subview reading that state re-renders:\n\n```swift\nstruct OrderView: View {\n    @State private var viewModel = OrderViewModel()\n\n    var body: some View {\n        VStack {\n            OrderHeader(title: viewModel.title)\n            OrderItemList(items: viewModel.items)\n            OrderTotal(total: viewModel.total)\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### ViewModifier for Reusable Styling\n\n```swift\nstruct CardModifier: ViewModifier {\n    func body(content: Content) -> some View {\n        content\n            .padding()\n            .background(.regularMaterial)\n            .clipShape(RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 12))\n    }\n}\n\nextension View {\n    func cardStyle() -> some View {\n        modifier(CardModifier())\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Navigation\n\n### Type-Safe NavigationStack\n\nUse `NavigationStack` with `NavigationPath` for programmatic, type-safe routing:\n\n```swift\n@Observable\nfinal class Router {\n    var path = NavigationPath()\n\n    func navigate(to destination: Destination) {\n        path.append(destination)\n    }\n\n    func popToRoot() {\n        path = NavigationPath()\n    }\n}\n\nenum Destination: Hashable {\n    case detail(Item.ID)\n    case settings\n    case profile(User.ID)\n}\n\nstruct RootView: View {\n    @State private var router = Router()\n\n    var body: some View {\n        NavigationStack(path: $router.path) {\n            HomeView()\n                .navigationDestination(for: Destination.self) { dest in\n                    switch dest {\n                    case .detail(let id): ItemDetailView(itemID: id)\n                    case .settings: SettingsView()\n                    case .profile(let id): ProfileView(userID: id)\n                    }\n                }\n        }\n        .environment(router)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Performance\n\n### Use Lazy Containers for Large Collections\n\n`LazyVStack` and `LazyHStack` create views only when visible:\n\n```swift\nScrollView {\n    LazyVStack(spacing: 8) {\n        ForEach(items) { item in\n            ItemRow(item: item)\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Stable Identifiers\n\nAlways use stable, unique IDs in `ForEach` — avoid using array indices:\n\n```swift\n// Use Identifiable conformance or explicit id\nForEach(items, id: \\.stableID) { item in\n    ItemRow(item: item)\n}\n```\n\n### Avoid Expensive Work in body\n\n- Never perform I/O, network calls, or heavy computation inside `body`\n- Use `.task {}` for async work — it cancels automatically when the view disappears\n- Use `.sensoryFeedback()` and `.geometryGroup()` sparingly in scroll views\n- Minimize `.shadow()`, `.blur()`, and `.mask()` in lists — they trigger offscreen rendering\n\n### Equatable Conformance\n\nFor views with expensive bodies, conform to `Equatable` to skip unnecessary re-renders:\n\n```swift\nstruct ExpensiveChartView: View, Equatable {\n    let dataPoints: [DataPoint] // DataPoint must conform to Equatable\n\n    static func == (lhs: Self, rhs: Self) -> Bool {\n        lhs.dataPoints == rhs.dataPoints\n    }\n\n    var body: some View {\n        // Complex chart rendering\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Previews\n\nUse `#Preview` macro with inline mock data for fast iteration:\n\n```swift\n#Preview(\"Empty state\") {\n    ItemListView(viewModel: ItemListViewModel(repository: EmptyMockRepository()))\n}\n\n#Preview(\"Loaded\") {\n    ItemListView(viewModel: ItemListViewModel(repository: PopulatedMockRepository()))\n}\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n- Using `ObservableObject` / `@Published` / `@StateObject` / `@EnvironmentObject` in new code — migrate to `@Observable`\n- Putting async work directly in `body` or `init` — use `.task {}` or explicit load methods\n- Creating view models as `@State` inside child views that don''t own the data — pass from parent instead\n- Using `AnyView` type erasure — prefer `@ViewBuilder` or `Group` for conditional views\n- Ignoring `Sendable` requirements when passing data to/from actors\n\n## References\n\nSee skill: `swift-actor-persistence` for actor-based persistence patterns.\nSee skill: `swift-protocol-di-testing` for protocol-based DI and testing with Swift Testing.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:12:11.311Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"SwiftUI 模式与 AI 工具","ja":"SwiftUI パターンと AI エージェント","ko":"SwiftUI 패턴 및 AI 에이전트","es":"Patrones de SwiftUI con Agentes de IA","fr":"Modèles SwiftUI avec Outils d''IA","de":"SwiftUI-Muster mit KI-Agents","pt":"Padrões SwiftUI com Ferramentas de IA","ru":"Шаблоны SwiftUI с ИИ Агентами","ar":"نماذج SwiftUI مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"swiftui-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"SwiftUI 模式和 AI 工具可以帮助您构建高效的 iOS 和 macOS 应用","ja":"SwiftUI パターンと AI エージェントを使用して、効率的な iOS と macOS アプリを構築しましょう","ko":"SwiftUI 패턴과 AI 에이전트를 사용하여 효율적인 iOS 및 macOS 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있습니다","es":"SwiftUI architecture patterns, state management with @Observable, view composition, navigation, performance optimization, and modern iOS/macOS UI best practi...","fr":"Modèles d''architecture SwiftUI, gestion d''état avec @Observable, composition de vues, navigation, optimisation des performances et meilleures pratiques d''UI ...","de":"SwiftUI-Architekturmuster, Zustandsverwaltung mit @Observable, View-Zusammensetzung, Navigation, Leistungsoptimierung und moderne UI-Best-Practices für iOS/m...","pt":"SwiftUI é uma ferramenta poderosa para desenvolvedores iOS e macOS. Aprenda a usar padrões de arquitetura, gerenciamento de estado e otimização de desempenho...","ru":"SwiftUI - мощный инструмент для разработчиков iOS и macOS. Узнайте, как использовать шаблоны архитектуры, управление состоянием и оптимизацию производительно...","ar":"SwiftUI هي أداة قوية للمطورين iOS و macOS. تعلم كيفية استخدام أنماط الهندسة المعمارية وإدارة الحالة وأفضل Practices لتحسين الأداء مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"SwiftUI architecture patterns, state management with @Observable, view composition, navigation, performance optimization, and modern iOS/macOS UI best practi..."},"definition":{"en":"SwiftUI architecture patterns, state management with @Observable, view composition, navigation, performance optimization, and modern iOS/macOS UI best practices."},"features":{"zh":["SwiftUI 架构模式","状态管