Native"],"de":["wie man KI-Agents verwendet","SwiftUI-Muster","Zustandsverwaltung in SwiftUI","Leistungsoptimierung auf iOS","Best-Practices für UI auf macOS","Alternativen zu SwiftUI","SwiftUI vs React Native"],"pt":["como usar padrões SwiftUI","o que é SwiftUI","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","SwiftUI vs React","instalar SwiftUI","guia de configuração do SwiftUI","melhores práticas para desenvolvedores iOS","otimização de desempenho em SwiftUI"],"ru":["как использовать шаблоны SwiftUI","что такое SwiftUI","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","SwiftUI vs React","установить SwiftUI","руководство по настройке SwiftUI","лучшие практики для разработчиков iOS","оптимизация производительности в SwiftUI"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أنماط SwiftUI","ما هي SwiftUI","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","SwiftUI vs React","تثبيت SwiftUI","دليل إعداد SwiftUI","أفضل الممارسات لتطوير تطبيقات iOS","تحسين الأداء في SwiftUI"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for iOS and macOS Development Agents needing to implement declarative, performant user interfaces with SwiftUI architecture patterns.","zh":"非常适合需要使用SwiftUI架构模式实现声明式、高性能用户界面的iOS和macOS开发代理。","ja":"SwiftUIアーキテクチャパターンを使用して宣言的で高パフォーマンスなユーザーインターフェイスを実装する必要があるiOSおよびmacOS開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"SwiftUI 아키텍처 패턴을 사용하여 선언적이고 고성능의 사용자 인터페이스를 구현해야 하는 iOS 및 macOS 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo de iOS y macOS que necesitan implementar interfaces de usuario declarativas y eficientes con patrones de arquitectura de SwiftUI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement iOS et macOS ayant besoin de mettre en œuvre des interfaces utilisateur déclaratives et performantes avec des modèles d''architecture SwiftUI.","de":"Perfekt für iOS- und macOS-Entwicklungsagenten, die deklarative, leistungsstarke Benutzeroberflächen mit SwiftUI-Architekturmuster implementieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do iOS e macOS que precisam implementar interfaces de usuário declarativas e performáticas com padrões de arquitetura SwiftUI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки iOS и macOS, которым необходимо реализовать декларативные и производительные пользовательские интерфейсы с помощью шаблонов архитектуры SwiftUI.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ واجهات المستخدم الإعلانية والأداء مع أنماط الهندسة المعمارية لبرنامج SwiftUI من أجل تطوير iOS و macOS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage state with @Observable, compose views, and optimize rendering performance using NavigationStack and type-safe navigation, while following modern iOS/macOS UI best practices.","zh":"赋予代理管理状态的能力，使用@Observable、组合视图，并使用NavigationStack和类型安全导航优化渲染性能，同时遵循现代iOS/macOS UI最佳实践。","ja":"エージェントに状態を管理する機能を与え、@Observable、ビューの構成、およびNavigationStackと型安全なナビゲーションを使用してレンダリングパフォーマンスを最適化し、同時に最新のiOS/macOS UIのベストプラクティスに従うことができます。","ko":"에이전트에 상태를 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, @Observable, 뷰의 구성, 및 NavigationStack와 타입 안전한 탐색을 사용하여 렌더링 성능을 최적화하고,同時에 최신 iOS/macOS UI의 ベスト プラクティス에 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar el estado con @Observable, componer vistas y optimizar el rendimiento de renderizado utilizando NavigationStack y navegación de tipo seguro, siguiendo las mejores prácticas de UI de iOS/macOS modernas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer l''état avec @Observable, de composer des vues et d''optimiser les performances de rendu en utilisant NavigationStack et une navigation de type sécurisé, tout en suivant les meilleures pratiques de UI iOS/macOS modernes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, den Zustand mit @Observable zu verwalten, Ansichten zu komponieren und die Renderleistung mit NavigationStack und typesicherer Navigation zu optimieren, während sie moderne iOS/macOS-UI-Best-Practices befolgen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar o estado com @Observable, compor visualizações e otimizar o desempenho de renderização usando NavigationStack e navegação segura de tipo, seguindo as melhores práticas modernas de IU do iOS/macOS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять состоянием с помощью @Observable, составлять представления и оптимизировать производительность рендеринга с использованием NavigationStack и безопасной типизированной навигации, следуя современным лучшим практикам IU для iOS/macOS.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة الحالة باستخدام @Observable، و組 ترکیب العروض، وتحسين أداء العرض باستخدام NavigationStack والتنقل الآمن للنوع، مع اتباع أفضل الممارسات الحديثة لبرنامج IU من أجل iOS/macOS."},"useCases":{"en":["Building declarative SwiftUI views with @State and @Binding","Designing navigation flows with NavigationStack and type-safe navigation","Optimizing rendering performance for lists and complex layouts","Structuring view models and data flow with Observation framework"],"zh":["使用@State和@Binding构建声明式SwiftUI视图","使用NavigationStack和类型安全导航设计导航流程","优化列表和复杂布局的渲染性能","使用Observation框架结构视图模型和数据流"],"ja":["@Stateと@Bindingを使用して宣言的SwiftUIビューを構築する","NavigationStackと型安全なナビゲーションを使用してナビゲーションフローを設計する","リストと複雑なレイアウトのレンダリングパフォーマンスを最適化する","Observationフレームワークを使用してビューモデルとデータフローを構造化する"],"ko":["@State와 @Binding을 사용하여 선언적 SwiftUI 뷰를 구축하는 것","NavigationStack와 타입 안전한 탐색을 사용하여 탐색 흐름을 설계하는 것","리스트와 복잡한 레이아웃의 렌더링 성능을 최적화하는 것","Observation 프레임워크를 사용하여 뷰 모델과 데이터 흐름을 구조화하는 것"],"es":["Crear vistas SwiftUI declarativas con @State y @Binding","Diseñar flujos de navegación con NavigationStack y navegación de tipo seguro","Optimizar el rendimiento de renderizado para listas y diseños complejos","Estructurar modelos de vista y flujo de datos con el marco de Observation"],"fr":["Créer des vues SwiftUI déclaratives avec @State et @Binding","Concevoir des flux de navigation avec NavigationStack et une navigation de type sécurisé","Optimiser les performances de rendu pour les listes et les mises en page complexes","Structurer les modèles de vue et le flux de données avec le framework Observation"],"de":["Deklarative SwiftUI-Ansichten mit @State und @Binding erstellen","Navigationsflüsse mit NavigationStack und typesicherer Navigation entwerfen","Renderleistung für Listen und komplexe Layouts optimieren","Ansichtsmodelle und Datenfluss mit dem Observation-Framework strukturieren"],"pt":["Construir visualizações declarativas SwiftUI com @State e @Binding","Projetar fluxos de navegação com NavigationStack e navegação segura de tipo","Otimizar o desempenho de renderização para listas e layouts complexos","Estruturar modelos de visualização e fluxo de dados com o framework Observation"],"ru":["Создание декларативных представлений SwiftUI с помощью @State и @Binding","Проектирование потоков навигации с помощью NavigationStack и безопасной типизированной навигации","Оптимизация производительности рендеринга для списков и сложных макетов","Структуризация моделей представления и потока данных с помощью фреймворка Observation"],"ar":["بناء عروض إعلانية لبرنامج SwiftUI باستخدام @State و @Binding","تصميم تدفقات التنقل باستخدام NavigationStack والتنقل الآمن للنوع","تحسين أداء العرض للقوائم والتصاميم المعقدة","هيكلة نماذج العرض وتدفق البيانات مع إطار العمل Observation"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Swift programming language","Limited to Apple platforms (iOS, macOS)","Needs Xcode development environment"],"zh":["需要Swift编程语言","仅限于Apple平台（iOS，macOS）","需要Xcode开发环境"],"ja":["Swiftプログラミング言語が必要","Appleプラットフォーム（iOS、macOS）のみ","Xcode開発環境が必要"],"ko":["Swift 프로그래밍 언어가 필요합니다","Apple 플랫폼（iOS, macOS）만 해당합니다","Xcode 개발 환경이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere el lenguaje de programación Swift","Limitado a plataformas Apple (iOS, macOS)","Necesita el entorno de desarrollo Xcode"],"fr":["Nécessite le langage de programmation Swift","Limité aux plateformes Apple (iOS, macOS)","Nécessite l''environnement de développement Xcode"],"de":["Benötigt die Swift-Programmiersprache","Begrenzt auf Apple-Plattformen (iOS, macOS)","Benötigt die Xcode-Entwicklungsumgebung"],"pt":["Requer a linguagem de programação Swift","Limitado às plataformas Apple (iOS, macOS)","Necessita do ambiente de desenvolvimento Xcode"],"ru":["Требует языка программирования Swift","Ограничен платформами Apple (iOS, macOS)","Требует среды разработки Xcode"],"ar":["يتطلب لغة البرمجة Swift","محدود منصات شركة Apple (iOS, macOS)","يحتاج إلى بيئة تطوير Xcode"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c27f90145101dd77d64e9f9b70297c4167af26abb8a924f2a91326289bc3ec2c","repoEtag":"W/\"1d66934774ad40d3d916abf4c33c3e340ab032f8212b35e12a94daa7359886c9\"","qualityScore":68}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('cloudflare/skills/agents-sdk', 'official', 'cloudflare', 'skills', 'cloudflare/skills', 'agents-sdk', 387, 38, 68, '2026-02-28T23:20:41Z', '2026-03-01T05:14:09.668Z', '6ee0d50d51db67e5fe338101cbdb787c0914938d7c319dd276392b9f2535619c', '{"id":"cloudflare/skills/agents-sdk","name":"agents-sdk","description":{"zh":"Cloudflare Agents SDK是一个用于构建AI智能代理的开发工具包，支持实时WebSocket应用、状态管理和工作流集成","ja":"Cloudflare Agents SDKはAIエージェントを構築するための開発ツールキットであり、リアルタイムのWebSocketアプリケーション、状態管理、ワークフロー統合をサポート","ko":"Cloudflare Agents SDK는 AI 에이전트를 구축하기 위한 개발 도구 키트로서 실시간 WebSocket 애플리케이션, 상태 관리 및 워크플로우 통합을 지원","es":"El Agents SDK de Cloudflare permite crear agentes de IA en Cloudflare Workers con características como gestión de estado y callable RPC","fr":"Le Agents SDK de Cloudflare permet de créer des agents d''IA sur Cloudflare Workers avec des fonctionnalités comme la gestion d''état et callable RPC","de":"Das Agents SDK von Cloudflare ermöglicht die Erstellung von KI-Agents auf Cloudflare Workers mit Funktionen wie Zustandsverwaltung und callable RPC","pt":"O Agents SDK da Cloudflare permite criar agentes de IA stateful, fluxos de trabalho duráveis e aplicativos WebSocket em tempo real","ru":"Agents SDK от Cloudflare позволяет создавать государственных агентов, долговечные рабочие процессы и приложения WebSocket в реальном времени","ar":"يسمح SDK وكلاء Cloudflare بإنشاء وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي ذوي حالة، وعمليات عمل متينة، وتطبيقات WebSocket في الوقت الفعلي","en":"Build AI agents on Cloudflare Workers using the Agents SDK. Load when creating stateful agents, durable workflows, real-time WebSocket apps, scheduled tasks, MCP servers, or chat applications. Covers Agent class, state management, callable RPC, Workflows integration, and React hooks."},"owner":"cloudflare","repo":"skills","repoPath":"cloudflare/skills","stars":387,"forks":38,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T23:20:41Z","topics":["agents","cloudflare","skills","workers"],"skillMd":{"name":"agents-sdk","description":"Build AI agents on Cloudflare Workers using the Agents SDK. Load when creating stateful agents, durable workflows, real-time WebSocket apps, scheduled tasks, MCP servers, or chat applications. Covers Agent class, state management, callable RPC, Workflows integration, and React hooks.","bodyPreview":"# Cloudflare Agents SDK\n\n**STOP.** Your knowledge of the Agents SDK may be outdated. Prefer retrieval over pre-training for any Agents SDK task.\n\n## Documentation\n\nFetch current docs from `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` before implementing.\n\n| Topic | Doc | Use for |\n|-------|-----|---------|\n| Getting started | `docs/getting-started.md` | First agent, project setup |\n| State | `docs/state.md` | `setState`, `validateStateChange`, persistence |\n| Routing | `docs/routing.md`","body":"# Cloudflare Agents SDK\n\n**STOP.** Your knowledge of the Agents SDK may be outdated. Prefer retrieval over pre-training for any Agents SDK task.\n\n## Documentation\n\nFetch current docs from `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` before implementing.\n\n| Topic | Doc | Use for |\n|-------|-----|---------|\n| Getting started | `docs/getting-started.md` | First agent, project setup |\n| State | `docs/state.md` | `setState`, `validateStateChange`, persistence |\n| Routing | `docs/routing.md` | URL patterns, `routeAgentRequest`, `basePath` |\n| Callable methods | `docs/callable-methods.md` | `@callable`, RPC, streaming, timeouts |\n| Scheduling | `docs/scheduling.md` | `schedule()`, `scheduleEvery()`, cron |\n| Workflows | `docs/workflows.md` | `AgentWorkflow`, durable multi-step tasks |\n| HTTP/WebSockets | `docs/http-websockets.md` | Lifecycle hooks, hibernation |\n| Email | `docs/email.md` | Email routing, secure reply resolver |\n| MCP client | `docs/mcp-client.md` | Connecting to MCP servers |\n| MCP server | `docs/mcp-servers.md` | Building MCP servers with `McpAgent` |\n| Client SDK | `docs/client-sdk.md` | `useAgent`, `useAgentChat`, React hooks |\n| Human-in-the-loop | `docs/human-in-the-loop.md` | Approval flows, pausing workflows |\n| Resumable streaming | `docs/resumable-streaming.md` | Stream recovery on disconnect |\n\nCloudflare docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/\n\n## Capabilities\n\nThe Agents SDK provides:\n\n- **Persistent state** - SQLite-backed, auto-synced to clients\n- **Callable RPC** - `@callable()` methods invoked over WebSocket\n- **Scheduling** - One-time, recurring (`scheduleEvery`), and cron tasks\n- **Workflows** - Durable multi-step background processing via `AgentWorkflow`\n- **MCP integration** - Connect to MCP servers or build your own with `McpAgent`\n- **Email handling** - Receive and reply to emails with secure routing\n- **Streaming chat** - `AIChatAgent` with resumable streams\n- **React hooks** - `useAgent`, `useAgentChat` for client apps\n\n## FIRST: Verify Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm ls agents  # Should show agents package\n```\n\nIf not installed:\n```bash\nnpm install agents\n```\n\n## Wrangler Configuration\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"durable_objects\": {\n    \"bindings\": [{ \"name\": \"MyAgent\", \"class_name\": \"MyAgent\" }]\n  },\n  \"migrations\": [{ \"tag\": \"v1\", \"new_sqlite_classes\": [\"MyAgent\"] }]\n}\n```\n\n## Agent Class\n\n```typescript\nimport { Agent, routeAgentRequest, callable } from \"agents\";\n\ntype State = { count: number };\n\nexport class Counter extends Agent<Env, State> {\n  initialState = { count: 0 };\n\n  // Validation hook - runs before state persists (sync, throwing rejects the update)\n  validateStateChange(nextState: State, source: Connection | \"server\") {\n    if (nextState.count < 0) throw new Error(\"Count cannot be negative\");\n  }\n\n  // Notification hook - runs after state persists (async, non-blocking)\n  onStateUpdate(state: State, source: Connection | \"server\") {\n    console.log(\"State updated:\", state);\n  }\n\n  @callable()\n  increment() {\n    this.setState({ count: this.state.count + 1 });\n    return this.state.count;\n  }\n}\n\nexport default {\n  fetch: (req, env) => routeAgentRequest(req, env) ?? new Response(\"Not found\", { status: 404 })\n};\n```\n\n## Routing\n\nRequests route to `/agents/{agent-name}/{instance-name}`:\n\n| Class | URL |\n|-------|-----|\n| `Counter` | `/agents/counter/user-123` |\n| `ChatRoom` | `/agents/chat-room/lobby` |\n\nClient: `useAgent({ agent: \"Counter\", name: \"user-123\" })`\n\n## Core APIs\n\n| Task | API |\n|------|-----|\n| Read state | `this.state.count` |\n| Write state | `this.setState({ count: 1 })` |\n| SQL query | `` this.sql`SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ${id}` `` |\n| Schedule (delay) | `await this.schedule(60, \"task\", payload)` |\n| Schedule (cron) | `await this.schedule(\"0 * * * *\", \"task\", payload)` |\n| Schedule (interval) | `await this.scheduleEvery(30, \"poll\")` |\n| RPC method | `@callable() myMethod() { ... }` |\n| Streaming RPC | `@callable({ streaming: true }) stream(res) { ... }` |\n| Start workflow | `await this.runWorkflow(\"ProcessingWorkflow\", params)` |\n\n## React Client\n\n```tsx\nimport { useAgent } from \"agents/react\";\n\nfunction App() {\n  const [state, setLocalState] = useState({ count: 0 });\n\n  const agent = useAgent({\n    agent: \"Counter\",\n    name: \"my-instance\",\n    onStateUpdate: (newState) => setLocalState(newState),\n    onIdentity: (name, agentType) => console.log(`Connected to ${name}`)\n  });\n\n  return (\n    <button onClick={() => agent.setState({ count: state.count + 1 })}>\n      Count: {state.count}\n    </button>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## References\n\n- **[references/workflows.md](references/workflows.md)** - Durable Workflows integration\n- **[references/callable.md](references/callable.md)** - RPC methods, streaming, timeouts\n- **[references/state-scheduling.md](references/state-scheduling.md)** - State persistence, scheduling\n- **[references/streaming-chat.md](references/streaming-chat.md)** - AIChatAgent, resumable streams\n- **[references/mcp.md](references/mcp.md)** - MCP server integration\n- **[references/email.md](references/email.md)** - Email routing and handling\n- **[references/codemode.md](references/codemode.md)** - Code Mode (experimental)\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:14:09.668Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理 Cloudflare Agents SDK","ja":"AIエージェント開発用 Cloudflare Agents SDK","ko":"AI 에이전트 개발을 위한 Cloudflare Agents SDK","es":"Herramientas de Agentes de IA en Cloudflare","fr":"Outils d''Agents d''IA sur Cloudflare","de":"KI-Agenten-Tools auf Cloudflare","pt":"Construa Agentes de IA com o SDK de Agentes da Cloudflare","ru":"ИИ Агенты на Cloudflare Workers с помощью Agents SDK","ar":"ابني وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي مع SDK وكلاء Cloudflare","en":"agents-sdk"},"description":{"zh":"Cloudflare Agents SDK是一个用于构建AI智能代理的开发工具包，支持实时WebSocket应用、状态管理和工作流集成","ja":"Cloudflare Agents SDKはAIエージェントを構築するための開発ツールキットであり、リアルタイムのWebSocketアプリケーション、状態管理、ワークフロー統合をサポート","ko":"Cloudflare Agents SDK는 AI 에이전트를 구축하기 위한 개발 도구 키트로서 실시간 WebSocket 애플리케이션, 상태 관리 및 워크플로우 통합을 지원","es":"El Agents SDK de Cloudflare permite crear agentes de IA en Cloudflare Workers con características como gestión de estado y callable RPC","fr":"Le Agents SDK de Cloudflare permet de créer des agents d''IA sur Cloudflare Workers avec des fonctionnalités comme la gestion d''état et callable RPC","de":"Das Agents SDK von Cloudflare ermöglicht die Erstellung von KI-Agents auf Cloudflare Workers mit Funktionen wie Zustandsverwaltung und callable RPC","pt":"O Agents SDK da Cloudflare permite criar agentes de IA stateful, fluxos de trabalho duráveis e aplicativos WebSocket em tempo real","ru":"Agents SDK от Cloudflare позволяет создавать государственных агентов, долговечные рабочие процессы и приложения WebSocket в реальном времени","ar":"يسمح SDK وكلاء Cloudflare بإنشاء وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي ذوي حالة، وعمليات عمل متينة، وتطبيقات WebSocket في الوقت الفعلي","en":"Build AI agents on Cloudflare Workers using the Agents SDK. Load when creating stateful agents, durable workflows, real-time WebSocket apps, scheduled tasks,..."},"definition":{"en":"Build AI agents on Cloudflare Workers using the Agents SDK. Load when creating stateful agents, durable workflows, real-time WebSocket apps, scheduled tasks, MCP servers, or chat applications. Covers Agent class, state management, callable RPC, Workflows integration, and React hooks."},"features":{"zh":["支持实时WebSocket应用","状态管理和持久化","工作流集成和可调用RPC","React Hooks支持","Cloudflare Workers集成"],"ja":["リアルタイムのWebSocketアプリケーションをサポート","状態管理と永続化","ワークフロー統合とcallable RPC","React Hooksをサポート","Cloudflare Workersをサポート"],"ko":["실시간 WebSocket 애플리케이션 지원","상태 관리 및 영속성","워크플로우 통합 및 callable RPC","React Hooks 지원","Cloudflare Workers 지원"],"es":["Clase de Agentes para crear agentes de IA personalizados","Gestión de estado para persistir datos","Callable RPC para comunicación entre agentes","Integración con Workflows para flujos de trabajo automatizados","React hooks para integración con aplicaciones web"],"fr":["Classe d''Agents pour créer des agents d''IA personnalisés","Gestion d''état pour persister des données","Callable RPC pour la communication entre agents","Intégration avec Workflows pour des flux de travail automatisés","React hooks pour l''intégration avec des applications web"],"de":["Agentenklasse für die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten KI-Agents","Zustandsverwaltung für die Persistenz von Daten","Callable RPC für die Kommunikation zwischen Agents","Integration mit Workflows für automatisierte Workflows","React hooks für die Integration mit Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Crie agentes de IA stateful","Desenvolva fluxos de trabalho duráveis","Construa aplicativos WebSocket em tempo real","Integre com o React","Gerencie estado com setState e validateStateChange"],"ru":["Создавайте государственных агентов","Разрабатывайте долговечные рабочие процессы","Создавайте приложения WebSocket в реальном времени","Интегрируйте с React","Управляйте состоянием с помощью setState и validateStateChange"],"ar":["ابني وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي ذوي حالة","طور عمليات عمل متينة","ابني تطبيقات WebSocket في الوقت الفعلي","ادمج مع React","ادير الحالة باستخدام setState و validateStateChange"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Cloudflare Agents SDK","实时WebSocket应用","状态管理","工作流集成","React Hooks","Cloudflare Workers","AI开发工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Cloudflare Agents SDK","リアルタイムのWebSocketアプリケーション","状態管理","ワークフロー統合","React Hooks","Cloudflare Workers","AI開発ツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Cloudflare Agents SDK","실시간 WebSocket 애플리케이션","상태 관리","워크플로우 통합","React Hooks","Cloudflare Workers","AI 개발 도구"],"es":["agentes de ia","cloudflare workers","agents sdk","desarrollo de ia","automatización de tareas","inteligencia artificial","programación de ia"],"fr":["agents d''ia","cloudflare workers","agents sdk","développement d''ia","automatisation de tâches","intelligence artificielle","programmation d''ia"],"de":["ki-agents","cloudflare workers","agents sdk","entwicklung von ki","automatisierung von aufgaben","künstliche intelligenz","programmierung von ki"],"pt":["agentes de ia","cloudflare workers","sdk de agentes","desenvolvimento de ia","aplicativos websocket","fluxos de trabalho duráveis"],"ru":["ии агенты","cloudflare workers","agents sdk","разработка ии","приложения websocket","долговечные рабочие процессы"],"ar":["وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي","cloudflare workers","sdk وكلاء","تطوير ذكاء اصطناعي","تطبيقات websocket","عمليات عمل متينة"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloudflare-focused AI Agents seeking to build stateful applications, durable workflows, and real-time WebSocket apps using the Agents SDK.","zh":"适合于Cloudflare专注的AI代理，旨在使用Agents SDK构建有状态应用程序、持久工作流和实时WebSocket应用程序。","ja":"Cloudflareに焦点を当てたAIエージェント向けに、Agents SDKを使用してステートフルなアプリケーション、耐久性のあるワークフロー、リアルタイムのWebSocketアプリケーションを構築することが理想的です。","ko":"Cloudflare에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트를 위한 것으로, Agents SDK를 사용하여 상태가 있는 응용 프로그램, 지속적인 워크플로 및 실시간 WebSocket 응용 프로그램을 구축하는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial de Cloudflare que buscan crear aplicaciones con estado, flujos de trabajo duraderos y aplicaciones WebSocket en tiempo real utilizando el SDK de Agentes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle Cloudflare qui souhaitent créer des applications à état, des flux de travail durables et des applications WebSocket en temps réel à l''aide du SDK d''Agents.","de":"Ideal für Cloudflare-AI-Agents, die stateful-Anwendungen, dauerhafte Workflows und Echtzeit-WebSocket-Apps mit dem Agents-SDK erstellen möchten.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA do Cloudflare que buscam criar aplicações stateful, fluxos de trabalho duráveis e aplicações WebSocket em tempo real usando o Agents SDK.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ Cloudflare, стремящихся создавать приложения со сохранением состояния, прочные рабочие процессы и приложения WebSocket в режиме реального времени с помощью Agents SDK.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي في Cloudflare الذين يسعون إلى بناء تطبيقات بحالة، وتدفقات عمل متينة، وتطبيقات WebSocket في الوقت الفعلي باستخدام Agents SDK."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create scalable and persistent applications using Cloudflare Workers, with features like state management through `setState` and `validateStateChange`, callable RPC, Workflows integration, and React hooks, all while leveraging WebSocket protocols for real-time communication.","zh":"赋予代理创建可扩展且持久的应用程序的能力，使用Cloudflare Workers，具有通过`setState`和`validateStateChange`进行状态管理、可调用RPC、Workflows集成和React hooks等功能，同时利用WebSocket协议进行实时通信。","ja":"エージェントが、Cloudflare Workersを使用してスケーラブルで耐久性のあるアプリケーションを作成できるようにし、`setState`と`validateStateChange`によるステート管理、呼び出し可能なRPC、Workflows統合、React hooksなどの機能を提供し、リアルタイム通信にはWebSocketプロトコルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Cloudflare Workers를 사용하여 확장 가능하고 지속적인 응용 프로그램을 만들 수 있도록 하며, `setState`와 `validateStateChange`를 통한 상태 관리, 호출 가능한 RPC, Workflows 통합 및 React hooks 등의 기능을 제공하며, 실시간 통신에는 WebSocket 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones escalables y persistentes utilizando Cloudflare Workers, con características como administración de estado a través de `setState` y `validateStateChange`, RPC callable, integración de Workflows y ganchos de React, todo mientras se aprovechan los protocolos WebSocket para la comunicación en tiempo real.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications escalables et persistantes à l''aide de Cloudflare Workers, avec des fonctionnalités telles que la gestion d''état via `setState` et `validateStateChange`, RPC appelable, intégration de Workflows et crochets de React, le tout en exploitant les protocoles WebSocket pour la communication en temps réel.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, skalierbare und beständige Anwendungen mit Cloudflare Workers zu erstellen, mit Funktionen wie Zustandsverwaltung durch `setState` und `validateStateChange`, callable RPC, Workflows-Integration und React-Hooks, alles unter Ausnutzung der WebSocket-Protokolle für die Echtzeitkommunikation.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar aplicações escaláveis e persistentes usando Cloudflare Workers, com recursos como gerenciamento de estado por meio de `setState` e `validateStateChange`, RPC chamável, integração de Workflows e ganchos React, tudo isso aproveitando os protocolos WebSocket para comunicação em tempo real.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать масштабируемые и устойчивые приложения с помощью Cloudflare Workers, с функциями, такими как управление состоянием через `setState` и `validateStateChange`, вызываемый RPC, интеграция Workflows и крючки React, все это при помощи протоколов WebSocket для общения в реальном времени.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء تطبيقات قابلة للتوسيع ومتينة باستخدام Cloudflare Workers، مع ميزات مثل إدارة الحالة من خلال `setState` و `validateStateChange`، وبروتوكول RPC القابل للاتصال، وتكامل Workflows، وأقواس React، كل ذلك بالاستفادة من بروتوكولات WebSocket للاتصال في الوقت الفعلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Building stateful agents with durable workflows","Creating real-time WebSocket applications","Implementing scheduled tasks and MCP servers","Developing chat applications with React hooks"],"zh":["构建具有持久工作流的有状态代理","创建实时WebSocket应用程序","实现定时任务和MCP服务器","使用React hooks开发聊天应用程序"],"ja":["耐久性のあるワークフローを備えたステートフルなエージェントの構築","リアルタイムのWebSocketアプリケーションの作成","スケジュールされたタスクとMCPサーバーの実装","React hooksを使用したチャットアプリケーションの開発"],"ko":["지속적인 워크플로를 갖춘 상태가 있는 에이전트 구축","실시간 WebSocket 응용 프로그램 생성","예약된 작업 및 MCP 서버 구현","React hooks를 사용한 채팅 응용 프로그램 개발"],"es":["Creación de agentes con estado y flujos de trabajo duraderos","Creación de aplicaciones WebSocket en tiempo real","Implementación de tareas programadas y servidores MCP","Desarrollo de aplicaciones de chat con ganchos de React"],"fr":["Création d''agents à état et de flux de travail durables","Création d''applications WebSocket en temps réel","Mise en œuvre de tâches planifiées et de serveurs MCP","Développement d''applications de chat avec des crochets de React"],"de":["Erstellung von Agents mit Zustand und dauerhaften Workflows","Erstellung von Echtzeit-WebSocket-Anwendungen","Implementierung von geplanten Aufgaben und MCP-Servern","Entwicklung von Chat-Anwendungen mit React-Hooks"],"pt":["Construir agentes stateful com fluxos de trabalho duráveis","Criar aplicações WebSocket em tempo real","Implementar tarefas agendadas e servidores MCP","Desenvolver aplicações de chat com ganchos React"],"ru":["Создание агентов со сохранением состояния и прочными рабочими процессами","Разработка приложений WebSocket в режиме реального времени","Реализация запланированных задач и серверов MCP","Разработка приложений чата с крючками React"],"ar":["بناء وكلاء بحالة مع تدفقات عمل متينة","إنشاء تطبيقات WebSocket في الوقت الفعلي","تنفيذ المهام المجدولة وخادم MCP","تطوير تطبيقات الدردشة مع أقواس React"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Cloudflare Workers setup","Knowledge of Agents SDK documentation from `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` is mandatory","Prefer retrieval over pre-training for any Agents SDK task"],"zh":["需要Cloudflare Workers设置","必须了解Agents SDK文档，见`https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs`","对于任何Agents SDK任务，优先使用检索而不是预训练"],"ja":["Cloudflare Workersの設定が必要","Agents SDKのドキュメントの知識が必須、`https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs`を参照","Agents SDKのタスクでは、事前トレーニングよりも取得を優先する"],"ko":["Cloudflare Workers 설정이 필요","Agents SDK 문서에 대한 지식이 필수, `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` 참조","에이전트 SDK 작업에서는 사전 교육보다 검색을 우선"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Cloudflare Workers","Conocimiento de la documentación del SDK de Agentes desde `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` es obligatorio","Preferir la recuperación sobre la preformación para cualquier tarea del SDK de Agentes"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Cloudflare Workers","Connaissance de la documentation du SDK d''Agents depuis `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` est obligatoire","Préférer la récupération à la préformation pour toute tâche du SDK d''Agents"],"de":["Erfordert Cloudflare-Workers-Setup","Kenntnisse der Agents-SDK-Dokumentation von `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` sind obligatorisch","Bevorzugung der Abrufung gegenüber der Vorbereitung für jede Agents-SDK-Aufgabe"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Cloudflare Workers","Conhecimento da documentação do Agents SDK de `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` é obrigatório","Preferir recuperação em vez de pré-treinamento para qualquer tarefa do Agents SDK"],"ru":["Требуется настройка Cloudflare Workers","Знание документации Agents SDK с `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` является обязательным","Предпочтение извлечения над предварительной подготовкой для любой задачи Agents SDK"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Cloudflare Workers","معرفة وثائق Agents SDK من `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` أمر إلزامي","ال تفضيل استرجاع على التدريب المسبق لأي مهمة من مهام Agents SDK"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6ee0d50d51db67e5fe338101cbdb787c0914938d7c319dd276392b9f2535619c","repoEtag":"W/\"2050ff8b3c3e00d31ab6816727c74e0ab9c1b238360cd17bc6966651ab9c7ea4\"","qualityScore":68}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('langgenius/dify/frontend-code-review', 'official', 'langgenius', 'dify', 'langgenius/dify', 'frontend-code-review', 130730, 20358, 68, '2026-03-01T05:08:10Z', '2026-03-01T05:14:55.517Z', 'f4fefe4db6804043a36626f5f6028192f038bacd0c881f0fe6887cc4dd5f43b0', '{"id":"langgenius/dify/frontend-code-review","name":"frontend-code-review","description":{"zh":"前端代码审查AI智能工具，支持pending-change审查和特定文件审查，确保代码质量和安全","ja":"フロントエンドコードレビューエージェントは、コードの品質とセキュリティを確保するために、ペンディングチェンジレビューと特定のファイルレビューをサポートします","ko":"프론트엔드 코드 리뷰 에이전트는 코드 품질과 보안을 보장하기 위해_pending-change 리뷰와 특정 파일 리뷰를 지원합니다","es":"La herramienta de revisión de código frontend utiliza Agentes de IA para revisar archivos .tsx, .ts y .js de manera automática. Soporte para revisiones de cambios pendientes y revisiones de archivos específicos","fr":"L''outil de révision de code frontend utilise des Agents IA pour réviser les fichiers .tsx, .ts et .js de manière automatisée. Prise en charge des révisions de modifications en attente et des révisions de fichiers spécifiques","de":"Das Frontend-Code-Review-Tool verwendet KI-Agents, um Dateien .tsx, .ts und .js automatisch zu überprüfen. Unterstützung für Überprüfungen von ausstehenden Änderungen und Überprüfungen von bestimmten Dateien","pt":"O skill de revisão de código frontend é usado para revisar arquivos de código frontend, como .tsx, .ts e .js, com suporte a revisões de alterações pendentes e revisões de arquivos específicos","ru":"Навык проверки фронтенд-кода используется для проверки файлов фронтенд-кода, таких как .tsx, .ts и .js, с поддержкой проверок изменений и целевых файлов","ar":"يستخدم مهارة مراجعة код المواقع الأمامية لمراجعة ملفات код المواقع الأمامية، مثل .tsx و .ts و .js، مع دعم لمراجعة التغييرات المعلقة ومراجعة الملفات المستهدفة","en":"Trigger when the user requests a review of frontend files (e.g., `.tsx`, `.ts`, `.js`). Support both pending-change reviews and focused file reviews while applying the checklist rules."},"owner":"langgenius","repo":"dify","repoPath":"langgenius/dify","stars":130730,"forks":20358,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:08:10Z","topics":["agent","agentic-ai","agentic-framework","agentic-workflow","ai","automation","gemini","genai","gpt","gpt-4","llm","low-code","mcp","nextjs","no-code","openai","orchestration","python","rag","workflow"],"skillMd":{"name":"frontend-code-review","description":"Trigger when the user requests a review of frontend files (e.g., `.tsx`, `.ts`, `.js`). Support both pending-change reviews and focused file reviews while applying the checklist rules.","bodyPreview":"# Frontend Code Review\n\n## Intent\nUse this skill whenever the user asks to review frontend code (especially `.tsx`, `.ts`, or `.js` files). Support two review modes:\n\n1. **Pending-change review** – inspect staged/working-tree files slated for commit and flag checklist violations before submission.\n2. **File-targeted review** – review the specific file(s) the user names and report the relevant checklist findings.\n\nStick to the checklist below for every applicable file and mode.\n\n## Checklist\nSee","body":"# Frontend Code Review\n\n## Intent\nUse this skill whenever the user asks to review frontend code (especially `.tsx`, `.ts`, or `.js` files). Support two review modes:\n\n1. **Pending-change review** – inspect staged/working-tree files slated for commit and flag checklist violations before submission.\n2. **File-targeted review** – review the specific file(s) the user names and report the relevant checklist findings.\n\nStick to the checklist below for every applicable file and mode.\n\n## Checklist\nSee [references/code-quality.md](references/code-quality.md), [references/performance.md](references/performance.md), [references/business-logic.md](references/business-logic.md) for the living checklist split by category—treat it as the canonical set of rules to follow.\n\nFlag each rule violation with urgency metadata so future reviewers can prioritize fixes.\n\n## Review Process\n1. Open the relevant component/module. Gather lines that relate to class names, React Flow hooks, prop memoization, and styling.\n2. For each rule in the review point, note where the code deviates and capture a representative snippet.\n3. Compose the review section per the template below. Group violations first by **Urgent** flag, then by category order (Code Quality, Performance, Business Logic).\n\n## Required output\nWhen invoked, the response must exactly follow one of the two templates:\n\n### Template A (any findings)\n```\n# Code review\nFound <N> urgent issues need to be fixed:\n\n## 1 <brief description of bug>\nFilePath: <path> line <line>\n<relevant code snippet or pointer>\n\n\n### Suggested fix\n<brief description of suggested fix>\n\n---\n... (repeat for each urgent issue) ...\n\nFound <M> suggestions for improvement:\n\n## 1 <brief description of suggestion>\nFilePath: <path> line <line>\n<relevant code snippet or pointer>\n\n\n### Suggested fix\n<brief description of suggested fix>\n\n---\n\n... (repeat for each suggestion) ...\n```\n\nIf there are no urgent issues, omit that section. If there are no suggestions, omit that section.\n\nIf the issue number is more than 10, summarize as \"10+ urgent issues\" or \"10+ suggestions\" and just output the first 10 issues.\n\nDon''t compress the blank lines between sections; keep them as-is for readability.\n\nIf you use Template A (i.e., there are issues to fix) and at least one issue requires code changes, append a brief follow-up question after the structured output asking whether the user wants you to apply the suggested fix(es). For example: \"Would you like me to use the Suggested fix section to address these issues?\"\n\n### Template B (no issues)\n```\n## Code review\nNo issues found.\n```\n\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:14:55.517Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代码审查工具 - 前端代码审查","ja":"AIエージェント - フロントエンドコードレビュー","ko":"AI 에이전트 - 프론트엔드 코드 리뷰","es":"Herramientas de revisión de código frontend con Agentes d...","fr":"Outils de révision de code frontend avec Agents IA","de":"Frontend-Code-Review-Tools mit KI-Agents","pt":"Ferramentas de Revisão de Código Frontend com Agentes de IA","ru":"ИИ Агенты для Проверки Фронтенд-Кода","ar":"أدوات المراجعة الأمامية للمواقع مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"frontend-code-review"},"description":{"zh":"前端代码审查AI智能工具，支持pending-change审查和特定文件审查，确保代码质量和安全","ja":"フロントエンドコードレビューエージェントは、コードの品質とセキュリティを確保するために、ペンディングチェンジレビューと特定のファイルレビューをサポートします","ko":"프론트엔드 코드 리뷰 에이전트는 코드 품질과 보안을 보장하기 위해_pending-change 리뷰와 특정 파일 리뷰를 지원합니다","es":"La herramienta de revisión de código frontend utiliza Agentes de IA para revisar archivos .tsx, .ts y .js de manera automática. Soporte para revisiones de ca...","fr":"L''outil de révision de code frontend utilise des Agents IA pour réviser les fichiers .tsx, .ts et .js de manière automatisée. Prise en charge des révisions d...","de":"Das Frontend-Code-Review-Tool verwendet KI-Agents, um Dateien .tsx, .ts und .js automatisch zu überprüfen. Unterstützung für Überprüfungen von ausstehenden Ä...","pt":"O skill de revisão de código frontend é usado para revisar arquivos de código frontend, como .tsx, .ts e .js, com suporte a revisões de alterações pendentes ...","ru":"Навык проверки фронтенд-кода используется для проверки файлов фронтенд-кода, таких как .tsx, .ts и .js, с поддержкой проверок изменений и целевых файлов","ar":"يستخدم مهارة مراجعة код المواقع الأمامية لمراجعة ملفات код المواقع الأمامية، مثل .tsx و .ts و .js، مع دعم لمراجعة التغييرات المعلقة ومراجعة الملفات المستهدفة","en":"Trigger when the user requests a review of frontend files (e.g., `.tsx`, `.ts`, `.js`). Support both pending-change reviews and focused file reviews while ap..."},"definition":{"en":"Trigger when the user requests a review of frontend files (e.g., `.tsx`, `.ts`, `.js`). Support both pending-change reviews and focused file reviews while applying the checklist rules."},"features":{"zh":["支持pending-change审查","支持特定文件审查","利用AI智能技术进行代码审查","提高代码质量和安全","支持多种编程语言"],"ja":["ペンディングチェンジレビューをサポート","特定のファイルレビューをサポート","AIエージェントを使用してコードをレビュー","コードの品質とセキュリティを向上させる","多くのプログラミング言語をサポート"],"ko":["_pending-change 리뷰를 지원","특정 파일 리뷰를 지원","인공지능 에이전트를 사용하여 코드를 리뷰","코드 품질과 보안을 향상시키기","여러 프로그래밍 언어를 지원"],"es":["Revisión automática de código frontend","Soporte para archivos .tsx, .ts y .js","Revisiones de cambios pendientes y revisiones de archivos específicos","Aplicación de reglas de checklist para garantizar la calidad del código","Integración con flujos de trabajo de desarrollo existentes"],"fr":["Révision automatisée de code frontend","Prise en charge des fichiers .tsx, .ts et .js","Révisions de modifications en attente et révisions de fichiers spécifiques","Application de règles de checklist pour garantir la qualité du code","Intégration avec les flux de travail de développement existants"],"de":["Automatisierte Code-Review für Frontend","Unterstützung für Dateien .tsx, .ts und .js","Überprüfungen von ausstehenden Änderungen und Überprüfungen von bestimmten Dateien","Anwendung von Checklist-Regeln, um die Code-Qualität zu gewährleisten","Integration in bestehende Entwicklungswerkflüsse"],"pt":["Suporte a revisões de alterações pendentes","Suporte a revisões de arquivos específicos","Verificação de violações de checklist","Integração com frameworks de desenvolvimento web","Suporte a linguagens de programação como JavaScript e TypeScript"],"ru":["Поддержка проверок изменений","Поддержка проверок целевых файлов","Проверка нарушений чек-листа","Интеграция с фреймворками веб-разработки","Поддержка языков программирования, таких как JavaScript и TypeScript"],"ar":["دعم مراجعة التغييرات المعلقة","دعم مراجعة الملفات المستهدفة","فحص انتهاكات قائمة المراجعة","التكامل مع الإطارات عمل التطوير الويب","دعم لغات البرمجة مثل جافاسكريبت وتايبسكريبت"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代码审查","前端代码审查","pending-change审查","特定文件审查","代码质量","代码安全","AIエージェント","代码审查工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","フロントエンドコードレビュー","ペンディングチェンジレビュー","特定のファイルレビュー","コードの品質","コードのセキュリティ","コードレビューエージェント","AIコードレビュー"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","프론트엔드 코드 리뷰","_pending-change 리뷰","특정 파일 리뷰","코드 품질","코드 보안","코드 리뷰 에이전트","AI 코드 리뷰"],"es":["Agentes de IA","revisión de código frontend","automatización de código","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","code review","frontend development"],"fr":["Agents IA","révision de code frontend","automatisation de code","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","code review","développement frontend"],"de":["KI-Agents","Code-Review für Frontend","Code-Automatisierung","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Code-Review","Frontend-Entwicklung"],"pt":["revisão de código frontend","agentes de IA","desenvolvimento web","JavaScript","TypeScript","frameworks de desenvolvimento web","revisão de código","qualidade de código"],"ru":["проверка фронтенд-кода","ИИ Агенты","веб-разработка","JavaScript","TypeScript","фреймворки веб-разработки","проверка кода","качество кода"],"ar":["مراجعة код المواقع الأمامية","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير الويب","جافاسكريبت","تايبسكريبت","إطارات عمل التطوير الويب","مراجعة الكود","جودة الكود"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Code Review Agents specializing in frontend development workflows.","zh":"对于专门从事前端开发工作流的代码审查代理来说是必不可少的。","ja":"フロントエンド開発ワークフローを専門とするコードレビューエージェントには不可欠です。","ko":"프론트엔드 개발 워크플로를 전문으로 하는 코드 리뷰 에이전트에게는 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para Agentes de Revisión de Código especializados en flujos de trabajo de desarrollo frontend.","fr":"Essentiel pour les Agents de Revue de Code spécialisés dans les flux de travail de développement frontend.","de":"Wesentlich für Code-Review-Agents, die auf Frontend-Entwicklungsworkflows spezialisiert sind.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Revisão de Código especializados em fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento frontend.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов проверки кода, специализирующихся на рабочих процессах разработки frontend.","ar":"ضروري للموكلين من مراجعة الكود الذين يختصون بتدفقات عمل التطوير 前端."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables comprehensive static analysis of TypeScript and JavaScript files against predefined checklist rules, supporting both pre-commit validation for staged changes and targeted file reviews. Provides automated violation flagging for .tsx, .ts, and .js files across two distinct review modes.","zh":"能够对TypeScript和JavaScript文件进行全面静态分析，以预定义的检查列表规则为依据，支持预提交验证和目标文件审查，提供对.tsx、.ts和.js文件的自动化违规标记，支持两种不同的审查模式。","ja":"TypeScriptとJavaScriptファイルを事前に定義されたチェックリストルールに対して包括的な静的分析を実行できるため、ステージングされた変更の事前コミット検証とターゲットファイルレビューの両方をサポートし、.tsx、.ts、.jsファイルに対する自動化された違反フラグを提供し、二つの異なるレビューモードをサポートする。","ko":"사전 정의된 체크리스트 규칙에 대해 TypeScript 및 JavaScript 파일에 대해 포괄적인 정적 분석을 수행할 수 있으며 커밋 전 검증 및 대상 파일 검토를 지원하며 .tsx, .ts 및 .js 파일에 대한 자동 위반 플래그를 제공하며 두 가지 다른 검토 모드를 지원합니다.","es":"Permite un análisis estático integral de archivos TypeScript y JavaScript frente a reglas de lista de verificación predefinidas, admitiendo tanto la validación pre-compromiso para cambios en espera como las revisiones de archivos dirigidas. Proporciona una señalización de violación automatizada para archivos .tsx, .ts y .js a través de dos modos de revisión distintos.","fr":"Permet une analyse statique complète de fichiers TypeScript et JavaScript par rapport à des règles de checklist préétablies, prenant en charge à la fois la validation pré-engagement pour les modifications en attente et les examens de fichiers ciblés. Fournit un signal de violation automatisé pour les fichiers .tsx, .ts et .js à travers deux modes de révision distincts.","de":"Ermöglicht eine umfassende statische Analyse von TypeScript- und JavaScript-Dateien gegenüber vordefinierten Prüflistenregeln, unterstützt sowohl die Vorab-Validierung für in Bearbeitung befindliche Änderungen als auch gezielte Dateibewertungen. Bietet automatisierte Verletzungsflaggen für .tsx-, .ts- und .js-Dateien über zwei unterschiedliche Überprüfungsmodi.","pt":"Permite uma análise estática abrangente de arquivos TypeScript e JavaScript contra regras de lista de verificação predefinidas, suportando tanto a validação pré-envio para alterações em estágio quanto revisões de arquivos direcionadas. Fornece marcação automática de violações para arquivos .tsx, .ts e .js em dois modos de revisão distintos.","ru":"Позволяет проводить всесторонний статический анализ файлов TypeScript и JavaScript против предустановленных правил контрольного списка, поддерживая как валидацию до фиксации для изменений в очереди, так и целевые обзоры файлов. Обеспечивает автоматическую маркировку нарушений для файлов .tsx, .ts и .js в двух различных режимах обзора.","ar":"يسمح بالتحليل الساكن الشامل لملفات TypeScript وJavaScript ضد قواعد قائمة التحقق المحددة مسبقًا ، مع دعم التحقق من صحة ما قبل الإرسال للتغييرات الموقعة ومراجعة الملفات المستهدفة. يوفر وضع علامات انتهاك تلقائي لملفات .tsx و .ts و .js عبر وضعين مراجعة متميزين."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pre-commit code validation","Performing targeted file analysis","Enforcing frontend code standards","Identifying checklist violations in staged changes"],"zh":["自动化预提交代码验证","执行目标文件分析","实施前端代码标准","识别阶段更改中的检查列表违规"],"ja":["コミット前のコード検証の自動化","ターゲットファイル分析の実行","フロントエンドコード規範の施行","ステージングされた変更におけるチェックリスト違反の特定"],"ko":["커밋 전 코드 유효성 검사의 자동화","대상 파일 분석의 수행","프론트엔드 코드 표준의 적용","단계적 변경 사항에서의 체크리스트 위반 확인"],"es":["Automatización de la validación de código pre-compromiso","Realización de análisis de archivos dirigidos","Aplicación de estándares de código frontend","Identificación de violaciones de la lista de verificación en cambios en espera"],"fr":["Automatisation de la validation de code pré-engagement","Réalisations d''analyses de fichiers ciblés","Application des normes de code frontend","Identification des violations de la checklist dans les modifications en attente"],"de":["Automatisierung der Vorab-Code-Validierung","Durchführung gezielter Dateianalysen","Durchsetzung von Frontend-Code-Standards","Identifizierung von Verletzungen der Prüfliste in in Bearbeitung befindlichen Änderungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a validação de código pré-envio","Realizar análise de arquivo direcionada","Impor padrões de código frontend","Identificar violações da lista de verificação em alterações em estágio"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода до фиксации","Провести целевую анализ файла","Применять стандарты кода frontend","Обнаруживать нарушения контрольного списка в изменениях в очереди"],"ar":["تحسين التحقق من صحة الكود قبل الإرسال","إجراء تحليل الملف المستهدف","فرض معايير كود الويب الأمامي","تحديد انتهاكات قائمة التحقق في التغييرات الموقعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git repository context for pending-change reviews","Limited to .tsx, .ts, and .js file extensions","Depends on predefined checklist ruleset"],"zh":["需要Git仓库上下文进行待处理更改审查","仅限.tsx、.ts和.js文件扩展名","依赖于预定义的检查列表规则集"],"ja":["未処理の変更のレビューにはGitリポジトリコンテキストが必要",".tsx、.ts、.jsファイル拡張子のみ","事前に定義されたチェックリストルールセットに依存"],"ko":["대기 중인 변경 사항 검토를 위해 Git 리포지토리 контек스트가 필요합니다.",".tsx, .ts 및 .js 파일 확장자만","사전 정의된 체크리스트 규칙 세트에 의존"],"es":["Requiere un contexto de repositorio Git para revisiones de cambios pendientes","Limitado a extensiones de archivo .tsx, .ts y .js","Depende de un conjunto de reglas de lista de verificación predefinido"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de référentiel Git pour les révisions de modifications en attente","Limité aux extensions de fichiers .tsx, .ts et .js","Dépend d''un ensemble de règles de checklist préétabli"],"de":["Benötigt einen Git-Repository-Kontext für Überprüfungen von in Bearbeitung befindlichen Änderungen","Begrenzt auf Dateierweiterungen .tsx, .ts und .js","Hängt von einem vordefinierten Satz von Prüflistenregeln ab"],"pt":["Exige contexto de repositório Git para revisões de alterações pendentes","Limitado a extensões de arquivo .tsx, .ts e .js","Depende de um conjunto de regras de lista de verificação predefinido"],"ru":["Требует контекста репозитория Git для обзоров изменений в очереди","Ограничен расширениями файлов .tsx, .ts и .js","Зависит от предустановленного набора правил контрольного списка"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق مستودع Git لمراجعات التغييرات الموقعة","محدود بامتدادات الملفات .tsx و .ts و .js","يعتمد على مجموعة قواعد قائمة التحقق المحددة مسبقًا"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f4fefe4db6804043a36626f5f6028192f038bacd0c881f0fe6887cc4dd5f43b0","repoEtag":"W/\"bd31bf445d19a7c4de800d8fae38bad2dd460f6168553876110afcf1c22fc352\"","qualityScore":68}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('vercel/next.js/update-docs', 'official', 'vercel', 'next.js', 'vercel/next.js', 'update-docs', 138050, 30519, 68, '2026-03-01T04:34:26Z', '2026-03-01T05:14:56.110Z', '0f46c6e76a222cfa4008d16cdb1dfa37c413901db2b304a49cce829ef4c7ad71', '{"id":"vercel/next.js/update-docs","name":"update-docs","description":{"zh":"update-docs AI智能工具提供了一个指导性的工作流程，用于根据代码更改更新Next.js文档","ja":"update-docs AIエージェントは、コード変更に基づいてNext.jsのドキュメントを更新するためのガイド付きワークフローを提供","ko":"update-docs AI 에이전트는 코드 변경에 따라 Next.js 문서를 업데이트하는 데 도움이 되는 가이드 워크플로를 제공","es":"Actualiza documentación de Next.js con update-docs, una habilidad de IA que proporciona un flujo de trabajo guiado","fr":"Mettez à jour la documentation Next.js avec update-docs, un outil d''IA qui propose un flux de travail guidé","de":"Aktualisieren Sie die Next.js-Dokumentation mit update-docs, einem KI-Tool mit einem guidierten Workflow","pt":"O update-docs é uma habilidade de IA que ajuda a manter a documentação de Next.js atualizada com base nas alterações de código.","ru":"ИИ Агент update-docs помогает поддерживать документацию Next.js в актуальном состоянии на основе изменений кода.","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي update-docs تساعد في الحفاظ على توثيق Next.js محدث بناءً على تغييرات الكود.","en":"This skill should be used when the user asks to update documentation for my changes, check docs for this PR, what docs need updating, sync docs with code, scaffold docs for this feature, document this feature, review docs completeness, add docs for this change, what documentation is affected, doc..."},"owner":"vercel","repo":"next.js","repoPath":"vercel/next.js","stars":138050,"forks":30519,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T04:34:26Z","topics":["blog","browser","compiler","components","hybrid","nextjs","node","react","server-rendering","ssg","static","static-site-generator","universal","vercel"],"skillMd":{"name":"update-docs","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to update documentation for my changes, check docs for this PR, what docs need updating, sync docs with code, scaffold docs for this feature, document this feature, review docs completeness, add docs for this change, what documentation is affected, docs impact, or mentions docs/, docs/01-app, docs/02-pages, MDX, documentation update, API reference, .mdx files. Provides guided workflow for updating Next.js documentation based on code changes.","bodyPreview":"# Next.js Documentation Updater\n\nGuides you through updating Next.js documentation based on code changes on the active branch. Designed for maintainers reviewing PRs for documentation completeness.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Analyze changes**: Run `git diff canary...HEAD --stat` to see what files changed\n2. **Identify affected docs**: Map changed source files to documentation paths\n3. **Review each doc**: Walk through updates with user confirmation\n4. **Validate**: Run `pnpm lint` to check formatting","body":"# Next.js Documentation Updater\n\nGuides you through updating Next.js documentation based on code changes on the active branch. Designed for maintainers reviewing PRs for documentation completeness.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Analyze changes**: Run `git diff canary...HEAD --stat` to see what files changed\n2. **Identify affected docs**: Map changed source files to documentation paths\n3. **Review each doc**: Walk through updates with user confirmation\n4. **Validate**: Run `pnpm lint` to check formatting\n5. **Commit**: Stage documentation changes\n\n## Workflow: Analyze Code Changes\n\n### Step 1: Get the diff\n\n```bash\n# See all changed files on this branch\ngit diff canary...HEAD --stat\n\n# See changes in specific areas\ngit diff canary...HEAD -- packages/next/src/\n```\n\n### Step 2: Identify documentation-relevant changes\n\nLook for changes in these areas:\n\n| Source Path                            | Likely Doc Impact           |\n| -------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `packages/next/src/client/components/` | Component API reference     |\n| `packages/next/src/server/`            | Function API reference      |\n| `packages/next/src/shared/lib/`        | Varies by export            |\n| `packages/next/src/build/`             | Configuration or build docs |\n| `packages/next/src/lib/`               | Various features            |\n\n### Step 3: Map to documentation files\n\nUse the code-to-docs mapping in `references/CODE-TO-DOCS-MAPPING.md` to find corresponding documentation files.\n\nExample mappings:\n\n- `src/client/components/image.tsx` → `docs/01-app/03-api-reference/02-components/image.mdx`\n- `src/server/config-shared.ts` → `docs/01-app/03-api-reference/05-config/`\n\n## Workflow: Update Existing Documentation\n\n### Step 1: Read the current documentation\n\nBefore making changes, read the existing doc to understand:\n\n- Current structure and sections\n- Frontmatter fields in use\n- Whether it uses `<AppOnly>` / `<PagesOnly>` for router-specific content\n\n### Step 2: Identify what needs updating\n\nCommon updates include:\n\n- **New props/options**: Add to the props table and create a section explaining usage\n- **Changed behavior**: Update descriptions and examples\n- **Deprecated features**: Add deprecation notices and migration guidance\n- **New examples**: Add code blocks following conventions\n\n### Step 3: Apply updates with confirmation\n\nFor each change:\n\n1. Show the user what you plan to change\n2. Wait for confirmation before editing\n3. Apply the edit\n4. Move to the next change\n\n### Step 4: Check for shared content\n\nIf the doc uses the `source` field pattern (common for Pages Router docs), the source file is the one to edit. Example:\n\n```yaml\n# docs/02-pages/... file with shared content\n---\nsource: app/building-your-application/optimizing/images\n---\n```\n\nEdit the App Router source, not the Pages Router file.\n\n### Step 5: Validate changes\n\n```bash\npnpm lint          # Check formatting\npnpm prettier-fix  # Auto-fix formatting issues\n```\n\n## Workflow: Scaffold New Feature Documentation\n\nUse this when adding documentation for entirely new features.\n\n### Step 1: Determine the doc type\n\n| Feature Type        | Doc Location                                        | Template         |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| New component       | `docs/01-app/03-api-reference/02-components/`       | API Reference    |\n| New function        | `docs/01-app/03-api-reference/04-functions/`        | API Reference    |\n| New config option   | `docs/01-app/03-api-reference/05-config/`           | Config Reference |\n| New concept/guide   | `docs/01-app/02-guides/`                            | Guide            |\n| New file convention | `docs/01-app/03-api-reference/03-file-conventions/` | File Convention  |\n\n### Step 2: Create the file with proper naming\n\n- Use kebab-case: `my-new-feature.mdx`\n- Add numeric prefix if ordering matters: `05-my-new-feature.mdx`\n- Place in the correct directory based on feature type\n\n### Step 3: Use the appropriate template\n\n**API Reference Template:**\n\n```mdx\n---\ntitle: Feature Name\ndescription: Brief description of what this feature does.\n---\n\n{/* The content of this doc is shared between the app and pages router. You can use the `<PagesOnly>Content</PagesOnly>` component to add content that is specific to the Pages Router. Any shared content should not be wrapped in a component. */}\n\nBrief introduction to the feature.\n\n## Reference\n\n### Props\n\n<div style={{ overflowX: ''auto'', width: ''100%'' }}>\n\n| Prop                    | Example            | Type   | Status   |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------ | ------ | -------- |\n| [`propName`](#propname) | `propName=\"value\"` | String | Required |\n\n</div>\n\n#### `propName`\n\nDescription of the prop.\n\n\\`\\`\\`tsx filename=\"app/example.tsx\" switcher\n// TypeScript example\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n\\`\\`\\`jsx filename=\"app/example.js\" switcher\n// JavaScript example\n\\`\\`\\`\n```\n\n**Guide Template:**\n\n```mdx\n---\ntitle: How to do X in Next.js\nnav_title: X\ndescription: Learn how to implement X in your Next.js application.\n---\n\nIntroduction explaining why this guide is useful.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nWhat the reader needs to know before starting.\n\n## Step 1: First Step\n\nExplanation and code example.\n\n\\`\\`\\`tsx filename=\"app/example.tsx\" switcher\n// Code example\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## Step 2: Second Step\n\nContinue with more steps...\n\n## Next Steps\n\nRelated topics to explore.\n```\n\n### Step 4: Add related links\n\nUpdate frontmatter with related documentation:\n\n```yaml\nrelated:\n  title: Next Steps\n  description: Learn more about related features.\n  links:\n    - app/api-reference/functions/related-function\n    - app/guides/related-guide\n```\n\n## Documentation Conventions\n\nSee `references/DOC-CONVENTIONS.md` for complete formatting rules.\n\n### Quick Reference\n\n**Frontmatter (required):**\n\n```yaml\n---\ntitle: Page Title (2-3 words)\ndescription: One or two sentences describing the page.\n---\n```\n\n**Code blocks:**\n\n```\n\\`\\`\\`tsx filename=\"app/page.tsx\" switcher\n// TypeScript first\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n\\`\\`\\`jsx filename=\"app/page.js\" switcher\n// JavaScript second\n\\`\\`\\`\n```\n\n**Router-specific content:**\n\n```mdx\n<AppOnly>Content only for App Router docs.</AppOnly>\n\n<PagesOnly>Content only for Pages Router docs.</PagesOnly>\n```\n\n**Notes:**\n\n```mdx\n> **Good to know**: Single line note.\n\n> **Good to know**:\n>\n> - Multi-line note point 1\n> - Multi-line note point 2\n```\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\nBefore committing documentation changes:\n\n- [ ] Frontmatter has `title` and `description`\n- [ ] Code blocks have `filename` attribute\n- [ ] TypeScript examples use `switcher` with JS variant\n- [ ] Props tables are properly formatted\n- [ ] Related links point to valid paths\n- [ ] `pnpm lint` passes\n- [ ] Changes render correctly (if preview available)\n\n## References\n\n- `references/DOC-CONVENTIONS.md` - Complete frontmatter and formatting rules\n- `references/CODE-TO-DOCS-MAPPING.md` - Source code to documentation mapping\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:14:56.110Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具：update-docs 文档更新","ja":"AIエージェント：update-docs ドキュメント更新","ko":"AI 에이전트: update-docs 문서 업데이트","es":"Herramientas de IA: Actualiza Documentos con update-docs","fr":"Outils d''IA : Mettre à jour les documents avec update-docs","de":"KI-Tools: Dokumente mit update-docs aktualisieren","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Atualize Documentação com update-docs","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Обновите Документацию с update-docs","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: تحديث الوثائق باستخدام update-docs","en":"update-docs"},"description":{"zh":"update-docs AI智能工具提供了一个指导性的工作流程，用于根据代码更改更新Next.js文档","ja":"update-docs AIエージェントは、コード変更に基づいてNext.jsのドキュメントを更新するためのガイド付きワークフローを提供","ko":"update-docs AI 에이전트는 코드 변경에 따라 Next.js 문서를 업데이트하는 데 도움이 되는 가이드 워크플로를 제공","es":"Actualiza documentación de Next.js con update-docs, una habilidad de IA que proporciona un flujo de trabajo guiado","fr":"Mettez à jour la documentation Next.js avec update-docs, un outil d''IA qui propose un flux de travail guidé","de":"Aktualisieren Sie die Next.js-Dokumentation mit update-docs, einem KI-Tool mit einem guidierten Workflow","pt":"O update-docs é uma habilidade de IA que ajuda a manter a documentação de Next.js atualizada com base nas alterações de código.","ru":"ИИ Агент update-docs помогает поддерживать документацию Next.js в актуальном состоянии на основе изменений кода.","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي update-docs تساعد في الحفاظ على توثيق Next.js محدث بناءً على تغييرات الكود.","en":"This skill should be used when the user asks to update documentation for my changes, check docs for this PR, what docs need 