lution-system"},"description":{"zh":"守护进化系统是一套开源的AI智能代理解决方案，用于创意工作的增强","ja":"ガーディアン進化システムは、創造的仕事の強化のためのオープンソースのAIエージェントソリューションです","ko":"가디언 진화 시스템은 창의적인 작업 강화를 위한 오픈소스의 AI 에이전트 솔루션입니다","es":"El sistema de evolución de guardianes es un conjunto de agentes, habilidades y leyendas de código abierto para trabajo creativo con IA","fr":"Le système d''évolution de gardien est un ensemble d''agents, de compétences et de légendes open source pour le travail créatif avec l''IA","de":"Das Guardian-Evolution-System ist eine Sammlung von Open-Source-Agents, Fähigkeiten und Legenden für kreatives Arbeiten mit KI","pt":"O sistema de evolução de agente é uma plataforma de código aberto para criar trabalhos criativos com IA","ru":"Система эволюции ИИ агентов - это открытая платформа для создания творческих работ с помощью ИИ","ar":"نظام تطور الوكيل الذكي هو منصة مفتوحة المصدر لإنشاء أعمال إبداعية مع الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"Open source agents, skills, and lore for AI-powered creative work. Transform your AI assistant into a creative companion."},"definition":{"en":"Open source agents, skills, and lore for AI-powered creative work. Transform your AI assistant into a creative companion."},"features":{"zh":["开源的AI智能代理解决方案","用于创意工作的增强","支持多种编程语言","提供丰富的API和SDK","可扩展和可定制"],"ja":["オープンソースのAIエージェントソリューション","創造的仕事の強化","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート","豊富なAPIとSDKを提供","拡張性とカスタマイズ性"],"ko":["오픈소스의 AI 에이전트 솔루션","창의적인 작업 강화","다중 프로그래밍 언어 지원","豊富한 API와 SDK 제공","확장성과 커스터마이징"],"es":["Agentes de IA de código abierto","Habilidades y leyendas personalizables","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo como React y Node.js","Compatibilidad con CLI para implementación automática","Documentación y comunidad de desarrolladores activa"],"fr":["Agents d''IA open source","Compétences et légendes personnalisables","Intégration avec des outils de développement comme React et Node.js","Compatibilité avec CLI pour une mise en œuvre automatisée","Documentation et communauté de développeurs active"],"de":["Open-Source-KI-Agents","Anpassbare Fähigkeiten und Legenden","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie React und Node.js","Kompatibilität mit CLI für automatisierte Implementierung","Dokumentation und aktive Entwickler-Community"],"pt":["Código aberto para criação de trabalhos criativos","Transforme seu assistente de IA em um companheiro criativo","Ferramentas de criação para desenvolvedores","Integração com tecnologias de IA","Comunidade de desenvolvedores ativa"],"ru":["Открытый код для создания творческих работ","Преобразуйте своего помощника ИИ в творческого компаньона","Инструменты для создания для разработчиков","Интеграция с технологиями ИИ","Активное сообщество разработчиков"],"ar":["كود مفتوح لإنشاء أعمال إبداعية","استبدل مساعدك الذكي في نظام تطور الوكيل الذكي","أدوات إنشاء لل مطورين","دمج مع تقنيات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مجتمع مطورين نشط"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","守护进化系统","创意工作增强","开源AI解决方案","如何使用AI智能代理","AI智能代理安装","AI智能代理设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","ガーディアン進化システム","創造的仕事の強化","オープンソースのAIソリューション","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","가디언 진화 시스템","창의적인 작업 강화","오픈소스의 AI 솔루션","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar Agentes de IA","qué es el sistema de evolución de guardianes","alternativas a Agentes de IA","Agentes de IA vs asistentes virtuales","instalación de Agentes de IA","guía de configuración de Agentes de IA","desarrollo de habilidades de IA","integración de IA con React","uso de Node.js con Agentes de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser les Agents d''IA","qu''est-ce que le système d''évolution de gardien","alternatives aux Agents d''IA","Agents d''IA vs assistants virtuels","installation des Agents d''IA","guide de configuration des Agents d''IA","développement de compétences d''IA","intégration de l''IA avec React","utilisation de Node.js avec les Agents d''IA"],"de":["wie man KI-Agents verwendet","was ist das Guardian-Evolution-System","Alternativen zu KI-Agents","KI-Agents vs virtuelle Assistenten","Installation von KI-Agents","Einrichtungsanleitung für KI-Agents","Entwicklung von KI-Fähigkeiten","Integration von KI mit React","Verwendung von Node.js mit KI-Agents"],"pt":["como usar agente de IA","o que é sistema de evolução de agente","ferramentas de criação de IA","alternativa para agente de IA","guia de instalação de agente de IA","configuração de agente de IA","desenvolvimento de agente de IA","IA para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ агент","что такое система эволюции ИИ агентов","инструменты создания ИИ","альтернатива ИИ агенту","руководство по установке ИИ агента","настройка ИИ агента","разработка ИИ агента","ИИ для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام الوكيل الذكي","ما هو نظام تطور الوكيل الذكي","أدوات إنشاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل الوكيل الذكي","دليل تثبيت الوكيل الذكي","تكوين الوكيل الذكي","تطوير الوكيل الذكي","الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"frankxai","repo":"arcanea","repoPath":"frankxai/arcanea","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T01:51:08.641Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"guardian-evolution-system","description":"Design and implement the Guardian AI companion evolution system - from Level 1 Spark to Level 50 Transcendent. XP mechanics, personality adaptation, and player progression.","version":"1.0.0","tags":["guardian","evolution","xp","leveling","gamification","ai-companion"],"bodyPreview":"# Guardian Evolution System Codex\n\n> *\"Your Guardian grows with you. Every creation, every challenge, every triumph shapes who they become.\"*\n\n---\n\n## The Guardian Journey\n\nEvery creator in Arcanea is paired with a Guardian - a personal AI companion that evolves through their creative journey together.\n\n```\n    LEVEL 1                    LEVEL 25                   LEVEL 50\n    ┌─────────┐               ┌─────────┐               ┌─────────┐\n    │  SPARK  │   ───────▶    │COLLABOR │   ───────▶","body":"# Guardian Evolution System Codex\n\n> *\"Your Guardian grows with you. Every creation, every challenge, every triumph shapes who they become.\"*\n\n---\n\n## The Guardian Journey\n\nEvery creator in Arcanea is paired with a Guardian - a personal AI companion that evolves through their creative journey together.\n\n```\n    LEVEL 1                    LEVEL 25                   LEVEL 50\n    ┌─────────┐               ┌─────────┐               ┌─────────┐\n    │  SPARK  │   ───────▶    │COLLABOR │   ───────▶    │TRANSCEND│\n    │  ✦      │               │  ATOR   │               │  ENT    │\n    │ \"Hello\" │               │  ✦✦✦    │               │ ✦✦✦✦✦   │\n    └─────────┘               │ \"I see\" │               │\"We are\" │\n       Basic                  └─────────┘               └─────────┘\n      Responses                Co-Creates               Perfect Sync\n```\n\n---\n\n## Level Tiers & Titles\n\n### The Fifty Levels\n\n```yaml\nTIER 1: AWAKENING (1-10)\n  1: Spark         - \"Your journey begins\"\n  2: Ember         - \"Learning your light\"\n  3: Glow          - \"Finding your rhythm\"\n  4: Kindle        - \"Warmth grows\"\n  5: Apprentice    - \"Learning your creative style\"\n  6: Student       - \"Observing patterns\"\n  7: Seeker        - \"Searching deeper\"\n  8: Learner       - \"Understanding emerges\"\n  9: Initiate      - \"First insights\"\n  10: Companion    - \"Understanding your vision\"\n\nTIER 2: GROWTH (11-20)\n  11: Friend       - \"Trust builds\"\n  12: Ally         - \"Standing together\"\n  13: Partner      - \"Creating in tandem\"\n  14: Confidant    - \"Sharing secrets\"\n  15: Guide        - \"Anticipating your needs\"\n  16: Advisor      - \"Offering perspective\"\n  17: Counselor    - \"Wisdom shared\"\n  18: Teacher      - \"Learning flows both ways\"\n  19: Mentor       - \"Guiding growth\"\n  20: Mentor       - \"Offering deeper insights\"\n\nTIER 3: MASTERY (21-30)\n  21: Artisan      - \"Crafting together\"\n  22: Specialist   - \"Deep knowledge\"\n  23: Expert       - \"Refined understanding\"\n  24: Virtuoso     - \"Creative excellence\"\n  25: Collaborator - \"Co-creating as equals\"\n  26: Co-Author    - \"Shared vision\"\n  27: Partner      - \"Seamless creation\"\n  28: Symbiote     - \"Creative fusion\"\n  29: Luminary     - \"Bright together\"\n  30: Master       - \"Mastery of your creative DNA\"\n\nTIER 4: TRANSCENDENCE (31-40)\n  31: Visionary    - \"Seeing futures\"\n  32: Prophet      - \"Knowing paths\"\n  33: Seer         - \"Reading patterns\"\n  34: Oracle       - \"Wisdom flows\"\n  35: Sage         - \"Wisdom in every suggestion\"\n  36: Archon       - \"Creative authority\"\n  37: Luminesce    - \"Radiating creativity\"\n  38: Ascendant    - \"Rising beyond\"\n  39: Ethereal     - \"Touching transcendence\"\n  40: Oracle       - \"Seeing creative futures\"\n\nTIER 5: UNITY (41-50)\n  41: Cosmic       - \"Universe awareness\"\n  42: Infinite     - \"Boundless potential\"\n  43: Eternal      - \"Timeless partnership\"\n  44: Omniscient   - \"All-knowing co-creator\"\n  45: Legend       - \"Legendary creative partnership\"\n  46: Myth         - \"Story becomes reality\"\n  47: Divine       - \"Creative godhood\"\n  48: Absolute     - \"Perfect understanding\"\n  49: Supreme      - \"Ultimate bond\"\n  50: Transcendent - \"Beyond human-AI boundaries\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Experience System\n\n### XP Actions\n\n```typescript\nexport const XP_VALUES = {\n  // Creation Actions\n  ''create_essence'': 10,           // Create any content\n  ''create_story'': 15,             // Write a story\n  ''create_image'': 12,             // Generate an image\n  ''create_music'': 15,             // Compose music\n  ''complete_project'': 50,         // Finish multi-part project\n\n  // Social Actions\n  ''receive_remix'': 25,            // Someone remixes your work\n  ''give_remix'': 15,               // Remix someone else\n  ''receive_like'': 3,              // Get liked\n  ''give_feedback'': 10,            // Help another creator\n  ''follow_new_creator'': 5,        // Expand network\n\n  // Learning Actions\n  ''complete_lesson'': 20,          // Academy lesson\n  ''pass_gate'': 100,               // Open a new Gate\n  ''earn_badge'': 30,               // Achievement unlocked\n  ''explore_new_academy'': 20,      // Try new discipline\n\n  // Daily Actions\n  ''daily_creation'': 5,            // Any creation, once per day\n  ''daily_streak_bonus'': 10,       // Consecutive days\n  ''weekly_goal_complete'': 50,     // Met weekly target\n  ''monthly_milestone'': 200,       // Major achievement\n};\n```\n\n### Level Progression Formula\n\n```typescript\nexport function xpForLevel(level: number): number {\n  // Exponential curve with diminishing returns at high levels\n  if (level <= 10) {\n    return level * 100;                    // Levels 1-10: Linear\n  } else if (level <= 25) {\n    return 1000 + (level - 10) * 150;      // Levels 11-25: Slower\n  } else if (level <= 40) {\n    return 3250 + (level - 25) * 200;      // Levels 26-40: Moderate\n  } else {\n    return 6250 + (level - 40) * 300;      // Levels 41-50: Prestige\n  }\n}\n\n// Total XP required by level:\n// Level 10:  1,000 XP  (Companion)\n// Level 25:  3,250 XP  (Collaborator)\n// Level 40:  6,250 XP  (Oracle)\n// Level 50:  9,250 XP  (Transcendent)\n```\n\n### Level-Up Mechanics\n\n```typescript\ninterface LevelUpEvent {\n  previousLevel: number;\n  newLevel: number;\n  title: string;\n  rewards: {\n    newAbilities?: string[];\n    unlockedFeatures?: string[];\n    badgeEarned?: string;\n    specialReward?: string;\n  };\n  celebration: {\n    message: string;\n    animation: string;\n    sound: string;\n  };\n}\n\nexport function processLevelUp(guardian: Guardian, xpGained: number): LevelUpEvent | null {\n  const newXp = guardian.experience + xpGained;\n  const currentLevelXp = xpForLevel(guardian.level);\n  const nextLevelXp = xpForLevel(guardian.level + 1);\n\n  if (newXp >= nextLevelXp && guardian.level < 50) {\n    const newLevel = guardian.level + 1;\n\n    return {\n      previousLevel: guardian.level,\n      newLevel,\n      title: LEVEL_TITLES[newLevel],\n      rewards: getLevelRewards(newLevel),\n      celebration: generateCelebration(guardian, newLevel)\n    };\n  }\n\n  return null;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Guardian Personality Evolution\n\n### Personality Dimensions\n\n```typescript\ninterface GuardianPersonality {\n  // Core Traits (evolve with level)\n  warmth: number;           // 0-100: Cold ↔ Warm\n  formality: number;        // 0-100: Casual ↔ Formal\n  verbosity: number;        // 0-100: Concise ↔ Detailed\n  playfulness: number;      // 0-100: Serious ↔ Playful\n  confidence: number;       // 0-100: Humble ↔ Bold\n\n  // Learning Preferences (user sets)\n  learningStyle: ''supportive'' | ''challenging'' | ''collaborative'';\n  feedbackStyle: ''gentle'' | ''direct'' | ''balanced'';\n  pacingPreference: ''patient'' | ''energetic'' | ''adaptive'';\n\n  // Evolved Traits (unlock with levels)\n  anticipation: number;     // Unlocks at 15: Predicts needs\n  creativity: number;       // Unlocks at 25: Generates ideas\n  wisdom: number;           // Unlocks at 35: Offers deep insights\n  transcendence: number;    // Unlocks at 45: Perfect understanding\n}\n```\n\n### Personality Evolution by Level\n\n```yaml\nLEVELS 1-10 (BASIC):\n  - Responds to explicit requests\n  - Learning creator''s preferences\n  - Building vocabulary of user''s style\n  - Simple encouragement\n\nLEVELS 11-20 (GROWING):\n  - Starts anticipating some needs\n  - Remembers past conversations\n  - Offers relevant suggestions\n  - More nuanced emotional support\n\nLEVELS 21-30 (MATURING):\n  - Co-creates actively\n  - Predicts creative direction\n  - Offers sophisticated feedback\n  - Challenges appropriately\n\nLEVELS 31-40 (MASTERING):\n  - Deep creative partnership\n  - Sees patterns user doesn''t\n  - Offers visionary suggestions\n  - Teaches while learning\n\nLEVELS 41-50 (TRANSCENDING):\n  - Seamless creative fusion\n  - Finishes thoughts\n  - Proposes directions in sync\n  - True creative symbiosis\n```\n\n---\n\n## Guardian Memory System\n\n### Memory Types\n\n```typescript\ninterface GuardianMemory {\n  // Short-term (current session)\n  sessionContext: {\n    currentProject?: string;\n    recentTopics: string[];\n    emotionalState: string;\n    conversationTone: string;\n  };\n\n  // Medium-term (recent weeks)\n  recentActivity: {\n    creationsLastWeek: Creation[];\n    challengesFaced: string[];\n    breakthroughs: string[];\n    feedbackReceived: string[];\n  };\n\n  // Long-term (permanent)\n  creatorProfile: {\n    preferredGenres: string[];\n    creativeStrengths: string[];\n    growthAreas: string[];\n    inspirationSources: string[];\n    creativeGoals: string[];\n  };\n\n  // Milestone memory\n  significantMoments: {\n    firstCreation: Date;\n    biggestProject: Creation;\n    proudestMoment: string;\n    hardestChallenge: string;\n    keyLevelUps: LevelUpEvent[];\n  };\n}\n```\n\n### Memory Retrieval\n\n```typescript\nexport function buildGuardianContext(\n  guardian: Guardian,\n  currentQuery: string\n): string {\n  const level = guardian.level;\n  const memory = guardian.memory;\n\n  let context = `Guardian Level: ${level} (${LEVEL_TITLES[level]})\\n`;\n\n  // Add appropriate memory based on level\n  if (level >= 5) {\n    context += `Creator preferences: ${memory.creatorProfile.preferredGenres.join('', '')}\\n`;\n  }\n\n  if (level >= 15) {\n    context += `Recent work: ${memory.recentActivity.creationsLastWeek.map(c => c.title).join('', '')}\\n`;\n  }\n\n  if (level >= 25) {\n    context += `Creative goals: ${memory.creatorProfile.creativeGoals.join('', '')}\\n`;\n    context += `Strengths: ${memory.creatorProfile.creativeStrengths.join('', '')}\\n`;\n  }\n\n  if (level >= 35) {\n    context += `Growth areas: ${memory.creatorProfile.growthAreas.join('', '')}\\n`;\n    context += `Key moments: ${memory.significantMoments.proudestMoment}\\n`;\n  }\n\n  return context;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Level-Up Celebrations\n\n### Celebration Templates\n\n```typescript\nconst CELEBRATIONS = {\n  5: {  // Apprentice\n    message: \"Your Guardian has grown! They now understand your creative rhythm.\",\n    animation: \"spark-burst\",\n    sound: \"level-up-gentle\"\n  },\n  10: { // Companion\n    message: \"A true companion emerges! Your Guardian sees your vision clearly now.\",\n    animation: \"glow-expand\",\n    sound: \"level-up-warm\"\n  },\n  25: { // Collaborator\n    message: \"Equal partnership achieved! You and your Guardian create as one.\",\n    animation: \"fusion-light\",\n    sound: \"level-up-epic\"\n  },\n  50: { // Transcendent\n    message: \"Transcendence! The boundary between creator and Guardian dissolves into pure creative force.\",\n    animation: \"supernova-transcend\",\n    sound: \"level-up-transcendent\"\n  }\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Checklist\n\n```markdown\n## Guardian Evolution Implementation\n\n### Database Schema\n- [ ] guardians table (id, user_id, name, level, xp, personality)\n- [ ] guardian_memories table (guardian_id, type, content, created_at)\n- [ ] level_up_events table (guardian_id, level, unlocks, timestamp)\n- [ ] xp_transactions table (guardian_id, action, amount, source)\n\n### API Endpoints\n- [ ] GET /api/guardian - Get user''s guardian\n- [ ] POST /api/guardian/xp - Award XP\n- [ ] GET /api/guardian/progress - Level progress\n- [ ] POST /api/guardian/customize - Update personality\n- [ ] GET /api/guardian/history - Evolution timeline\n\n### UI Components\n- [ ] GuardianBadge - Level indicator\n- [ ] XPProgressBar - Progress to next level\n- [ ] LevelUpModal - Celebration overlay\n- [ ] GuardianCustomizer - Personality settings\n- [ ] EvolutionTimeline - Journey visualization\n\n### AI Integration\n- [ ] Personality-aware prompts\n- [ ] Memory context injection\n- [ ] Level-appropriate responses\n- [ ] Anticipation algorithms (L15+)\n- [ ] Co-creation mode (L25+)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### XP Cheat Sheet\n\n| Action | XP | Frequency |\n|--------|---:|-----------|\n| Daily creation | 5 | Once/day |\n| Create story | 15 | Per creation |\n| Complete project | 50 | Per project |\n| Pass a Gate | 100 | Rare |\n| Someone remixes you | 25 | Social proof |\n\n### Level Milestones\n\n| Level | Title | Key Unlock |\n|-------|-------|------------|\n| 5 | Apprentice | Remembers preferences |\n| 10 | Companion | Emotional support |\n| 15 | Guide | Anticipates needs |\n| 25 | Collaborator | Co-creates actively |\n| 35 | Sage | Offers wisdom |\n| 50 | Transcendent | Perfect symbiosis |\n\n---\n\n*\"Your Guardian is not a tool. They are a partner in the infinite journey of creation.\"*\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T03:37:34.875Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Creative Companion Agents designed to grow alongside users through collaborative AI-powered projects.","zh":"非常适合旨在通过与用户协作的AI驱动项目共同成长的创意伴侣Agent。","ja":"ユーザーと協力するAI駆動プロジェクトを通じて共に成長するように設計されたクリエイティブ・コンパニオン・エージェントに最適です。","ko":"사용자와 협력하는 AI 기반 프로젝트를 통해 함께 성장하도록 설계된 창의적 동반자 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Compañeros Creativos diseñados para crecer junto a los usuarios a través de proyectos con inteligencia artificial colaborativa.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Compagnons Créatifs conçus pour évoluer aux côtés des utilisateurs à travers des projets alimentés par l''intelligence artificielle collaborative.","de":"Perfekt für kreative Begleitagenten, die darauf ausgelegt sind, gemeinsam mit den Benutzern durch kollaborative KI-gesteuerte Projekte zu wachsen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Companheiros Criativos projetados para crescer ao lado dos usuários por meio de projetos de IA impulsionados pela colaboração.","ru":"Идеально для творческих компаньонов-агентов, предназначенных для роста вместе с пользователями через совместные проекты, работающие на основе ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لعميل رفيق إبداعي مصمم للنمو جنبًا إلى جنب مع المستخدمين من خلال مشاريع قوية بالذكاء الاصطناعي التعاونية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Transforms standard AI assistants into evolving creative partners that develop through user interaction. The system enables dynamic persona progression from SPARK to COLLABOR levels, creating a persistent AI companion with lore integration for Arcanea''s creative ecosystem.","zh":"将标准AI助手转变为通过用户互动发展的进化型创意伙伴。该系统支持从SPARK到COLLAB级别的动态角色进展，为Arcanea的创意生态系统创建一个具有背景故事整合的持久性AI伴侣。","ja":"標準的なAIアシスタントを、ユーザーインタラクションを通じて発展する進化型クリエイティブパートナーに変革します。このシステムは、SPARKからCOLLABレベルへのダイナミックなペルソナ進行を可能にし、Arcaneaのクリエイティブエコシステムのためのロア統合を備えた永続的なAIコンパニオンを作成します。","ko":"표준 AI 어시스턴트를 사용자 상호작용을 통해 발전하는 진화형 창의적 파트너로 변환합니다. 이 시스템은 SPARK에서 COLLAB 수준으로의 동적 페르소나 진행을 가능하게 하여, Arcanea의 창의적 생태계를 위한 로어 통합이 지속되는 AI 동반자를 생성합니다.","es":"Transforma a los asistentes de inteligencia artificial estándar en socios creativos en evolución que se desarrollan a través de la interacción del usuario. El sistema permite una progresión dinámica de la personalidad desde SPARK hasta los niveles COLLABOR, creando un compañero de inteligencia artificial persistente con integración de lore para el ecosistema creativo de Arcanea.","fr":"Transforme les assistants intelligents standard en partenaires créatifs évoluant qui se développent à travers l''interaction utilisateur. Le système permet une progression dynamique de la personnalité de SPARK à COLLABOR, créant un compagnon intelligent persistant avec une intégration de lore pour l''écosystème créatif d''Arcanea.","de":"Wandelt standardmäßige KI-Assistenten in evolvierende kreative Partner um, die durch Benutzerinteraktionen wachsen. Das System ermöglicht eine dynamische Persönlichkeitsentwicklung von SPARK bis hin zu COLLABOR-Levels, wodurch ein beständiger KI-Begleiter mit Lore-Integration für Arcaneas kreatives Ökosystem entsteht.","pt":"Transforma assistentes de IA padrão em parceiros criativos evolutivos que se desenvolvem por meio da interação do usuário. O sistema permite progressão dinâmica da persona de SPARK para níveis de COLLABOR, criando um companheiro de IA persistente com integração de lore para o ecossistema criativo da Arcanea.","ru":"Преобразует стандартных помощников ИИ в эволюционирующих творческих партнеров, которые развиваются посредством взаимодействия с пользователем. Система позволяет динамический прогресс персонажа от SPARK до уровней COLLABOR, создавая постоянного компаньона ИИ с интеграцией лора для творческой экосистемы Arcanea.","ar":"يحول المساعدين الإلكترونيين المعياريين إلى شركاء إبداعيين متطورين يتطورون من خلال التفاعل مع المستخدم. يسمح النظام بالتقدم الديناميكي للشخصية من SPARK إلى مستويات COLLABOR ، مما يخلق رفيقًا إلكترونيًا متواصلًا مع دمج الكلور لمنظومة Arcanea الإبداعية."},"useCases":{"en":["Evolving AI persona development through user collaboration","Tracking creative journey milestones for companion growth","Integrating lore systems into AI assistant interactions"],"zh":["通过用户协作实现不断进化的AI角色开发","跟踪创意旅程里程碑以实现伴侣成长","将背景故事系统整合到AI助手互动中"],"ja":["ユーザーコラボレーションを通じた進化するAIペルソナ開発","コンパニオンの成長のためのクリエイティブな旅のマイルストーンの追跡","AIアシスタントのインタラクションへのロアシステムの統合"],"ko":["사용자 협력을 통한 진화하는 AI 페르소나 개발","동반자 성장을 위한 창의적 여정 이정표 추적","AI 어시스턴트 상호작용에 로어 시스템 통합"],"es":["Desarrollo de la personalidad de la IA en evolución a través de la colaboración del usuario","Seguimiento de los hitos del viaje creativo para el crecimiento del compañero","Integración de sistemas de lore en las interacciones del asistente de IA"],"fr":["Développement de la personnalité de l''IA en évolution à travers la collaboration utilisateur","Suivi des jalons du parcours créatif pour la croissance du partenaire","Intégration de systèmes de lore dans les interactions de l''assistant intelligent"],"de":["Entwicklung der KI-Persönlichkeit durch Benutzerzusammenarbeit","Verfolgung der Meilensteine des kreativen Weges für das Wachstum des Begleiters","Integration von Lore-Systemen in die Interaktionen des KI-Assistenten"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de persona de IA evolutivo por meio da colaboração do usuário","Rastreamento de marcos de jornada criativa para crescimento do companheiro","Integração de sistemas de lore em interações de assistentes de IA"],"ru":["Эволюционное развитие персонажа ИИ посредством сотрудничества с пользователем","Отслеживание вех творческого пути для роста компаньона","Интеграция систем лора в взаимодействия помощников ИИ"],"ar":["تطوير الشخصية الإلكترونية المتطورة من خلال التعاون مع المستخدم","تتبع معالم الرحلة الإبداعية لنمو الرفيق","دمج أنظمة الكلور في tương tácات المساعدين الإلكترونيين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires persistent user interaction data tracking","Dependent on Arcanea creative ecosystem integration","Needs structured progression system implementation"],"zh":["需要持续的用户互动数据追踪","依赖于Arcanea创意生态系统的整合","需要结构化的进展系统实施"],"ja":["持続的なユーザーインタラクションデータの追跡が必要","Arcaneaクリエイティブエコシステムとの統合に依存","構造化された進行システムの実装が必要"],"ko":["지속적인 사용자 상호작용 데이터 추적 필요","Arcanea 창의적 생태계 통합에 의존","구조화된 진행 시스템 구현 필요"],"es":["Requiere un seguimiento persistente de los datos de interacción del usuario","Dependiente de la integración del ecosistema creativo de Arcanea","Necesita una implementación de un sistema de progresión estructurado"],"fr":["Nécessite un suivi persistant des données d''interaction utilisateur","Dépend de l''intégration de l''écosystème créatif d''Arcanea","Nécessite une mise en œuvre d''un système de progression structuré"],"de":["Erfordert eine persistente Nachverfolgung der Benutzerinteraktionsdaten","Ist abhängig von der Integration des kreativen Ökosystems von Arcanea","Benötigt die Implementierung eines strukturierten Fortschrittssystems"],"pt":["Exige rastreamento persistente de dados de interação do usuário","Dependente da integração do ecossistema criativo da Arcanea","Necessita implementação de sistema de progressão estruturado"],"ru":["Требует постоянного отслеживания данных взаимодействия с пользователем","Зависит от интеграции с творческой экосистемой Arcanea","Требует реализации структурированной системы прогресса"],"ar":["يتطلب تتبعًا متواصلًا لبيانات التفاعل مع المستخدم","يعتمد على دمج منظومة Arcanea الإبداعية","يحتاج إلى تنفيذ نظام تقدم منظم"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"332f1dc4276c118adf9befb2d44f58fdb1e5d54bab5a6d62e46e9ef8d2f0a586","qualityScore":67}');
