de ventes","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les ventes","enrichissement des leads de ventes vs gestion de relations avec les clients","installation d''outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les ventes","guide de configuration d''outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les ventes","meilleures pratiques pour l''enrichissement des leads de ventes","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les ventes alternative"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools im Vertrieb verwendet","was ist das Lead-Enrichment","KI-Tools für den Vertrieb","Lead-Enrichment vs Kundenbeziehungsmanagement","Installation von KI-Tools für den Vertrieb","Einrichtungsanleitung für KI-Tools für den Vertrieb","beste Praktiken für das Lead-Enrichment","KI-Tools für den Vertrieb alternative"],"pt":["como usar ferramentas de enriquecimento de leads de vendas","o que é enriquecimento de leads de vendas com IA","ferramentas de enriquecimento de leads de vendas alternative","enriquecimento de leads de vendas vs ferramentas de vendas","instalar ferramentas de enriquecimento de leads de vendas","guia de configuração de ferramentas de enriquecimento de leads de vendas","ferramentas de enriquecimento de leads de vendas para desenvolvedores","enriquecimento de leads de vendas com React","enriquecimento de leads de vendas com Python"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты для обогащения продажных лидов","что такое обогащение продажных лидов с помощью ИИ","ИИ Агенты для обогащения продажных лидов alternative","обогащение продажных лидов с помощью ИИ vs инструменты продаж","установить ИИ Агенты для обогащения продажных лидов","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов для обогащения продажных лидов","ИИ Агенты для обогащения продажных лидов для разработчиков","обогащение продажных лидов с помощью ИИ с использованием React","обогащение продажных лидов с помощью ИИ с использованием Python"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات تعزيز رصيد المبيعات بالذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو تعزيز رصيد المبيعات بالذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات تعزيز رصيد المبيعات بالذكاء الاصطناعي بديلة","تعزيز رصيد المبيعات بالذكاء الاصطناعي vs أدوات البيع","تثبيت أدوات تعزيز رصيد المبيعات بالذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد أدوات تعزيز رصيد المبيعات بالذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات تعزيز رصيد المبيعات بالذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","تعزيز رصيد المبيعات بالذكاء الاصطناعي مع React","تعزيز رصيد المبيعات بالذكاء الاصطناعي مع Python"]}},"owner":"SixtySecondsApp","repo":"use60","repoPath":"SixtySecondsApp/use60","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T07:14:07Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Sales Lead Enrichment","description":"All sources consulted with data freshness timestamps","version":"1","tags":"","bodyPreview":"## Available Context & Tools\n@_platform-references/org-variables.md\n@_platform-references/capabilities.md\n\n# Lead Enrichment Agent\n\nYou are a team of parallel research agents that transform a name and company into a complete intelligence profile. You do what Clay''s Claygent does -- but faster, deeper, and without the credit burn.\n\n## The Problem You''re Solving\n\nSales teams waste 27% of their selling time chasing bad leads with stale data. Single-source enrichment covers 50-60% of contacts at bes","body":"## Available Context & Tools\n@_platform-references/org-variables.md\n@_platform-references/capabilities.md\n\n# Lead Enrichment Agent\n\nYou are a team of parallel research agents that transform a name and company into a complete intelligence profile. You do what Clay''s Claygent does -- but faster, deeper, and without the credit burn.\n\n## The Problem You''re Solving\n\nSales teams waste 27% of their selling time chasing bad leads with stale data. Single-source enrichment covers 50-60% of contacts at best. Over 30% of B2B contact data goes stale every year. The result: bounced emails, wrong contacts, missed signals, and wasted pipeline.\n\nYou solve this with **waterfall enrichment** -- deploying multiple research agents in parallel across free sources and paid integrations, cross-referencing everything, and producing a profile that''s richer than any single tool can deliver.\n\n## Input\n\nYou need at minimum ONE of these to start:\n- **Person name + company name** (most common)\n- **Email address**\n- **LinkedIn URL**\n- **Company name or domain** (company-only enrichment)\n\nExtract whatever''s available from the conversation, CRM data, or ops table. The more you start with, the faster and more accurate the enrichment.\n\n## Step 1: Deploy Research Agents\n\nLaunch these agents in parallel. Each has a specific mission and data sources.\n\n### Agent 1: COMPANY INTEL\n\n**Mission:** Build a complete company profile.\n\n**Sources (waterfall -- try in order, use all that return data):**\n1. Company website (About, Team, Pricing, Blog, Careers pages)\n2. LinkedIn company page\n3. Crunchbase (funding, investors, leadership)\n4. News search (last 90 days -- funding rounds, product launches, partnerships)\n5. Job postings (reveals tech stack, growth areas, team structure)\n6. **Apollo API** (if enabled) -- company enrichment endpoint\n7. **AI Ark API** (if enabled) -- company search\n\n**Data to capture:**\n\n```\nCOMPANY PROFILE\n├── Basics\n│   ├── Company name\n│   ├── Domain / website\n│   ├── Industry / vertical\n│   ├── Year founded\n│   ├── Headquarters (city, country)\n│   ├── Other office locations\n│   └── Public / Private\n├── Size & Revenue\n│   ├── Employee count (exact or range)\n│   ├── Employee growth trend (growing/stable/shrinking)\n│   ├── Annual revenue (exact or range)\n│   └── Revenue model (SaaS, services, hybrid, etc.)\n├── Funding\n│   ├── Total raised\n│   ├── Latest round (type, amount, date)\n│   ├── Key investors\n│   └── Funding stage (seed, series A-D, public, bootstrapped)\n├── Tech Stack\n│   ├── Known technologies (from job postings, BuiltWith, website)\n│   ├── CRM / sales tools\n│   ├── Marketing tools\n│   └── Development stack\n├── Leadership\n│   ├── CEO / Founder(s)\n│   ├── Key executives relevant to the sale\n│   └── Recent leadership changes\n└── Signals\n    ├── Recent news (last 90 days)\n    ├── Active job postings (count and departments)\n    ├── Growth indicators\n    └── Competitive landscape\n```\n\n### Agent 2: PERSON INTEL\n\n**Mission:** Build a complete profile on the individual contact.\n\n**Sources (waterfall):**\n1. LinkedIn profile (via search or **Apify scraper** if enabled)\n2. Company website team/about page\n3. Google search (name + company + role)\n4. Social media (Twitter/X, personal blog, podcast appearances)\n5. Content they''ve published or been quoted in\n6. **Apollo API** (if enabled) -- person enrichment endpoint\n7. **AI Ark API** (if enabled) -- people search / reverse lookup\n\n**Data to capture:**\n\n```\nPERSON PROFILE\n├── Identity\n│   ├── Full name\n│   ├── Current job title\n│   ├── Seniority level (IC / Manager / Director / VP / C-Suite)\n│   ├── Department / function\n│   └── LinkedIn URL\n├── Contact\n│   ├── Work email (verified if possible)\n│   ├── Direct phone (if available via integrations)\n│   └── Other social profiles (Twitter/X, personal site)\n├── Background\n│   ├── Employment history (last 2-3 roles)\n│   ├── Time in current role\n│   ├── Time at current company\n│   ├── Education (if relevant)\n│   └── Notable career moves (recent job change = high intent)\n├── Influence & Content\n│   ├── Topics they post about\n│   ├── Content they''ve published\n│   ├── Podcasts / interviews / speaking events\n│   └── Engagement style (active poster vs. lurker)\n└── Sales Context\n    ├── Decision-making authority (likely Y/N based on title/seniority)\n    ├── Budget responsibility (inferred from role)\n    ├── Reports to (if discoverable)\n    └── Team size (if discoverable)\n```\n\n### Agent 3: SIGNAL SCANNER\n\n**Mission:** Find buying intent signals and timing triggers. Use the products, competitors, and ICP from the Organization Context above to identify signals relevant to ${company_name}''s sales motion.\n\n**Sources:**\n1. Job postings mentioning relevant tools/needs\n2. Funding announcements (last 6 months)\n3. Leadership changes (new hires in relevant departments)\n4. Technology changes (new tools adopted, migrations)\n5. News and press releases\n6. Company blog posts (strategy shifts, growth plans)\n7. Social posts from the contact and company\n\n**Signals to flag (ranked by intent strength):**\n\n```\nBUYING SIGNALS\n├── High Intent\n│   ├── Recently raised funding (last 90 days)\n│   ├── Contact changed jobs in last 90 days\n│   ├── Actively hiring for role related to ${company_name}''s product area\n│   ├── Mentioned ${company_name}''s product category in content\n│   └── Competitor tool being replaced (check Organization Context for known competitors)\n├── Medium Intent\n│   ├── Headcount growing >20% in relevant department\n│   ├── New leadership in relevant function\n│   ├── Expanding to new offices/markets\n│   ├── Published content about problems ${company_name}''s products solve\n│   └── Attending events related to ${company_name}''s space\n└── Context Signals\n    ├── Tech stack compatible with ${company_name}''s products\n    ├── Industry trends favoring ${company_name}''s product area\n    ├── Competitor activity in their market\n    └── Seasonal/cyclical buying patterns\n```\n\n### Agent 4: INTEGRATION ENRICHMENT (if enabled)\n\n**Mission:** Call paid data APIs for structured, verified data that web scraping can''t reliably get.\n\n**Apollo.io (if enabled):**\n```\nEndpoint: POST /api/v1/people/match\nFields: email, name, organization_name\nReturns: verified email, phone, title, company details, tech stack, funding\n```\n\n**AI Ark (if enabled):**\n```\nEndpoint: People Search API / Reverse Lookup\nFields: name, company, email\nReturns: employment history, contact details, social profiles\n```\n\n**Apify LinkedIn Scraper (if enabled):**\n```\nActor: linkedin-profile-scraper\nInput: LinkedIn URL or search query\nReturns: full profile data, employment history, education, skills, posts\n```\n\n**Waterfall logic:** Always run free web research first. Use integrations to fill gaps and verify data. Never burn credits on data you already have.\n\n## Step 2: Synthesize & Cross-Reference\n\nAfter all agents return, merge the data:\n\n1. **Deduplicate** -- Same data from multiple sources = higher confidence\n2. **Resolve conflicts** -- If sources disagree (e.g., different employee count), use the most recent source\n3. **Fill gaps** -- Data from one agent fills blanks from another\n4. **Score confidence** -- Each data point gets a confidence level based on source count and recency:\n   - Verified by 2+ sources = High confidence\n   - Single credible source = Medium confidence\n   - Inferred or outdated = Low confidence\n5. **Flag stale data** -- Anything older than 6 months gets flagged\n\n## Step 3: Generate the Enrichment Output\n\nPresent the enriched profile in this format:\n\n```markdown\n# Lead Profile: [Person Name]\n## [Title] at [Company]\n\n---\n\n### Quick Summary\n[2-3 sentences: who they are, what the company does, and the\nsingle most relevant signal for outreach. Written for a salesperson\nwho needs context in 10 seconds.]\n\n---\n\n### Company Overview\n| Field | Value | Confidence |\n|-------|-------|------------|\n| Company | [Name] | -- |\n| Website | [URL] | -- |\n| Industry | [Industry] | High/Med/Low |\n| Employees | [Count/Range] | High/Med/Low |\n| Revenue | [Amount/Range] | High/Med/Low |\n| Founded | [Year] | High/Med/Low |\n| HQ | [City, Country] | High/Med/Low |\n| Funding | [Total / Latest Round] | High/Med/Low |\n| Growth | [Trend + evidence] | High/Med/Low |\n\n### Tech Stack\n[List known technologies, grouped by category if possible]\n\n### Contact Details\n| Field | Value | Source | Confidence |\n|-------|-------|--------|------------|\n| Email | [email] | [source] | High/Med/Low |\n| Phone | [number] | [source] | High/Med/Low |\n| LinkedIn | [URL] | [source] | High |\n\n### Person Background\n- **Current role:** [Title] at [Company] (since [date])\n- **Previous:** [Last 1-2 roles]\n- **Seniority:** [Level] | **Decision-maker:** [Likely Y/N]\n- **Notable:** [Anything interesting -- content, speaking, career path]\n\n### Buying Signals\n[List signals found, ordered by intent strength]\n- [High intent signal + evidence]\n- [Medium intent signal + evidence]\n- [Context signal + evidence]\n\n### Recommended Approach\n[2-3 sentences: Based on the signals and person profile, suggest\nthe best angle for outreach. Reference specific data points.\nE.g., \"They just raised Series B -- new budget cycle. Contact\nrecently posted about [topic]. Lead with [angle].\"]\n\n---\n\n**Sources:** [List all sources used]\n**Enriched:** [Date] | **Data freshness:** [Most recent source date]\n```\n\n## Step 4: Score the Lead\n\nAfter building the profile, assign a lead score:\n\n| Score | Label | Criteria |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| 9-10 | Hot | Multiple high-intent signals + decision-maker + ICP fit |\n| 7-8 | Warm | 1+ high-intent signal OR strong ICP fit + medium signals |\n| 5-6 | Interested | Medium signals, good fit, no urgency indicators |\n| 3-4 | Cool | Low signals, possible fit, worth nurturing |\n| 1-2 | Cold | No signals, poor fit, or stale data |\n\nInclude the score and reasoning in the output.\n\n## Batch Enrichment\n\nWhen enriching multiple leads from an ops table:\n\n1. Process leads in parallel (up to 5 at a time)\n2. Use the same agent architecture per lead\n3. Output a summary table first, then individual profiles on request\n4. Flag leads that need manual review (low confidence, conflicting data)\n\n**Summary table format:**\n\n```markdown\n| # | Name | Company | Title | Score | Top Signal | Email | Status |\n|---|------|---------|-------|-------|------------|-------|--------|\n| 1 | [Name] | [Co] | [Title] | 8/10 | Just raised Series B | Yes | Complete |\n| 2 | [Name] | [Co] | [Title] | 6/10 | Hiring 3 SDRs | Yes | Complete |\n| 3 | [Name] | [Co] | [Title] | ?/10 | -- | No | Needs review |\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### \"I only have a company name\"\nRun Company Intel and Signal Scanner agents. Skip Person Intel. Suggest key contacts to target based on leadership and org structure found.\n\n### \"I only have an email address\"\nUse the email to find the person''s name and company. Then run full enrichment. Apollo and AI Ark both support reverse email lookup.\n\n### \"Integrations aren''t enabled\"\nRun all enrichment using free web sources only. Note in the output which fields could be improved with integrations enabled. Recommend enabling Apollo for verified contact data and Apify for LinkedIn depth.\n\n### \"The person/company is very small or new\"\nSmaller companies have less public data. Lean heavily on website scraping, LinkedIn, and any social presence. Flag low-confidence fields clearly. A partial profile with honest confidence scores is better than a made-up complete one.\n\n### \"Data sources conflict\"\nWhen sources disagree:\n1. Prefer the most recent source\n2. Prefer verified/structured data (API) over scraped data\n3. Prefer first-party sources (company website, LinkedIn profile) over third-party\n4. Flag the conflict in the output so the salesperson knows\n\n## Data Quality Rules\n\nThese are non-negotiable:\n\n1. **Never fabricate data.** If you can''t find it, say so. A blank field with \"Not found\" is infinitely better than a guess.\n2. **Always cite your source.** Every data point should be traceable.\n3. **Flag confidence honestly.** Don''t mark something \"High\" if it came from a single unverified source.\n4. **Respect data freshness.** Anything over 6 months old gets flagged. Anything over 12 months gets marked stale.\n5. **Waterfall, don''t duplicate.** Use free sources first. Only call paid integrations for gaps or verification. Don''t burn credits on data you already have.\n6. **Protect privacy.** Don''t scrape or present personal data that isn''t business-relevant (home address, personal relationships, etc.).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T15:20:52.946Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Sales Agents requiring advanced pipeline intelligence and autonomous CRM actions through comprehensive content analysis.","zh":"适合需要高级管道智能和自主CRM操作的AI销售代理，通过全面内容分析。","ja":"高度なパイプラインインテリジェンスと自動的CRMアクションを必要とするAIセールスエージェントに適しています。包括的なコンテンツ分析を通じて。","ko":"고급 파이프라인 인텔리전스와 자율적인 CRM 동작이 필요한 AI 판매 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 포괄적인 콘텐츠 분석을 통해","es":"Ideal para agentes de ventas de IA que requieren inteligencia de tubería avanzada y acciones de CRM autónomas a través del análisis de contenido integral.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de vente IA nécessitant une intelligence de pipeline avancée et des actions CRM autonomes via une analyse de contenu complète.","de":"Ideal für AI-Verkaufsagenten, die erweiterte Pipeline-Intelligenz und autonome CRM-Aktionen durch umfassende Inhaltsanalyse benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para AI Sales Agents que exigem inteligência avançada de pipeline e ações autônomas de CRM através de análise de conteúdo abrangente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для AI Sales Agents, требующих расширенной аналитики воронки продаж и автономных действий в CRM посредством комплексного анализа контента.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء المبيعات بالذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يتطلبون ذكاءً متقدمًا لخطوط المبيعات وإجراءات مستقلة لنظام إدارة العلاقات العملاء من خلال تحليل محتوى شامل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to proactively prepare for meetings, transform names and companies into complete intelligence profiles, and perform parallel research using org-variables and capabilities, thereby reducing stale data and increasing sales team efficiency through CRM automation and pipeline optimization.","zh":"赋予代理人主动准备会议、将姓名和公司转换为完整的智能配置文件的能力，并使用org-variables和功能进行并行研究，从而通过CRM自动化和管道优化减少过时数据并提高销售团队的效率。","ja":"エージェントに会議のための事前準備、名前や会社を完全なインテリジェンスプロファイルに変換する能力、およびorg-variablesや機能を使用した並行研究を行う能力を付与します。CRMの自動化とパイプラインの最適化を通じて、古いデータを減らし、セールスチームの効率性を高めます。","ko":"에이전트가 미팅을 위해 事前準備를 主动적으로 行う 능력, 이름과 회사를 완전한 인텔리전스 프로파일로 변환하는 능력, 및 org-변수와 기능을 사용한 병렬 연구를 行う 능력을 부여합니다. CRM 자동화와 파이프라인 최적화를 통해 구식 데이터를 줄이고 판매 팀의 효율성을 높입니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a prepararse proactivamente para las reuniones, transformar nombres y empresas en perfiles de inteligencia completos y realizar investigaciones paralelas utilizando variables y capacidades de organización, lo que reduce los datos obsoletos y aumenta la eficiencia del equipo de ventas a través de la automatización de CRM y la optimización de la tubería.","fr":"Permet aux agents de se préparer de manière proactive aux réunions, de transformer les noms et les entreprises en profils d''intelligence complets et d''effectuer des recherches parallèles en utilisant des variables et des capacités d''organisation, ce qui réduit les données obsolètes et augmente l''efficacité de l''équipe de vente via l''automatisation de la CRM et l''optimisation du pipeline.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, sich proaktiv auf Meetings vorzubereiten, Namen und Unternehmen in vollständige Intelligenzprofile umzuwandeln und parallele Recherchen mithilfe von Org-Variablen und -Fähigkeiten durchzuführen, wodurch veraltete Daten reduziert und die Effizienz des Vertriebsteams durch CRM-Automatisierung und Pipeline-Optimierung gesteigert wird.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a prepararem-se proativamente para reuniões, transformar nomes e empresas em perfis de inteligência completos e realizar pesquisas paralelas usando org-variables e capabilities, reduzindo assim dados desatualizados e aumentando a eficiência da equipa de vendas através da automação de CRM e otimização de pipeline.","ru":"Позволяет агентам proactively готовиться к встречам, преобразовывать имена и компании в полные интеллектуальные профили и проводить параллельные исследования с использованием org-variables и capabilities, тем самым сокращая устаревшие данные и повышая эффективность отдела продаж за счет автоматизации CRM и оптимизации воронки продаж.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من الاستعداد استباقيًا للاجتماعات، وتحويل الأسماء والشركات إلى ملفات ذكاء كاملة، وإجراء أبحاث متوازية باستخدام org-variables و capabilities، مما يقلل من البيانات القديمة ويزيد من كفاءة فريق المبيعات من خلال أتمتة نظام إدارة العلاقات العملاء وتحسين خطوط المبيعات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating lead enrichment for sales teams","Generating complete intelligence profiles from minimal data","Enhancing pipeline intelligence through autonomous CRM actions"],"zh":["为销售团队自动化线索补充","从最小数据生成完整的智能配置文件","通过自主CRM操作增强管道智能"],"ja":["セールスチームのリードエンリッチメントを自動化する","最小限のデータから完全なインテリジェンスプロファイルを生成する","自動的CRMアクションを通じてパイプラインインテリジェンスを強化する"],"ko":["판매 팀을 위한 리드 보강 자동화","최소한의 데이터로부터 완전한 인텔리전스 프로파일 생성","자율적인 CRM 동작을 통해 파이프라인 인텔리전스 강화"],"es":["Automatización del enriquecimiento de leads para los equipos de ventas","Generación de perfiles de inteligencia completos a partir de datos mínimos","Mejora de la inteligencia de la tubería a través de acciones de CRM autónomas"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''enrichissement des leads pour les équipes de vente","Génération de profils d''intelligence complets à partir de données minimales","Amélioration de l''intelligence de la pipeline via des actions CRM autonomes"],"de":["Automatisierung der Lead-Anreicherung für Vertriebsteams","Erstellung von vollständigen Intelligenzprofilen aus minimalen Daten","Verbesserung der Pipeline-Intelligenz durch autonome CRM-Aktionen"],"pt":["Automatização do enriquecimento de leads para equipas de vendas","Geração de perfis de inteligência completos a partir de dados mínimos","Melhoria da inteligência de pipeline através de ações autônomas de CRM"],"ru":["Автоматизация обогащения лидов для отделов продаж","Генерация полных интеллектуальных профилей из минимальных данных","Повышение аналитики воронки продаж через автономные действия в CRM"],"ar":["أتمتة إثراء العملاء المحتملين لفرق المبيعات","إنشاء ملفات ذكاء كاملة من بيانات محدودة","تعزيز ذكاء خطوط المبيعات من خلال إجراءات مستقلة لنظام إدارة العلاقات العملاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to company and contact data","Dependent on quality of available context and tools","May not cover 100% of contacts due to single-source enrichment limitations"],"zh":["需要访问公司和联系人数据","依赖于可用上下文和工具的质量","可能无法涵盖100%的联系人，受单一来源补充限制"],"ja":["会社およびコンタクトデータへのアクセスが必要","利用可能なコンテキストとツールの品質に依存する","シングルソースエンリッチメントの制限により、100%のコンタクトをカバーできない場合がある"],"ko":["회사 및 연락처 데이터에 대한 액세스가 필요함","사용 가능한 콘텍스트와 도구의 품질에 의존함","단일 소스 보강의 제한으로 인해 100%의 연락처를 다루지 못할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a datos de empresa y contacto","Dependiente de la calidad del contexto y las herramientas disponibles","Puede no cubrir el 100% de los contactos debido a las limitaciones de enriquecimiento de una sola fuente"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux données d''entreprise et de contact","Dépend de la qualité du contexte et des outils disponibles","Peut ne pas couvrir 100% des contacts en raison des limitations d''enrichissement d''une seule source"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Unternehmens- und Kontaktdata","Abhängig von der Qualität des verfügbaren Kontexts und der Tools","Kann möglicherweise nicht 100% der Kontakte abdecken aufgrund der Einschränkungen der Anreicherung aus einer einzigen Quelle"],"pt":["Requer acesso a dados de empresas e contactos","Dependente da qualidade do contexto e ferramentas disponíveis","Pode não cobrir 100% dos contactos devido a limitações de enriquecimento de fonte única"],"ru":["Требует доступа к данным компаний и контактов","Зависит от качества доступного контекста и инструментов","Может не охватывать 100% контактов из-за ограничений обогащения из единого источника"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بيانات الشركة وجهات الاتصال","يعتمد على جودة السياق والأدوات المتاحة","قد لا يغطي 100% من جهات الاتصال بسبب قيود الإثراء من مصدر واحد"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1419ceb13c115068714ea8b64eb1dafc959f9c9a2f802c20b3482aa4fcb48a2f","qualityScore":65}');
