r SKILL.md.","fr":"L''assistant de création de compétences d''Agent Zero vous guide à travers la création de nouvelles compétences qui suivent la norme SKILL.md.","de":"Der Fähigkeits-Assistent von Agent Zero führt Sie durch die Erstellung neuer Fähigkeiten, die den SKILL.md-Standard erfüllen.","pt":"O Agent Zero AI permite criar habilidades personalizadas com o padrão SKILL.md. Siga nosso guia para começar","ru":"Agent Zero AI позволяет создавать пользовательские навыки по стандарту SKILL.md. Следуйте нашему руководству, чтобы начать","ar":"يسمح Agent Zero AI بإنشاء مهارات مخصصة بالمواصفات SKILL.md. اتبع دليلنا لبدء استخدام","en":"Agent Zero AI framework"},"definition":{"en":"Agent Zero AI framework"},"features":{"zh":["SKILL.md ","Name & Purpose","Trigger Patterns","Content Structure","Supporting Files"],"ja":["SKILL.md","Name & Purpose","Trigger Patterns","Content Structure","Supporting Files"],"ko":["SKILL.md "," "," "," "," "],"es":["Creación de habilidades personalizadas","Guía paso a paso para la creación de habilidades","Compatibilidad con el estándar SKILL.md","Soporte para scripts y plantillas","Creación de archivos SKILL.md"],"fr":["Création de compétences personnalisées","Guide étape par étape pour la création de compétences","Compatibilité avec la norme SKILL.md","Prise en charge de scripts et de modèles","Création de fichiers SKILL.md"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Fähigkeiten","Schritt-für-Schritt-Anleitung zur Erstellung von Fähigkeiten","Kompatibilität mit dem SKILL.md-Standard","Unterstützung für Skripte und Vorlagen","Erstellung von SKILL.md-Dateien"],"pt":["Crie habilidades personalizadas com o padrão SKILL.md","Defina nomes e propósitos para as habilidades","Configure padrões de disparo para ativar as habilidades","Estruture o conteúdo para as habilidades","Adicione arquivos de suporte como scripts e modelos","Siga um guia passo a passo para criar habilidades"],"ru":["Создайте пользовательские навыки по стандарту SKILL.md","Определите имена и цели для навыков","Настройте шаблоны срабатывания для активации навыков","Организуйте содержание для навыков","Добавьте вспомогательные файлы, такие как скрипты и шаблоны","Следуйте пошаговому руководству для создания навыков"],"ar":["أنشئ مهارات مخصصة بالمواصفات SKILL.md","حدد أسماء وأهداف للمهارات","اضبط أنماط التشغيل لتنشيط المهارات","هيكل المحتوى للمهارات","أضف الملفات المساعدة مثل البرامج النصية والقوالب","اتبع دليل خطوة بخطوة لإنشاء المهارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Agent Zero AI","SKILL.md","AI "," ","Name & Purpose","Trigger Patterns"],"ja":["Agent Zero AI","SKILL.md","AI","","Name & Purpose","Trigger Patterns"],"ko":["Agent Zero AI","SKILL.md","AI "," "," "," "],"es":["Agent Zero AI","creación de habilidades","SKILL.md","desarrollo de habilidades","asistente de creación de habilidades","competencias personalizadas"],"fr":["Agent Zero AI","création de compétences","SKILL.md","développement de compétences","assistant de création de compétences","compétences personnalisées"],"de":["Agent Zero AI","Erstellung von Fähigkeiten","SKILL.md","Entwicklung von Fähigkeiten","Fähigkeits-Assistent","benutzerdefinierte Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Agent Zero AI","criar habilidades","SKILL.md","desenvolvimento de habilidades","framework de IA","personalização de habilidades","guia de criação de habilidades","padrão SKILL.md","habilidades personalizadas"],"ru":["Agent Zero AI","создание навыков","SKILL.md","разработка навыков","фреймворк ИИ","настройка навыков","руководство по созданию навыков","стандарт SKILL.md","пользовательские навыки"],"ar":["Agent Zero AI","إنشاء المهارات","SKILL.md","تطوير المهارات","هيكل الذكاء الاصطناعي","تخصيص المهارات","دليل إنشاء المهارات","مواصفات SKILL.md","المهارات المخصصة"]}},"owner":"agent0ai","repo":"agent-zero","repoPath":"agent0ai/agent-zero","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.879Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-skill","description":"Wizard for creating new Agent Zero skills. Guides users through creating well-structured SKILL.md files. Use when users want to create custom skills.","version":"1.0.0","tags":["meta","wizard","creation","tutorial","skills"],"bodyPreview":"# Create Skill Wizard\n\nThis skill helps you create new Agent Zero skills that follow the SKILL.md standard.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nTo create a new skill, I''ll guide you through these steps:\n\n1. **Name & Purpose** - What should this skill do?\n2. **Trigger Patterns** - When should this skill activate?\n3. **Content Structure** - What instructions should the agent follow?\n4. **Supporting Files** - Any scripts or templates needed?\n\n## SKILL.md Format\n\nEvery skill needs a `SKILL.md` file with YAML frontmatt","body":"# Create Skill Wizard\n\nThis skill helps you create new Agent Zero skills that follow the SKILL.md standard.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nTo create a new skill, I''ll guide you through these steps:\n\n1. **Name & Purpose** - What should this skill do?\n2. **Trigger Patterns** - When should this skill activate?\n3. **Content Structure** - What instructions should the agent follow?\n4. **Supporting Files** - Any scripts or templates needed?\n\n## SKILL.md Format\n\nEvery skill needs a `SKILL.md` file with YAML frontmatter:\n\n```yaml\n---\nname: \"skill-name\"\ndescription: \"Clear description of what this skill does and when to use it\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nauthor: \"Your Name\"\ntags: [\"category1\", \"category2\"]\ntrigger_patterns:\n  - \"keyword1\"\n  - \"phrase that triggers this\"\n---\n\n# Skill Title\n\nYour skill instructions go here...\n```\n\n## Required Fields\n\n| Field | Description | Example |\n|-------|-------------|---------|\n| `name` | Unique identifier (lowercase, hyphens) | `\"code-review\"` |\n| `description` | When/why to use this skill | `\"Review code for quality and security issues\"` |\n\n## Optional Fields\n\n| Field | Description | Example |\n|-------|-------------|---------|\n| `version` | Semantic version | `\"1.0.0\"` |\n| `author` | Creator name | `\"Jane Developer\"` |\n| `tags` | Categorization keywords | `[\"review\", \"quality\"]` |\n| `trigger_patterns` | Words/phrases that activate skill | `[\"review\", \"check code\"]` |\n| `allowed_tools` | Tools this skill can use | `[\"code_execution\", \"web_search\"]` |\n\n## Skill Directory Structure\n\n```\n/a0/usr/skills/\n└── my-skill/\n   ├── SKILL.md           # Required: Main skill file\n   ├── scripts/           # Optional: Helper scripts\n   │   ├── helper.py\n   │   └── process.sh\n   ├── templates/         # Optional: Templates\n   │   └── output.md\n   └── docs/              # Optional: Additional docs\n      └── examples.md\n```\n\n## Writing Good Skill Instructions\n\n### Be Specific and Actionable\n\n```markdown\n# Good\nWhen reviewing code:\n1. Check for security vulnerabilities\n2. Verify error handling\n3. Assess test coverage\n\n# Bad\nReview the code and make it better.\n```\n\n### Include Examples\n\n```markdown\n## Example Usage\n\n**User**: \"Review my Python function for issues\"\n\n**Agent Response**:\n> I''ll review your function using the code review checklist:\n>\n> 1. **Security**: No user input validation detected\n> 2. **Error Handling**: Missing try-catch for file operations\n> 3. **Testing**: Function is testable but no tests found\n```\n\n### Provide Checklists\n\n```markdown\n## Review Checklist\n- [ ] Input validation present\n- [ ] Error handling complete\n- [ ] Tests included\n- [ ] Documentation updated\n```\n\n## Creating Your Skill: Step by Step\n\n### Step 1: Define Purpose\n\nAnswer these questions:\n- What problem does this skill solve?\n- When should the agent use it?\n- What''s the expected output?\n\n### Step 2: Choose a Name\n\n- Use lowercase letters and hyphens\n- Be descriptive but concise\n- Examples: `code-review`, `data-analysis`, `deploy-helper`\n\n### Step 3: Write Trigger Patterns\n\nList words/phrases that should activate this skill:\n\n```yaml\ntrigger_patterns:\n  - \"review\"\n  - \"check code\"\n  - \"code quality\"\n  - \"pull request\"\n```\n\n### Step 4: Structure Your Content\n\nOrganize with clear sections:\n\n```markdown\n# Skill Title\n\n## When to Use\nDescribe the trigger conditions\n\n## The Process\nStep-by-step instructions\n\n## Examples\nShow sample interactions\n\n## Tips\nAdditional guidance\n```\n\n### Step 5: Add Supporting Files (Optional)\n\nIf your skill needs scripts or templates:\n\n```bash\n# Create directory structure\nmkdir -p /a0/usr/skills/my-skill/{scripts,templates,docs}\n```\n\n## Example: Complete Skill\n\n```yaml\n---\nname: \"python-optimizer\"\ndescription: \"Optimize Python code for performance and readability. Use when asked to improve or optimize Python code.\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nauthor: \"Agent Zero Team\"\ntags: [\"python\", \"optimization\", \"performance\"]\ntrigger_patterns:\n  - \"optimize python\"\n  - \"improve performance\"\n  - \"make faster\"\n  - \"python optimization\"\n---\n\n# Python Optimizer\n\n## When to Use\nActivate when user asks to optimize, improve, or speed up Python code.\n\n## Optimization Process\n\n### Step 1: Profile First\nBefore optimizing, understand where time is spent:\n```python\nimport cProfile\ncProfile.run(''your_function()'')\n```\n\n### Step 2: Common Optimizations\n\n1. **Use List Comprehensions**\n   ```python\n   # Slow\n   result = []\n   for x in data:\n       result.append(x * 2)\n\n   # Fast\n   result = [x * 2 for x in data]\n   ```\n\n2. **Use Sets for Lookups**\n   ```python\n   # Slow: O(n)\n   if item in large_list:\n\n   # Fast: O(1)\n   if item in large_set:\n   ```\n\n3. **Use Generators for Large Data**\n   ```python\n   # Memory-heavy\n   data = [process(x) for x in huge_list]\n\n   # Memory-efficient\n   data = (process(x) for x in huge_list)\n   ```\n\n### Step 3: Verify Improvement\nAlways measure before and after:\n```python\nimport time\nstart = time.perf_counter()\n# code to measure\nelapsed = time.perf_counter() - start\nprint(f\"Took {elapsed:.4f} seconds\")\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n- Premature optimization\n- Optimizing without profiling\n- Sacrificing readability for tiny gains\n```\n\n## Skill Installation\n\n### Local Installation\n\n1. Create skill directory:\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p /a0/usr/skills/my-skill\n   ```\n\n2. Create SKILL.md:\n   ```bash\n   touch /a0/usr/skills/my-skill/SKILL.md\n   ```\n\n3. Add content and save\n\n4. Skills are automatically loaded on next agent initialization\n\n### Sharing Skills\n\nTo share skills with others:\n\n1. Create a GitHub repository\n2. Include the skill directory structure\n3. Add a README with installation instructions\n4. Users can copy to their `/a0/usr/skills/` directory\n\n## Testing Your Skill\n\nAfter creating a skill:\n\n1. Start a new conversation\n2. Use one of your trigger patterns\n3. Verify the agent follows your instructions\n4. Iterate and improve based on results"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:08:06.262Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing to create custom skills following the SKILL.md standard.","zh":"非常适合需要创建自定义技能的AI代理，且遵循SKILL.md标准。","ja":"SKILL.md標準に従ってカスタムスキルを作成する必要があるAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"SKILL.md 표준을 따르는 사용자 지정 스킬을 생성해야 하는 AI 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan crear habilidades personalizadas siguiendo el estándar SKILL.md.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de créer des compétences personnalisées suivant la norme SKILL.md.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die benutzerdefinierte Fähigkeiten nach dem SKILL.md-Standard erstellen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam criar habilidades personalizadas seguindo o padrão SKILL.md.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимо создавать пользовательские навыки, соответствующие стандарту SKILL.md.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل الإيضاح الذكية التي تحتاج إلى إنشاء مهارات مخصصة متوافقة مع معيار SKILL.md."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate new skills with structured content using YAML frontmatter, supporting files, and trigger patterns, while adhering to the SKILL.md format.","zh":"赋予代理生成具有结构化内容的新技能，使用YAML前置内容、支持文件和触发模式，同时遵循SKILL.md格式。","ja":"YAMLフロントマター、サポートファイル、トリガーパターンを使用して構造化されたコンテンツを持つ新しいスキルを生成することができ、SKILL.md形式に従っています。","ko":"YAML 프론트매터, 지원 파일 및 트리거 패턴을 사용하여 구조화된 콘텐츠가 포함된 새로운 스킬을 생성할 수 있으며, SKILL.md 형식을 따릅니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar nuevas habilidades con contenido estructurado utilizando frontmatter YAML, archivos de soporte y patrones de activación, mientras se ajusta al formato SKILL.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer de nouvelles compétences avec un contenu structuré en utilisant le frontmatter YAML, les fichiers de support et les modèles de déclenchement, tout en respectant le format SKILL.md.","de":"Ermöglich es Agents, neue Fähigkeiten mit strukturiertem Inhalt zu generieren, indem sie YAML-Frontmatter, Unterstützungsdateien und Auslösemuster verwenden, während sie dem SKILL.md-Format entsprechen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem novas habilidades com conteúdo estruturado usando frontmatter YAML, arquivos de suporte e padrões de disparo, enquanto seguem o formato SKILL.md.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать новые навыки со структурированным содержанием, используя YAML-заголовки, файлы поддержки и шаблоны триггеров, при этом соблюдая формат SKILL.md.","ar":"يمكن للوسائل الإيضاح الذكية توليد مهارات جديدة بمحتوى منظم باستخدام YAML وملفات داعمة وأنماط تشغيل، مع الالتزام bằng تنسيق SKILL.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating custom skills for specific tasks","Generating SKILL.md files with YAML frontmatter","Defining trigger patterns for skill activation"],"zh":["为特定任务创建自定义技能","使用YAML前置内容生成SKILL.md文件","为技能激活定义触发模式"],"ja":["特定タスク用のカスタムスキルを作成する","YAMLフロントマターを使用してSKILL.mdファイルを生成する","スキルアクティベーションのトリガーパターンを定義する"],"ko":["특정 작업을 위한 사용자 지정 스킬을 생성하는 것","YAML 프론트매터를 사용하여 SKILL.md 파일을 생성하는 것","스킬 활성화의 트리거 패턴을 정의하는 것"],"es":["Creación de habilidades personalizadas para tareas específicas","Generación de archivos SKILL.md con frontmatter YAML","Definición de patrones de activación para la activación de habilidades"],"fr":["Création de compétences personnalisées pour des tâches spécifiques","Génération de fichiers SKILL.md avec frontmatter YAML","Définition de modèles de déclenchement pour l''activation de compétences"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Fähigkeiten für spezifische Aufgaben","Generierung von SKILL.md-Dateien mit YAML-Frontmatter","Definition von Auslösemustern für die Aktivierung von Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Criação de habilidades personalizadas para tarefas específicas","Geração de arquivos SKILL.md com frontmatter YAML","Definição de padrões de disparo para ativação de habilidades"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских навыков для конкретных задач","Генерация файлов SKILL.md с YAML-заголовками","Определение шаблонов триггеров для активации навыков"],"ar":["إنشاء مهارات مخصصة لمهام محددة","توليد ملفات SKILL.md مع YAML","تحديد أنماط التشغيل لتفعيل المهارات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to SKILL.md standard","Needs supporting files and scripts for skill functionality"],"zh":["需要遵循SKILL.md标准","需要支持文件和脚本来实现技能功能"],"ja":["SKILL.md標準に従う必要がある","スキル機能を実現するためにサポートファイルとスクリプトが必要である"],"ko":["SKILL.md 표준을 따라야 함","스킬 기능을 구현하기 위해 지원 파일 및 스크립트가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere la adherencia al estándar SKILL.md","Necesita archivos y scripts de soporte para la funcionalidad de la habilidad"],"fr":["Nécessite le respect de la norme SKILL.md","Nécessite des fichiers et des scripts de support pour la fonctionnalité de la compétence"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des SKILL.md-Standards","Benötigt Unterstützungsdateien und -skripte für die Funktionalität der Fähigkeit"],"pt":["Exige aderência ao padrão SKILL.md","Necessita de arquivos e scripts de suporte para funcionalidade de habilidades"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения стандарта SKILL.md","Требует файлов и скриптов поддержки для функциональности навыков"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بمعيار SKILL.md","يحتاج إلى ملفات وبرامج داعمة للوظائف الإضافية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"55f81fc1d57546548d400d6e71470643bc64fc7bbe464ebf40609712bb43bc0c","qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Galaxy-Dawn/claude-scholar/ui-ux-pro-max', 'community', 'Galaxy-Dawn', 'claude-scholar', 'Galaxy-Dawn/claude-scholar', 'ui-ux-pro-max', 0, 0, 65, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.880Z', '2026-03-02T02:08:14.055Z', 'd34ca9a7ec3104f60ae1cfabccb6bfa7f0a62e6c52cfe26327756a13cbeaab70', '{"id":"Galaxy-Dawn/claude-scholar/ui-ux-pro-max","name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":{"zh":"ui-ux-pro-max是一种综合的Claude Code配置，用于数据科学、AI研究和学术写作，能够简化整个研究工作流程","ja":"ui-ux-pro-maxは、データサイエンス、AI研究、学術論文執筆のための包括的なClaude Code構成であり、研究のワークフローを一元化することができます","ko":"ui-ux-pro-max는 데이터 과학, AI 연구 및 학술 저술을 위한 종합적인 Claude Code 구성으로, 연구 워크플ロー 전체를 간소화할 수 있습니다","es":"ui-ux-pro-max es una configuración de Claude Code para investigación de IA y escritura académica, que permite optimizar el flujo de trabajo de investigación","fr":"ui-ux-pro-max est une configuration de Claude Code pour la recherche en IA et l''écriture académique, qui permet d''optimiser le flux de travail de recherche","de":"ui-ux-pro-max ist eine Claude-Code-Konfiguration für KI-Forschung und wissenschaftliches Schreiben, die den Forschungsworkflow optimiert","pt":"O ui-ux-pro-max é uma configuração abrangente para ciência de dados, pesquisa de IA e escrita acadêmica","ru":"ui-ux-pro-max - это комплексная конфигурация для 数据 науки, исследований ИИ и академического письма","ar":"ui-ux-pro-max هو تكوين شامل للعلوم البيانات و بحث الذكاء الاصطناعي و الكتابة الأكاديمية","en":"A comprehensive Claude Code configuration for data science, AI research, and academic writing. Streamline the complete research workflow—from idea to publication."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具ui-ux-pro-max","ja":"AIエージェントui-ux-pro-max","ko":"AI 에이전트 ui-ux-pro-max","es":"Herramientas de AI: ui-ux-pro-max para investigación","fr":"Outils d''IA: ui-ux-pro-max pour la recherche","de":"KI-Tools: ui-ux-pro-max für Forschung und Wissenschaft","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: ui-ux-pro-max para Pesquisa e Escrita ...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: ui-ux-pro-max для Научных Исследований и Акаде...","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: ui-ux-pro-max لبحوث العلوم و الكت...","en":"ui-ux-pro-max"},"description":{"zh":"ui-ux-pro-max是一种综合的Claude Code配置，用于数据科学、AI研究和学术写作，能够简化整个研究工作流程","ja":"ui-ux-pro-maxは、データサイエンス、AI研究、学術論文執筆のための包括的なClaude Code構成であり、研究のワークフローを一元化することができます","ko":"ui-ux-pro-max는 데이터 과학, AI 연구 및 학술 저술을 위한 종합적인 Claude Code 구성으로, 연구 워크플ロー 전체를 간소화할 수 있습니다","es":"ui-ux-pro-max es una configuración de Claude Code para investigación de IA y escritura académica, que permite optimizar el flujo de trabajo de investigación","fr":"ui-ux-pro-max est une configuration de Claude Code pour la recherche en IA et l''écriture académique, qui permet d''optimiser le flux de travail de recherche","de":"ui-ux-pro-max ist eine Claude-Code-Konfiguration für KI-Forschung und wissenschaftliches Schreiben, die den Forschungsworkflow optimiert","pt":"O ui-ux-pro-max é uma configuração abrangente para ciência de dados, pesquisa de IA e escrita acadêmica","ru":"ui-ux-pro-max - это комплексная конфигурация для 数据 науки, исследований ИИ и академического письма","ar":"ui-ux-pro-max هو تكوين شامل للعلوم البيانات و بحث الذكاء الاصطناعي و الكتابة الأكاديمية","en":"A comprehensive Claude Code configuration for data science, AI research, and academic writing. Streamline the complete research workflow—from idea to publica..."},"definition":{"en":"A comprehensive Claude Code configuration for data science, AI research, and academic writing. Streamline the complete research workflow—from idea to publication."},"features":{"zh":["综合的Claude Code配置","数据科学和AI研究工作流程优化","学术写作辅助","从想法到出版的高效流程","支持多种开发语言，如Python和Node.js"],"ja":["包括的なClaude Code構成","データサイエンスとAI研究のワークフロー最適化","学術論文執筆支援","アイデアから出版までの効率的なプロセス","PythonやNode.jsなどの多くの開発言語をサポート"],"ko":["종합적인 Claude Code 구성","데이터 과학 및 AI 연구 워크플ロー 최적화","학술 저술 지원","아이디어에서 출판까지의 효율적인 프로세스","Python, Node.js 등 여러 개발 언어 지원"],"es":["Configuración de Claude Code para investigación de IA","Optimización del flujo de trabajo de investigación","Soporte para ciencia de datos y escritura académica","Integración con herramientas de investigación","Mejora de la productividad y eficiencia"],"fr":["Configuration de Claude Code pour la recherche en IA","Optimisation du flux de travail de recherche","Prise en charge de la science des données et de l''écriture académique","Intégration avec des outils de recherche","Amélioration de la productivité et de l''efficacité"],"de":["Claude-Code-Konfiguration für KI-Forschung","Optimierung des Forschungsworkflows","Unterstützung für Data Science und wissenschaftliches Schreiben","Integration mit Forschungstools","Verbesserung der Produktivität und Effizienz"],"pt":["Configuração abrangente para ciência de dados","Suporte para pesquisa de IA e escrita acadêmica","Simplificação do fluxo de trabalho de pesquisa","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Otimização do processo de publicação"],"ru":["Комплексная конфигурация для данных науки","Поддержка исследований ИИ и академического письма","Упрощение рабочего процесса исследования","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Оптимизация процесса публикации"],"ar":["تكوين شامل للعلوم البيانات","دعم لبحث الذكاء الاصطناعي و الكتابة الأكاديمية","تبسيط تدفق العمل البحثي","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","تحسين عملية النشر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","数据科学工作流程","AI研究工具","学术写作辅助","Claude Code配置","Python开发","Node.js开发","如何使用ui-ux-pro-max","ui-ux-pro-max安装指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","データサイエンスワークフロー","AI研究ツール","学術論文執筆支援","Claude Code構成","Python開発","Node.js開発","ui-ux-pro-maxの使い方","ui-ux-pro-maxインストールガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","데이터 과학 워크플ロー","AI 연구 도구","학술 저술 지원","Claude Code 구성","Python 개발","Node.js 개발","ui-ux-pro-max 사용법","ui-ux-pro-max 설치 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI para investigación","configuración de Claude Code","ciencia de datos","escritura académica","optimización del flujo de trabajo","productividad y eficiencia","guias de instalación de ui-ux-pro-max","alternativas a ui-ux-pro-max"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour la recherche","configuration de Claude Code","science des données","écriture académique","optimisation du flux de travail","productivité et efficacité","guides d''installation de ui-ux-pro-max","alternatives à ui-ux-pro-max"],"de":["KI-Tools für Forschung","Claude-Code-Konfiguration","Data Science","wissenschaftliches Schreiben","Optimierung des Forschungsworkflows","Produktivität und Effizienz","Installationsanleitungen für ui-ux-pro-max","Alternativen zu ui-ux-pro-max"],"pt":["como usar ui-ux-pro-max","o que é ui-ux-pro-max","ferramentas de ia para pesquisa","ui-ux-pro-max alternativa","ui-ux-pro-max vs outras ferramentas","instalar ui-ux-pro-max","guias de configuração ui-ux-pro-max"],"ru":["как использовать ui-ux-pro-max","что такое ui-ux-pro-max","ИИ инструменты для исследования","ui-ux-pro-max альтернатива","ui-ux-pro-max vs другие инструменты","установить ui-ux-pro-max","руководства по конфигурации ui-ux-pro-max"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ui-ux-pro-max","ما هو ui-ux-pro-max","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للبحث","بديل ui-ux-pro-max","ui-ux-pro-max مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت ui-ux-pro-max","دليل تكوين ui-ux-pro-max"]}},"owner":"Galaxy-Dawn","repo":"claude-scholar","repoPath":"Galaxy-Dawn/claude-scholar","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.880Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"UI/UX design intelligence. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 9 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind, shadcn/ui). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient. Integrations: shadcn/ui MCP for component search and examples.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Designing new UI components or pages\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\n- Implementing acce","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Designing new UI components or pages\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\n- Implementing accessibility requirements\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Domain |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Accessibility | CRITICAL | `ux` |\n| 2 | Touch & Interaction | CRITICAL | `ux` |\n| 3 | Performance | HIGH | `ux` |\n| 4 | Layout & Responsive | HIGH | `ux` |\n| 5 | Typography & Color | MEDIUM | `typography`, `color` |\n| 6 | Animation | MEDIUM | `ux` |\n| 7 | Style Selection | MEDIUM | `style`, `product` |\n| 8 | Charts & Data | LOW | `chart` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Accessibility (CRITICAL)\n\n- `color-contrast` - Minimum 4.5:1 ratio for normal text\n- `focus-states` - Visible focus rings on interactive elements\n- `alt-text` - Descriptive alt text for meaningful images\n- `aria-labels` - aria-label for icon-only buttons\n- `keyboard-nav` - Tab order matches visual order\n- `form-labels` - Use label with for attribute\n\n### 2. Touch & Interaction (CRITICAL)\n\n- `touch-target-size` - Minimum 44x44px touch targets\n- `hover-vs-tap` - Use click/tap for primary interactions\n- `loading-buttons` - Disable button during async operations\n- `error-feedback` - Clear error messages near problem\n- `cursor-pointer` - Add cursor-pointer to clickable elements\n\n### 3. Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `image-optimization` - Use WebP, srcset, lazy loading\n- `reduced-motion` - Check prefers-reduced-motion\n- `content-jumping` - Reserve space for async content\n\n### 4. Layout & Responsive (HIGH)\n\n- `viewport-meta` - width=device-width initial-scale=1\n- `readable-font-size` - Minimum 16px body text on mobile\n- `horizontal-scroll` - Ensure content fits viewport width\n- `z-index-management` - Define z-index scale (10, 20, 30, 50)\n\n### 5. Typography & Color (MEDIUM)\n\n- `line-height` - Use 1.5-1.75 for body text\n- `line-length` - Limit to 65-75 characters per line\n- `font-pairing` - Match heading/body font personalities\n\n### 6. Animation (MEDIUM)\n\n- `duration-timing` - Use 150-300ms for micro-interactions\n- `transform-performance` - Use transform/opacity, not width/height\n- `loading-states` - Skeleton screens or spinners\n\n### 7. Style Selection (MEDIUM)\n\n- `style-match` - Match style to product type\n- `consistency` - Use same style across all pages\n- `no-emoji-icons` - Use SVG icons, not emojis\n\n### 8. Charts & Data (LOW)\n\n- `chart-type` - Match chart type to data type\n- `color-guidance` - Use accessible color palettes\n- `data-table` - Provide table alternative for accessibility\n\n## How to Use\n\nSearch specific domains using the CLI tool below.\n\n---\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\n```\n\n---\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\n\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\n\nExtract key information from user request:\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\n\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\n\n**Always start with `--design-system`** to get comprehensive recommendations with reasoning:\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<product_type> <industry> <keywords>\" --design-system [-p \"Project Name\"]\n```\n\nThis command:\n1. Searches 5 domains in parallel (product, style, color, landing, typography)\n2. Applies reasoning rules from `ui-reasoning.csv` to select best matches\n3. Returns complete design system: pattern, style, colors, typography, effects\n4. Includes anti-patterns to avoid\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\n```\n\n### Step 2b: Persist Design System (Master + Overrides Pattern)\n\nTo save the design system for **hierarchical retrieval across sessions**, add `--persist`:\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<query>\" --design-system --persist -p \"Project Name\"\n```\n\nThis creates:\n- `design-system/MASTER.md` — Global Source of Truth with all design rules\n- `design-system/pages/` — Folder for page-specific overrides\n\n**With page-specific override:**\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<query>\" --design-system --persist -p \"Project Name\" --page \"dashboard\"\n```\n\nThis also creates:\n- `design-system/pages/dashboard.md` — Page-specific deviations from Master\n\n**How hierarchical retrieval works:**\n1. When building a specific page (e.g., \"Checkout\"), first check `design-system/pages/checkout.md`\n2. If the page file exists, its rules **override** the Master file\n3. If not, use `design-system/MASTER.md` exclusively\n\n**Context-aware retrieval prompt:**\n```\nI am building the [Page Name] page. Please read design-system/MASTER.md.\nAlso check if design-system/pages/[page-name].md exists.\nIf the page file exists, prioritize its rules.\nIf not, use the Master rules exclusively.\nNow, generate the code...\n```\n\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\n\nAfter getting the design system, use domain searches to get additional details:\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\n```\n\n**When to use detailed searches:**\n\n| Need | Domain | Example |\n|------|--------|---------|\n| More style options | `style` | `--domain style \"glassmorphism dark\"` |\n| Chart recommendations | `chart` | `--domain chart \"real-time dashboard\"` |\n| UX best practices | `ux` | `--domain ux \"animation accessibility\"` |\n| Alternative fonts | `typography` | `--domain typography \"elegant luxury\"` |\n| Landing structure | `landing` | `--domain landing \"hero social-proof\"` |\n\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\n\nGet implementation-specific best practices. If user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`, `shadcn`, `jetpack-compose`\n\n---\n\n## Search Reference\n\n### Available Domains\n\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\n|--------|---------|------------------|\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\n| `react` | React/Next.js performance | waterfall, bundle, suspense, memo, rerender, cache |\n| `web` | Web interface guidelines | aria, focus, keyboard, semantic, virtualize |\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\n\n### Available Stacks\n\n| Stack | Focus |\n|-------|-------|\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\n| `shadcn` | shadcn/ui components, theming, forms, patterns |\n| `jetpack-compose` | Composables, Modifiers, State Hoisting, Recomposition |\n\n---\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Requirements\n- Product type: Beauty/Spa service\n- Style keywords: elegant, professional, soft\n- Industry: Beauty/Wellness\n- Stack: html-tailwind (default)\n\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service elegant\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\n```\n\n**Output:** Complete design system with pattern, style, colors, typography, effects, and anti-patterns.\n\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\n\n```bash\n# Get UX guidelines for animation and accessibility\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation accessibility\" --domain ux\n\n# Get alternative typography options if needed\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury serif\" --domain typography\n```\n\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive form\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\n**Then:** Synthesize design system + detailed searches and implement the design.\n\n---\n\n## Output Formats\n\nThe `--design-system` flag supports two output formats:\n\n```bash\n# ASCII box (default) - best for terminal display\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system\n\n# Markdown - best for documentation\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system -f markdown\n```\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Better Results\n\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\n\n---\n\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\n\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\n\n### Icons & Visual Elements\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\n\n### Interaction & Cursor\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\n\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\n\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\n\n### Visual Quality\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\n- [ ] Brand logos are correct (verified from Simple Icons)\n- [ ] Hover states don''t cause layout shift\n- [ ] Use theme colors directly (bg-primary) not var() wrapper\n\n### Interaction\n- [ ] All clickable elements have `cursor-pointer`\n- [ ] Hover states provide clear visual feedback\n- [ ] Transitions are smooth (150-300ms)\n- [ ] Focus states visible for keyboard navigation\n\n### Light/Dark Mode\n- [ ] Light mode text has sufficient contrast (4.5:1 minimum)\n- [ ] Glass/transparent elements visible in light mode\n- [ ] Borders visible in both modes\n- [ ] Test both modes before delivery\n\n### Layout\n- [ ] Floating elements have proper spacing from edges\n- [ ] No content hidden behind fixed navbars\n- [ ] Responsive at 375px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px\n- [ ] No horizontal scroll on mobile\n\n### Accessibility\n- [ ] All images have alt text\n- [ ] Form inputs have labels\n- [ ] Color is not the only indicator\n- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` respected\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:08:14.055Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Design-oriented Agents needing comprehensive UI/UX guidelines and data visualization capabilities for web and mobile applications.","zh":"非常适合需要全面 UI/UX 指南和数据可视化功能的面向设计的代理，尤其适用于网页和移动应用程序。","ja":"デザイン志向のエージェントが、包括的な UI/UX ガイドラインとウェブおよびモバイル アプリケーション向けのデータ可視化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"디자인 지향 에이전트가 웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션을 위한 종합적인 UI/UX 가이드라인과 데이터 시각화 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes orientados al diseño que necesitan directrices de UI/UX completas y capacidades de visualización de datos para aplicaciones web y móviles.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur la conception nécessitant des directives UI/UX complètes et des capacités de visualisation de données pour les applications Web et mobiles.","de":"Perfekt für designorientierte Agenten, die umfassende UI/UX-Richtlinien und Datenvisualisierungsfähigkeiten für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes orientados ao Design que necessitam de diretrizes abrangentes de UI/UX e capacidades de visualização de dados para aplicações web e móveis.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на дизайн, которым необходимы комплексные рекомендации по UI/UX и возможности визуализации данных для веб- и мобильных приложений.","ar":"مثالي للوكيلات التي تركز على التصميم التي تحتاج إلى إرشادات شاملة لتوافق واجهة المستخدم وتجربة المستخدم وقدرات تصور البيانات للتطبيقات الويب والجوال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create visually appealing and user-friendly interfaces using 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, and 57 font pairings, while adhering to 99 UX guidelines and utilizing 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks, all accessible through a searchable database with priority-based recommendations.","zh":"赋予代理创建视觉上吸引人和用户友好的接口的能力，使用 50+ 样式、97 色调板和 57 字体配对，同时遵循 99 个 UX 指南，并利用 25 种图表类型跨 9 个技术栈，所有这些都可以通过一个带有优先级推荐的可搜索数据库访问。","ja":"エージェントが、50 種類以上のスタイル、97 種類のカラーパレット、57 種類のフォントのペアを使用して、視覚的に魅力的なユーザーインターフェイスを作成できるようにし、99 の UX ガイドラインに従い、9 つのテクノロジースタックにわたる 25 種類のチャートタイプを利用し、優先度に基づいた推奨事項を備えた検索可能なデータベースからアクセスできます。","ko":"에이전트가 50개 이상의 스타일, 97개의 색상 팔레트, 57개의 폰트 페어를 사용하여 시각적으로 매력적이고 사용자 친화적인 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 99개의 UX 가이드라인을 따르며, 9개의 기술 스택에 걸친 25종류의 차트 유형을 활용하며, 우선순위 기반의 추천을 갖춘 검색 가능한 데이터베이스를 통해 모든 것을 액세스할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces visuales atractivas y fáciles de usar utilizando más de 50 estilos, 97 paletas de colores y 57 combinaciones de fuentes, mientras se adhieren a 99 directrices de UX y utilizan 25 tipos de gráficos en 9 pilas de tecnología, todo accesible a través de una base de datos searchable con recomendaciones basadas en prioridades.","fr":"Habilite les agents à créer des interfaces visuelles attrayantes et conviviales en utilisant plus de 50 styles, 97 palettes de couleurs et 57 appariements de polices, tout en respectant 99 directives d''UX et en utilisant 25 types de graphiques sur 9 piles de technologie, le tout accessible via une base de données searchable avec des recommandations basées sur les priorités.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, visuell ansprechende und benutzerfreundliche Schnittstellen zu erstellen, indem sie 50+ Stile, 97 Farbpaletten und 57 Schriftkombinationen verwenden, während sie sich an 99 UX-Richtlinien halten und 25 Chart-Typen über 9 Technologiestacks hinweg nutzen, alles über eine durchsuchbare Datenbank mit prioritätsbasierten Empfehlungen zugänglich.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar interfaces visualmente atraentes e amigáveis ao usuário, usando 50+ estilos, 97 paletas de cores e 57 combinações de fontes, enquanto adere a 99 diretrizes de UX e utiliza 25 tipos de gráficos em 9 pilhas de tecnologia, todos acessíveis por meio de um banco de dados pesquisável com recomendações baseadas em prioridade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать визуально привлекательные и удобные для пользователя интерфейсы, используя 50+ стилей, 97 цветовых палитр и 57 парных шрифтов, при этом соблюдая 99 рекомендаций по UX и используя 25 типов графиков в 9 технологических стеках, все доступные через поисковую базу данных с рекомендациями на основе приоритета.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيلات من إنشاء واجهات مستخدم جذابة وسهلة الاستخدام، باستخدام أكثر من 50 نمطًا و97 لوحة ألوان و57 زوجًا من الخطوط، مع اتباع 99 توجيهًا لتوافق واجهة المستخدم واستخدام 25 نوعًا من الرسوم البيانية عبر 9 مجموعات تقنية، وكلها يمكن الوصول إليها من خلال قاعدة بيانات قابلة للبحث مع توصيات بناءً على الأولوية."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing new UI components or pages with optimized color schemes and typography","Reviewing code for UX issues and implementing accessibility features","Building landing pages or dashboards with data-driven chart types and styles"],"zh":["使用优化的颜色方案和字体设计新的 UI 组件或页面","查看代码中的 UX 问题并实施无障碍功能","使用数据驱动的图表类型和样式构建登陆页面或仪表盘"],"ja":["最適化された色彩スキームとタイポグラフィを使用して新しい UI コンポーネントまたはページを設計する","コードの UX の問題をレビューし、アクセシビリティ機能を実装する","データ駆動のチャートタイプとスタイルを使用してランディングページまたはダッシュボードを構築する"],"ko":["최적화된 색상 스키마와 타이포그래피를 사용하여 새로운 UI 컴포넌트 또는 페이지를 설계합니다.","코드의 UX 문제를 검토하고 접근성 기능을 구현합니다.","데이터 주도형 차트 유형과 스타일을 사용하여 랜딩 페이지 또는 대시보드를 구축합니다."],"es":["Diseñar nuevos componentes de UI o páginas con esquemas de color optimizados y tipografía","Revisar el código para problemas de UX e implementar características de accesibilidad","Crear páginas de aterrizaje o paneles de control con tipos de gráficos y estilos impulsados por datos"],"fr":["Concevoir de nouveaux composants d''interface utilisateur ou des pages avec des schémas de couleur optimisés et une typographie","Examiner le code pour les problèmes d''UX et mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités d''accessibilité","Créer des pages de destination ou des tableaux de bord avec des types de graphiques et des styles impulsés par les données"],"de":["Neue UI-Komponenten oder Seiten mit optimierten Farbschemata und Typografie entwerfen","Code auf UX-Probleme überprüfen und Zugriffsmöglichkeiten implementieren","Landingpages oder Dashboards mit datengetriebenen Chart-Typen und Stilen erstellen"],"pt":["Projetar novos componentes de UI ou páginas com esquemas de cores e tipografia otimizados","Revisar código para problemas de UX e implementar recursos de acessibilidade","Construir páginas de destino ou painéis com tipos de gráficos e estilos impulsionados por dados"],"ru":["Проектировать новые компоненты UI или страницы с оптимизированными цветовыми схемами и типографией","Проверять код на проблемы UX и реализовывать функции доступности","Строить целевые страницы или панели с типами графиков и стилями, управляемыми данными"],"ar":["تصميم مكونات واجهة المستخدم الجديدة أو الصفحات مع مخططات الألوان والتنسيق المثالي","مراجعة الكود لمشاكل توافق واجهة المستخدم وتطبيق ميزات إمكانية الوصول","بناء صفحات الهبوط أو لوحات القيادة مع أنواع الرسوم البيانية والأشكال التي تعتمد على البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to a searchable database for design guidelines","Limited to web and mobile application design"],"zh":["需要访问可搜索的数据库以获取设计指南","仅限于网页和移动应用程序设计"],"ja":["デザイン ガイドラインにアクセスするための検索可能なデータベースへのアクセスが必要","ウェブおよびモバイル アプリケーションのデザインのみに限定されます"],"ko":["디자인 가이드라인에 액세스하기 위한 검색 가능한 데이터베이스에 액세스해야 함","웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션 디자인에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a una base de datos searchable para directrices de diseño","Limitado al diseño de aplicaciones web y móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à une base de données searchable pour les directives de conception","Limité à la conception d''applications Web et mobiles"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf eine durchsuchbare Datenbank für Designrichtlinien","Begrenzt auf das Design von Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer acesso a um banco de dados pesquisável para diretrizes de design","Limitado ao design de aplicações web e móvel"],"ru":["Требует доступа к поисковой базе данных для рекомендаций по дизайну","Ограничен дизайном веб- и мобильных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة بيانات قابلة للبحث لإرشادات التصميم","محدود بتصميم التطبيقات الويب والجوال"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d34ca9a7ec3104f60ae1cfabccb6bfa7f0a62e6c52cfe26327756a13cbeaab70","qualityScore":65}');
