-system","qu''est-ce que ros2-launch-system","alternatives à ros2-launch-system","ros2-launch-system vs autres systèmes de lancement","installation de ros2-launch-system","guide de configuration de ros2-launch-system"],"de":["wie man ros2-launch-system verwendet","was ist ros2-launch-system","alternativen zu ros2-launch-system","ros2-launch-system vs andere startsysteme","installation von ros2-launch-system","konfigurationsanleitung für ros2-launch-system"],"pt":["como usar ros2-launch-system","o que é ros2-launch-system","desenvolvimento de aplicações com inteligência reutilizável","alternativas para ros2-launch-system","ros2-launch-system vs outros agentes de IA","instalar ros2-launch-system","guia de configuração do ros2-launch-system"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент ros2-launch-system","что такое ИИ Агент ros2-launch-system","разработка приложений с переиспользуемой интеллект","альтернативы ИИ Агенту ros2-launch-system","ИИ Агент ros2-launch-system vs другие ИИ Агенты","установить ИИ Агент ros2-launch-system","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента ros2-launch-system"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكيل إيه آي ros2-launch-system","ما هو وكيل إيه آي ros2-launch-system","تطوير التطبيقات باستخدام الذكاء القابل لإعادة الاستخدام","بديل لوكيل إيه آي ros2-launch-system","وكيل إيه آي ros2-launch-system مقابل وكلاء إيه آي آخرين","تثبيت وكيل إيه آي ros2-launch-system","دليل إعداد وكيل إيه آي ros2-launch-system"]}},"owner":"mjunaidca","repo":"robolearn","repoPath":"mjunaidca/robolearn","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.897Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ros2-launch-system","description":"Generate ROS 2 Python launch files and multi-node system configurations for educational content. This skill should be used when creating lessons that teach launch file syntax, writing exercises involving multi-node startup, parameter configuration, or generating worked examples for robot system deployment.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# ROS 2 Launch System Skill\n\n**Purpose**: Generate accurate, educational ROS 2 Python launch files and multi-node configurations following official ROS 2 Humble patterns for the Physical AI textbook.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating lessons in Chapter 6 (Building Robot Systems)\n- Writing multi-node deployment exercises\n- Generating worked examples for system startup\n- Teaching parameter configuration and node composition\n- Chapter 7 capstone project integration\n\n## Live Documentation Access\n\n**CRITIC","body":"# ROS 2 Launch System Skill\n\n**Purpose**: Generate accurate, educational ROS 2 Python launch files and multi-node configurations following official ROS 2 Humble patterns for the Physical AI textbook.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating lessons in Chapter 6 (Building Robot Systems)\n- Writing multi-node deployment exercises\n- Generating worked examples for system startup\n- Teaching parameter configuration and node composition\n- Chapter 7 capstone project integration\n\n## Live Documentation Access\n\n**CRITICAL**: Before generating any code, fetch current ROS 2 documentation using Context7 MCP:\n\n```\nTool: mcp__context7__resolve-library-id\nlibraryName: \"ros2 launch\"\n\nThen:\nTool: mcp__context7__get-library-docs\ncontext7CompatibleLibraryID: [resolved ID]\ntopic: \"launch file python\"\n```\n\nThis ensures launch patterns match current ROS 2 Humble API.\n\n## Launch File Patterns\n\n### Basic Launch File (Canonical)\n\n```python\n# File: launch/robot_system.launch.py\n\nfrom launch import LaunchDescription\nfrom launch_ros.actions import Node\n\ndef generate_launch_description():\n    return LaunchDescription([\n        Node(\n            package=''my_robot_pkg'',\n            executable=''publisher_node'',\n            name=''sensor_publisher'',\n            output=''screen'',\n        ),\n        Node(\n            package=''my_robot_pkg'',\n            executable=''subscriber_node'',\n            name=''data_processor'',\n            output=''screen'',\n        ),\n    ])\n```\n\n### Launch File with Parameters\n\n```python\nfrom launch import LaunchDescription\nfrom launch_ros.actions import Node\n\ndef generate_launch_description():\n    return LaunchDescription([\n        Node(\n            package=''my_robot_pkg'',\n            executable=''configurable_node'',\n            name=''robot_controller'',\n            output=''screen'',\n            parameters=[{\n                ''robot_name'': ''my_robot'',\n                ''update_rate'': 10.0,\n                ''max_speed'': 1.5,\n                ''enabled_sensors'': [''lidar'', ''camera'', ''imu''],\n            }],\n        ),\n    ])\n```\n\n### Launch File with Parameter File (YAML)\n\n```python\nimport os\nfrom ament_index_python.packages import get_package_share_directory\nfrom launch import LaunchDescription\nfrom launch_ros.actions import Node\n\ndef generate_launch_description():\n    config = os.path.join(\n        get_package_share_directory(''my_robot_pkg''),\n        ''config'',\n        ''robot_params.yaml''\n    )\n\n    return LaunchDescription([\n        Node(\n            package=''my_robot_pkg'',\n            executable=''robot_node'',\n            name=''robot_controller'',\n            output=''screen'',\n            parameters=[config],\n        ),\n    ])\n```\n\n### Parameter File (YAML)\n\n```yaml\n# File: config/robot_params.yaml\nrobot_controller:\n  ros__parameters:\n    robot_name: \"physical_ai_bot\"\n    update_rate: 20.0\n    max_linear_speed: 2.0\n    max_angular_speed: 1.57\n    sensors:\n      lidar:\n        enabled: true\n        topic: \"/scan\"\n      camera:\n        enabled: true\n        topic: \"/image_raw\"\n```\n\n### Launch File with Arguments\n\n```python\nfrom launch import LaunchDescription\nfrom launch.actions import DeclareLaunchArgument\nfrom launch.substitutions import LaunchConfiguration\nfrom launch_ros.actions import Node\n\ndef generate_launch_description():\n    # Declare launch arguments\n    robot_name_arg = DeclareLaunchArgument(\n        ''robot_name'',\n        default_value=''default_robot'',\n        description=''Name of the robot''\n    )\n\n    sim_mode_arg = DeclareLaunchArgument(\n        ''sim_mode'',\n        default_value=''true'',\n        description=''Run in simulation mode''\n    )\n\n    return LaunchDescription([\n        robot_name_arg,\n        sim_mode_arg,\n        Node(\n            package=''my_robot_pkg'',\n            executable=''robot_node'',\n            name=''robot_controller'',\n            output=''screen'',\n            parameters=[{\n                ''robot_name'': LaunchConfiguration(''robot_name''),\n                ''simulation'': LaunchConfiguration(''sim_mode''),\n            }],\n        ),\n    ])\n```\n\n## Package Structure for Launch Files\n\n```\nmy_robot_pkg/\n├── my_robot_pkg/\n│   ├── __init__.py\n│   ├── publisher_node.py\n│   └── subscriber_node.py\n├── launch/\n│   ├── robot_system.launch.py\n│   └── debug_system.launch.py\n├── config/\n│   ├── robot_params.yaml\n│   └── debug_params.yaml\n├── package.xml\n├── setup.py\n└── setup.cfg\n```\n\n### setup.py (Essential Parts for Launch)\n\n```python\nfrom setuptools import setup\nimport os\nfrom glob import glob\n\npackage_name = ''my_robot_pkg''\n\nsetup(\n    name=package_name,\n    version=''0.1.0'',\n    packages=[package_name],\n    data_files=[\n        (''share/ament_index/resource_index/packages'',\n            [''resource/'' + package_name]),\n        (''share/'' + package_name, [''package.xml'']),\n        # Include launch files\n        (os.path.join(''share'', package_name, ''launch''),\n            glob(''launch/*.launch.py'')),\n        # Include config files\n        (os.path.join(''share'', package_name, ''config''),\n            glob(''config/*.yaml'')),\n    ],\n    install_requires=[''setuptools''],\n    entry_points={\n        ''console_scripts'': [\n            ''publisher_node = my_robot_pkg.publisher_node:main'',\n            ''subscriber_node = my_robot_pkg.subscriber_node:main'',\n        ],\n    },\n)\n```\n\n## Debugging Multi-Node Systems\n\n### Using ros2doctor\n\n```bash\n# Check system health\nros2 doctor\n\n# Verbose output\nros2 doctor --report\n```\n\n### Using rqt_graph\n\n```bash\n# Visualize node graph\nros2 run rqt_graph rqt_graph\n```\n\n### Logging Levels\n\n```python\n# In node code\nself.get_logger().debug(''Detailed debug info'')\nself.get_logger().info(''Normal operation'')\nself.get_logger().warn(''Warning condition'')\nself.get_logger().error(''Error occurred'')\nself.get_logger().fatal(''Fatal error'')\n```\n\n```bash\n# Set log level at runtime\nros2 run my_pkg my_node --ros-args --log-level debug\n```\n\n## Educational Requirements\n\n### Layer 1 (Manual Foundation)\n- Explain launch file structure and purpose\n- Walk through LaunchDescription components\n- Demonstrate parameter passing patterns\n\n### Layer 2 (AI Collaboration)\n- Generate launch files from system requirements\n- Debug multi-node communication issues with AI\n- Optimize node configuration (Three Roles INVISIBLE)\n\n### Layer 3 (Intelligence Design)\n- System architecture patterns\n- Configuration management strategies\n- Reusable launch file components\n\n### Layer 4 (Spec-Driven)\n- Design system from specification\n- Multi-node integration testing\n- Capstone project orchestration\n\n## Hardware Tier Compatibility\n\nAll launch files MUST work on:\n- **Tier 1**: Cloud ROS 2 (TheConstruct) with turtlesim\n- **Tier 2+**: Local ROS 2 Humble with physical robots\n\nLaunch commands:\n```bash\n# Build and source\ncd ~/ros2_ws\ncolcon build --packages-select my_robot_pkg\nsource install/setup.bash\n\n# Launch\nros2 launch my_robot_pkg robot_system.launch.py\n\n# Launch with arguments\nros2 launch my_robot_pkg robot_system.launch.py robot_name:=my_bot sim_mode:=false\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes to Prevent\n\n1. **Missing data_files in setup.py**: Launch files won''t be installed\n2. **Wrong path in get_package_share_directory**: Package name must match\n3. **Forgetting to rebuild**: Changes require `colcon build`\n4. **Parameter type mismatches**: YAML types must match node expectations\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n- **ros2-publisher-subscriber**: Nodes to launch\n- **ros2-service-pattern**: Service nodes in system\n- **ros2-custom-interfaces**: Interface packages as dependencies\n- **lesson-generator**: For full lesson structure\n\n## Authoritative Source\n\nAll patterns verified against:\n- https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Intermediate/Launch/Creating-Launch-Files.html\n- https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Beginner-Client-Libraries/Using-Parameters-In-A-Class-Python.html\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:11:21.949Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Robotics Agents needing advanced ROS 2 launch system configurations and Python script generation.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 ROS 2 启动系统配置和 Python 脚本生成的 Robotics Agents。","ja":"高度な ROS 2 起動システム構成と Python スクリプト生成を必要とする Robotics Agents に最適です。","ko":"고급 ROS 2 런치 시스템 구성 및 Python 스크립트 생성이 필요한 Robotics Agents에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de robótica que necesitan configuraciones avanzadas del sistema de lanzamiento ROS 2 y generación de scripts Python.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de robotique nécessitant des configurations avancées du système de lancement ROS 2 et la génération de scripts Python.","de":"Perfekt für Roboteragenten, die erweiterte ROS 2 Startsystemkonfigurationen und Python-Skriptgenerierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de robótica que necessitam de configurações avançadas do sistema de lançamento ROS 2 e geração de scripts Python.","ru":"Идеально для робототехнических агентов, которым требуются продвинутые конфигурации системы запуска ROS 2 и генерация скриптов Python.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الروبوتية الذين يحتاجون إلى تكوينات متقدمة لنظام إطلاق ROS 2 وتوليد البرامج النصية Python."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate accurate, educational ROS 2 Python launch files and multi-node configurations following official ROS 2 Humble patterns, utilizing Spec-Driven methodology and Reusable Intelligence for efficient robot system development.","zh":"赋能代理生成准确、具有教育意义的 ROS 2 Python 启动文件和多节点配置，遵循官方 ROS 2 Humble 模式，利用 Spec-Driven 方法和 Reusable Intelligence 实现高效的机器人系统开发。","ja":"公式の ROS 2 Humble パターンに従い、Spec-Driven 方法論と Reusable Intelligence を活用して、正確で教育的な ROS 2 Python 起動ファイルとマルチノード構成を生成し、効率的なロボットシステム開発を実現するようにエージェントを強化します。","ko":"공식 ROS 2 Humble 패턴을 따르고 Spec-Driven 방법론과 Reusable Intelligence를 활용하여 정확하고 교육적인 ROS 2 Python 런치 파일 및 다중 노드 구성을 생성함으로써 효율적인 로봇 시스템 개발을 위한 에이전트의 능력을 강화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar archivos de lanzamiento de Python ROS 2 precisos y educativos, y configuraciones de varios nodos siguiendo los patrones oficiales de ROS 2 Humble, utilizando la metodología Spec-Driven y la Inteligencia Reutilizable para un desarrollo eficiente de sistemas robóticos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des fichiers de lancement Python ROS 2 précis et éducatifs, et des configurations de plusieurs nœuds suivant les modèles officiels ROS 2 Humble, en utilisant la méthodologie Spec-Driven et l''Intelligence Réutilisable pour un développement efficace de systèmes robotiques.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, genaue, lehrreiche ROS 2 Python-Startdateien und Multi-Node-Konfigurationen zu generieren, die den offiziellen ROS 2 Humble-Mustern folgen, unter Verwendung der spezifikationsgesteuerten Methodik und der wiederverwendbaren Intelligenz für eine effiziente Entwicklung von Robotersystemen.","pt":"Habilita agentes a gerar arquivos de lançamento Python ROS 2 precisos e educacionais e configurações de multi-nó seguindo os padrões oficiais ROS 2 Humble, utilizando metodologia Dirigida por Especificações e Inteligência Reutilizável para desenvolvimento eficiente de sistemas robóticos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать точные, образовательные файлы запуска Python ROS 2 и конфигурации многоузловых систем, следующие официальным шаблонам ROS 2 Humble, используя методологию, управляемую спецификациями, и многократное использование интеллекта для эффективного развития робототехнических систем.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من توليد ملفات إطلاق Python ROS 2 الدقيقة والتعليمية وتكوينات متعدد العقد اتباعًا لأنماط ROS 2 Humble الرسمية، باستخدام منهجية محددة بالمواصفات والاستخبارات القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام من أجل تطوير نظم روبوتية فعالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating multi-node deployment exercises","Creating educational ROS 2 launch files","Teaching parameter configuration and node composition"],"zh":["生成多节点部署练习","创建教育用的 ROS 2 启动文件","教授参数配置和节点组成"],"ja":["マルチノード展開演習の生成","教育的な ROS 2 起動ファイルの作成","パラメータ設定とノード構成の指導"],"ko":["다중 노드 배포 연습 생성","교육용 ROS 2 런치 파일 생성","매개변수 구성 및 노드 구성 교육"],"es":["Generación de ejercicios de implementación de varios nodos","Creación de archivos de lanzamiento educativos ROS 2","Enseñanza de configuración de parámetros y composición de nodos"],"fr":["Génération d''exercices de déploiement de plusieurs nœuds","Création de fichiers de lancement éducatifs ROS 2","Enseignement de la configuration des paramètres et de la composition des nœuds"],"de":["Generierung von Übungen für die Bereitstellung mehrerer Knoten","Erstellung von lehrreichen ROS 2-Startdateien","Unterricht in Parameterkonfiguration und Knotenkomposition"],"pt":["Geração de exercícios de implantação de multi-nó","Criação de arquivos de lançamento ROS 2 educacionais","Ensino de configuração de parâmetros e composição de nós"],"ru":["Генерация упражнений по развертыванию многоузловых систем","Создание образовательных файлов запуска ROS 2","Обучение настройке параметров и составлению узлов"],"ar":["توليد تمارين لتركيب متعدد العقد","إنشاء ملفات إطلاق ROS 2 تعليمية","تعليم تكوين المعاملات وتركيب العقد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ROS 2 Humble compatibility","Limited to Python launch file generation","Specific to Physical AI textbook and Chapter 6-7 content"],"zh":["需要 ROS 2 Humble 兼容性","仅限于 Python 启动文件生成","特定于 Physical AI 教科书和第 6-7 章内容"],"ja":["ROS 2 Humble 互換性が必要","Python 起動ファイルの生成に限定","Physical AI 教科書および第6-7章の内容に特化"],"ko":["ROS 2 Humble 호환성 필요","Python 런치 파일 생성으로 제한됨","Physical AI 교재 및 6-7장 내용에 특화됨"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con ROS 2 Humble","Limitado a la generación de archivos de lanzamiento de Python","Específico para el libro de texto de Inteligencia Artificial Física y contenido de los capítulos 6-7"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec ROS 2 Humble","Limité à la génération de fichiers de lancement Python","Spécifique au manuel d''Intelligence Artificielle Physique et contenu des chapitres 6-7"],"de":["Erfordert ROS 2 Humble-Kompatibilität","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von Python-Startdateien","Spezifisch für das Lehrbuch Physikalische Künstliche Intelligenz und Inhalt der Kapitel 6-7"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com ROS 2 Humble","Limitado à geração de arquivos de lançamento Python","Específico para o livro didático de IA Física e conteúdo dos capítulos 6-7"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с ROS 2 Humble","Ограничен генерацией файлов запуска Python","Конкретно для учебника по физической ИИ и содержания глав 6-7"],"ar":["يتطلب التوافق مع ROS 2 Humble","محدود بتوليد ملفات إطلاق Python","محدد للكتاب المدرسي للذكاء الاصطناعي المادي ومحتوى الفصول 6-7"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1d79309c4e7e0f961c03bdf238a3cbcf0862abbd7056572c16d8fcd2f43438b1","qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('alex-tgk/saasquatch/ffmpeg', 'community', 'alex-tgk', 'saasquatch', 'alex-tgk/saasquatch', 'ffmpeg', 0, 0, 65, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.906Z', '2026-03-02T02:18:06.082Z', '6e597ecb0fbe9c1bb76549ce47060fcc4003a6514abffb2600142de216ad4936', '{"id":"alex-tgk/saasquatch/ffmpeg","name":"ffmpeg","description":{"zh":"SaaSQuatch是一个生产就绪的CLI工具，使用Fastify生成完整的微服务架构，支持ffmpeg","ja":"SaaSQuatchは、Fastifyを使って完全なマイクロサービスアーキテクチャを生成する、production-readyのCLIツールです。ffmpegに対応しています","ko":"SaaSQuatch는 Fastify를 사용하여 완전한 마이크로 서비스 아키텍처를 생성하는生产就绪의 CLI 도구입니다. ffmpeg를 지원합니다","es":"SaaSQuatch es una herramienta de línea de comandos que genera arquitecturas de microservicios completas con Fastify y ffmpeg","fr":"SaaSQuatch est un outil en ligne de commande qui génère des architectures de microservices complètes avec Fastify et ffmpeg","de":"SaaSQuatch ist ein Befehlszeilen-Tool, das vollständige Mikrodienst-Architekturen mit Fastify und ffmpeg generiert","pt":"SaaSQuatch é uma ferramenta de linha de comando que gera arquiteturas de microsserviços completas usando Fastify e ffmpeg","ru":"SaaSQuatch - это инструмент командной строки, который генерирует полные микросервисные архитектуры, используя Fastify и ffmpeg","ar":"SaaSQuatch هي أداة سطر أوامر ت动生成 هياكل микروسيرفيس كاملة باستخدام Fastify و ffmpeg","en":"SaaSQuatch - A production-ready CLI tool that generates complete microservices architectures using Fastify"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"ffmpeg AIエージェント：SaaSQuatch微服务架构工具","ja":"ffmpeg AIエージェント：SaaSQuatchマイクロサービスアーキテクチャツール","ko":"ffmpeg AI 에이전트: SaaSQuatch 마이크로 서비스 아키텍처 도구","es":"Herramientas de AI: ffmpeg para microservicios con Fastify","fr":"Outils d''IA : ffmpeg pour les microservices avec Fastify","de":"KI-Tools: ffmpeg für Mikrodienste mit Fastify","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: SaaSQuatch com ffmpeg","ru":"ИИ Агенты: SaaSQuatch с ffmpeg","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: SaaSQuatch مع ffmpeg","en":"ffmpeg"},"description":{"zh":"SaaSQuatch是一个生产就绪的CLI工具，使用Fastify生成完整的微服务架构，支持ffmpeg","ja":"SaaSQuatchは、Fastifyを使って完全なマイクロサービスアーキテクチャを生成する、production-readyのCLIツールです。ffmpegに対応しています","ko":"SaaSQuatch는 Fastify를 사용하여 완전한 마이크로 서비스 아키텍처를 생성하는生产就绪의 CLI 도구입니다. ffmpeg를 지원합니다","es":"SaaSQuatch es una herramienta de línea de comandos que genera arquitecturas de microservicios completas con Fastify y ffmpeg","fr":"SaaSQuatch est un outil en ligne de commande qui génère des architectures de microservices complètes avec Fastify et ffmpeg","de":"SaaSQuatch ist ein Befehlszeilen-Tool, das vollständige Mikrodienst-Architekturen mit Fastify und ffmpeg generiert","pt":"SaaSQuatch é uma ferramenta de linha de comando que gera arquiteturas de microsserviços completas usando Fastify e ffmpeg","ru":"SaaSQuatch - это инструмент командной строки, который генерирует полные микросервисные архитектуры, используя Fastify и ffmpeg","ar":"SaaSQuatch هي أداة سطر أوامر ت动生成 هياكل микروسيرفيس كاملة باستخدام Fastify و ffmpeg","en":"SaaSQuatch - A production-ready CLI tool that generates complete microservices architectures using Fastify"},"definition":{"en":"SaaSQuatch - A production-ready CLI tool that generates complete microservices architectures using Fastify"},"features":{"zh":["支持ffmpeg","使用Fastify生成微服务架构","生产就绪的CLI工具","支持微服务架构生成","使用SaaSQuatch生成完整的微服务架构"],"ja":["ffmpeg対応","Fastifyを使ってマイクロサービスアーキテクチャを生成","production-readyのCLIツール","マイクロサービスアーキテクチャ生成対応","SaaSQuatchを使って完全なマイクロサービスアーキテクチャを生成"],"ko":["ffmpeg 지원","Fastify를 사용하여 마이크로 서비스 아키텍처를 생성","생산就绪의 CLI 도구","마이크로 서비스 아키텍처 생성 지원","SaaSQuatch를 사용하여 완전한 마이크로 서비스 아키텍처를 생성"],"es":["Generación de arquitecturas de microservicios","Integración con Fastify","Procesamiento de video y audio con ffmpeg","Herramienta de línea de comandos","Arquitecturas de producción lista"],"fr":["Génération d''architectures de microservices","Intégration avec Fastify","Traitement de la vidéo et de l''audio avec ffmpeg","Outil en ligne de commande","Architectures de production prêtes"],"de":["Generierung von Mikrodienst-Architekturen","Integration mit Fastify","Verarbeitung von Video und Audio mit ffmpeg","Befehlszeilen-Tool","Produktionsreife Architekturen"],"pt":["Geração de arquiteturas de microsserviços","Uso de Fastify para criação de serviços","Integração com ffmpeg","Ferramenta de linha de comando","Criação de microsserviços completos"],"ru":["Генерация микросервисных архитектур","Использование Fastify для создания сервисов","Интеграция с ffmpeg","Инструмент командной строки","Создание полных микросервисов"],"ar":["إنشاء هياكل микروسيرفيس","استخدام Fastify لإنشاء الخدمات","التكامل مع ffmpeg","أداة سطر أوامر","إنشاء هياكل микروسيرفيس كاملة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ffmpeg AIエージェント","SaaSQuatch","微服务架构生成","Fastify","CLI工具","生产就绪","如何使用SaaSQuatch","SaaSQuatch替代品","SaaSQuatch安装"],"ja":["ffmpeg AIエージェント","SaaSQuatch","マイクロサービスアーキテクチャ生成","Fastify","CLIツール","production-ready","SaaSQuatchの使い方","SaaSQuatchの代替","SaaSQuatchのインストール"],"ko":["ffmpeg AI 에이전트","SaaSQuatch","마이크로 서비스 아키텍처 생성","Fastify","CLI 도구","생산就绪","SaaSQuatch 사용법","SaaSQuatch 대체","SaaSQuatch 설치"],"es":["cómo usar ffmpeg","qué es SaaSQuatch","alternativas a ffmpeg","ffmpeg vs libav","instalación de ffmpeg","guía de configuración de SaaSQuatch"],"fr":["comment utiliser ffmpeg","quoi est SaaSQuatch","alternatives à ffmpeg","ffmpeg vs libav","installation de ffmpeg","guide de configuration de SaaSQuatch"],"de":["wie man ffmpeg verwendet","was ist SaaSQuatch","Alternativen zu ffmpeg","ffmpeg vs libav","Installation von ffmpeg","Konfigurationsanleitung für SaaSQuatch"],"pt":["como usar SaaSQuatch","o que é SaaSQuatch","SaaSQuatch alternative","SaaSQuatch vs outros","instalar SaaSQuatch","guia de configuração do SaaSQuatch","ffmpeg para desenvolvedores","Fastify para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать SaaSQuatch","что такое SaaSQuatch","альтернативы SaaSQuatch","SaaSQuatch vs другие","установить SaaSQuatch","руководство по настройке SaaSQuatch","ffmpeg для разработчиков","Fastify для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام SaaSQuatch","ما هو SaaSQuatch","بديل SaaSQuatch","SaaSQuatch مقابل غيره","تثبيت SaaSQuatch","دليل إعداد SaaSQuatch","ffmpeg للمطورين","Fastify للمطورين"]}},"owner":"alex-tgk","repo":"saasquatch","repoPath":"alex-tgk/saasquatch","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.906Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ffmpeg","description":"Guide for using FFmpeg - a comprehensive multimedia framework for video/audio encoding, conversion, streaming, and filtering. Use when processing media files, converting formats, extracting audio, creating streams, applying filters, or optimizing video/audio quality.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# FFmpeg Skill\n\nFFmpeg is a comprehensive open-source multimedia framework that handles video, audio, and other multimedia files and streams. It provides command-line tools and libraries for recording, converting, and streaming audio and video.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Converting media files between formats (MP4, MKV, WebM, AVI, etc.)\n- Encoding/decoding video with different codecs (H.264, H.265, VP9, AV1)\n- Processing audio files (AAC, MP3, FLAC, Opus)\n- Live streaming","body":"# FFmpeg Skill\n\nFFmpeg is a comprehensive open-source multimedia framework that handles video, audio, and other multimedia files and streams. It provides command-line tools and libraries for recording, converting, and streaming audio and video.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Converting media files between formats (MP4, MKV, WebM, AVI, etc.)\n- Encoding/decoding video with different codecs (H.264, H.265, VP9, AV1)\n- Processing audio files (AAC, MP3, FLAC, Opus)\n- Live streaming to platforms (Twitch, YouTube, RTMP servers)\n- Creating HLS/DASH adaptive streams\n- Extracting audio from video files\n- Applying video/audio filters (scale, crop, denoise, volume)\n- Screen recording and capture\n- Optimizing video quality and file size\n- Batch processing media files\n- Analyzing media file properties\n\n## Core Components\n\n### Command-Line Tools\n\n**ffmpeg**: Primary tool for transcoding, conversion, and streaming\n**ffprobe**: Media analysis and inspection tool\n**ffplay**: Minimalist multimedia player for testing\n\n### Libraries\n\n- **libavcodec**: Encoding/decoding codecs\n- **libavformat**: Container formats and I/O\n- **libavfilter**: Audio/video filtering framework\n- **libavutil**: Utility functions\n- **libswscale**: Video scaling and color conversion\n- **libswresample**: Audio resampling and mixing\n\n## Common Video Codecs\n\n### Modern Codecs\n\n**H.264 (libx264)**: Most widely supported, excellent compression/quality balance\n- Best for: Universal compatibility, streaming, web video\n- Quality range: CRF 17-28 (lower = better quality)\n\n**H.265/HEVC (libx265)**: 25-50% better compression than H.264\n- Best for: 4K video, file size reduction\n- Slower encoding, limited browser support\n\n**VP9**: Royalty-free, WebM format\n- Best for: YouTube, open-source projects\n- Good quality/compression, Chrome/Firefox support\n\n**AV1 (libaom-av1, libsvtav1)**: Next-generation codec, best compression\n- Best for: Future-proofing, ultimate quality/size ratio\n- Very slow encoding (improving with SVT-AV1)\n\n### Legacy Codecs\n- MPEG-4 (Xvid/DivX)\n- MPEG-2\n- VP8\n\n## Common Audio Codecs\n\n**AAC**: Industry standard, excellent quality\n**MP3**: Universal compatibility, good quality\n**Opus**: Best quality at low bitrates, ideal for voice/streaming\n**FLAC**: Lossless compression, archival quality\n**Vorbis**: Open-source, good quality\n**AC-3/DTS**: Surround sound formats\n\n## Container Formats\n\n**MP4**: Universal compatibility, streaming-friendly\n**MKV (Matroska)**: Feature-rich, supports multiple tracks/subtitles\n**WebM**: Web-optimized (VP8/VP9 + Vorbis/Opus)\n**AVI**: Legacy format, broad compatibility\n**MOV**: Apple QuickTime format\n**TS**: Transport stream for broadcasting\n**FLV**: Flash video (legacy streaming)\n\n## Basic Operations\n\n### Format Conversion\n\nSimple format conversion without re-encoding:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mkv -c copy output.mp4\n```\n\nConvert with specific codecs:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.avi -c:v libx264 -c:a aac output.mp4\n```\n\n### Quality-Based Encoding (CRF)\n\nConstant Rate Factor - best for quality-focused encoding:\n\n```bash\n# H.264 encoding (CRF 23 = default, 17-28 recommended range)\nffmpeg -i input.mkv -c:v libx264 -preset slow -crf 22 -c:a copy output.mp4\n\n# H.265 encoding (higher compression)\nffmpeg -i input.mkv -c:v libx265 -preset medium -crf 24 -c:a copy output.mp4\n\n# VP9 encoding (WebM)\nffmpeg -i input.mkv -c:v libvpx-vp9 -crf 30 -b:v 0 -c:a libopus output.webm\n```\n\n**CRF Scale:**\n- 0 = Lossless (huge file size)\n- 17-18 = Visually lossless\n- 20-23 = High quality (recommended)\n- 24-28 = Medium quality\n- 30+ = Low quality\n- 51 = Worst quality\n\n**Presets** (speed vs compression):\n- ultrafast, superfast, veryfast, faster, fast\n- medium (default)\n- slow, slower, veryslow (better compression)\n- placebo (not recommended - minimal gains)\n\n### Bitrate-Based Encoding (Two-Pass)\n\nFor targeting specific file sizes:\n\n```bash\n# Pass 1 (analysis)\nffmpeg -y -i input.mkv -c:v libx264 -b:v 2600k -pass 1 -an -f null /dev/null\n\n# Pass 2 (encoding)\nffmpeg -i input.mkv -c:v libx264 -b:v 2600k -pass 2 -c:a aac -b:a 128k output.mp4\n```\n\n### Audio Extraction\n\nExtract audio without re-encoding:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -vn -c:a copy audio.m4a\n```\n\nExtract and convert to MP3:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -vn -q:a 0 audio.mp3\n```\n\nExtract with specific bitrate:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -vn -c:a libmp3lame -b:a 192k audio.mp3\n```\n\n### Video Scaling/Resizing\n\nScale to specific dimensions:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf scale=1280:720 output.mp4\n```\n\nScale maintaining aspect ratio:\n```bash\n# Width 1280, height auto-calculated\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf scale=1280:-1 output.mp4\n\n# Height 720, width auto-calculated\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf scale=-1:720 output.mp4\n```\n\nScale to half resolution:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf scale=iw/2:ih/2 output.mp4\n```\n\n### Trimming/Cutting Video\n\nCut without re-encoding (fast but less precise):\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -ss 00:01:30 -to 00:03:00 -c copy output.mp4\n```\n\nCut with re-encoding (precise):\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -ss 00:01:30 -t 00:01:30 -c:v libx264 -c:a aac output.mp4\n```\n\nParameters:\n- `-ss`: Start time (HH:MM:SS or seconds)\n- `-to`: End time\n- `-t`: Duration (instead of end time)\n\n### Concatenation\n\n**Method 1: Concat demuxer (same codec/format)**\n\nCreate `concat.txt`:\n```\nfile ''input1.mp4''\nfile ''input2.mp4''\nfile ''input3.mp4''\n```\n\nRun:\n```bash\nffmpeg -f concat -safe 0 -i concat.txt -c copy output.mp4\n```\n\n**Method 2: Concat filter (different formats)**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input1.mp4 -i input2.mp4 -i input3.mp4 \\\n  -filter_complex \"[0:v][0:a][1:v][1:a][2:v][2:a]concat=n=3:v=1:a=1[v][a]\" \\\n  -map \"[v]\" -map \"[a]\" output.mp4\n```\n\n## Advanced Filtering\n\n### Video Filters\n\n**Multiple filters (chain with comma):**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"scale=1280:720,hqdn3d\" output.mp4\n```\n\n**Denoise:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf hqdn3d output.mp4\n```\n\n**Deinterlace:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf yadif output.mp4\n```\n\n**Crop:**\n```bash\n# Crop to 1280x720 from top-left (0,0)\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"crop=1280:720:0:0\" output.mp4\n\n# Auto-detect and remove black borders\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"cropdetect\" output.mp4\n```\n\n**Rotate:**\n```bash\n# Rotate 90 degrees clockwise\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"transpose=1\" output.mp4\n\n# Rotate 180 degrees\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"transpose=1,transpose=1\" output.mp4\n```\n\n**Watermark/Logo:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -i logo.png \\\n  -filter_complex \"overlay=10:10\" output.mp4\n```\n\n**Speed adjustment:**\n```bash\n# 2x speed\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"setpts=0.5*PTS\" -af \"atempo=2.0\" output.mp4\n\n# 0.5x speed (slow motion)\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"setpts=2.0*PTS\" -af \"atempo=0.5\" output.mp4\n```\n\n### Audio Filters\n\n**Volume adjustment:**\n```bash\n# Increase volume by 10dB\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -af \"volume=10dB\" output.mp4\n\n# Set to 50% volume\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -af \"volume=0.5\" output.mp4\n```\n\n**Normalize audio:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -af loudnorm output.mp4\n```\n\n**Crossfade between audio:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i audio1.mp3 -i audio2.mp3 \\\n  -filter_complex \"[0][1]acrossfade=d=5\" output.mp3\n```\n\n**Mix multiple audio tracks:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input1.mp3 -i input2.mp3 \\\n  -filter_complex \"[0:a][1:a]amix=inputs=2:duration=longest\" output.mp3\n```\n\n## Streaming\n\n### RTMP Streaming (Twitch/YouTube)\n\n**Basic stream:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -re -i input.mp4 -c:v libx264 -preset veryfast \\\n  -maxrate 3000k -bufsize 6000k -pix_fmt yuv420p -g 50 \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 128k -ar 44100 \\\n  -f flv rtmp://live.twitch.tv/app/YOUR_STREAM_KEY\n```\n\n**Screen capture + stream (Linux):**\n```bash\nffmpeg -f x11grab -s 1920x1080 -framerate 30 -i :0.0 \\\n  -f pulse -ac 2 -i default \\\n  -c:v libx264 -preset veryfast -tune zerolatency \\\n  -maxrate 2500k -bufsize 5000k -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 128k -ar 44100 \\\n  -f flv rtmp://live.twitch.tv/app/YOUR_STREAM_KEY\n```\n\n**Screen capture (Windows DirectShow):**\n```bash\nffmpeg -f dshow -i video=\"screen-capture-recorder\":audio=\"Stereo Mix\" \\\n  -c:v libx264 -preset ultrafast -tune zerolatency \\\n  -maxrate 750k -bufsize 3000k \\\n  -f flv rtmp://live.twitch.tv/app/YOUR_STREAM_KEY\n```\n\n**Important streaming parameters:**\n- `-re`: Read input at native frame rate (real-time)\n- `-tune zerolatency`: Optimize for low latency\n- `-g 50`: Keyframe every 50 frames (2 seconds @ 25fps)\n- `-maxrate`: Maximum bitrate\n- `-bufsize`: Rate control buffer (typically 2x maxrate)\n\n### HLS Streaming\n\nGenerate adaptive HLS stream:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 \\\n  -c:v libx264 -preset fast -crf 22 -g 48 -sc_threshold 0 \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 128k \\\n  -f hls -hls_time 6 -hls_playlist_type vod \\\n  -hls_segment_filename \"segment_%03d.ts\" \\\n  playlist.m3u8\n```\n\n**Multi-bitrate HLS:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 \\\n  -map 0:v -map 0:a -map 0:v -map 0:a \\\n  -c:v libx264 -crf 22 -c:a aac -b:a 128k \\\n  -b:v:0 2000k -s:v:0 1280x720 -b:v:1 5000k -s:v:1 1920x1080 \\\n  -var_stream_map \"v:0,a:0 v:1,a:1\" \\\n  -master_pl_name master.m3u8 \\\n  -f hls -hls_time 6 -hls_list_size 0 \\\n  stream_%v/index.m3u8\n```\n\n### UDP/RTP Streaming\n\n**UDP stream:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -re -i input.mp4 -c copy -f mpegts udp://192.168.1.100:1234\n```\n\n**RTP audio stream:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -re -i audio.mp3 -c:a libopus -f rtp rtp://192.168.1.100:5004\n```\n\n## Hardware Acceleration\n\n### NVIDIA NVENC\n\n```bash\n# H.264 with NVENC\nffmpeg -hwaccel cuda -i input.mp4 -c:v h264_nvenc -preset fast -crf 22 output.mp4\n\n# H.265 with NVENC\nffmpeg -hwaccel cuda -i input.mp4 -c:v hevc_nvenc -preset fast -crf 24 output.mp4\n```\n\n### Intel QuickSync (QSV)\n\n```bash\nffmpeg -hwaccel qsv -c:v h264_qsv -i input.mp4 \\\n  -c:v h264_qsv -preset fast -global_quality 22 output.mp4\n```\n\n### AMD VCE\n\n```bash\nffmpeg -hwaccel auto -i input.mp4 \\\n  -c:v h264_amf -quality balanced -rc cqp -qp 22 output.mp4\n```\n\n## Media Analysis\n\n### Inspect media file\n\n```bash\n# Detailed information\nffprobe -v quiet -print_format json -show_format -show_streams input.mp4\n\n# Human-readable format\nffprobe input.mp4\n\n# Get duration\nffprobe -v error -show_entries format=duration \\\n  -of default=noprint_wrappers=1:nokey=1 input.mp4\n\n# Get resolution\nffprobe -v error -select_streams v:0 \\\n  -show_entries stream=width,height \\\n  -of csv=s=x:p=0 input.mp4\n\n# Get bitrate\nffprobe -v error -show_entries format=bit_rate \\\n  -of default=noprint_wrappers=1:nokey=1 input.mp4\n```\n\n## Batch Processing\n\n### Bash loop for batch conversion\n\n```bash\n# Convert all MKV files to MP4\nfor file in *.mkv; do\n  ffmpeg -i \"$file\" -c:v libx264 -crf 22 -c:a aac \"${file%.mkv}.mp4\"\ndone\n\n# Resize all videos to 720p\nfor file in *.mp4; do\n  ffmpeg -i \"$file\" -vf scale=-1:720 \"720p_${file}\"\ndone\n```\n\n### Parallel processing with GNU Parallel\n\n```bash\n# Install: sudo apt-get install parallel\n\n# Process multiple files in parallel\nls *.mkv | parallel ffmpeg -i {} -c:v libx264 -crf 22 -c:a aac {.}.mp4\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Create GIF from video\n\n```bash\n# High quality GIF\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"fps=15,scale=640:-1:flags=lanczos,split[s0][s1];[s0]palettegen[p];[s1][p]paletteuse\" output.gif\n\n# Simple GIF\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"fps=10,scale=320:-1\" output.gif\n```\n\n### Extract frames as images\n\n```bash\n# Extract all frames\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 frame_%04d.png\n\n# Extract 1 frame per second\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf fps=1 frame_%04d.png\n\n# Extract single frame at 5 seconds\nffmpeg -ss 00:00:05 -i input.mp4 -frames:v 1 frame.png\n```\n\n### Create video from images\n\n```bash\n# From numbered images\nffmpeg -framerate 30 -i frame_%04d.png -c:v libx264 -crf 22 -pix_fmt yuv420p output.mp4\n\n# From pattern\nffmpeg -framerate 24 -pattern_type glob -i ''*.png'' -c:v libx264 output.mp4\n```\n\n### Add subtitles\n\n```bash\n# Burn subtitles into video\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -vf subtitles=subtitles.srt output.mp4\n\n# Embed subtitle track (soft subtitles)\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -i subtitles.srt -c copy -c:s mov_text output.mp4\n```\n\n### Remove audio\n\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -an -c:v copy output.mp4\n```\n\n### Replace audio\n\n```bash\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -i audio.mp3 -c:v copy -c:a aac -map 0:v:0 -map 1:a:0 output.mp4\n```\n\n### Create thumbnail\n\n```bash\n# Single thumbnail at 5 seconds\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -ss 00:00:05 -vframes 1 -vf scale=320:-1 thumb.jpg\n\n# Multiple thumbnails (one per minute)\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf fps=1/60,scale=320:-1 thumb_%03d.jpg\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### Speed vs Quality Trade-offs\n\n**Fast encoding (real-time processing):**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -c:v libx264 -preset ultrafast -crf 23 output.mp4\n```\n\n**Balanced (default):**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -c:v libx264 -preset medium -crf 22 output.mp4\n```\n\n**High quality (archival):**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -c:v libx264 -preset veryslow -crf 18 output.mp4\n```\n\n### Multi-threading\n\nFFmpeg automatically uses multiple CPU cores. Override with:\n```bash\nffmpeg -threads 8 -i input.mp4 -c:v libx264 output.mp4\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use CRF for quality-focused encoding** - Better than bitrate for most use cases\n2. **Two-pass for size targets** - When file size is critical\n3. **Copy streams when possible** - Use `-c copy` to avoid re-encoding\n4. **Choose appropriate presets** - Balance speed vs compression\n5. **Match output to source** - Don''t upscale or use higher quality than source\n6. **Test short clips first** - Verify settings before batch processing\n7. **Hardware acceleration** - Use GPU encoding for faster processing\n8. **Audio matters** - Don''t neglect audio codec/bitrate choices\n9. **Use filters efficiently** - Chain multiple filters with commas\n10. **Verify output** - Always check quality after encoding\n\n## Common Parameters Reference\n\n### Video Parameters\n- `-c:v` or `-vcodec`: Video codec\n- `-b:v`: Video bitrate (e.g., `2M`, `2500k`)\n- `-crf`: Constant Rate Factor (0-51)\n- `-preset`: Encoding speed/quality (ultrafast to veryslow)\n- `-tune`: Encoding optimization (film, animation, zerolatency)\n- `-pix_fmt`: Pixel format (yuv420p for compatibility)\n- `-r`: Frame rate (e.g., `30`, `60`)\n- `-g`: GOP size (keyframe interval)\n\n### Audio Parameters\n- `-c:a` or `-acodec`: Audio codec\n- `-b:a`: Audio bitrate (e.g., `128k`, `192k`)\n- `-ar`: Audio sample rate (e.g., `44100`, `48000`)\n- `-ac`: Audio channels (1=mono, 2=stereo)\n- `-q:a`: Audio quality for VBR (0=best for MP3)\n\n### General Parameters\n- `-i`: Input file\n- `-y`: Overwrite output without asking\n- `-n`: Never overwrite output\n- `-t`: Duration to encode\n- `-ss`: Start time offset\n- `-to`: End time\n- `-vf`: Video filters\n- `-af`: Audio filters\n- `-map`: Stream selection\n- `-metadata`: Set metadata\n- `-f`: Force format\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### \"Unknown encoder\" errors\nInstall codec libraries:\n```bash\n# Ubuntu/Debian\nsudo apt-get install ffmpeg libx264-dev libx265-dev libvpx-dev\n\n# Check available encoders\nffmpeg -encoders\n```\n\n### Output compatibility issues\nUse safe defaults for maximum compatibility:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mkv -c:v libx264 -profile:v high -level 4.0 \\\n  -pix_fmt yuv420p -c:a aac -b:a 128k output.mp4\n```\n\n### Performance issues\n- Use hardware acceleration (`-hwaccel`)\n- Choose faster presets (`-preset fast`)\n- Reduce resolution with scale filter\n- Use multiple threads explicitly\n\n### Quality issues\n- Lower CRF value (18-22 for high quality)\n- Use slower preset (`-preset slow`)\n- Use two-pass encoding for better bitrate distribution\n- Match or exceed source bitrate\n\n## Resources\n\n- Official Documentation: https://ffmpeg.org/documentation.html\n- FFmpeg Wiki: https://trac.ffmpeg.org/\n- Codec Guides: https://trac.ffmpeg.org/wiki/Encode\n- Filter Documentation: https://ffmpeg.org/ffmpeg-filters.html\n- GitHub Repository: https://github.com/ffmpeg/ffmpeg\n- Community Examples: https://trac.ffmpeg.org/wiki/\n\n## Implementation Checklist\n\nWhen using FFmpeg:\n\n- [ ] Verify FFmpeg installation (`ffmpeg -version`)\n- [ ] Check available codecs for your use case\n- [ ] Test encoding settings on short clip first\n- [ ] Choose appropriate codec for target platform\n- [ ] Set quality level (CRF or bitrate)\n- [ ] Configure audio codec and bitrate\n- [ ] Apply necessary filters (scale, crop, etc.)\n- [ ] Consider hardware acceleration if available\n- [ ] Verify output quality and file size\n- [ ] Test output compatibility on target devices\n- [ ] Document settings for reproducibility\n- [ ] Create batch scripts for repetitive tasks\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:18:06.082Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Media Processing Agents requiring advanced video and audio manipulation capabilities with FFmpeg.","zh":"适合需要高级视频和音频操作功能的媒体处理代理，支持FFmpeg。","ja":"FFmpegを使用した高度なビデオおよびオーディオ操作機能を必要とするメディア処理エージェントに適しています。","ko":"FFmpeg를 사용한 고급 비디오 및 오디오 조작 기능을 필요로 하는 미디어 처리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Procesamiento de Medios que requieren capacidades avanzadas de manipulación de video y audio con FFmpeg.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Traitement des Médias nécessitant des capacités avancées de manipulation de vidéo et d''audio avec FFmpeg.","de":"Ideal für Media-Processing-Agents, die erweiterte Video- und Audio-Manipulationsfunktionen mit FFmpeg erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Processamento de Mídia que exigem capacidades avançadas de manipulação de vídeo e áudio com FFmpeg.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов обработки медиа, требующих расширенных возможностей манипулирования видео и аудио с помощью FFmpeg.","ar":"مثالية لعميل معالجة الوسائط المتعددة التي تتطلب إمكانيات متقدمة لتعديل الفيديو والصوت مع FFmpeg."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert media files between formats like MP4, MKV, and WebM, encode and decode video with codecs such as H.264 and H.265, and process audio files in formats like AAC and MP3, enabling live streaming and multimedia content handling.","zh":"赋予代理转换媒体文件的格式，如MP4、MKV和WebM，使用H.264和H.265等编解码器对视频进行编码和解码，并处理AAC和MP3等格式的音频文件，使得可以实现直播和多媒体内容处理。","ja":"エージェントに、MP4、MKV、WebMなどのフォーマット間でメディアファイルを変換し、H.264やH.265などのコーデックを使用してビデオをエンコードおよびデコードし、AACやMP3などのフォーマットのオーディオファイルを処理する機能を付与し、ライブストリーミングやマルチメディアコンテンツの処理を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 MP4, MKV, WebM 등의 형식 간에 미디어 파일을 변환하고 H.264 및 H.265 등의 코덱을 사용하여 비디오를 인코딩 및 디코딩하며 AAC 및 MP3 등의 형식의 오디오 파일을 처리하여 라이브 스트리밍 및 멀티미디어 콘텐츠 처리를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir archivos de medios entre formatos como MP4, MKV y WebM, codificar y decodificar video con codecs como H.264 y H.265, y procesar archivos de audio en formatos como AAC y MP3, lo que permite la transmisión en vivo y el manejo de contenido multimedia.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des fichiers multimédias entre des formats tels que MP4, MKV et WebM, de coder et de décoder la vidéo avec des codecs tels que H.264 et H.265, et de traiter des fichiers audio dans des formats tels que AAC et MP3, permettant ainsi la diffusion en direct et la gestion de contenu multimédia.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Mediendateien zwischen Formaten wie MP4, MKV und WebM zu konvertieren, Video mit Codecs wie H.264 und H.265 zu codieren und zu decodieren und Audiodateien in Formaten wie AAC und MP3 zu verarbeiten, wodurch Live-Streaming und die Verarbeitung von Multimediainhalten ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter arquivos de mídia entre formatos como MP4, MKV e WebM, codificar e decodificar vídeo com codecs como H.264 e H.265, e processar arquivos de áudio em formatos como AAC e MP3, permitindo transmissão ao vivo e manipulação de conteúdo multimídia.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью конвертировать медиафайлы между форматами, такими как MP4, MKV и WebM, кодировать и декодировать видео с помощью кодеков, таких как H.264 и H.265, и обрабатывать аудиофайлы в форматах, таких как AAC и MP3, обеспечивая прямую трансляцию и обработку мультимедийного контента.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحويل ملفات الوسائط المتعددة بين الصيغ مثل MP4 و MKV و WebM، وتشفير وفك تشفير الفيديو باستخدام محسّنات مثل H.264 و H.265، ومعالجة ملفات الصوت في صيغ مثل AAC و MP3، مما يسمح بالبث المباشر ومعالجة المحتوى المتعدد الوسائط."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting video files for cross-platform compatibility","Encoding audio streams with codecs like Opus for efficient transmission","Streaming live video content with FFmpeg''s robust streaming capabilities"],"zh":["为跨平台兼容性转换视频文件","使用Opus等编解码器对音频流进行编码以实现高效传输","使用FFmpeg的强大的流媒体功能进行直播视频内容的处理"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォームの互換性のためにビデオファイルを変換する","Opusなどのコーデックを使用してオーディオストリームをエンコードし、効率的な転送を実現する","FFmpegの強力なストリーミング機能を使用してライブビデオコンテンツを処理する"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 호환성을 위한 비디오 파일 변환","Opus 등의 코덱을 사용하여 오디오 스트림을 인코딩하여 효율적인 전송을 실현하는 것","FFmpeg의 강력한 스트리밍 기능을 사용하여 라이브 비디오 콘텐츠를 처리하는 것"],"es":["Conversión de archivos de video para la compatibilidad entre plataformas","Codificación de flujos de audio con codecs como Opus para una transmisión eficiente","Transmisión de contenido de video en vivo con las capacidades de transmisión robustas de FFmpeg"],"fr":["Conversion de fichiers vidéo pour la compatibilité entre plateformes","Codage de flux audio avec des codecs tels que Opus pour une transmission efficace","Diffusion de contenu vidéo en direct avec les capacités de diffusion robustes de FFmpeg"],"de":["Konvertierung von Videodateien für die Kompatibilität zwischen Plattformen","Codierung von Audio-Streams mit Codecs wie Opus für eine effiziente Übertragung","Streaming von Live-Video-Inhalten mit den robusten Streaming-Funktionen von FFmpeg"],"pt":["Conversão de arquivos de vídeo para compatibilidade entre plataformas","Codificação de fluxos de áudio com codecs como Opus para transmissão eficiente","Transmissão de conteúdo de vídeo ao vivo com capacidades de transmissão robustas do FFmpeg"],"ru":["Преобразование видеофайлов для обеспечения совместимости на разных платформах","Кодирование аудиопотоков с помощью кодеков, таких как Opus, для эффективной передачи","Просмотр прямого видеоконтента с помощью надежных возможностей потоковой передачи FFmpeg"],"ar":["تحويل ملفات الفيديو لتوافق المنصات المتعددة","تشفير تيارات الصوت باستخدام محسّنات مثل Opus لنقل فعال","بث محتوى الفيديو المباشر باستخدام إمكانيات البث القوية من FFmpeg"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires command-line interface access","Dependent on system resources for processing-intensive tasks like video encoding"],"zh":["需要命令行接口访问","依赖于系统资源来处理诸如视频编码等计算密集型任务"],"ja":["コマンドラインインターフェースへのアクセスが必要","ビデオエンコードなどの計算集中タスクの処理にシステムリソースに依存する"],"ko":["명령줄 인터페이스 액세스가 필요하다.","비디오 인코딩 등의 연산 집중적인 작업의 처리에 시스템 리소스에 의존한다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a la interfaz de línea de comandos","Dependiente de los recursos del sistema para tareas de procesamiento intensivo como la codificación de video"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''interface de ligne de commande","Dépend des ressources du système pour des tâches de traitement intensif telles que la codification de la vidéo"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle","Abhängig von den Systemressourcen für ressourcenintensive Aufgaben wie die Videocodierung"],"pt":["Exige acesso à interface de linha de comando","Depende dos recursos do sistema para tarefas intensivas de processamento, como codificação de vídeo"],"ru":["Требует доступа к командной строке","Зависит от системных ресурсов для ресурсоемких задач, таких как кодирование видео"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة سطر الأوامر","يعتمد على موارد النظام لمهام معالجة مكثفة مثل ترميز الفيديو"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6e597ecb0fbe9c1bb76549ce47060fcc4003a6514abffb2600142de216ad4936","qualityScore":65}');
