のSpec-Driven Developmentツールです","ko":"github-actions는 현대적 AI 에이전트 개발을 위한 가벼운Flexible Spec-Driven Development 도구입니다","es":"github-actions ofrece Spec-Driven Development para un desarrollo ágil y flexible","fr":"github-actions propose SDD pour un développement moderne et flexible","de":"github-actions bietet SDD für ein modernes und flexibles Development","pt":"GitHub Actions é uma ferramenta de IA para desenvolvimento ágil e Spec-Driven Development (SDD) moderno","ru":"GitHub Actions - это ИИ инструмент для современного разработки и Spec-Driven Development (SDD)","ar":"GitHub Actions هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لتنمية البرمجيات الحديثة والمستندة إلى مواصفات","en":"Lightweight, flexible Spec-Driven Development (SDD) for modern AI-powered development"},"definition":{"en":"Lightweight, flexible Spec-Driven Development (SDD) for modern AI-powered development"},"features":{"zh":["轻量级的Spec-Driven Development","灵活的AI驱动开发","支持现代AI开发框架","易于使用和集成","提高开发效率"],"ja":["軽量級のSpec-Driven Development","柔軟なAIエージェントによる開発","モダンAI開発フレームワークのサポート","簡単な使用と統合","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["가벼운 Spec-Driven Development","유연한 AI 에이전트 기반 개발","현대적 AI 개발 프레임워크 지원","쉬운 사용과 통합","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Desarrollo ágil con Spec-Driven Development","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo modernas","Flexibilidad y personalización","Soporte para desarrollo de AI","Automatización de tareas y flujos de trabajo"],"fr":["Développement agile avec SDD","Intégration avec des outils de développement modernes","Flexibilité et personnalisation","Support pour le développement d''IA","Automatisation de tâches et de flux de travail"],"de":["Agiles Development mit SDD","Integration mit modernen Entwicklungstools","Flexibilität und Anpassungsfähigkeit","Unterstützung für KI-Entwicklung","Automatisierung von Aufgaben und Workflows"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento ágil e flexível","Spec-Driven Development (SDD) moderno","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento populares","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes de desenvolvimento","Automatização de tarefas e workflows"],"ru":["Жизненный и гибкий разработка","Современный Spec-Driven Development (SDD)","Интеграция с популярными инструментами разработки","Поддержка нескольких сред разработки","Автоматизация задач и рабочих процессов"],"ar":["تنمية برمجيات سريعة ومتنوعة","تنمية مستندة إلى مواصفات حديثة","التكامل مع أدوات التنمية الشائعة","دعم بيئات متعددة للتنمية","أتمتة المهام والعمليات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["github-actions教程","AI智能代理工具","Spec-Driven Development","现代AI驱动开发","github-actions安装","github-actions使用指南","github-actions替代品","github-actions vs jenkins"],"ja":["github-actionsチュートリアル","AIエージェントツール","Spec-Driven Development","モダンAIエージェント開発","github-actionsインストール","github-actions使用方法","github-actionsの代替","github-actions vs jenkins"],"ko":["github-actions 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트 도구","Spec-Driven Development","현대적 AI 에이전트 개발","github-actions 설치","github-actions 사용 가이드","github-actions 대체","github-actions vs jenkins"],"es":["herramientas de AI","github-actions","Spec-Driven Development","desarrollo ágil","integración con herramientas de desarrollo","flexibilidad y personalización","soporte para desarrollo de AI","automatización de tareas","github-actions vs jenkins","github-actions instalación"],"fr":["outils d''IA","github-actions","SDD","développement agile","intégration avec des outils de développement","flexibilité et personnalisation","support pour le développement d''IA","automatisation de tâches","github-actions vs jenkins","guide d''installation github-actions"],"de":["KI-Tools","github-actions","SDD","agiles Development","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Flexibilität und Anpassungsfähigkeit","Unterstützung für KI-Entwicklung","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","github-actions vs jenkins","github-actions installieren"],"pt":["como usar github actions","o que é github actions","github actions vs jenkins","github actions install","github actions setup guide","desenvolvimento ágil com github actions","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvimento","github actions para iniciantes"],"ru":["как использовать github actions","что такое github actions","github actions vs jenkins","github actions установка","github actions руководство по настройке","современный разработка с github actions","инструменты ии для разработки","github actions для начинающих"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام github actions","ما هي github actions","github actions vs jenkins","تثبيت github actions","دليل إعداد github actions","تنمية برمجيات حديثة مع github actions","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي للتنمية","github actions للمبتدئين"]}},"owner":"codervisor","repo":"lean-spec","repoPath":"codervisor/lean-spec","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.921Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-actions","description":"GitHub Actions workflow management for LeanSpec. Use when triggering, monitoring, or debugging CI/CD workflows.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Actions Skill\n\nTeach agents how to trigger, monitor, and manage GitHub Actions workflows for the LeanSpec project.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate this skill when any of the following are true:\n- Triggering CI/CD workflows manually\n- Monitoring workflow run status\n- Debugging failed workflow runs\n- Managing workflow artifacts\n- Checking build status before releases\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Use GitHub CLI (`gh`)** - All workflow interactions use the `gh` CLI tool\n2. **Check Status","body":"# GitHub Actions Skill\n\nTeach agents how to trigger, monitor, and manage GitHub Actions workflows for the LeanSpec project.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate this skill when any of the following are true:\n- Triggering CI/CD workflows manually\n- Monitoring workflow run status\n- Debugging failed workflow runs\n- Managing workflow artifacts\n- Checking build status before releases\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Use GitHub CLI (`gh`)** - All workflow interactions use the `gh` CLI tool\n2. **Check Status Before Acting** - Always verify current run status before triggering new ones\n3. **Monitor Until Completion** - Background workflows need periodic status checks\n4. **Artifacts Are Ephemeral** - Download important artifacts before they expire (default: 30 days)\n5. **Respect Rate Limits** - Don''t poll too frequently (minimum 30s between checks)\n\n## Available Workflows\n\n| Workflow | File | Triggers | Purpose |\n|----------|------|----------|---------|\n| **CI** | `ci.yml` | push, PR to main | Build, test, lint (Node.js + Rust) |\n| **Publish** | `publish.yml` | release, manual | Publish to npm (all platforms) |\n| **Desktop Build** | `desktop-build.yml` | push, PR, manual | Build Tauri desktop apps |\n| **Copilot Setup** | `copilot-setup-steps.yml` | push, PR, manual | Setup environment for Copilot agent |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Check Workflow Status\n\n```bash\n# List recent workflow runs\ngh run list --limit 10\n\n# View specific workflow runs\ngh run list --workflow ci.yml --limit 5\ngh run list --workflow publish.yml --limit 5\n\n# Get details of a specific run\ngh run view <run-id>\n\n# Watch a run in progress\ngh run watch <run-id>\n```\n\n### Trigger Workflows\n\n```bash\n# Trigger CI manually (usually automatic on push/PR)\ngh workflow run ci.yml\n\n# Trigger publish (dev version)\ngh workflow run publish.yml --field dev=true\n\n# Trigger publish (dry run - validates without publishing)\ngh workflow run publish.yml --field dev=true --field dry_run=true\n\n# Trigger desktop build\ngh workflow run desktop-build.yml\n```\n\n### Debug Failed Runs\n\n```bash\n# View failed run logs\ngh run view <run-id> --log-failed\n\n# View full logs\ngh run view <run-id> --log\n\n# Re-run failed jobs only\ngh run rerun <run-id> --failed\n\n# Re-run entire workflow\ngh run rerun <run-id>\n```\n\n### Manage Artifacts\n\n```bash\n# List artifacts from a run\ngh run view <run-id>\n\n# Download all artifacts from a run\ngh run download <run-id>\n\n# Download specific artifact\ngh run download <run-id> --name ui-dist\ngh run download <run-id> --name binaries-linux-x64\n```\n\n## Workflow Details\n\n### CI Workflow (`ci.yml`)\n\n**Triggers**: Push to main, PRs to main\n\n**Jobs**:\n1. **node** - Node.js/TypeScript build and test\n   - Install dependencies\n   - Build all packages\n   - Run typecheck\n   - Run tests\n   - Upload UI build artifact\n\n2. **rust** - Rust build and test (depends on node)\n   - Check formatting (`cargo fmt`)\n   - Run clippy linting\n   - Build binaries\n   - Run tests\n   - Validate specs\n\n**Common Failures**:\n- TypeScript errors → Run `pnpm typecheck` locally\n- Test failures → Run `pnpm test` locally\n- Clippy warnings → Run `cargo clippy -- -D warnings` in `rust/`\n- Formatting issues → Run `cargo fmt` in `rust/`\n\n### Publish Workflow (`publish.yml`)\n\n**Triggers**:\n- GitHub Release creation (primary production method)\n- Manual workflow dispatch (for dev/testing)\n\n**Inputs** (for manual dispatch):\n- `dry_run` (boolean) - Validate without publishing\n- `dev` (boolean) - Publish with `@dev` tag\n\n**Jobs**:\n1. **build-ui** - Build UI package first\n2. **rust-binaries** - Build for all platforms (matrix: darwin-x64, darwin-arm64, linux-x64, windows-x64)\n3. **publish-platform** - Publish platform-specific npm packages\n4. **publish-main** - Publish main packages (after platform packages propagate)\n\n**Common Failures**:\n- Platform packages not propagating → Retry publish-main job\n- Version mismatch → Run `pnpm sync-versions` locally\n- npm auth errors → Check `NPM_TOKEN` secret\n\n### Desktop Build Workflow (`desktop-build.yml`)\n\n**Triggers**: Changes to `packages/desktop/`, `packages/ui/`, or the workflow file\n\n**Jobs**:\n- Matrix build on macOS, Ubuntu, Windows\n- Builds Tauri desktop bundle\n- Uploads artifacts per platform\n\n## Workflow Patterns for Agents\n\n### Pattern 1: Check Before Triggering\n\nAlways check if a workflow is already running before triggering:\n\n```bash\n# Check for running CI workflows\ngh run list --workflow ci.yml --status in_progress\n\n# Only trigger if nothing is running\ngh workflow run ci.yml\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Wait for Completion\n\n```bash\n# Trigger and wait\ngh workflow run publish.yml --field dev=true\n\n# Get the latest run ID\nRUN_ID=$(gh run list --workflow publish.yml --limit 1 --json databaseId --jq ''.[0].databaseId'')\n\n# Watch until completion\ngh run watch $RUN_ID\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Debug and Retry\n\n```bash\n# Check what failed\ngh run view <run-id> --log-failed\n\n# If transient failure, retry just failed jobs\ngh run rerun <run-id> --failed\n\n# If you need clean state, retry all\ngh run rerun <run-id>\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Pre-Release Validation\n\nBefore publishing a release:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Ensure CI passes\ngh run list --workflow ci.yml --branch main --limit 1\n\n# 2. Run publish dry run\ngh workflow run publish.yml --field dev=true --field dry_run=true\n\n# 3. Watch the dry run\nRUN_ID=$(gh run list --workflow publish.yml --limit 1 --json databaseId --jq ''.[0].databaseId'')\ngh run watch $RUN_ID\n\n# 4. If successful, trigger real dev publish\ngh workflow run publish.yml --field dev=true\n```\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n```\nNeed to check if build passing?\n└─> gh run list --workflow ci.yml --limit 1\n\nNeed to publish packages?\n├─> Production: Create GitHub Release (recommended)\n└─> Testing: gh workflow run publish.yml --field dev=true\n\nWorkflow failed?\n├─> View logs: gh run view <id> --log-failed\n├─> Transient: gh run rerun <id> --failed\n└─> Real issue: Fix locally, push, let CI re-run\n\nNeed build artifacts?\n└─> gh run download <run-id> --name <artifact-name>\n```\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\n- [references/WORKFLOWS.md](./references/WORKFLOWS.md) - Detailed workflow documentation\n- [references/COMMANDS.md](./references/COMMANDS.md) - Complete command reference\n- [references/TROUBLESHOOTING.md](./references/TROUBLESHOOTING.md) - Common issues and solutions\n\n## Setup Requirements\n\n### GitHub CLI Authentication\n\n```bash\n# Check if authenticated\ngh auth status\n\n# Login if needed\ngh auth login\n\n# Verify repo access\ngh repo view codervisor/lean-spec\n```\n\n### Required Permissions\n\n- Repository read access (for viewing runs)\n- Repository write access (for triggering workflows)\n- `NPM_TOKEN` secret configured (for publish workflow)\n\n## Auto-activation Hints\n\nIf the tool supports auto-activation, detect:\n- Tasks related to: \"CI\", \"workflow\", \"build\", \"deploy\", \"publish\", \"GitHub Actions\"\n- Commands being run: `gh run`, `gh workflow`\n- Errors mentioning: workflow failures, CI failures, build errors"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:17.860Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring automated CI/CD workflow management using GitHub Actions","zh":"适用于需要使用 GitHub Actions 进行自动化 CI/CD 工作流管理的 DevOps Agents","ja":"GitHub Actions を使用した自動化 CI/CD ワークフロー管理を必要とする DevOps Agents に適しています","ko":"GitHub Actions를 사용하여 자동화된 CI/CD 워크플ロー 관리가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que requieren una gestión de flujo de trabajo de CI/CD automatizada utilizando GitHub Actions","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant une gestion de flux de travail CI/CD automatisée à l''aide de GitHub Actions","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die eine automatisierte CI/CD-Workflow-Verwaltung mit GitHub Actions benötigen","pt":"Ideal para agentes DevOps que requerem gestão de fluxo de trabalho de CI/CD automatizado usando GitHub Actions","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, требующих автоматизированного управления рабочим процессом CI/CD с использованием GitHub Actions","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps الذي يتطلب إدارة تدفق عمل CI/CD آلي باستخدام GitHub Actions"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to trigger, monitor, and manage GitHub Actions workflows using the GitHub CLI (`gh`), enabling efficient Spec-Driven Development and streamlined LeanSpec project management through automated workflow run status checks and artifact management","zh":"赋予代理触发、监控和管理 GitHub Actions 工作流的能力，使用 GitHub CLI (`gh`)，实现高效的 Spec-Driven Development 和流畅的 LeanSpec 项目管理，通过自动化工作流运行状态检查和工件管理","ja":"GitHub CLI (`gh`) を使用して GitHub Actions ワークフローをトリガー、監視、管理するエージェントを可能にし、Spec-Driven Development と LeanSpec プロジェクト管理を効率化し、ワークフローの実行状態のチェックとアーティファクトの管理を自動化する","ko":"GitHub CLI(`gh`)를 사용하여 GitHub Actions 워크플ロー에 대한 트리거, 모니터링 및 관리 기능을 제공하여 효율적인 Spec-Driven Development 및 LeanSpec 프로젝트 관리를 가능하게 하며 자동화된 워크플로 실행 상태 확인 및 아티팩트 관리를 통해 프로젝트를 스트림라인합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes para desencadenar, supervisar y gestionar flujos de trabajo de GitHub Actions utilizando la GitHub CLI (`gh`), lo que permite un desarrollo Spec-Driven eficiente y una gestión de proyectos LeanSpec optimizada a través de controles de estado de ejecución de flujo de trabajo automatizados y gestión de artefactos","fr":"Permet aux agents de déclencher, de surveiller et de gérer les flux de travail GitHub Actions à l''aide de la GitHub CLI (`gh`), permettant ainsi un développement Spec-Driven efficace et une gestion de projet LeanSpec rationalisée grâce à des vérifications de statut d''exécution de flux de travail automatisées et à une gestion d''artefacts","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, GitHub Actions-Workflows mithilfe der GitHub CLI (`gh`) auszulösen, zu überwachen und zu verwalten, wodurch eine effiziente Spec-Driven-Entwicklung und eine optimierte LeanSpec-Projektverwaltung durch automatisierte Workflow-Ausführungsstatus-Checks und Artefaktverwaltung ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a acionar, monitorar e gerenciar fluxos de trabalho do GitHub Actions usando o GitHub CLI (`gh`), permitindo o desenvolvimento eficiente baseado em especificações e a gestão de projetos LeanSpec otimizada por meio de verificações automatizadas de status de execução de fluxo de trabalho e gerenciamento de artefatos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать, контролировать и управлять рабочими процессами GitHub Actions с помощью GitHub CLI (`gh`), обеспечивая эффективное развитие, управляемое спецификациями, и оптимизированное управление проектами LeanSpec за счет автоматических проверок статуса выполнения рабочего процесса и управления артефактами","ar":"يسمح للعاملين بتشغيل ومراقبة وإدارة سير عمل GitHub Actions باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر GitHub (`gh`) ، مما يتيح التطوير الكفء القائم على المواصفات وإدارة مشاريع LeanSpec المُجددة من خلال عمليات فحص حالة تشغيل سير العمل الآلية وإدارة الملفات المكونة"},"useCases":{"en":["Triggering CI/CD workflows manually","Monitoring workflow run status","Debugging failed workflow runs","Managing workflow artifacts"],"zh":["手动触发 CI/CD 工作流","监控工作流运行状态","调试失败的工作流运行","管理工作流工件"],"ja":["CI/CD ワークフローを手動でトリガーする","ワークフローの実行状態を監視する","失敗したワークフローの実行をデバッグする","ワークフローのアーティファクトを管理する"],"ko":["CI/CD 워크플ロー 수동 트리거","워크플로 실행 상태 모니터링","실패한 워크플로 실행 디버깅","워크플로 아티팩트 관리"],"es":["Desencadenar flujos de trabajo de CI/CD manualmente","Supervisar el estado de ejecución del flujo de trabajo","Depurar ejecuciones de flujo de trabajo fallidas","Gestionar artefactos del flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["Déclencher manuellement des flux de travail CI/CD","Surveiller l''état d''exécution du flux de travail","Déboguer les exécutions de flux de travail ayant échoué","Gérer les artefacts du flux de travail"],"de":["CI/CD-Workflows manuell auslösen","Überwachung des Workflow-Ausführungsstatus","Fehlerhafte Workflow-Ausführungen debuggen","Verwalten von Workflow-Artefakten"],"pt":["Disparar fluxos de trabalho de CI/CD manualmente","Monitorar status de execução do fluxo de trabalho","Depurar execuções de fluxo de trabalho com falha","Gerenciar artefatos de fluxo de trabalho"],"ru":["Запуск рабочих процессов CI/CD вручную","Мониторинг статуса выполнения рабочего процесса","Отладка неудавшихся запусков рабочего процесса","Управление артефактами рабочего процесса"],"ar":["تشغيل سير عمل CI/CD يدويا","مراقبة حالة تشغيل سير العمل","تصحيح الأخطاء في تشغيل سير العمل الفاشلة","إدارة الملفات المكونة لسير العمل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI (`gh`) installation","GitHub Actions workflow configuration needed"],"zh":["需要安装 GitHub CLI (`gh`)","需要 GitHub Actions 工作流配置"],"ja":["GitHub CLI (`gh`) のインストールが必要","GitHub Actions ワークフローの構成が必要"],"ko":["GitHub CLI(`gh`) 설치 필요","GitHub Actions 워크플로 구성 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de GitHub CLI (`gh`)","Se necesita configuración de flujo de trabajo de GitHub Actions"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la GitHub CLI (`gh`)","Une configuration de flux de travail GitHub Actions est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation der GitHub CLI (`gh`)","Eine GitHub Actions-Workflow-Konfiguration ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer instalação do GitHub CLI (`gh`)","Configuração do fluxo de trabalho do GitHub Actions necessária"],"ru":["Требуется установка GitHub CLI (`gh`)","Необходима настройка рабочего процесса GitHub Actions"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت واجهة سطر الأوامر GitHub (`gh`)","تتطلب إعداد سير عمل GitHub Actions"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a3c1bf3040947020ea644199dc9420b76eecbf3f812a42f62be55df95a3b4240","qualityScore":65}');
