tomatisée de diagrammes Azure","Compatibilité avec de multiples formats de fichiers","Intégration avec des outils de développement populaires","Conception de diagrammes personnalisable","Prise en charge de la collaboration en temps réel"],"de":["Automatisierte Erstellung von Azure-Diagrammen","Unterstützung für mehrere Dateiformate","Integration mit beliebten Entwicklungstools","Anpassbares Diagrammdesign","Unterstützung für Echtzeit-Kollaboration"],"pt":["Criação de diagramas de infraestrutura na nuvem","Integração com outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de arquivo","Ferramentas de edição avançadas","Compatibilidade com diferentes sistemas operacionais"],"ru":["Создание диаграмм инфраструктуры в облаке","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки","Поддержка нескольких форматов файлов","Продвинутые инструменты редактирования","Совместимость с разными операционными системами"],"ar":["إنشاء مخططات بنية تحتية سحابية","دمج مع أدوات تطوير أخرى","دعم لمножة صيغ الملفات","أدوات تحرير متقدمة","توافق مع أنظمة تشغيل مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Azure Diagrams AI工具","Azure资源创建和管理","AI驱动的开发辅助工具","Azure Diagrams替代品","Azure Diagrams vs 其他工具","Azure Diagrams安装指南","Azure Diagrams设置教程"],"ja":["Azure Diagrams AIエージェント","Azureリソースの作成と管理","AI駆動の開発ツール","Azure Diagramsの代替","Azure Diagramsと他のツールの比較","Azure Diagramsのインストール方法","Azure Diagramsの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Azure Diagrams AI 에이전트","Azure 리소스의 생성과 관리","AI 기반의 개발 도구","Azure Diagrams의 대안","Azure Diagrams와 다른 도구의 비교","Azure Diagrams의 설치 방법","Azure Diagrams의 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de diagramas de Azure","azure-diagrams alternativa","azure-diagrams vs drawio","cómo instalar azure-diagrams","guía de configuración de azure-diagrams","azure-diagrams para desarrolladores","creación de diagramas de Azure","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores"],"fr":["outils de diagrammes Azure","alternative à azure-diagrams","azure-diagrams vs drawio","comment installer azure-diagrams","guide de configuration d''azure-diagrams","azure-diagrams pour les développeurs","création de diagrammes Azure","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les développeurs"],"de":["Azure-Diagramm-Tools","Alternative zu azure-diagrams","azure-diagrams vs drawio","wie man azure-diagrams installiert","Anleitung zur Konfiguration von azure-diagrams","azure-diagrams für Entwickler","Erstellung von Azure-Diagrammen","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["como usar azure diagrams","o que é azure diagrams","azure diagrams alternative","azure diagrams vs visio","instalar azure diagrams","guia de configuração do azure diagrams"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты Azure Diagrams","что такое ИИ Агенты Azure Diagrams","ИИ Агенты Azure Diagrams альтернатива","ИИ Агенты Azure Diagrams vs visio","установить ИИ Агенты Azure Diagrams","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов Azure Diagrams"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي azure-diagrams","ما هي أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي azure-diagrams","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي azure-diagrams بديلة","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي azure-diagrams vs visio","تثبيت أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي azure-diagrams","دليل إعداد أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي azure-diagrams"]}},"owner":"gamingopgamingop","repo":"sarthak-skill-forge","repoPath":"gamingopgamingop/sarthak-skill-forge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.925Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-diagrams","description":"Visualizes Azure infrastructure from ARM templates, Azure CLI, or descriptions. Use when user has Azure resources to diagram.","version":"1.0.0","tags":"azure, diagram, arm, resource-group, vnet, vm, storage, infrastructure","bodyPreview":"# Azure Diagram Generator\n\nGenerates architecture diagrams for Azure infrastructure from ARM templates, Azure CLI output, or natural language descriptions.\n\n## When to Use\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- User has ARM (Azure Resource Manager) templates (JSON)\n- User provides Azure CLI output (e.g., `az vm list`)\n- User wants to visualize Azure resources\n- User mentions Azure services (Virtual Machines, Storage Accounts, VNets, etc.)\n- User asks to \"diagram my Azure infrastructure\"\n\n## How It Works","body":"# Azure Diagram Generator\n\nGenerates architecture diagrams for Azure infrastructure from ARM templates, Azure CLI output, or natural language descriptions.\n\n## When to Use\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- User has ARM (Azure Resource Manager) templates (JSON)\n- User provides Azure CLI output (e.g., `az vm list`)\n- User wants to visualize Azure resources\n- User mentions Azure services (Virtual Machines, Storage Accounts, VNets, etc.)\n- User asks to \"diagram my Azure infrastructure\"\n\n## How It Works\n\nThis skill generates Azure-specific diagrams by parsing Azure resources and calling the Eraser API directly:\n\n1. **Parse Azure Resources**: Extract resources from ARM templates, CLI output, or descriptions\n2. **Map Azure Relationships**: Identify Resource Groups, VNets, subnets, and service connections\n3. **Generate Eraser DSL**: Create Eraser DSL code from Azure resources\n4. **Call Eraser API**: Use `/api/render/elements` with `diagramType: \"cloud-architecture-diagram\"`\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen the user provides Azure infrastructure information:\n\n1. **Parse the Source**\n\n   - **ARM Templates**: Extract `resources` array, identify types (Microsoft.Compute/virtualMachines, etc.)\n   - **CLI Output**: Parse JSON output from `az` commands\n   - **Description**: Identify Azure service names and relationships\n\n2. **Identify Azure Components**\n\n   - **Networking**: Virtual Networks (VNets), Subnets, Network Security Groups, Load Balancers\n   - **Compute**: Virtual Machines, Virtual Machine Scale Sets, App Services, Functions\n   - **Storage**: Storage Accounts, Blob Storage, File Shares\n   - **Databases**: SQL Databases, Cosmos DB, Redis Cache\n   - **Security**: Network Security Groups, Azure AD, Key Vault\n   - **Load Balancing**: Application Gateway, Load Balancer, Traffic Manager\n   - **Other**: Service Bus, Event Hubs, API Management\n\n3. **Map Relationships**\n\n   - VMs in subnets\n   - Subnets in VNets\n   - VNets in Resource Groups\n   - Storage accounts accessed by VMs\n   - Databases accessed by applications\n   - Network Security Groups attached to subnets\n\n4. **Generate Eraser DSL** Convert Azure resources to Eraser DSL:\n\n   - **CRITICAL: Label Formatting Rules**\n     - Labels MUST be on a single line - NEVER use newlines inside label attributes\n     - Keep labels simple and readable - prefer separate labels over concatenating too much metadata\n     - Format DSL with proper line breaks (one node/group per line, but labels stay on single lines)\n     - If including metadata like CIDR blocks or instance types, include them in the same quoted label string: `[label: \"VNet 10.0.0.0/16\"]`\n\n   Example:\n\n   ```\n   myVNet [label: \"VNet 10.0.0.0/16\"] {\n     subnet1 [label: \"Subnet 1\"] {\n       myVM [icon: azure-vm, label: \"Virtual Machine\"]\n       gateway [icon: azure-app-gateway]\n     }\n     subnet2 [label: \"Subnet 2\"] {\n       database [icon: azure-sql]\n     }\n   }\n   storage [icon: azure-storage]\n   myVNet -> myVM\n   myVM -> database\n   ```\n\n5. **Make the HTTP Request**\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: You MUST execute this curl command after generating the DSL. Never stop after generating DSL without making the API call.\n\n   **CRITICAL**: In the `X-Skill-Source` header below, you MUST replace the value with your AI agent name:\n   - If you are Claude (Anthropic), use: `claude`\n   - If you are running in Cursor, use: `cursor`\n   - If you are ChatGPT (OpenAI), use: `chatgpt`\n   - If you are Gemini (Google), use: `gemini`\n   - Otherwise, use your model/agent name in lowercase\n\n   ```bash\n   curl -X POST https://app.eraser.io/api/render/elements \\\n     -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n     -H \"X-Skill-Source: eraser-skill\" \\\n     -H \"Authorization: Bearer ${ERASER_API_KEY}\" \\\n     -d ''{\n       \"elements\": [{\n         \"type\": \"diagram\",\n         \"id\": \"diagram-1\",\n         \"code\": \"<your generated DSL>\",\n         \"diagramType\": \"cloud-architecture-diagram\"\n       }],\n       \"scale\": 2,\n       \"theme\": \"${ERASER_THEME:-dark}\",\n       \"background\": true\n     }''\n   ```\n\n6. **Track Sources During Analysis**\n\n   As you analyze files and resources to generate the diagram, track:\n\n   - **Internal files**: Record each file path you read and what information was extracted (e.g., `infra/main.bicep` - VNet and subnet definitions)\n   - **External references**: Note any documentation, examples, or URLs consulted (e.g., Azure architecture best practices documentation)\n   - **Annotations**: For each source, note what it contributed to the diagram\n\n7. **Handle the Response**\n\n   **CRITICAL: Minimal Output Format**\n\n   Your response MUST always include these elements with clear headers:\n\n   1. **Diagram Preview**: Display with a header\n      ```\n      ## Diagram\n      ![{Title}]({imageUrl})\n      ```\n      Use the ACTUAL `imageUrl` from the API response.\n\n   2. **Editor Link**: Display with a header\n      ```\n      ## Open in Eraser\n      [Edit this diagram in the Eraser editor]({createEraserFileUrl})\n      ```\n      Use the ACTUAL URL from the API response.\n\n   3. **Sources section**: Brief list of files/resources analyzed (if applicable)\n      ```\n      ## Sources\n      - `path/to/file` - What was extracted\n      ```\n\n   4. **Diagram Code section**: The Eraser DSL in a code block with `eraser` language tag\n      ```\n      ## Diagram Code\n      ```eraser\n      {DSL code here}\n      ```\n      ```\n\n   5. **Learn More link**: `You can learn more about Eraser at https://docs.eraser.io/docs/using-ai-agent-integrations`\n\n   **Additional content rules:**\n   - If the user ONLY asked for a diagram, include NOTHING beyond the 5 elements above\n   - If the user explicitly asked for more (e.g., \"explain the architecture\", \"suggest improvements\"), you may include that additional content\n   - Never add unrequested sections like Overview, Security Considerations, Testing, etc.\n\n   The default output should be SHORT. The diagram image speaks for itself.\n\n## Azure-Specific Tips\n\n- **Resource Groups**: Show Resource Groups as logical containers\n- **VNets as Containers**: Always show VNets containing subnets and resources\n- **Network Security Groups**: Include NSG rules and attachments\n- **Subscriptions**: Note subscription context if provided\n- **Data Flow**: Show traffic flow (Internet → Application Gateway → VM → SQL Database)\n- **Use Azure Icons**: Request Azure-specific styling in the description\n\n## Example: ARM Template with Multiple Azure Services\n\n### User Input\n\n```json\n{\n  \"resources\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"Microsoft.Resources/resourceGroups\",\n      \"name\": \"rg-main\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"Microsoft.Network/virtualNetworks\",\n      \"name\": \"myVNet\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"addressSpace\": {\n          \"addressPrefixes\": [\"10.0.0.0/16\"]\n        },\n        \"subnets\": [\n          {\n            \"name\": \"subnet1\",\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"addressPrefix\": \"10.0.1.0/24\"\n            }\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"Microsoft.Compute/virtualMachines\",\n      \"name\": \"myVM\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"hardwareProfile\": {\n          \"vmSize\": \"Standard_B1s\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"Microsoft.Web/sites\",\n      \"name\": \"myAppService\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"serverFarmId\": \"/subscriptions/.../serverfarms/myPlan\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts\",\n      \"name\": \"mystorageaccount\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"Microsoft.Sql/servers\",\n      \"name\": \"mysqlserver\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"administratorLogin\": \"admin\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\n1. Parses ARM template:\n\n   - **Resource Group**: rg-main (container)\n   - **Networking**: VNet with subnet\n   - **Compute**: VM, App Service\n   - **Storage**: Storage Account\n   - **Database**: SQL Server\n\n2. Generates DSL showing Azure service diversity:\n\n   ```\n   resource-group [label: \"Resource Group rg-main\"] {\n     myVNet [label: \"VNet 10.0.0.0/16\"] {\n       subnet1 [label: \"Subnet 1 10.0.1.0/24\"] {\n         myVM [icon: azure-vm, label: \"VM Standard_B1s\"]\n       }\n     }\n     myAppService [icon: azure-app-service, label: \"App Service\"]\n     mystorageaccount [icon: azure-storage, label: \"Storage Account\"]\n     mysqlserver [icon: azure-sql, label: \"SQL Server\"]\n   }\n\n   myAppService -> mystorageaccount\n   myVM -> mysqlserver\n   ```\n\n   **Important**: All label text must be on a single line within quotes. Azure-specific: Show Resource Groups as containers, include App Services, Storage Accounts, and SQL databases with proper Azure icons.\n\n3. Calls `/api/render/elements` with `diagramType: \"cloud-architecture-diagram\"`\n\n## Example: Azure CLI Output\n\n### User Input\n\n```\nUser runs: az vm list --output json\nProvides JSON output\n```\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\n1. Parses JSON to extract:\n\n   - VM names, sizes, states\n   - Resource groups\n   - Network interfaces\n   - Storage accounts\n\n2. Formats and calls API\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:28:12.639Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Agents needing advanced Azure infrastructure diagram generation capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级 Azure 基础设施图生成能力的云代理","ja":"Azure 基礎構成図を生成するための高級な機能が必要なクラウド エージェントに適しています","ko":"고급 Azure 인프라 구성図를 생성해야 하는 클라우드 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes en la nube que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación de diagramas de infraestructura de Azure.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud nécessitant des capacités avancées de génération de diagrammes d''infrastructure Azure.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Agents, die erweiterte Azure-Infrastruktur-Diagramm-Generierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Nuvem que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de geração de diagramas de infraestrutura do Azure.","ru":"Идеально для облачных агентов, которым необходимы расширенные возможности генерации диаграмм инфраструктуры Azure.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء السحابيون الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لإنشاء رسومات لبنية تحتية Azure."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate architecture diagrams for Azure infrastructure from ARM templates, Azure CLI output, or natural language descriptions using JSON and Azure CLI protocols.","zh":"使代理能够从 ARM 模板、Azure CLI 输出或使用 JSON 和 Azure CLI 协议的自然语言描述来生成 Azure 基础结构的体系结构图","ja":"ARM テンプレート、Azure CLI 出力、または JSON と Azure CLI プロトコルを使用する自然言語の記述から Azure 基礎構成の体系構成図を生成するためにエージェントを有効にする","ko":"ARM 템플릿, Azure CLI 출력 또는 JSON과 Azure CLI 프로토콜을 사용하는 자연어 설명에서 Azure 인프라 구성의体系 구조图를 생성하는 기능을 사용하여 에이전트를 활성화합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar diagramas de arquitectura para infraestructura de Azure a partir de plantillas de ARM, salida de Azure CLI o descripciones en lenguaje natural utilizando protocolos JSON y Azure CLI.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des diagrammes d''architecture pour l''infrastructure Azure à partir de modèles ARM, de sortie Azure CLI ou de descriptions en langage naturel en utilisant les protocoles JSON et Azure CLI.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Architekturdiagramme für Azure-Infrastruktur aus ARM-Vorlagen, Azure-CLI-Ausgaben oder natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen unter Verwendung von JSON- und Azure-CLI-Protokollen zu generieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar diagramas de arquitetura para infraestrutura do Azure a partir de modelos ARM, saída do Azure CLI ou descrições em linguagem natural usando protocolos JSON e Azure CLI.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать диаграммы архитектуры для инфраструктуры Azure из шаблонов ARM, вывода Azure CLI или описаний на естественном языке с использованием протоколов JSON и Azure CLI.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء رسومات لهياكل تحتية Azure من قوالب ARM أو إخراج Azure CLI أو وصفات لغة طبيعية باستخدام بروتوكولات JSON و Azure CLI."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Azure resource visualization","Generating Azure infrastructure diagrams from ARM templates","Debugging Azure resource configurations using natural language descriptions"],"zh":["自动化 Azure 资源可视化","从 ARM 模板生成 Azure 基础结构图","使用自然语言描述调试 Azure 资源配置"],"ja":["Azure リソースの可視化を自動化する","ARM テンプレートから Azure 基礎構成図を生成する","自然言語の記述を使用して Azure リソースの構成をデバッグする"],"ko":["Azure 리소스의 시각화를 자동화하는","ARM 템플릿에서 Azure 인프라 구성图를 생성하는","자연어 설명을 사용하여 Azure 리소스 구성의 디버깅을 수행하는"],"es":["Automatizar la visualización de recursos de Azure","Generar diagramas de infraestructura de Azure a partir de plantillas de ARM","Depurar configuraciones de recursos de Azure utilizando descripciones en lenguaje natural"],"fr":["Automatiser la visualisation des ressources Azure","Générer des diagrammes d''infrastructure Azure à partir de modèles ARM","Déboguer les configurations de ressources Azure en utilisant des descriptions en langage naturel"],"de":["Automatisieren der Visualisierung von Azure-Ressourcen","Generieren von Azure-Infrastrukturdiagrammen aus ARM-Vorlagen","Debuggen von Azure-Ressourcenkonfigurationen unter Verwendung von natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a visualização de recursos do Azure","Gerar diagramas de infraestrutura do Azure a partir de modelos ARM","Depurar configurações de recursos do Azure usando descrições em linguagem natural"],"ru":["Автоматизация визуализации ресурсов Azure","Генерация диаграмм инфраструктуры Azure из шаблонов ARM","Отладка конфигураций ресурсов Azure с помощью описаний на естественном языке"],"ar":["آليّة تصور موارد Azure","إنشاء رسومات لبنى تحتية Azure من قوالب ARM","تصحيح أخطاء تكوينات مورد Azure باستخدام وصفات لغة طبيعية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Azure Resource Manager (ARM) templates or Azure CLI output","Limited to Azure infrastructure only"],"zh":["需要 Azure Resource Manager (ARM) 模板或 Azure CLI 输出","仅限于 Azure 基础结构"],"ja":["Azure リソース マネージャー (ARM) テンプレートまたは Azure CLI 出力を必要とする","Azure 基礎構成のみに限られている"],"ko":["Azure Resource Manager (ARM) 템플릿 또는 Azure CLI 출력이 필요합니다","Azure 인프라 구성のみ에 적용됩니다"],"es":["Requiere plantillas de Azure Resource Manager (ARM) o salida de Azure CLI","Limitado solo a la infraestructura de Azure"],"fr":["Nécessite des modèles Azure Resource Manager (ARM) ou une sortie Azure CLI","Limité uniquement à l''infrastructure Azure"],"de":["Benötigt Azure Resource Manager (ARM)-Vorlagen oder Azure-CLI-Ausgaben","Begrenzt auf Azure-Infrastruktur nur"],"pt":["Requer modelos ARM ou saída do Azure CLI","Limitado apenas à infraestrutura do Azure"],"ru":["Требует шаблонов ARM или вывода Azure CLI","Ограничен только инфраструктурой Azure"],"ar":["يتطلب قوالب ARM أو إخراج Azure CLI","محدود للهياكل التحتية ل Azure فقط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7a2a9640b208428d82d03e5ab5929f26919f68b11996b73fd9c9b5a3b39058b8","qualityScore":65}');
