原يبة للرسومات","en":"nano-pdf"},"description":{"zh":"nano-pdf - OpenClaw","ja":"nano-pdf - OpenClaw","ko":"nano-pdf - OpenClaw","es":"nano-pdf es un entorno de trabajo de grafo nativo para OpenClaw con 312 habilidades y 27 clusters, que incluye Cypher integrado a través de LadybugDB","fr":"nano-pdf est un environnement de travail de graphe natif pour OpenClaw avec 312 compétences et 27 clusters, qui inclut Cypher intégré via LadybugDB","de":"nano-pdf ist eine graph-natieve Arbeitsumgebung für OpenClaw mit 312 Fähigkeiten und 27 Clustern, die Cypher über LadybugDB integriert","pt":"O nano-pdf é um backend de workspace nativo em grafos para OpenClaw, com 312 habilidades e 27 clusters, que utiliza Cypher via LadybugDB","ru":"nano-pdf - это граф-родной бэкэнд рабочего пространства для OpenClaw, с 312 навыками и 27 кластерами, использующий Cypher через LadybugDB","ar":"nano-pdf هو خلفية عمل原يبة للرسومات لمفتاح OpenClaw، مع 312 مهارة و27 مجموعة، يستخدم سايفر عبر LadybugDB","en":"Graph-native workspace backend for OpenClaw — 312 skills, 27 clusters, embedded Cypher via LadybugDB. Zero flat files, zero daemons."},"definition":{"en":"Graph-native workspace backend for OpenClaw — 312 skills, 27 clusters, embedded Cypher via LadybugDB. Zero flat files, zero daemons."},"features":{"zh":["OpenClaw","nano-pdf","Cypher","LadybugDB"],"ja":["OpenClaw","nano-pdf","Cypher","LadybugDB"],"ko":["OpenClaw","nano-pdf","Cypher","LadybugDB"],"es":["Entorno de trabajo de grafo nativo para OpenClaw","312 habilidades y 27 clusters","Cypher integrado a través de LadybugDB","Sin archivos planos, sin demonios","Ideal para desarrolladores que buscan una solución de grafo escalable"],"fr":["Environnement de travail de graphe natif pour OpenClaw","312 compétences et 27 clusters","Cypher intégré via LadybugDB","Sans fichiers plats, sans démons","Idéal pour les développeurs qui recherchent une solution de graphe évolutive"],"de":["Graph-natieve Arbeitsumgebung für OpenClaw","312 Fähigkeiten und 27 Cluster","Cypher über LadybugDB integriert","Ohne flache Dateien, ohne Dämonen","Ideal für Entwickler, die eine skalierbare Graphlösung suchen"],"pt":["Backend de workspace nativo em grafos","312 habilidades e 27 clusters","Utiliza Cypher via LadybugDB","Sem arquivos planos","Sem daemons"],"ru":["Граф-родной бэкэнд рабочего пространства","312 навыков и 27 кластеров","Использует Cypher через LadybugDB","Без плоских файлов","Без даemons"],"ar":["خلفية عمل原يبة للرسومات","312 مهارة و27 مجموعة","يستخدم سايفر عبر LadybugDB","بدون ملفات مسطحة","بدون ديمونات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI","OpenClaw","nano-pdf","Cypher","LadybugDB","OpenClaw"],"ja":["AI","OpenClaw","nano-pdf","Cypher","LadybugDB","OpenClaw"],"ko":["AI","OpenClaw","nano-pdf","Cypher","LadybugDB","OpenClaw"],"es":["herramientas de agente de inteligencia artificial","nano-pdf","OpenClaw","entorno de trabajo de grafo nativo","cómo usar nano-pdf","qué es nano-pdf","instalación de nano-pdf","guía de configuración de nano-pdf"],"fr":["outils d''agent d''intelligence artificielle","nano-pdf","OpenClaw","environnement de travail de graphe natif","comment utiliser nano-pdf","qu''est-ce que nano-pdf","installation de nano-pdf","guide de configuration de nano-pdf"],"de":["KI-Agent-Tools","nano-pdf","OpenClaw","graph-natieve Arbeitsumgebung","wie man nano-pdf verwendet","was ist nano-pdf","Installation von nano-pdf","Konfigurationsanleitung für nano-pdf"],"pt":["como usar nano-pdf","o que é nano-pdf","alternativa para OpenClaw","nano-pdf vs outros ferramentas","instalar nano-pdf","guias de configuração do nano-pdf"],"ru":["как использовать nano-pdf","что такое nano-pdf","альтернатива для OpenClaw","nano-pdf vs другие инструменты","установить nano-pdf","руководства по настройке nano-pdf"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام nano-pdf","ما هو nano-pdf","بديل لمفتاح OpenClaw","nano-pdf مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت nano-pdf","دليل إعداد nano-pdf"]}},"owner":"alphaonedev","repo":"openclaw-graph","repoPath":"alphaonedev/openclaw-graph","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.151Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nano-pdf","description":"PDF processing: extraction, text mining, form filling, manipulation, OCR integration","tags":["pdf","document","extraction","ocr"],"bodyPreview":"# nano-pdf\n\n## Purpose\nThis skill provides tools for PDF processing, including text extraction, mining, form filling, manipulation, and OCR integration, to handle document workflows efficiently.\n\n## When to Use\nUse this skill for tasks involving PDF data extraction (e.g., from scanned documents), text analysis in reports, automating form submissions, merging/splitting files, or applying OCR to non-text PDFs. Apply it in data pipelines, document automation scripts, or when integrating with OCR se","body":"# nano-pdf\n\n## Purpose\nThis skill provides tools for PDF processing, including text extraction, mining, form filling, manipulation, and OCR integration, to handle document workflows efficiently.\n\n## When to Use\nUse this skill for tasks involving PDF data extraction (e.g., from scanned documents), text analysis in reports, automating form submissions, merging/splitting files, or applying OCR to non-text PDFs. Apply it in data pipelines, document automation scripts, or when integrating with OCR services for unstructured data.\n\n## Key Capabilities\n- Text extraction: Pulls plain text or structured data from PDFs, supporting encrypted files with passwords; uses OCR via Tesseract integration for image-based PDFs.\n- Text mining: Analyzes extracted text for keywords, sentiment, or patterns; e.g., counts occurrences of phrases in a document.\n- Form filling: Populates interactive PDF forms with JSON data; supports flattening forms to static PDFs.\n- Manipulation: Merges, splits, rotates, or watermarks PDFs; handles up to 500-page documents efficiently.\n- OCR integration: Converts scanned PDFs to searchable text using external APIs; requires Tesseract or similar engine configuration.\n\n## Usage Patterns\nInvoke via CLI for quick scripts or API for server-side integration. For batch processing, chain commands in a shell script; for web apps, use API calls in loops. Always specify input/output paths explicitly. Pattern: Extract text first, then mine or manipulate as needed. For OCR-heavy tasks, preprocess images before PDF operations.\n\n## Common Commands/API\nCLI commands use `nano-pdf` binary; API endpoints are under `https://api.opencclaw.com/nano-pdf/`. Authentication requires `$NANO_PDF_API_KEY` environment variable.\n\n- Extract text: `nano-pdf extract --file input.pdf --output text.txt --ocr true` (adds OCR if text is not selectable).\n- Mine text: `nano-pdf mine --input text.txt --keywords \"AI,robot\" --output results.json` (outputs keyword frequencies).\n- Fill form: `nano-pdf fill --template form.pdf --data ''{\"field1\": \"value\"}'' --output filled.pdf`.\n- Manipulate PDF: `nano-pdf merge --files file1.pdf file2.pdf --output combined.pdf`.\n- API endpoint for extraction: POST /extract with body `{\"file\": \"base64encoded_content\", \"ocr\": true}` and header `Authorization: Bearer $NANO_PDF_API_KEY`.\n- Code snippet (Python):\n  ```\n  import requests\n  response = requests.post(''https://api.opencclaw.com/nano-pdf/extract'', headers={''Authorization'': f''Bearer {os.environ[\"NANO_PDF_API_KEY\"]}''}, json={''file'': ''base64data''})\n  print(response.json()[''text''])\n  ```\n- Config format: JSON for API bodies, e.g., `{\"file\": \"path\", \"options\": {\"ocr_engine\": \"tesseract\", \"language\": \"en\"}}`; CLI uses flag-based configs like `--config config.json`.\n\n## Integration Notes\nIntegrate by setting `$NANO_PDF_API_KEY` for authenticated requests; for local use, install via `pip install nano-pdf` and import as a module. Combine with other tools: pipe CLI output to NLP libraries for mining, or use in Node.js via HTTP requests. For OCR, ensure Tesseract is installed and configured in your environment path. Test integrations in a sandbox to verify API rate limits (e.g., 100 requests/min).\n\n## Error Handling\nCheck for common errors like file not found (exit code 404), invalid API keys (401), or OCR failures (e.g., no Tesseract installed). Use try-except in code: \n```\ntry:\n    result = nano_pdf.extract(''input.pdf'')\nexcept FileNotFoundError:\n    print(\"Error: File does not exist.\")\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f\"API Error: {e} - Check $NANO_PDF_API_KEY.\")\n```\nFor CLI, parse stderr output; retry transient errors (e.g., network issues) with exponential backoff. Always validate inputs, like ensuring PDFs are not corrupted before processing.\n\n## Example 1: Extract and Mine Text from a PDF\nTo extract text from a scanned invoice PDF and mine for product names:\n1. Run: `nano-pdf extract --file invoice.pdf --output invoice_text.txt --ocr true`\n2. Then: `nano-pdf mine --input invoice_text.txt --keywords \"product\" --output analysis.json`\nThis produces a JSON with keyword occurrences for further processing.\n\n## Example 2: Fill and Manipulate a Form PDF\nTo fill a job application form and merge it with a cover letter:\n1. Prepare data in JSON: `{\"name\": \"John Doe\", \"position\": \"Engineer\"}`\n2. Execute: `nano-pdf fill --template application.pdf --data application_data.json --output filled_app.pdf`\n3. Merge: `nano-pdf merge --files filled_app.pdf cover_letter.pdf --output final_packet.pdf`\nOutput is a single PDF ready for submission.\n\n## Graph Relationships\n- Related to: \"ocr-tool\" (for enhanced OCR capabilities), \"document-parser\" (for broader file type support), \"text-analyzer\" (for advanced mining integrations).\n- Clusters: Connected via \"community\" cluster to skills like \"data-extraction\" and \"automation-utils\".\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:45:43.553Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Document Analysis Agents requiring advanced PDF processing capabilities, including text extraction, form filling, and OCR integration.","zh":"适合需要高级PDF处理能力的文档分析代理，包括文本提取、表单填充和OCR集成。","ja":"文書分析エージェントが高度なPDF処理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。テキスト抽出、フォーム入力、OCR統合などが含まれます。","ko":"고급 PDF 처리 기능이 필요한 문서 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 텍스트 추출, 양식填充, OCR 통합 등을 포함합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Documentos que requieren capacidades de procesamiento de PDF avanzadas, incluyendo extracción de texto, llenado de formularios y integración de OCR.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Analyse de Documents nécessitant des capacités de traitement de PDF avancées, notamment l''extraction de texte, le remplissage de formulaires et l''intégration de l''OCR.","de":"Ideal für Dokumentenanalyse-Agents, die erweiterte PDF-Verarbeitungsfunktionen benötigen, einschließlich Textextraktion, Formulareingabe und OCR-Integration.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Documentos que requerem capacidades avançadas de processamento de PDF, incluindo extração de texto, preenchimento de formulários e integração de OCR.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов Анализа Документов, требующих продвинутых возможностей обработки PDF, включая извлечение текста, заполнение форм и интеграцию OCR.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الوثائق التي تتطلب إمكانيات متقدمة لمعالجة ملفات PDF، بما في ذلك استخراج النص وملء الاستمارات وتكامل OCR."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently handle document workflows by providing tools for PDF text extraction, mining, form manipulation, and OCR integration via embedded Cypher and LadybugDB, all without relying on flat files or daemons.","zh":"通过提供PDF文本提取、挖掘、表单操作和OCR集成等工具，赋予代理高效处理文档工作流的能力，所有这些都无需依赖平面文件或守护进程，并且可以通过嵌入Cypher和LadybugDB实现。","ja":"エージェントが効率的に文書ワークフローを処理できるようにすることで、PDFテキスト抽出、採掘、フォーム操作、OCR統合などのツールを提供します。すべてこれはフラットファイルやデーモンに依存せず、CypherとLadybugDBを埋め込むことで実現されます。","ko":"PDF 텍스트 추출, 채굴, 양식 조작, OCR 통합 등을 제공함으로써 에이전트가 효율적으로 문서 워크플ロー를 처리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 모든 이는 평면 파일이나 데몬에 의존하지 않고, Cypher와 LadybugDB를 삽입함으로써 실현됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar flujos de trabajo de documentos de manera eficiente, proporcionando herramientas para la extracción de texto de PDF, la minería, la manipulación de formularios y la integración de OCR a través de Cypher y LadybugDB incrustados, todo sin depender de archivos planos o demonios.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement les flux de travail de documents en fournissant des outils pour l''extraction de texte de PDF, la mine, la manipulation de formulaires et l''intégration de l''OCR via Cypher et LadybugDB intégrés, le tout sans dépendre de fichiers plats ou de démons.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Dokumentenworkflows effizient zu bearbeiten, indem es Tools für die PDF-Textextraktion, das Mining, die Formularmanipulation und die OCR-Integration über eingebettete Cypher und LadybugDB bereitstellt, alles ohne auf flache Dateien oder Dämonen angewiesen zu sein.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar eficientemente com fluxos de trabalho de documentos, fornecendo ferramentas para extração de texto PDF, mineração, manipulação de formulários e integração de OCR via Cypher e LadybugDB incorporados, tudo sem depender de arquivos planos ou daemons.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно обрабатывать документооборот, предоставляя инструменты для извлечения текста из PDF, его добычи, манипуляций с формами и интеграции OCR посредством встроенных Cypher и LadybugDB, все без использования плоских файлов или демонов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التعامل بفعالية مع تدفقات العمل الوثائقية، من خلال توفير أدوات لاستخراج النص من ملفات PDF وتنقيبه و操ولة وتكامل OCR عبر Cypher وLadybugDB المدمجة، كل ذلك بدون الاعتماد على الملفات المسطحة أو الدايمونات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating form submissions in PDF documents","Extracting text from scanned documents using OCR integration","Merging and splitting PDF files for data pipeline optimization"],"zh":["自动化PDF文档中的表单提交","使用OCR集成从扫描文档中提取文本","合并和拆分PDF文件以优化数据管道"],"ja":["PDF文書内のフォームの自動送信","OCR統合を使用してスキャンドキュメントからテキストを抽出","データパイプラインの最適化のためにPDFファイルを結合および分割"],"ko":["PDF 문서中的 表单 제출 자동화","OCR 통합을 사용하여 스캔된 문서에서 텍스트 추출","데이터 파이프라인 최적화를 위한 PDF 파일 결합 및 분할"],"es":["Automatizar las presentaciones de formularios en documentos PDF","Extraer texto de documentos escaneados mediante la integración de OCR","Combinar y dividir archivos PDF para la optimización de la canalización de datos"],"fr":["Automatiser les soumissions de formulaires dans les documents PDF","Extraire le texte de documents scannés à l''aide de l''intégration de l''OCR","Fusionner et diviser les fichiers PDF pour l''optimisation du pipeline de données"],"de":["Automatisieren von Formulareinreichungen in PDF-Dokumenten","Extrahieren von Text aus gescannten Dokumenten unter Verwendung der OCR-Integration","Zusammenführen und Aufteilen von PDF-Dateien zur Optimierung der Datenpipelining"],"pt":["Automatizar envios de formulários em documentos PDF","Extrair texto de documentos digitalizados usando integração de OCR","Mesclar e dividir arquivos PDF para otimização do pipeline de dados"],"ru":["Автоматизация отправки форм в документах PDF","Извлечение текста из сканированных документов с помощью интеграции OCR","Объединение и разделение файлов PDF для оптимизации конвейера данных"],"ar":["توفير عملية إرسال الاستمارات في مستندات PDF","استخراج النص من الوثائق الممسوحة ضوئيًا باستخدام تكامل OCR","دمج وsplit ملفات PDF لتحسين خط أنابيب البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires graph-native workspace backend for OpenClaw","Zero flat files and daemons may limit compatibility with certain legacy systems"],"zh":["需要图形本地工作空间后端用于OpenClaw","零平面文件和守护进程可能会限制与某些遗留系统的兼容性"],"ja":["OpenClaw用のグラフネイティブワークスペースバックエンドが必要","ゼロのフラットファイルとデーモンは、特定のレガシーシステムとの互換性を制限する可能性がある"],"ko":["OpenClaw용 그래프 네이티브 작업공간 백엔드가 필요","제로 평면 파일 및 데몬은 특정 레거시 시스템과의 호환성을 제한할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de trabajo de grafo nativo para OpenClaw","Cero archivos planos y demonios pueden limitar la compatibilidad con ciertos sistemas heredados"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de travail de graphique natif pour OpenClaw","Aucun fichier plat ni démon peut limiter la compatibilité avec certains systèmes hérités"],"de":["Benötigt eine graph-natives Arbeitsbereich-Backend für OpenClaw","Null flache Dateien und Dämonen können die Kompatibilität mit bestimmten Legacy-Systemen einschränken"],"pt":["Exige backend de workspace nativo para grafos para OpenClaw","Zero arquivos planos e daemons podem limitar a compatibilidade com certos sistemas legados"],"ru":["Требует графического workspace-бэкенда для OpenClaw","Нет плоских файлов и демонов может ограничить совместимость с определенными устаревшими системами"],"ar":["يتطلب خلفية workspace أصلية للرسومات لبرنامج OpenClaw","أي ملفات مسطحة أو دايمونات قد تقيد التوافق مع بعض الأنظمة القديمة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"dce762c7476293d734ce1079780cbfca0a4883f04967c127057d53d08b5f18a7","qualityScore":65}');
