g","SQL","statistische Analyse","Data Story Outliner","Jupyter Notebooks"],"pt":["análise de dados","data story outliner","padrões de orquestração","tutoriais interativos","consultas SQL","análise estatística","visualização de dados"],"ru":["анализ данных","Data Story Outliner","паттерны оркестровки","интерактивные уроки","запросы SQL","статистический анализ","визуализация данных"],"ar":["تحليل البيانات","مخطط قصة البيانات","أنماط الإدارة الإنتاجية","دروس تفاعلية","استفسارات SQL","التحليل الإحصائي","تصوير البيانات"]}},"owner":"jeremylongshore","repo":"claude-code-plugins-plus-skills","repoPath":"jeremylongshore/claude-code-plugins-plus-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.577Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"data-story-outliner","description":"|","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Data Story Outliner\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for data story outliner tasks within the Data Analytics domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"data story outliner\" in your request\n- Ask about data story outliner patterns or best practices\n- Need help with data analytics skills covering sql queries, data visualization, statistical analysis, and business intelligence.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step guidance for data","body":"# Data Story Outliner\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for data story outliner tasks within the Data Analytics domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"data story outliner\" in your request\n- Ask about data story outliner patterns or best practices\n- Need help with data analytics skills covering sql queries, data visualization, statistical analysis, and business intelligence.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step guidance for data story outliner\n2. Follows industry best practices and patterns\n3. Generates production-ready code and configurations\n4. Validates outputs against common standards\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example: Basic Usage**\nRequest: \"Help me with data story outliner\"\nResult: Provides step-by-step guidance and generates appropriate configurations\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Relevant development environment configured\n- Access to necessary tools and services\n- Basic understanding of data analytics concepts\n\n\n## Output\n\n- Generated configurations and code\n- Best practice recommendations\n- Validation results\n\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Error | Cause | Solution |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| Configuration invalid | Missing required fields | Check documentation for required parameters |\n| Tool not found | Dependency not installed | Install required tools per prerequisites |\n| Permission denied | Insufficient access | Verify credentials and permissions |\n\n\n## Resources\n\n- Official documentation for related tools\n- Best practices guides\n- Community examples and tutorials\n\n## Related Skills\n\nPart of the **Data Analytics** skill category.\nTags: sql, analytics, visualization, statistics, bi\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:47:10.188Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analytics Agents needing automated data story outlining with SQL queries and data visualization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自动数据故事大纲、SQL 查询和数据可视化能力的数据分析代理。","ja":"データ分析エージェントが自動化されたデータストーリーのアウトライン、SQLクエリ、データ視覚化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"데이터 분석 에이전트가 자동화된 데이터 스토리 아웃라인, SQL 쿼리 및 데이터 시각화 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Datos que necesitan esquemas de historias de datos automatizados con consultas SQL y capacidades de visualización de datos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Données ayant besoin de schémas de récits de données automatisés avec des requêtes SQL et des capacités de visualisation de données.","de":"Perfekt für Data Analytics-Agents, die automatisierte Datenstory-Outline mit SQL-Abfragen und Datenvisualisierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perf